  ('zcrm_1579374000173907068', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000130357002', 'Steven Copus', '11/18/25', 'Informed the member that after researching, it was found that her preferred counselor was added with our previous EAP vendor, not the current one. Advised that the current vendor has no record of the counselor’s nomination. Explained that she will need to contact an intake clinician at <b>888-507-0435</b> to start the process, obtain a list of in-network counselors, or request assistance with getting her preferred counselor added. Also informed her that if she proceeds with tomorrow’s appointment, we will not be able to reimburse or retroactively cover any past appointment', 'Concierge', 'Concierge', '2025-11-18 15:00:58', '2025-11-18 15:00:58'),
