  ('zcrm_1579374000173830218', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000169157001', 'Shawn Aycock', '11/18', 'called with questions about preventive, educated her on phcs and arm and the differences, also ran a network search for her pcp and gastro for colonoscopy. - Tupac Manzanarez', 'Tupac Manzanarez', 'Tupac Manzanarez', '2025-11-18 13:26:12', '2025-11-18 13:26:12'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000173915063', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000175690001', 'David Timmons', NULL, '11-18-25 Spoke with Amanda 46 and David 42. David is self-employed with an EIN. They are currently on Anthem at $588 today and going up to $900 for 2026. She watched the video. They are healthy, no stress, no meds, no tobacco, no pre-x. Everything is suddenly out of network where they live. Amanda likes to do her annual wellness screenings and David hasn''t had the need to do anything. They like to fund an HSA and really just want catastrophic benefits. Secure HSA is the best for them in their age group. They are tired of the racket in the insurance world. I explained to her the PHCS network is likely limited in Durango. However, they ARM will use the PPO pricing. If the provider doesn''t agree, the member might have to pay the difference. She was fine with that. She will discuss it with David tonight and let me know.', 'Wendy Scipione - SR VP National Sales Advisor', 'Wendy Scipione - SR VP National Sales Advisor', '2025-11-18 13:21:54', '2025-11-18 13:21:54'),
