  ('zcrm_1579374000173830172', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000086225001', 'John Donovan', '11/18', 'wants digital card emailed to him right now, tried to log him into app but realized his plan hasn''t started so healthwallet isn''t working for him yet. was on an old plan with us through planstin, wanted planstin cards emailed to him, told him we can''t do that and that only planstin could email him the cards, educated him on differences between phcs and arm and planstin. - Tupac Manzanarez', 'Tupac Manzanarez', 'Tupac Manzanarez', '2025-11-18 12:02:58', '2025-11-18 12:02:58'),
