  ('zcrm_1579374000173915026', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000061091836', 'Amber Donnell', NULL, '11-18-25 Dear Amber Donnell,<br>Congratulations on purchasing a Direct Vision plan! You have just made a great investment in protecting your vision health. Please SAVE this important membership information. If you have any questions, call us at <a style="display:inline;" target="_blank" href="tel:800-620-5010"><u>844-833-8440</u></a> or e-mail us at <a style="display:inline;" target="_blank" href="mailto:directbenefits@directbenefits.com"><u>directbenefits@directbenefits.com</u></a>. Please do not respond to this confirmation email.<br>Here is what you need to know.<br><b>If you chose electronic delivery of your plan documents, you will not receive paper copies.</b> Instead, you will be able to access your information through your member portal. If you chose to have your plan documents delivered via direct mail, please allow up to 10 days for delivery to the address you provided in the Primary Applicant section. Your provider will verify benefits using your 9 digit policy # below. Do not use your SSN. Please note: While your vision insurance is effective on the date noted below, your application may take up to five business days to be processed and be accessible in the system through the network providers. Please make sure your provider is able to verify benefits before you schedule an appointment.  <br><b>Access your ID cards, benefits, claims, and more electronically via your member portal account (s).   </b><br><ul style="list-style-type:disc;list-style-position:inside;"><li style="list-style-image:none;"><p style="display:inline;"><span style="margin-inline-start:25px;color:rgb(51, 51, 51);font-weight:normal;font-style:normal;">For billing information and ID cards, please register for your Ameritas Member Portal Account here: </span><a style="display:inline;margin-inline-start:25px;font-weight:normal;font-style:normal;" target="_blank" href="https://urldefense.proofpoint.com/v2/url?u=http-3A__track.smtpsendmail.com_6009018_c-3Fp-3Dvl0jT6cjfLeG-5FVxfqbfn-5FpYTBdAnUvUQjNhCMgwtv1OQ39oqdpX6alfm9NpcfIjiyzlsMMU9KAU207Q7Cnta-5FVKVIfNHRCHSR9HkeL-5FRWmrtwcj-2DjBm7h3bQMwKNtqHHuZiqtC1hM1Hcsae5-2DBQmoJggF5SnIss2hpHbZUwGTB6OEkvCYyr0PGb8W1rRQYLi&amp;d=DwMCAg&amp;c=euGZstcaTDllvimEN8b7jXrwqOf-v5A_CdpgnVfiiMM&amp;r=dVT6mh2rJEvNldIIymVnN6cN9mVnz23yakDKr-Yqv6Q&amp;m=mKZFRXUaEFWM0l6Bn39G_x8fbT9o9rPAPqGv7RQzu13c38nDyMFYQ0DrCJDKZ2u0&amp;s=LZZWw1puhXCrZwfHaqBAQ_Jqnf2ArTz3biYpwWRJ87g&amp;e="><u>https://www.ameritas.com/sign-in/</u></a></p></li><li style="list-style-image:none;"><p style="display:inline;"><span style="margin-inline-start:25px;color:rgb(51, 51, 51);font-weight:normal;font-style:normal;">If you have an EyeMed policy, you can access your benefits and claims through your EyeMed Member Portal Account. When registering, please use your 9 digit policy number from your confirmation email below. Do not use your SSN: Register here: </span><a style="display:inline;margin-inline-start:25px;font-weight:normal;font-style:normal;" target="_blank" href="https://urldefense.proofpoint.com/v2/url?u=http-3A__track.smtpsendmail.com_6009018_c-3Fp-3Dfpk8gNZ41BUU675ZBLx9o9tfCgWDW07hsojgouj1qC6Wu08OsyvSGCbVTv0kppf3YcpS1mXf9C-5FDGqPoIK4tiFRWWrrdqB-5F5eEpvmdPqXBgXxGyU4I-2DSOH2xKLpE-5FUGASNb3W5IYYHmma9bl099RGfgnYIFOmSEk7eUp8NAIlMDcEKtNMT4T7IQT6BLzQ0pg&amp;d=DwMCAg&amp;c=euGZstcaTDllvimEN8b7jXrwqOf-v5A_CdpgnVfiiMM&amp;r=dVT6mh2rJEvNldIIymVnN6cN9mVnz23yakDKr-Yqv6Q&amp;m=mKZFRXUaEFWM0l6Bn39G_x8fbT9o9rPAPqGv7RQzu13c38nDyMFYQ0DrCJDKZ2u0&amp;s=jIRoiHtrfpxEL5JP45SpzoX0cbpfKp6MqPCj8BiRcMw&amp;e="><u>www.eyemedvisioncare.com/member/</u></a><span style="margin-inline-start:25px;color:rgb(51, 51, 51);font-weight:normal;font-style:normal;">.</span></p></li><li style="list-style-image:none;"><p style="display:inline;"><span style="margin-inline-start:25px;color:rgb(51, 51, 51);font-weight:normal;font-style:normal;">If you have a VSP policy, you can access your benefits and claims through your VSP Member Portal Account. When registering, please use your 9 digit policy number from your confirmation email below. Do not use your SSN. Create an account here: </span><a style="display:inline;margin-inline-start:25px;font-weight:normal;font-style:normal;" target="_blank" href="https://urldefense.proofpoint.com/v2/url?u=http-3A__track.smtpsendmail.com_6009018_c-3Fp-3DIIj-2520jrSDowiUzAE9Gwj2yuR4VRpgq53cOmVMTdrzQRolyTxXWBgh0NI9yekdE8v87mcHqvGQ-5FMA8RmKJ45LDe3AKgUdCU-5F9L7aYFXbjIXhky1GnRJD-2Dq9yIzE0NT-2DLl2TV45Rafav0HfgoYrwyfBweBJLjA9DWkS0wnif7TqgywY-3D&amp;d=DwMCAg&amp;c=euGZstcaTDllvimEN8b7jXrwqOf-v5A_CdpgnVfiiMM&amp;r=dVT6mh2rJEvNldIIymVnN6cN9mVnz23yakDKr-Yqv6Q&amp;m=mKZFRXUaEFWM0l6Bn39G_x8fbT9o9rPAPqGv7RQzu13c38nDyMFYQ0DrCJDKZ2u0&amp;s=g5UnQgNXFGe-HEc3-jeubvT_5vuwUfwQ_WfRKYnPTs0&amp;e="><u>www.vsp.com</u></a></p></li></ul><b>Ameritas </b>(ID cards and billing):<br>5900 O Street Lincoln, NE 68510<br>Customer Service 866-619-6095<br>Fax: 402-309-2598<br>Email: <a style="display:inline;" target="_blank" href="mailto:SpiritIndservice@Ameritas.com"><u>SpiritIndservice@Ameritas.com</u></a><br><b>EyeMed</b> (verification of benefits and claims):<br>800-521-3605<br><b>VSP </b>(verification of benefits and claims):<br>800-877-7195<br>Initial premium will be withdrawn within 3 days of your policies effective date, subsequent premiums are due on the day of the month in which the policy was effective. Plan includes a one-time non-refundable enrollment fee of $25. This charge will be made at the time of purchase and may appear as a sep arate transaction from your insurance as Direct Vision or Direct Benefits, Inc. <br>Your specific coverage information is as follows:<br><br>Plan Selected: VSP Choice Plan B<br>Who’s covered: Applicant<br>Effective Date: 11/19/2025<br>Carrier: Ameritas<br>Monthly Charge: <b>$12.22</b><br><br>Policy Number: <b>300168679</b><br>Agent Info: <b>Wendy Scipione (Phone : (720) 259-1555)</b> <br>Questions? Call (844)833-8440<br><br>©2025 Direct Benefits Inc, All rights reserved.', 'Wendy Scipione - SR VP National Sales Advisor', 'Wendy Scipione - SR VP National Sales Advisor', '2025-11-18 11:44:08', '2025-11-18 11:44:08'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000173915021', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000082413134', 'Nathan Knecht', NULL, '11-18-25 Nathan is the sole earner in the household and expects the same $110,400 but might also pay himself and additional $10K-$15K and has an S-Corp and pass through corporations. So, he''s really not sure of his income for 2026. He''s on the cusp of no APTC if he earns more than $128,601. So, he''s also exploring Secure HSA EF $2500/$852. He and the  kids are healthy, no issues. His wife Dhasa is 50 and starting have a number of things pop up. She''s already paying oop for menopause stuff. She''s taking the GLP1 to address new approaching diabetes and has already lost weight. She has a knee and shoulder issue that she''s doing PT for. He knows that will all be their cost 100% year one.  The only benefit with their Cigna plan is the co-pays for PT, chiro and mental health. So, he will review it all. We could split the family if the APTC doesn''t matter but the cost will be more. He''s been reading through the Sharing Guidelines and will decide what he thinks is best for 2026 and let me know.  They are on the Cigna Connect Flex Bronze 7200 at the moment and it will be about $640 if their income is truly $110K. Sounds like that''s not super likely though.', 'Wendy Scipione - SR VP National Sales Advisor', 'Wendy Scipione - SR VP National Sales Advisor', '2025-11-18 11:42:47', '2025-11-18 11:42:47'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000173904107', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000173885005', 'Alice Stolz', NULL, '11/18- Kirsten called in to review this Member''s start date and stated that the Member enrolled with a December 1, 2025 start date and wants it changed to January 1, 2026 start date.  I will process.', 'Michele R', 'Michele R', '2025-11-18 11:36:41', '2025-11-18 11:39:22'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000173904102', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000173819008', 'Sarah Works', 'Member & Children $2500 IUA Secure HSA', NULL, 'Michele R', 'Michele R', '2025-11-18 11:25:37', '2025-11-18 11:25:37'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000173927006', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000176659017', 'Candace Lucas', NULL, '11.18.25:  Candace emailed. Asked about the IUA and open enrollment period for MCS. Responded to her questions. Mentioned HSA benefits that come w/the MEC and how well it works for paying small med. needs. Cancdace emailed back asking if any amt. under the IUA is shared 100% as part of the plan and within th guidelines. I responded no, small med. needs are not shared by the MCS community; only large med. needs that are in excess of the IUA amount she chooses to pay before sharing begins. She also asked if this plan counts so they ren''t penalized for not having ACA. I told her there is no mandata in FL (her residence) for the ACA and even if there were, if she takes SECURE HSA she would meet that requirement. JSP', 'Joan Phelps', 'Joan Phelps', '2025-11-18 11:25:14', '2025-11-18 12:11:07'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000173927001', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000176659017', 'Candace Lucas', NULL, '11.17.25:  Candace emailed to thank me for following up and said they''re still looking at their options w/insurance cos. outside the ACA as they are having difficulty with her husband''s colitis pre-x condition. JSP', 'Joan Phelps', 'Joan Phelps', '2025-11-18 11:22:42', '2025-11-18 11:22:42'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000173830153', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000170902001', 'Val Hunter', '11/18 pt 2', 'they called me back to let me know that they still hand''t heard back from lyric on updates with their telehealth doctors lab orders for Jenne, I let them know that lyric told me they should have an update by end of today. I also let them know I will f/u tommorow to check on the status of their issue. Tupac Manzanarez.', 'Tupac Manzanarez', 'Tupac Manzanarez', '2025-11-18 11:16:33', '2025-11-18 11:16:33'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000173830148', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000168253002', 'Boon Ho', '11/18', 'called about dob needing change in healthwallet for wife''s login', 'Tupac Manzanarez', 'Tupac Manzanarez', '2025-11-18 11:07:10', '2025-11-18 11:07:10'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000173915016', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000152999021', 'Patrick Brighton', NULL, '11-18-25 Patrick called to better understand what happens with various levels of income or no income. They aren''t sure if they will earn income this year or not. He doesn''t want Medicaid. But, he wants a subsidy. They might wind up paying all of the tax credit back at the end of the year if their income turns out to be what they wish for. He will play with the numbers on the estimator tool.', 'Wendy Scipione - SR VP National Sales Advisor', 'Wendy Scipione - SR VP National Sales Advisor', '2025-11-18 11:04:23', '2025-11-18 11:04:23'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000173830143', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000120745009', 'Diane Sadowski', '11/18', 'i called and left a vm about helping her login to app', 'Tupac Manzanarez', 'Tupac Manzanarez', '2025-11-18 10:57:25', '2025-11-18 10:57:25'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000173907058', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000168819001', 'Diane Moore', NULL, '11/18/25<br>Diana wanted to know how to use her plan to go see a knee specialist AC', 'Concierge', 'Concierge', '2025-11-18 10:51:47', '2025-11-18 10:51:47'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000173907053', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000168250023', 'Kevin Isenberg', NULL, '11/18/25<br>Needed assitance with the rx valet AC', 'Concierge', 'Concierge', '2025-11-18 10:51:00', '2025-11-18 10:51:00'),
