  ('zcrm_1579374000173891011', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000121310002', 'Cooper Aiken', 'Zoho SalesIQ chat with Concierge', 'Visit ID : 4524 Question : Hello. I recently had a telehealth visit with Dr Pavel Conovalciuc. He was supposed to send a prescription to the mail pharmacy called Advanced Pharmacy in Greenville SC but they have not gotten the script yet.', 'MPB Health Member Notification', 'MPB Health Member Notification', '2025-11-18 10:46:39', '2025-11-18 10:46:39'),
