  ('zcrm_1579374000173907033', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000151451002', 'William Madsen', '11/18/25', '<br>Member reached out requesting a prescription refill. I informed him that he needs to book an appointment with our telehealth provider. He asked if we could book the appointment for him, and I explained that he must schedule it himself due to how the system is set up and because personal questions are required during the booking process. The member did not respond after<a style="" target="_blank"> that.AC</a>', 'Concierge', 'Concierge', '2025-11-18 09:30:22', '2025-11-18 09:30:22'),
