  ('zcrm_1579374000173845044', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000173889002', 'Joseph Weinstein', NULL, '11-17-25 Joseph read the Sharing Guidelines and asked excellent questions. He''s very diligent. He''s choosing Secure HSA and will join for Jan. 1st, 2026. He overpaid for CoveredCA so his December payment will be $0. He had a fractured leg in Feb. 2024 and 100% healed by using a boot and PT. I sent him the Dental Discount plan and vision information. Chose $1250/$448. Had Diverticulitis a year ago and changed his diet and all set.', 'Wendy Scipione - SR VP National Sales Advisor', 'Wendy Scipione - SR VP National Sales Advisor', '2025-11-17 17:51:48', '2025-11-17 17:51:48'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000173844024', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000155350054', 'Alexis Snyder', 'Zoho SalesIQ chat missed', 'Visit ID : 4520 Question : I signed up for an HSA but have never known how to access it, can you help with that?', 'MPB Health Member Notification', 'MPB Health Member Notification', '2025-11-17 16:34:47', '2025-11-17 16:34:47'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000173845039', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000044650228', 'Tom Schramer', NULL, '11-17-25They are deciding if they want to upgrade to Premium HSA for all ACA wellness and HSA compliance. Their drs. are not in network. But, the search isn''t pulling up much of anyone in the network for primary care, ob/gyn. It shows oncology, hematology, DME etc. when I put in Aspen Medical Center that he wants. Same for PCP, it''s extremely limited. She wants Aspen Valley Women''s Care and super limited. I told them to work with the Concierge Team for help getting pre-negotiations with Administrator to be able to carry out wellness visits.  They will take  a deeper dive into what will make the most sense. Leslie wants annual mammograms due to dense breasts and Premium Care is biennial only. She did her colonoscopy already this year I think. Tom wants typical blood tests. They may add their kids to the membership in case they don''t get employer benefits. Leslie has self-employment status to add HSA, I believe.', 'Wendy Scipione - SR VP National Sales Advisor', 'Wendy Scipione - SR VP National Sales Advisor', '2025-11-17 15:46:11', '2025-11-17 15:46:11'),
