  ('zcrm_1579374000173845029', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000122615027', 'Sean Conroy', NULL, '11-17-25 <span style="color:rgb(34, 34, 34);">Hi Wendy,</span><br><br>We actually don’t need dental or vision. We are able to get those through my husband’s work (it was nice to have the Health Access Solutions supplement), but we still want to have the Zion health share and other benefits we have had currently. I know Health Access Solutions is ending. That has been such a great thing. It looks like they are going to be another sharing type of service, so I’m guessing it isn’t worth looking into their new plan? <br><br>Thanks,<br><br>Sally Conroy', 'Wendy Scipione - SR VP National Sales Advisor', 'Wendy Scipione - SR VP National Sales Advisor', '2025-11-17 13:37:49', '2025-11-17 13:37:49'),
