  ('zcrm_1579374000173845011', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000167357006', 'Deborah Pope', NULL, '11-17-25 Debbie realized that she may needs imaging and labs which will be way more expensive with the Silver Plan vs the Bronze Co-Pay Focus. So, we switched her back to the Bronze with the $0 ded and co-pays for most items she will need. It will only cost her $2.69 per month. She was also worried the new plan started immediately. I let her know it''s Jan 1st and that she can fund an HSA since she chose the Bronze plan. She''s all set now for 2026.', 'Wendy Scipione - SR VP National Sales Advisor', 'Wendy Scipione - SR VP National Sales Advisor', '2025-11-17 12:24:20', '2025-11-17 12:24:20'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000173845006', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000167357006', 'Deborah Pope', NULL, '11-17-25 <br><p style="background-color:rgb(232, 241, 212);display:flex;"><span style="color:rgb(43, 49, 60);background-color:rgb(232, 241, 212);"><b>Enrolled member(s):</b></span><span style="color:rgb(43, 49, 60);background-color:rgb(232, 241, 212);">Deborah Pope, Joshua Densow-Pope</span></p><p style="display:flex;"><span style="color:rgb(43, 49, 60);"><br></span></p><p style="display:flex;"><span style="color:rgb(43, 49, 60);"><b>RMHP Valley Bronze Copay Focus ($0 Virtual Urgent Care, No Referrals)</b></span></p><p style=""><span style="color:rgb(43, 49, 60);">Family Deductible</span></p><p style=""><span style="color:rgb(43, 49, 60);">Family Out-of-Pocket Max</span></p><p style=""><span style="color:rgb(43, 49, 60);">Primary Care Coinsurance</span></p><p style=""><span style="color:rgb(43, 49, 60);">$0</span></p><p style=""><span style="color:rgb(43, 49, 60);">$21,200</span></p><p style=""><span style="color:rgb(43, 49, 60);">N/A</span></p><p style=""><span style="color:rgb(43, 49, 60);">Individual Deductible</span></p><p style=""><span style="color:rgb(43, 49, 60);">Individual Out-of-Pocket Max</span></p><p style=""><span style="color:rgb(43, 49, 60);">Specialist Coinsurance</span></p><p style=""><span style="color:rgb(43, 49, 60);">N/A</span></p><p style=""><span style="color:rgb(43, 49, 60);">N/A</span></p><p style=""><span style="color:rgb(43, 49, 60);">N/A</span></p><p style=""><span style="color:rgb(43, 49, 60);">Urgent Care Coinsurance</span></p><p style=""><span style="color:rgb(43, 49, 60);">N/A</span></p><p style="display:flex;background-color:rgb(227, 246, 255);"><span style="color:rgb(43, 49, 60);background-color:rgb(227, 246, 255);"><b>Payment required from:</b></span></p><p style="display:flex;background-color:rgb(227, 246, 255);"><span style="color:rgb(43, 49, 60);background-color:rgb(227, 246, 255);">01/01/26 - 12/31/26</span></p><p style="display:flex;b