  ('zcrm_1579374000173830065', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000117650002', 'Paul Copeland', '11/17', 'trying to schedule a mammogram through woman''s health, advised to ask for phcs network status of mammogram facility and told her to call them and tell them she has arm when asked for insurance.', 'Tupac Manzanarez', 'Tupac Manzanarez', '2025-11-17 12:15:27', '2025-11-17 12:15:27'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000173832016', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000168253002', 'Boon Ho', NULL, '11/17/25<br>Boon''s wife is having issues loging into the health wallet, I let Boon know i would let IT know. AC', 'Concierge', 'Concierge', '2025-11-17 12:14:45', '2025-11-17 12:14:45'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000173830060', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000010543087', 'Tania Dibbs', '11/17', 'went to grand river health, new doctor, preventive screening for annual checkup, took mpb health card, got a charge for $494, she had said in writing to hospital that she wanted only preventative but they billed her for diagnostic codes as well due to her questions, i told her to call them and explain that she specified only a preventive visit ahead of time in writing and ask them to honor that. also explained to avoid hospitals in the future for preventive care because they often cause situations like this. also explained her receiving the explanation of benefits.', 'Tupac Manzanarez', 'Tupac Manzanarez', '2025-11-17 12:14:16', '2025-11-17 12:14:16'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000173808003', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000154438037', 'Veronica Avery', NULL, 'Member called in asking to increase her IUA so she could obtain a lower monthly Share Amount.  I went over the $2500 IUA &amp; $5000 IUA and she will be changing to the $2500.  I will send her the Change Link and asked her to hold off on submitting that until after 12/1/25.', 'Patti Baron', 'Patti Baron', '2025-11-17 12:11:41', '2025-11-17 12:11:41'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000173845001', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000049242001', 'Madeleine Blanchard Cupolo', NULL, '11-17-25 Sondra is thinking that Madeleine might reach the mop again this year. So, I sent her 3 options to review to get the mop down as low as possible and to get the tax benefits of HSA. She will review them and decide. She might try to enroll on her own or tell me what she wants and I''ll do it. I told her the importance of making the payment to Kaiser once she''s enrolled and to wait 2 weeks to set it up. She will review and let me know.', 'Wendy Scipione - SR VP National Sales Advisor', 'Wendy Scipione - SR VP National Sales Advisor', '2025-11-17 11:56:21', '2025-11-17 11:56:21'),
