  ('zcrm_1579374000173639186', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000071028046', 'Jacob Martin', NULL, '11/14/25<br>Jacob called looking to schedule some labs that were ordered through telehealth. Let him know the documents were not uploaded so we would need to reach out to the telehealth department in order to get those so we can quote/find him an appointment. He did not have time to do a call with them at the moment so i gave him the number for him to call to get those orders so we can move forward with the process.<br>AJ', 'Concierge', 'Concierge', '2025-11-14 14:13:26', '2025-11-14 14:14:27'),
