  ('zcrm_1579374000173672055', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000086964002', 'Lani Cordova', NULL, '11-14-25 Lani came to me via CAW. She has 10 kids! One is 27 and 2 are married, I assume including the 27 year old. She has 8 to add to the system. She wants HSA MEC for the tax benefits. They live in WA and were kicked off Nov. 1st. She found another health share to join, I think Medishare. Supposedly that''s allowed!  She has joined for Dec. 1st, 2025 MEC + Essentials Only at $195 a month. All set for now.', 'Wendy Scipione - SR VP National Sales Advisor', 'Wendy Scipione - SR VP National Sales Advisor', '2025-11-14 13:39:28', '2025-11-14 13:39:28'),
