  ('zcrm_1579374000173660570', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000144281002', 'Abigayle Bacchus', NULL, 'I asked Wendy about this members cancellation, she has let me know to cancel her as she is unable to reach her.  I will process her cancellation eff 12/25.', 'Patti Baron', 'Patti Baron', '2025-11-14 13:27:02', '2025-11-14 13:27:02'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000173672036', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000111955009', 'Abram Dunaway', NULL, '11-14-25 Amanda has her life and health ins license and does annuities and long-term retirement planning for individuals. I''m not sure what Abe does. But they are kicking butt.', 'Wendy Scipione - SR VP National Sales Advisor', 'Wendy Scipione - SR VP National Sales Advisor', '2025-11-14 13:21:54', '2025-11-14 13:21:54'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000173672031', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000111955009', 'Abram Dunaway', NULL, '11-14-25  I submitted their cancellation for them for 11-30-25 and sent it to them via email to see.<br><p style="background-color:rgb(232, 241, 212);display:flex;"><span style="color:rgb(43, 49, 60);background-color:rgb(232, 241, 212);"><b>Enrolled member(s):</b></span></p><p style="background-color:rgb(232, 241, 212);display:flex;"><span style="color:rgb(43, 49, 60);background-color:rgb(232, 241, 212);"><b>Disenrolled member(s):</b></span><span style="color:rgb(43, 49, 60);background-color:rgb(232, 241, 212);">Abram Dunaway, Amanda Barrientez</span></p><p style="display:flex;"><span style="color:rgb(43, 49, 60);"><br></span></p><p style="display:flex;"><span style="color:rgb(43, 49, 60);"><b>KP Select CO Bronze 6500/35%/HSA</b></span></p><p style=""><span style="color:rgb(43, 49, 60);">Family Deductible</span></p><p style=""><span style="color:rgb(43, 49, 60);">Family Out-of-Pocket Max</span></p><p style=""><span style="color:rgb(43, 49, 60);">Primary Care Coinsurance</span></p><p style=""><span style="color:rgb(43, 49, 60);">$13,000</span></p><p style=""><span style="color:rgb(43, 49, 60);">$15,000</span></p><p style=""><span style="color:rgb(43, 49, 60);">35% (after deductible)</span></p><p style=""><span style="color:rgb(43, 49, 60);">Individual Deductible</span></p><p style=""><span style="color:rgb(43, 49, 60);">Individual Out-of-Pocket Max</span></p><p style=""><span style="color:rgb(43, 49, 60);">Specialist Coinsurance</span></p><p style=""><span style="color:rgb(43, 49, 60);">N/A</span></p><p style=""><span style="color:rgb(43, 49, 60);">N/A</span></p><p style=""><span style="color:rgb(43, 49, 60);">35% (after deductible)</span></p><p style=""><span style="color:rgb(43, 49, 60);">Urgent Care Coinsurance</span></p><p style=""><span style="color:rgb(43, 49, 60);">35% (after deductible)</span></p><p style="display:flex;background-color:rgb(227, 246, 255);"><span style="color:rgb(43, 49, 60);background-color:rgb(227, 246, 255);"><b>Payment required from:</b></span></p><p style="display:flex;background-color:rgb(227, 246, 255);"><span style="color:rgb(43, 49, 60);background-color:rgb(227, 246, 255);">01/01/25 - 11/30/25</span></p><p style="display:flex;background-color:rgb(227, 246, 255);"><span style="color:rgb(43, 49, 60);background-color:rgb(227, 246, 255);"><b>$77.27 /month </b></span><span style="color:rgb(43, 49, 60);background-color:rgb(227, 246, 255);">after$846.90 financial help</span></p><p style="display:flex;margin-inline-start:0.5rem;"><span style="color:rgb(43, 49, 60);"><b>Exchange policy number:</b></span><span style="color:rgb(43, 49, 60);"> 2669003176</span></p><p style="display:flex;margin-inline-start:0.5rem;"><span style="color:rgb(43, 49, 60);"><b>Coverage dates:</b></span><span style="color:rgb(43, 49, 60);"> 01/01/25 - 11/30/25</span></p><p style="display:flex;margin-inline-start:0.5rem;"><span style="color:rgb(43, 49, 60);"><b>Last updated:</b></span><span style="color:rgb(43, 49, 60);"> 12/02/24</span></p>', 'Wendy Scipione - SR VP National Sales Advisor', 'Wendy Scipione - SR VP National Sales Advisor', '2025-11-14 13:21:03', '2025-11-14 13:21:03'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000173672026', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000144281002', 'Abigayle Bacchus', NULL, '11-14-25 ABigayle completed the cancellation form. She no longer works for Florie Glusman. I tried calling Abi and her vm is full. I sent her an email offering to keep her plan active and provided the cancellation form. She completed the form immediately. So, Patti will process the cancellation.', 'Wendy Scipione - SR VP National Sales Advisor', 'Wendy Scipione - SR VP National Sales Advisor', '2025-11-14 13:15:19', '2025-11-14 13:15:19'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000173639151', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000168816001', 'Carla London', NULL, '11/14/25<br>returned missed call, spoke to her about derma appointment and let her know we appreciate her letting us know the dr was a little late getting back to them. I gave her the 469 number as well in case next time she needs to reach out to the dr if they are late or miss the appointment.', 'Concierge', 'Concierge', '2025-11-14 13:09:12', '2025-11-14 13:09:12'),
