  ('zcrm_1579374000173672021', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000059611038', 'Heidi McGuire', NULL, '11-14-25 Heidi completed the cancellation form for Dec. 1st. She''s working on setting up Medicare. She''d prefer to stay with MPB! She was super pleased with her experience when she had a Need. She was also very appreciative of all of my help over the years! She''s all set for now.', 'Wendy Scipione - SR VP National Sales Advisor', 'Wendy Scipione - SR VP National Sales Advisor', '2025-11-14 12:56:32', '2025-11-14 12:56:32'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000173672016', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000163173002', 'Kendal Reeves', NULL, '11-14-25 Re Florie Glusman Kendall might be better served on L-X. She will share the info with Kendall and get her thoughts.', 'Wendy Scipione - SR VP National Sales Advisor', 'Wendy Scipione - SR VP National Sales Advisor', '2025-11-14 12:54:37', '2025-11-14 12:54:37'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000173633131', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000173663005', 'Thomas Donovan', 'Member Only $2500 IUA Secure HSA', NULL, 'Michele R', 'Michele R', '2025-11-14 12:49:10', '2025-11-14 12:49:10'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000173639126', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000135605001', 'Olena Gorodisskiy', NULL, '11/14/25<br>returned call and left VM<br>AJ', 'Concierge', 'Concierge', '2025-11-14 12:39:45', '2025-11-14 12:39:45'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000173636065', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000157242002', 'Christopher Mitchell', NULL, '11/14/25<br>Sent email to follow up on Christopher for his bicep injury AC', 'Concierge', 'Concierge', '2025-11-14 12:34:45', '2025-11-14 12:34:45'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000173660550', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000015647211', 'Jacqueline Woodward', NULL, 'Member submitted the Change Form to add her dependent to the membership eff 12/1/25.  I will process.', 'Patti Baron', 'Patti Baron', '2025-11-14 12:34:14', '2025-11-14 12:34:14'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000173672011', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000011447059', 'Florie Glusman', NULL, '11-14-25 Florie will pass the L-X information to Kendall Reeves. She wants to know if Our Live Doc will give the patient the same counselor every time to build a relationship? Kendall is healthy but she thinks has anxiety. Florie is willing to pay $369 for the $1500 ded. Kendall can pay the difference if she wants the lower ded. For Florie, I described the HSA benefits. She needs a diagnostic mammo and MRI every year. I priced it out and the places are too far away for her and she found a place she likes and trusts which is an independent facility. The cost won''t likely meet the IUA or be just over the IUA. So, she will have to pay for this every year. She will think this over. She will wait until I have better options, if possible. She will revisit with me in Dec. Florie will be hiring a new employee in April. Abigayle Bacchus has left the company not on great terms. I need to contact Abigayle to see if she plans to continue her plan. If so, she has to update her payment. If not, Patti will cancel altogether.', 'Wendy Scipione - SR VP National Sales Advisor', 'Wendy Scipione - SR VP National Sales Advisor', '2025-11-14 12:29:11', '2025-11-14 12:29:11'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000173639121', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000015647211', 'Jacqueline Woodward', NULL, '11/14/25<br>Called in to speak with julia. Let her know she wouls call her back in 5 or 10 minutes.<br>AJ', 'Concierge', 'Concierge', '2025-11-14 12:27:05', '2025-11-14 12:27:05'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000173639116', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000128522002', 'Garet Hall', NULL, '11/14/25<br>Garet called in with trouble logging in. I was able to guide him to the right place and get logged in. He said he will call back if he runs into any more trouble<br>AJ', 'Concierge', 'Concierge', '2025-11-14 12:26:04', '2025-11-14 12:26:04'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000173636049', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000044650228', 'Tom Schramer', '11/14/25', 'sent follow up for rx coupon AC<br>', 'Concierge', 'Concierge', '2025-11-14 12:23:48', '2025-11-14 12:23:57'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000173660543', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000154439020', 'Carlos Weaver', NULL, 'Member submitted Change Form &amp; Dependent over 18 Form to update address for spouse.  Processed.', 'Patti Baron', 'Patti Baron', '2025-11-14 12:18:39', '2025-11-14 12:18:39'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000173639111', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000082058002', 'Andrea Andersson', NULL, '11/14/25<br>Called in to find out how to get results from lab work. Did not like that she had to reach out to provider and get results to then upload to telehealth and thought they should automatically send them over to her other dr. People at lyric and me did a 3 way call to try and explain the whole process and clear any confusion.<br>AJ', 'Concierge', 'Concierge', '2025-11-14 12:06:46', '2025-11-14 12:06:46'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000173639083', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000084187002', 'Jon Jenkins', NULL, '11/14/25<br>explained the switch over to ARM from planstin and how it all works. He was still sending bills to planstin. Let him know if providers will not send bills to ARM we can assist in submitting them. <br>AJ', 'Concierge', 'Concierge', '2025-11-14 12:03:36', '2025-11-14 12:03:36'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000173660520', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000163400004', 'Loretta Adams', NULL, 'Member submitted Cancellation eff 12/25 due ot the fact that she now has employer coverage.  I will process.', 'Patti Baron', 'Patti Baron', '2025-11-14 12:02:56', '2025-11-14 12:02:56'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000173633123', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000173662037', 'Tamara Crossman', 'Member Only $1000 IUA Direct', NULL, 'Michele R', 'Michele R', '2025-11-14 12:02:54', '2025-11-14 12:02:54'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000173672006', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000111955009', 'Abram Dunaway', NULL, '11-14-25 Abe and Amanda are psyched to join Premium HSA for Dec. 1st, 2025. Abe is 49 and Amanda 48. Live in C. Springs. They will wind up paying all of their APTC back for 2025 bc they were earning $60K when they enrolled but are now earning $300K-$400K or more for 2025. They had a Kaiser plan and will owe $9K.', 'Wendy Scipione - SR VP National Sales Advisor', 'Wendy Scipione - SR VP National Sales Advisor', '2025-11-14 11:36:40', '2025-11-14 11:36:40'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000173654032', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000104879002', 'Drew Leder', NULL, '11.14.25:  I was informed by Patti today that Drew cancelled his plan as he now has benefits with his new position. I emailed Drew to let him know I''ve been notified of his cancellation, etc.', 'Joan Phelps', 'Joan Phelps', '2025-11-14 11:31:59', '2025-11-14 11:31:59'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000173639062', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000081920010', 'Daniel Minerva', NULL, '11/14/25<br>Received call from member regarding trouble uploading receipt. Contactedf Zion for assist. SW', 'Concierge', 'Concierge', '2025-11-14 11:09:12', '2025-11-14 11:09:12'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000173633115', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000173662021', 'Amanda Barrientez', 'Member & Spouse $1500 IUA Premium HSA', NULL, 'Michele R', 'Michele R', '2025-11-14 11:00:20', '2025-11-14 11:00:20'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000173633107', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000173680002', 'Xavier Rosado Varner', 'Member Only $1000 IUA Care +', NULL, 'Michele R', 'Michele R', '2025-11-14 10:54:36', '2025-11-14 10:54:36'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000173681001', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000144281002', 'Abigayle Bacchus', 'Zoho SalesIQ chat with Concierge', 'Visit ID : 4505 Question : Hi, I had to visit urgent care this week and needed to know where to submit my claim', 'MPB Health Member Notification', 'MPB Health Member Notification', '2025-11-14 10:47:25', '2025-11-14 10:47:25'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000173634121', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000173568026', 'Alison Johnston', NULL, 'No response. Left a detailed message on vm. Sent email to reschedule the welcome call after start date of December 1, 2025. Vanessa Orozco', 'Concierge', 'Concierge', '2025-11-14 10:34:23', '2025-11-14 10:34:23'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000173654027', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000176659017', 'Candace Lucas', NULL, '11.14.25:  Emailed Candace to check in and see if they have any further questions or have made any decisions about their health plan options.', 'Joan Phelps', 'Joan Phelps', '2025-11-14 10:09:13', '2025-11-14 10:09:13'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000173654022', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000176659017', 'Candace Lucas', NULL, '11.07.25:  Recvd. an email from Candace. Asked if there is an exclusion clause for sports for a basefball college athlete. I responded there is no policy exclusion clause for sports as long as the athlete is not getting paid to play. I also sent her the actual Zion guidline re: sharing for sports injuries. Candace also asked about the pricing schedule for preexisting conditions, which I sent her.', 'Joan Phelps', 'Joan Phelps', '2025-11-14 10:07:52', '2025-11-14 10:07:52'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000173633099', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000173671001', 'Anne White', 'Member & Children $1000 IUA Secure HSA', NULL, 'Michele R', 'Michele R', '2025-11-14 10:02:46', '2025-11-14 10:02:46'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000173660510', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000159554001', 'Shaun Bowers', NULL, 'Member submitted cancellation eff 12/25 due to getting Employer Benefits.  I will process.', 'Patti Baron', 'Patti Baron', '2025-11-14 10:01:23', '2025-11-14 10:01:23'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000173634096', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000171891001', 'Keith Markle', NULL, 'Welcome call complete. Changed email on file. Also had him fill out membership change form. Vanessa Orozco', 'Concierge', 'Concierge', '2025-11-14 10:01:03', '2025-11-14 10:29:51'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000173672001', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000173671001', 'Anne White', NULL, 'Anne is 48 and Maya 21 and Matteo 19 and they live in Carbondale, CO. She came referred by Julie Oldham. She has a policy through work and is paying about $800 per month. Anne currently has a policy through work. Her daughter will be in Spain part of the time, so she has a policy for Spain. They do their annual wellness visits. The kids have  EOE <span style="color:rgb(70, 70, 73);">Eosinophilic Esophagitis, a chronic allergic inflammatory disease. They just take an OTC antacid sometimes. She''s not concerned about it regarding pre-x. She works as both W2 and 1099. No tobacco, no prescriptions other than bc. Son lives in MT and goes to MT State in Bozeman. She gets a mammo every year, no colonoscopy bc she did Cologuard. She wants Secure HSA for wellness. </span>', 'Wendy Scipione - SR VP National Sales Advisor', 'Wendy Scipione - SR VP National Sales Advisor', '2025-11-14 09:58:35', '2025-11-14 21:54:06'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000173633091', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000173662002', 'Daphne Mosko', 'Member & Children $2500 IUA Care +', NULL, 'Michele R', 'Michele R', '2025-11-14 09:57:11', '2025-11-14 09:57:11'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000173669008', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000082151010', 'Peter Benjamin', NULL, '11.14.25 Told Peter that vaccines are not covered by his plan. JA', 'MPB Health Member Notification', 'MPB Health Member Notification', '2025-11-14 09:56:56', '2025-11-14 09:56:56'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000173660500', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000131950002', 'Gabe Rothkamp', NULL, 'Member submitted cancellation to cancel his membership eff 12/25 due to going on membership with his mother &amp; sister.  New membership under his mother Angela Rothkamp eff 12/25.', 'Patti Baron', 'Patti Baron', '2025-11-14 09:55:23', '2025-11-14 09:55:23'),
