  ('zcrm_1579374000173636019', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000061594028', 'Aftan Murphy', NULL, '11/14/25<br>Aften called because she wanted to know what her new RX benefits where. I assisted her with navigating the rx valet portion of the app AC', 'Concierge', 'Concierge', '2025-11-14 07:23:07', '2025-11-14 07:23:07'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000173636014', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000141795002', 'Stephen Hillmer', NULL, '11/13/25<br>Stephen called to let us to let us know he sigined a phi form with sedera but he is not sure if he acutly but us down on that form so we can speak to sedera. I advised him to start the apeal proccess. AC', 'Concierge', 'Concierge', '2025-11-14 07:21:10', '2025-11-14 07:21:10'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000173633038', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000173619002', 'Sara Maleski', 'Member Only $2500 IUA Premium Care', NULL, 'Michele R', 'Michele R', '2025-11-14 07:20:50', '2025-11-14 07:20:50'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000173633030', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000173582009', 'Hunter Evans', 'Member Only $5000 IUA Secure HSA', NULL, 'Michele R', 'Michele R', '2025-11-14 07:15:29', '2025-11-14 07:15:29'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000173636009', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000165170001', 'Tiffany Billings', '11/13/25', 'Tiffany called in because she wanted to know exactly what is considered preventative I explained that when it comes to booking a wellness check on that appointment would be covered not any followups or establishing care appointment since those are coded as office visits AC', 'Concierge', 'Concierge', '2025-11-14 07:14:31', '2025-11-14 07:14:31'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000173636001', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000106861002', 'Timothy Sadusky', NULL, '11/14/25<br>Connie called to ask if they where any major changes coming to the plan. I informed her that only a price change AC', 'Concierge', 'Concierge', '2025-11-14 07:08:31', '2025-11-14 07:08:38'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000173633022', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000010331041', 'Karen Tips', 'New Membership:  Member & Children MEC + Essentials Eff 12/25 (Blue Side)', NULL, 'Michele R', 'Michele R', '2025-11-14 07:08:04', '2025-11-14 07:08:04'),
