  ('zcrm_1579374000173573034', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000167357006', 'Deborah Pope', NULL, '11-13-25 She wants to review the plan when they aren''t driving. She has access to a Silver plan with lowering her income to about $49,700 which is her best guess for now with working in the restaurant business. She was recently diagnosed with some type of cancer and will need to do scans, imaging, labs, etc.The co-pays were lower, mop is lower. I''ll send her an overview of the plan details.', 'Wendy Scipione - SR VP National Sales Advisor', 'Wendy Scipione - SR VP National Sales Advisor', '2025-11-13 14:44:42', '2025-11-13 14:44:42'),
