  ('zcrm_1579374000173573006', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000164537001', 'Brooke LeClaire', NULL, '11-13-25 Brooke was interestedin in MCS. But, her income is expected to be about $25K in 2026, so she gets a $994.72 APTC which includes the $80 from CO. She''s choosing Anthem Silver Pathway Essentials 5500 $0. She clicked Pay Here and it showed her that it was Paid and done. So, just to be safe, I told her to call Anthem in two weeks to set up her auto pay for 2026. She will do that. She will keep her Careington 500 1Dental plan for discounts on dental and vision. She might need dental work for receding gums. She thinks her eyes are all set after an ophthalmologist visit found no problems with her eyes.  She was super appreciative for my help and is all set for 2026!', 'Wendy Scipione - SR VP National Sales Advisor', 'Wendy Scipione - SR VP National Sales Advisor', '2025-11-13 12:29:34', '2025-11-13 12:34:15'),
