  ('zcrm_1579374000173570001', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000175122031', 'Sarah Sturm', NULL, '11/13/2025<br>Called and left Vm to try and get her on phone for our scheduled consult. <br>She called back and we spoke about Secure HSA. She is a self employed professional athlete - cyclist. Her and her husband are not happy with ACA plans for more than just price reasons. She is 35 husband 36. Need to make sure and see about her PCP/OBGYN being in network since she really likes them and there are not a lot of other options. Also need to do a little research for her and the specifics of the maternity guidelines and what it will/wont do such as abortion if necessary. Also want to know about genetic testing before birth and if positive could it be pre-ex. She is also curious on what she could accomplish out of the country other than emergency care. Will email her some details for now with a follow up on her deeper questions.  <br>AJ', 'Adam Jordano', 'Adam Jordano', '2025-11-13 10:22:09', '2025-11-13 12:43:01'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000173567001', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000119706002', 'Lakshmi Neelisetty', NULL, 'Member submitted cancellation eff 12/25 due to getting Employer Benefits.  I will process.', 'Patti Baron', 'Patti Baron', '2025-11-13 10:15:51', '2025-11-13 10:15:51'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000173548001', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000130420002', 'Ranjini Ettigi', 'Zoho SalesIQ chat missed', 'Visit ID : 4502 Question : I just met w/ my teledoc, and he made a referral for me. Where do I find that referral so to in my portal?', 'MPB Health Member Notification', 'MPB Health Member Notification', '2025-11-13 09:52:32', '2025-11-13 09:52:32'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000173520113', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000159349001', 'Chantelle Turner', NULL, '11/12/25<br>Chantella called regarding her husband, who needs a colonoscopy. They had an initial consultation with a provider who originally confirmed they were <i>in-network</i>, but later informed them at the appointment that they were <i>out-of-network</i> and billed them accordingly.<br>Chantella expressed that they would like to continue with the same provider despite the network issue. I advised her against this, explaining that the upcoming procedure may not be covered since the provider is out-of-network. Chantella understood and stated that her husband is experiencing significant stomach issues and will also need an endoscopy to determine the cause. They anticipate that this may lead to a <i>diagnostic colonoscopy</i> and are prepared to submit a <i>sharing request</i> for<a style="" target="_blank"> review.AC</a>', 'Concierge', 'Concierge', '2025-11-13 09:09:31', '2025-11-13 09:09:31'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000173520094', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000129877001', 'Amanda OBrien', NULL, '11/12/25<br>Amanda called because her husband had an mri and might need surgery and wanted to know if she can get care in any state in the nation. I explained the procces of how a sharing request works AC', 'Concierge', 'Concierge', '2025-11-13 09:04:03', '2025-11-13 09:04:03'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000173503101', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000173543002', 'Jennifer Carmack', 'Member Only $2500 IUA Premium HSA', NULL, 'Michele R', 'Michele R', '2025-11-13 09:02:13', '2025-11-13 09:02:13'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000173520083', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000099847002', 'Dena Pierre', NULL, '11/12/25<br>Dena called because she wanted to know if she had preventative care included. I explained that her plan is mostly for catastrophic care AC', 'Concierge', 'Concierge', '2025-11-13 08:58:40', '2025-11-13 08:58:40'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000173520064', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000107393002', 'Jessica Johnson', NULL, '11/12/25<br>Jessica called because her obgyn was not able to to take her mpb health card and ended up charging her out of pocket. I explained to her that she can submit for reimbursement. she needed to get cpt codes from the provider. I also informed her that is this provider is not in-netwrok we can no guarantee she will be fully reimbursed AC', 'Concierge', 'Concierge', '2025-11-13 08:56:11', '2025-11-13 08:56:11'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000173520059', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000153977001', 'Maria Koger', NULL, '11/12/25<br>Maria wanted to know how she could get her invoices and plan over view for her plan with us. I explained that all that can be found in the app. She need this info because her husband has retired and his previous employer is going to reimburse them back their<a style="" target="_blank"> premium.AC</a>', 'Concierge', 'Concierge', '2025-11-13 08:53:26', '2025-11-13 08:53:26'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000173512061', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000037141001', 'Kevin M Ryan', NULL, 'Welcome call complete. Vanessa Orozca', 'Concierge', 'Concierge', '2025-11-13 08:43:14', '2025-11-13 08:43:14'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000173520054', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000107844010', 'Sheri Auten', NULL, '11/12/25<br>Sheri called in because she is having a colonoscopy soon and the provider is having a hard time verifying if they are in network. It looks like the the hospital is but they cant give her a straight answer for thanesthesiologistst.', 'Concierge', 'Concierge', '2025-11-13 08:40:53', '2025-11-13 08:40:53'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000173516021', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000169148053', 'Brian Matthews', NULL, '11/13/25<br>Called to return missed call about requesting cancellation form since he has employee benefits now. sent him the cancel form link in an email<br>AJ', 'Concierge', 'Concierge', '2025-11-13 08:09:48', '2025-11-13 08:09:48'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000173516016', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000168293002', 'Carlene Wehrli', NULL, '11/13/25<br>called to return missed call about HSA questions, left VM<br>AJ', 'Concierge', 'Concierge', '2025-11-13 08:01:39', '2025-11-13 08:01:39'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000173503093', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000173524002', 'Christopher Murphy', 'Member Only $5000 IUA Secure HSA', NULL, 'Michele R', 'Michele R', '2025-11-13 08:00:26', '2025-11-13 08:00:26'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000173520049', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000081885001', 'Douglas Doran', NULL, '11/12/25<br>Natalia called because she is trying to book and appointment with Connecticut women''s health. The office was unable to verify that they where in-network. After some research they do list phcs as accepted insurance and they are also listed in the mutliplan website AC', 'Concierge', 'Concierge', '2025-11-13 07:59:48', '2025-11-13 07:59:48'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000173515026', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000109357031', 'Melvin Scott III', NULL, 'Member called in to cancel eff 1/1/26.  I advised him to be in touch with Lou and to submit after 12/1/25', 'Patti Baron', 'Patti Baron', '2025-11-13 07:59:35', '2025-11-13 07:59:35'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000173520044', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000146983002', 'Katherine ann DUERKSEN', NULL, '11/13/25<br>Katherine recelnty had an std panal dones and somethings came back abnormal and wanted to know what to do from here. I advised her to book and appoitment with a pcp using our telehealth and upload the results. AC', 'Concierge', 'Concierge', '2025-11-13 07:55:38', '2025-11-13 07:55:38'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000173503085', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000173504002', 'Deanna Martinson', 'Member Only $5000 IUA Care +', NULL, 'Michele R', 'Michele R', '2025-11-13 07:54:23', '2025-11-13 07:54:23'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000173520025', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000132140010', 'Christopher Melton', NULL, '11/13/25<br>Chris called because his child is having severe migraines and they have taken the child to multiple doctors. They need to get a genetic testing done However it is expensive. I advised them to get a good faith estimates and upload that so they can see if Zion will approve it. They did not seam happy when I said that it might take them 3-4 weeks to review their sharing request so I advised them to speak to zion and ask to expedite the review process due to the illness of the child AC', 'Concierge', 'Concierge', '2025-11-13 07:50:23', '2025-11-13 07:50:23'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000173503070', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000173485002', 'Carlos Reynes', 'Member Only $2500 IUA Premium HSA', NULL, 'Michele R', 'Michele R', '2025-11-13 07:47:54', '2025-11-13 07:47:54'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000173503062', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000173444041', 'Benjamin Larsen', 'Member & Spouse MEC + Essentials', NULL, 'Michele R', 'Michele R', '2025-11-13 07:41:37', '2025-11-13 07:41:37'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000173520020', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000168253002', 'Boon Ho', NULL, '11/12/25<br>Boon called in because his wife is unable to log into the health wallet with her ssn and DOB. I let the member know I would pass this issues on to the IT department. AC', 'Concierge', 'Concierge', '2025-11-13 07:36:55', '2025-11-13 07:36:55'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000173520001', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000162579002', 'Peter Wolf', NULL, '11/13/25<br>Peter called in he has an injury and wanted to know how to use his plan. I started to explaied how heis responsible for his IUA and he inturupted me and said that is all I need to know and then hung up. AC', 'Concierge', 'Concierge', '2025-11-13 07:30:31', '2025-11-13 07:30:31'),
