  ('zcrm_1579374000173449032', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000155206002', 'Kellie Matticks', NULL, '11-12-25 I let Kellie know about the option to upgrade from Premium Care to Premium HSA for wellness. She will ponder before our call in a few days.', 'Wendy Scipione - SR VP National Sales Advisor', 'Wendy Scipione - SR VP National Sales Advisor', '2025-11-12 20:43:48', '2025-11-12 20:43:48'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000173449021', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000063253037', 'Bobbi Georgeton', NULL, '11-12-25 Bobbi needs to keep ACA plans due to her unhealthy spine and cervical fusion last year and Chris'' bi-cuspid heart valve that he was born with. He wants to keep Dr. Ashwin Murthy but is open to changing if they have to. Dr. Murthy is not showing up in either Anthem network or Select Health. Cigna''s search is broken and they are currently on RMHP with the dr. in the network. It appears Cigna is a maybe and RMHP a yes but most expensive. Their prices are looking at $1700-$2000 per month? Yikes!<br>UPDATE- I figured it out. Cigna and RMHP accept Dr. Murthy.', 'Wendy Scipione - SR VP National Sales Advisor', 'Wendy Scipione - SR VP National Sales Advisor', '2025-11-12 17:25:14', '2025-11-13 22:07:42'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000173479001', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000082151010', 'Peter Benjamin', 'Zoho SalesIQ chat missed', 'Visit ID : 4501 Question : Hi! I just got a tetanus shot and i’m wondering if that is covered by my plan? I also got two other vaccines, yellow fever and typhoid fever. would my plan do any sort of reimbursement for these? thanks!', 'MPB Health Member Notification', 'MPB Health Member Notification', '2025-11-12 15:17:48', '2025-11-12 15:17:48'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000173425057', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000172130002', 'Tami Schweitzer', NULL, '11/12/25<br>sent tami an email to resceduled her welcome<a style="" target="_blank"> call.AC</a>', 'Concierge', 'Concierge', '2025-11-12 14:50:16', '2025-11-12 14:50:16'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000173449016', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000152320002', 'Stephanie Watson', NULL, '11-12-25 They chose to upgrade to Secure HSA for Jan. 1st. HAB is ending and they want wellness. They have Cobra that is ending in the summer. They have ortho to take care of at that point and vision. I quoted them a VSP Plan A for every 12 months $43.91. They will talk with their ortho to see what plans are good for individuals or if they have any good options. Care+ is $672 and HAB $250 = $922. Secure HSA will be $817 bc Stephanie is 45 and Zach 43 plus 2 kids. The Ortho is Dr. Wong and not in the 1Dental networks.She wants a skin check and will pay cash for that. They will build up their HSA. They''ll call the MPB Concierge Team to find out the instructions to set up the HSA.', 'Wendy Scipione - SR VP National Sales Advisor', 'Wendy Scipione - SR VP National Sales Advisor', '2025-11-12 14:28:15', '2025-11-12 14:28:15'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000173425050', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000131819002', 'Kristin Dotlich', NULL, '11/12/25<br>Kristin called because she needed help accessing her telehealth benefit AC', 'Concierge', 'Concierge', '2025-11-12 14:17:48', '2025-11-12 14:17:48'),
