  ('zcrm_1579374000173451022', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000156918006', 'Pierce Chupek', '11/12', 'called in asking what plan he''s on, informed him and got him logged into app -Tupac', 'Tupac Manzanarez', 'Tupac Manzanarez', '2025-11-12 14:17:00', '2025-11-12 14:17:00'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000173477001', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000153327002', 'Rachel Klobucher', NULL, '<span style="color:rgb(0, 0, 0);">RX Valet can do is honor the $12.97 price for each tube, so $38.91 for 3 tubes. The normal price is $32.84 for 1. Notifed Rachel via email - she requested a call to discuss her options as she believes the price on the formulary should be honored. Notified her that the app is the most accurate source for pricing as it is dependent upon manufacturers. JA</span>', 'MPB Health Member Notification', 'MPB Health Member Notification', '2025-11-12 14:06:38', '2025-11-12 14:06:38'),
