  ('zcrm_1579374000173421054', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000170995001', 'Pinchos Kaplan', NULL, '11/12/25<br>responded to him trying to get the date pushed again after the deadline and requesting refund. I let him know it is out of my hands on those decisions and due to being passed the deadline we can only cancel at this point. <br>AJ', 'Concierge', 'Concierge', '2025-11-12 12:37:23', '2025-11-12 12:37:23'),
