  ('zcrm_1579374000173456030', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000171945016', 'Dylan Webster', NULL, 'No response. Left a detailed message on vm. Sent email to reschedule the welcome call. Vanessa Orozco', 'Concierge', 'Concierge', '2025-11-12 12:30:20', '2025-11-12 12:30:20'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000173449011', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000138751080', 'Fritz Gearhart', NULL, '11-12-25 Fritz chose to keep his plan after looking at the options due to ER visits from last year. These will be predictable at $1700 per ER Visit. He had two ER visits this past year and only paid about $3K which he will be paying off for the next year. So, paying the full cost up to a high ded isn''t a  good idea. He''d prefer to pay $296 and have the predictability.  We reviewed Select Health $22.75, Anthem Gold $190 and Cigna Connect Flex Bronze $0 and the $7200 and he chose Cigna $0 Ded. He was super nice and appreciative of my help.', 'Wendy Scipione - SR VP National Sales Advisor', 'Wendy Scipione - SR VP National Sales Advisor', '2025-11-12 12:28:26', '2025-11-12 12:28:26'),
