  ('zcrm_1579374000173413102', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000088732002', 'Sean Saulsbury', NULL, 'Member called in and had questions about his membership.  He will be getting divorced and will need to alter his plan.  He is interested in looking at other options so I advised him to get with Leslie about that.   I will be sending him the link to the Change Form for plan change &amp; to update his email.   I advised him of the deadlines as well.', 'Patti Baron', 'Patti Baron', '2025-11-12 12:16:11', '2025-11-12 12:16:11'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000173421049', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000152206002', 'Jo Armstrong', NULL, '11/12/25<br>Called in to request a cancellation form and to ask if she could still begin again later if she wanted to. She is getting a job and taking their coverage.<br>AJ', 'Concierge', 'Concierge', '2025-11-12 12:07:07', '2025-11-12 12:07:07'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000173421044', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000123510012', 'William Klopfenstein', NULL, '11/12/25<br>Called in experiencing issues with MPB app. Once i saw he was in secure HSA i directed him straight to health wallet instead since other MEC members have had same issuue<br>AJ', 'Concierge', 'Concierge', '2025-11-12 12:05:59', '2025-11-12 12:05:59'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000173451003', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000155861001', 'Lynne McCarren', '11/12', 'she had a car accident and is at the urgent care. explained to her to present as cash pay and submit bills for a sharing request if it looks like it''s going to go above her iua - Tupac Manzanarez', 'Tupac Manzanarez', 'Tupac Manzanarez', '2025-11-12 12:05:36', '2025-11-12 12:05:36'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000173413097', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000159677002', 'Stanley Treadaway', NULL, 'Member submitted Cancellation Request eff 12/1/25 citing getting Employer Coverage.  I will process.', 'Patti Baron', 'Patti Baron', '2025-11-12 12:03:03', '2025-11-12 12:03:03'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000173421036', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000171004005', 'Matthew Byrnes', NULL, '11/12/25<br>Sent him proof of membership with ARM to show that he has a MEC for his company to fund his HRA. also attached a list of covered preventative services as dictated by the ACA on<a style="" target="_blank"> healthcare.gov</a><br>AJ', 'Concierge', 'Concierge', '2025-11-12 11:53:42', '2025-11-12 11:54:07'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000173449001', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000033574061', 'Shawna Sands', NULL, '11-12-25 Shawna wanted to understand her deadline to submit her bills to HAB which is March 1st. She has an appointment in a few weeks and will need to obtain the bill and then submit. She''s happy to know she has some time. She also wants to know if she should make any changes to her membership. Looks like she already has the MEC and is with Sedera. So, no changes necessary.', 'Wendy Scipione - SR VP National Sales Advisor', 'Wendy Scipione - SR VP National Sales Advisor', '2025-11-12 11:43:54', '2025-11-12 11:43:54'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000173413087', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000160284001', 'Ryan Samples', NULL, 'Member submitted Cancellation Request eff 12/1/25 citing getting Employer Benefits .  I will process.', 'Patti Baron', 'Patti Baron', '2025-11-12 11:40:10', '2025-11-12 11:40:10'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000173413077', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000121976011', 'Robin Kruel', NULL, 'Member submitted Cancellation Request eff 12/1/25 citing getting more comprehensive coverage.  Per Wendy''s note below whole family has changed their names.  Cancellation request was under new name Ava Christman.', 'Patti Baron', 'Patti Baron', '2025-11-12 11:29:10', '2025-11-12 11:29:10'),
