  ('zcrm_1579374000173425026', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000130059020', 'Elizabeth Wiersma', NULL, '11/7/25<br>Elizabeth called because she wanted to to sum bit a preventative bill with labs to the health share because she ended up going to a provider out of network. I explained she can submit for reimbursement to ARM but I did advise her that we might not be able to fully reimburse her because she went out of network. AC', 'Concierge', 'Concierge', '2025-11-12 11:07:28', '2025-11-12 11:07:28'),
