  ('zcrm_1579374000173421011', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000093922012', 'Jennifer Letz', NULL, '11/12/25<br>Sent Jennifer a list of some options she can pursue to get a cheaper alternative to paying full price for the covid shot. I did not see a lot of stuff so used ChatGPT and the interenet to come up with a list of things she could do to get a lower cost vaccine. Due to her being in care + she does not have access to the Rxvalet discounts.<br>AJ', 'Concierge', 'Concierge', '2025-11-12 09:59:19', '2025-11-12 09:59:19'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000173431001', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000083099001', 'julia avalon', NULL, '11.12.25 Julia called after her er visit for a broken leg. Went over the iua and the process to open a sharing request. JA', 'MPB Health Member Notification', 'MPB Health Member Notification', '2025-11-12 09:55:58', '2025-11-12 09:55:58'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000173416004', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000173149019', 'Kathleen Marker', 'Decline of 12/01/25 Share Amount', '11/12-1st notice sent to member &amp; advisor via em &amp; stm.  Wrong digits on bank account.  She will resubmit the correct bank information on the form. Member submitted payment update form. I will process', 'Michele R', 'Michele R', '2025-11-12 09:53:59', '2025-11-12 12:28:48'),
