  ('zcrm_1579374000173421004', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000132041011', 'Bobbi Shiflett', NULL, '11/12/25<br>Finally got in touch with bobbi and helped her make a decision based on her needs for dental. The denali product really does not offer what she is looking for since she has a few kids all about to get their wisdom teeth out and when you take out the monthly payment for the insurance she would be better off doing a negotiated rate at a dental school or something like that. Also with the annual max along with the tiered approach of what percentage they would pay for major services it just did not make sense for her.<br>AJ', 'Concierge', 'Concierge', '2025-11-12 09:38:16', '2025-11-12 09:38:16'),
