  ('zcrm_1579374000173307359', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000171621002', 'Beth Gangel', '11/12', 'got her logged into our app, she had issues logging into health wallet', 'Tupac Manzanarez', 'Tupac Manzanarez', '2025-11-12 09:16:46', '2025-11-12 09:16:46'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000173413001', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000173361001', 'Gene Esplin', NULL, 'This member submitted a change Form to change membership to Secure HSA prior to enrollment.  I tried to refund him the monies that were already collected, however it declined.  I spoke to member and advised him that their was a less than $10 difference in the price so that I would apply monies already collected I will process change.', 'Patti Baron', 'Patti Baron', '2025-11-12 09:15:34', '2025-11-12 09:15:34'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000173318142', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000107479026', 'Jaclyn Peters', '11/12/25', 'Sent follow-up email to clarify confusion caused by the previous message sent by colleague. Confirmed that <b>no reimbursement</b> was supposed to be issued to the member. The <b>claims for Eric and James (Date of Service 6/17/25)</b> were <b>submitted correctly</b>, and the <b>provider will be paid directly</b>. AC', 'Concierge', 'Concierge', '2025-11-12 09:13:07', '2025-11-12 09:13:07'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000173408006', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000012010011', 'Elizabeth Wood', NULL, '11-12-25 For Health Access - Good morning Wendy,<br><br>Per the member''s request the membership for Elizabeth Wood and Daniel Powers has been cancelled effective 12/1/2025.<br><br>Best regards,<br><br>MICHELLE FITZPATRICK<br>Customer Care Coordinator', 'Wendy Scipione - SR VP National Sales Advisor', 'Wendy Scipione - SR VP National Sales Advisor', '2025-11-12 09:02:59', '2025-11-12 09:02:59'),
