  ('zcrm_1579374000173406036', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000153947018', 'Maritza Galaviz', NULL, '11/12/25<br>Maritza called to verify when her membership would cancel if she did not pay by the 20th. I let her know how the deadlines work and that she could still continue her membership if she changed her mind and submitted the change on or before the 20th.<br>AJ', 'Concierge', 'Concierge', '2025-11-12 08:44:34', '2025-11-12 08:44:34'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000173318132', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000072553056', 'Jason Naumann', NULL, '11/12/25<br>Spoke with Jason regarding colonoscopy coverage under his plan. Explained that the procedure is covered if performed by an <b>in-network provider</b> under the <b>PHCS network</b>. Provided link to <a style="display:inline;" href="https://providersearch.multiplan.com/"><b><u>https://providersearch.multiplan.com/</u></b></a> and instructions to select “PHCS Specific Services” and search for “Gastroenterologist.”<br>Advised that the procedure must be <b>coded as preventative</b> to be covered. Notified that any associated <b>pathology charges</b> would <b>not be covered</b>.<br>Follow-up: Awaiting confirmation from Jason if he found an in-network provider. Offered assistance via email or phone for any additional<a style="" target="_blank"> questions.AC</a>', 'Concierge', 'Concierge', '2025-11-12 08:43:52', '2025-11-12 08:43:52'),
