  ('zcrm_1579374000173318113', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000172047005', 'Melanie Gerard', NULL, '11/12/25<br>Melanie called in multiple times because the telehealth provider did not send over her script and each time lyric would call her back she would miss their calls transferred over to lyric AC', 'Concierge', 'Concierge', '2025-11-12 08:08:54', '2025-11-13 09:01:33'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000173318094', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000061091836', 'Amber Donnell', NULL, '11/11/25<br>Amber called upset because her provider for the mammogram is not in-network and she does not want to drive far to find someone in network she explained that Monica at ARM had initially spoken to the clinic to verify if they where in network and later found out they where not. I told Amber I would look into this. <br>After speeking with Monica she inforemed the issue was resolved that she adviced the member to do cash pay and later submit the bill for reinbursment AC', 'Concierge', 'Concierge', '2025-11-12 08:04:41', '2025-11-12 08:04:41'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000173318075', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000168235002', 'Andrew Swisher', '11/12/25', 'Andrew called because he has a 30K bill for an endoscopy he had and wanted to know how to submit to zion. He did mention that he got the endoscopy due to a pre-ex condition. I still advised him to open the sharing request AC', 'Concierge', 'Concierge', '2025-11-12 08:01:23', '2025-11-12 08:01:23'),
