  ('zcrm_1579374000173343160', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000178071375', 'Heidi Godsil', NULL, '11-11-25 Heidi and Scott live in Nederland and came to me via WWSRA. She watched the video. They are self-employed. She''s very interested and wants to share it with Scott. They are looking for Jan. 1st, 2026 start date. They have kids and we discussed Secure HSA EF $1250/$1070. I will need to remember to waive $100 as WWSRA member and use the correct link for enrollment.', 'Wendy Scipione - SR VP National Sales Advisor', 'Wendy Scipione - SR VP National Sales Advisor', '2025-11-11 21:47:06', '2025-11-11 21:47:06'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000173343145', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000173575001', 'Robyn Savage', NULL, '11-11-25 Robyn is 61 and son 20, daughter 17. They live in Boulder, CO. She has bi-polar 2 disorder. Her 2 kids have ADHD and depression. No tobacco and yes for wellness screenings. Secure HSA is best bc son in OR and daughter in PA. Premium memberships aren''t allowed in PA.  Secure HSA EC $1250/$774 is what she wants. She watched the video and I think she''s ready to enroll. I missed her call back.', 'Wendy Scipione - SR VP National Sales Advisor', 'Wendy Scipione - SR VP National Sales Advisor', '2025-11-11 21:40:50', '2025-11-11 21:40:50'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000173343112', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000173343075', 'Laurie Cox', NULL, '11-11-25 <br><p style="background-color:rgb(232, 241, 212);display:flex;"><span style="color:rgb(43, 49, 60);background-color:rgb(232, 241, 212);"><b>Enrolled member(s):</b></span><span style="color:rgb(43, 49, 60);background-color:rgb(232, 241, 212);">Laurie Cox</span></p><p style="display:flex;"><span style="color:rgb(43, 49, 60);"><br></span></p><p style="display:flex;"><span style="color:rgb(43, 49, 60);"><b>Anthem Bronze Pathway 10300 $0 Select Drugs</b></span></p><p style=""><span style="color:rgb(43, 49, 60);">Family Deductible</span></p><p style=""><span style="color:rgb(43, 49, 60);">Family Out-of-Pocket Max</span></p><p style=""><span style="color:rgb(43, 49, 60);">Primary Care Coinsurance</span></p><p style=""><span style="color:rgb(43, 49, 60);">N/A</span></p><p style=""><span style="color:rgb(43, 49, 60);">N/A</span></p><p style=""><span style="color:rgb(43, 49, 60);">$0 (after deductible)</span></p><p style=""><span style="color:rgb(43, 49, 60);">Individual Deductible</span></p><p style=""><span style="color:rgb(43, 49, 60);">Individual Out-of-Pocket Max</span></p><p style=""><span style="color:rgb(43, 49, 60);">Specialist Coinsurance</span></p><p style=""><span style="color:rgb(43, 49, 60);">$10,300</span></p><p style=""><span style="color:rgb(43, 49, 60);">$10,300</span></p><p style=""><span style="color:rgb(43, 49, 60);">$0 (after deductible)</span></p><p style=""><span style="color:rgb(43, 49, 60);">Urgent Care Coinsurance</span></p><p style=""><span style="color:rgb(43, 49, 60);">$0 (after deductible)</span></p><p style="display:flex;background-color:rgb(227, 246, 255);"><span style="color:rgb(43, 49, 60);background-color:rgb(227, 246, 255);"><b>Payment required from:</b></span></p><p style="display:flex;background-color:rgb(227, 246, 255);"><span style="color:rgb(43, 49, 60);background-color:rgb(227, 246, 255);">01/01/26 - 12/31/26</span></p><p style="display:flex;background-color:rgb(227, 246, 255);"><span style="color:rgb(43, 49, 60);background-color:rgb(227, 246, 255);"><b>$351.98 /month </b></span><span style="color:rgb(43, 49, 60);background-color:rgb(227, 246, 255);">after$861.40 financial help</span></p><p style="display:flex;margin-inline-start:0.5rem;"><span style="color:rgb(43, 49, 60);"><b>Exchange policy number:</b></span><span style="color:rgb(43, 49, 60);"> 9015086053</span></p><p style="display:flex;margin-inline-start:0.5rem;"><span style="color:rgb(43, 49, 60);"><b>Coverage dates:</b></span><span style="color:rgb(43, 49, 60);"> 01/01/26 - 12/31/26</span></p><p style="display:flex;margin-inline-start:0.5rem;"><span style="color:rgb(43, 49, 60);"><b>Last updated:</b></span><span style="color:rgb(43, 49, 60);"> 11/11/25</span></p>', 'Wendy Scipione - SR VP National Sales Advisor', 'Wendy Scipione - SR VP National Sales Advisor', '2025-11-11 21:11:53', '2025-11-11 21:11:53'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000173343107', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000173343075', 'Laurie Cox', NULL, '11-11-25 Laurie DOB 12/10/65. She''s a nurse practitioner in a Functional Medicine practice. She originally said no need for wellness bc she can get her labs at wholesale price. But, then she realized she wants the mammo, gyno and she does cologuard. She has no pre-x, no tobacco, take thyroid hormone and bioidentical hormones. She thought she was facing $800+ plan for 2026. But, when she discussed income she thought it would be $50K-$60K. When I logged in it was set at $48K which she said is probably closest. I let her know if its higher she will wind up paying some of the tax credit back when she files her taxes. She understands. She''s been happy with her Anthem Bronze Pathway X HMO 9450 bc she can see doctors in Denver. I looked up her two doctors and they did show up in the Anthem search on Anthem''s site linked from C4. Dr. Eric Jamrich was one of them and I forget the other Invision something... showed up in network. Since her cost will be $351.98 she doesn''t want to disrupt this to try something new. MPB was going to be  a little more with the MEC. <br>So, I helped her re-enroll with the auto renew feature. She''s all set!', 'Wendy Scipione - SR VP National Sales Advisor', 'Wendy Scipione - SR VP National Sales Advisor', '2025-11-11 21:11:40', '2025-11-11 21:11:40'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000173343070', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000173398002', 'Dave Carpenter', NULL, '11-11-25 Kim is enrolling in Secure HSA EF $1250/$1070 for Jan. 1st. She is great friend''s with Cory Nickerson and is super nice. They had a fire in their house from a hover board 7 months before the big CA fires. They lost 2 pets. The rest of the family was out of the house at the time. Super crazy!  She is grasping how it all works and will set up the Welcome Call to get dialed in. All set!', 'Wendy Scipione - SR VP National Sales Advisor', 'Wendy Scipione - SR VP National Sales Advisor', '2025-11-11 18:15:33', '2025-11-11 18:15:33'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000173343065', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000173376001', 'Daniel Rutschmann', NULL, '11-11-25 Daniel enrolled in Delta Dental Basic for Jan. 1st, 2026 and Secure HSA $1250/$774.', 'Wendy Scipione - SR VP National Sales Advisor', 'Wendy Scipione - SR VP National Sales Advisor', '2025-11-11 17:33:12', '2025-11-11 17:33:12'),
