  ('zcrm_1579374000173343006', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000156321001', 'Brianne Davis', NULL, '11-11-25 Bri will remain on Premium Care and decided to keep the $1500 IUA and just removed the kids. She''s all set and will pay cash for wellness and knows of the $600 for preventive mammo and $2500 Preventive colonoscopy. She did the colonscopy this year and will do mammo next year sounds like. All set for now!', 'Wendy Scipione - SR VP National Sales Advisor', 'Wendy Scipione - SR VP National Sales Advisor', '2025-11-11 10:24:42', '2025-11-11 10:24:42'),
