  ('zcrm_1579374000173303127', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000172047005', 'Melanie Gerard', NULL, '11/11/215<br>helped her login to her app so she could use it since she has a chest cold. she at first did not want to use the app but i let her know everything she could do on there and now she is a fan of it. <br>[AJ', 'Concierge', 'Concierge', '2025-11-11 08:50:09', '2025-11-11 08:50:09'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000173337001', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000102254002', 'Alli Totzke-Hitzeroth', NULL, '11/11/25<br>Sent alli an email to let her know what lyric said about the records she requested for her aflac claim. I gave her guidance on how to find these records and let her know to reach out if she still needs help finding them<br>AJ', 'Adam Jordano', 'Adam Jordano', '2025-11-11 08:48:43', '2025-11-11 08:48:43'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000173307095', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000059611038', 'Heidi McGuire', NULL, 'Per Wendy''s notes below member is aware of her cancellation w/ MPB due to aging into Medicare.  Since she opted out of emails we cannot send her any email notifications.', 'Patti Baron', 'Patti Baron', '2025-11-11 08:44:40', '2025-11-11 08:44:40'),
