  ('zcrm_1579374000173303105', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000093922012', 'Jennifer Letz', NULL, '11/11/25<br>Jennifer called to get discount for covid shot. since she is on care + there are limited options for coupons so i will research the discount options from costco and CVS so i can find something cheaper for her. <br>AJ', 'Concierge', 'Concierge', '2025-11-11 07:36:45', '2025-11-11 07:36:45'),
