  ('zcrm_1579374000173254146', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000154862002', 'Danell Underwood', NULL, 'I updated members address back on 8/12/75, however Sedera did not get the address change via the file.  Just sent them an email.', 'Patti Baron', 'Patti Baron', '2025-11-11 06:41:19', '2025-11-11 06:41:19'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000173212042', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000173243005', 'Steven May', NULL, '11/11-Patti received an email from Karen stating that Member made an error in the start date when enrolling.  1) Member wants to change start date from 12/01/2025 to 01/01 2026 and  2) Member submitted a Change Form stating that he wants to change his IUA from $1000 to $2500.  I will process.', 'Michele R', 'Michele R', '2025-11-11 06:36:58', '2025-11-11 07:18:40'),
