  ('zcrm_1579374000173247278', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000173256008', 'Lori Koop', 'Member Only $1000 IUA Secure HSA Eff 01/26', '11/10 - Patti left voicemail to confirm start date of Dec 1 2025 or Jan 1 2026.<br>11/11- Lori called and spoke with Patti about the membership.  She explained the MEC and Individual Mandate State, the HSA and the Medical cost sharing.  Member understands the differences and is requesting to keep the same Membership and the only change is to make the Start Date as of 01/01/2026. Member understands that the IUA will be increasing to $1250 and the monthy share amount to $448 in January 2026.', 'Michele R', 'Michele R', '2025-11-10 14:03:50', '2025-11-11 07:50:04'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000173271046', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000116114008', 'Robert Hunter', NULL, '11/10/25<br>explained all of the upgrades to the telehealth and explained what happened to cirrus MD and how to access the telehealth for him and anyone over and under 18<br>AJM', 'Concierge', 'Concierge', '2025-11-10 14:02:07', '2025-11-10 14:02:07'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000173200016', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000116114008', 'Robert Hunter', 'Zoho SalesIQ chat with Concierge', 'Visit ID : 4478 Question : I dont seem to have access to CirrusMD for tele health anymore. It has been a ahwile but I need to use it now. Is that still part of the membership or is there another way to talk to a doctor online?', 'MPB Health Member Notification', 'MPB Health Member Notification', '2025-11-10 13:53:00', '2025-11-10 13:53:00'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000173271041', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000115751002', 'Rocio Borzage', NULL, '11/10/25<br>answered williams email just responding to our follow up to let him know that we were just following up with him<br>AJ', 'Concierge', 'Concierge', '2025-11-10 13:52:08', '2025-11-10 13:52:08'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000173271036', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000162279009', 'Anna Lavenhar', NULL, '11/10/25<br>answered her email questions about bills being submitted to ARM for a OBGYN visit. I gave her the info for her to submit the bills and let her know we can help her as well<br>AJ', 'Concierge', 'Concierge', '2025-11-10 13:50:39', '2025-11-10 13:50:39'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000173271031', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000123789009', 'Huong Le', NULL, '11/10/25<br>Got darin logged in to health wallet and he should be good to go now. He will be reaching back out for help with an appointment soon<br>AJ', 'Concierge', 'Concierge', '2025-11-10 13:49:27', '2025-11-10 13:49:27'),
