  ('zcrm_1579374000173260080', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000156186015', 'Noah Burleson', NULL, '11-10-25 Noah is losing HAB and aleady has Secure HSA. So, I explained what is ending and what he already has for wellness. Admin erroneously is planning to and his wife''s membership since she''s turning 26. She''s the spouse, not dependent! I''ll inform Patti. He will comminucate with Zion about an old bill that he''s working to get an itemized bill before the 6 month deadline. They have placed a note on his account in case this happened. So, he will hop on it right away.', 'Wendy Scipione - SR VP National Sales Advisor', 'Wendy Scipione - SR VP National Sales Advisor', '2025-11-10 13:26:32', '2025-11-10 13:26:32'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000173206221', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000081302002', 'David Pearson', NULL, '11/10/25<br>Lisa called because she wanted to get her mammogram at her local clinic but they are out of network, I explaied that if she chooses to go out of network the claim might not be fully<a style="" target="_blank"> paid.AC</a>', 'Concierge', 'Concierge', '2025-11-10 13:19:30', '2025-11-10 13:19:30'),
