  ('zcrm_1579374000173260065', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000152572016', 'Emily Cope', NULL, '11-10-25 Emily is interested in upgrading to Secure HSA. She''s pay $364/$2500+$200 HAB = $564 now and is happy to change her IUA to $1250/$603 for Secure HSA. She was looking at being added to her partners plans but that will be $800+ with a $3300 Ded and not sure of MOP. She''s happy to keep her membership.', 'Wendy Scipione - SR VP National Sales Advisor', 'Wendy Scipione - SR VP National Sales Advisor', '2025-11-10 12:23:44', '2025-11-10 12:23:44'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000173206190', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000095683010', 'John Wells', NULL, '11/10/25<br>John wells called because he paid 200+ out of pocket for vaccines at Walgreens because the pharmacist could not find the bin and PCN #. I advice him to go to the pharmacy and have them refund him his money so that they can run my mec card instead AC', 'Concierge', 'Concierge', '2025-11-10 12:12:55', '2025-11-10 12:12:55'),
