  ('zcrm_1579374000173219041', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000156321001', 'Brianne Davis', NULL, '11-7-25 Brianne let me know she''s not self-employed and cannot upgrade to Premium HSA. My mistake!  I let her know what''s included in her Premium Care membership and I can help her with dental and vision plans if she wants.', 'Wendy Scipione - SR VP National Sales Advisor', 'Wendy Scipione - SR VP National Sales Advisor', '2025-11-07 20:47:28', '2025-11-07 20:47:28'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000173219036', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000045798106', 'richard rosin', NULL, '11-7-25 Upon further thought, he will have to file the 1095-C form, so he might be safer to have Zion instead...', 'Wendy Scipione - SR VP National Sales Advisor', 'Wendy Scipione - SR VP National Sales Advisor', '2025-11-07 20:18:00', '2025-11-07 20:18:00'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000173219026', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000056557001', 'Anders Rasker', NULL, '11-7-25 Anders called asking how to submit a new Need for an ER visit in Aug. I left him a vm now letting him know to call Concierge and gave him the # and the 6 month time limit. He knows to call ASAP to get that going now.', 'Wendy Scipione - SR VP National Sales Advisor', 'Wendy Scipione - SR VP National Sales Advisor', '2025-11-07 17:15:32', '2025-11-07 17:15:32'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000173219016', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000059725045', 'Michelle Skellion', NULL, '11-7-25 Left vm returning her call. She might still need help sorting out her wellness bills with Planstin and ARM per the above notes.', 'Wendy Scipione - SR VP National Sales Advisor', 'Wendy Scipione - SR VP National Sales Advisor', '2025-11-07 17:11:38', '2025-11-07 17:11:38'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000173219011', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000045798106', 'richard rosin', NULL, '11-7-25 Ricki wanted ro know if Sedera settlement check was real. I told him another client just got $296 from it. So, he''ll proceed to get the payment. He also wanted to make sure he''s ok with keeping Premium HSA since he spends 7 months in CA and 5 in CO. However, he also pays rent 12 months in CO and works in CO with licensure and all. So, he has roots here in CO and just wants to make sure his needs will still be paid if/when in CA. He just had hernia surgery and waiting for reimbursement on that. I mentioned Secure HSA if he wants to switch but then he loses his status with Sedera for pre-x. He''s not too worried about it. He plans to revisit with me near the first of the year after Need is closed out and make a decision.', 'Wendy Scipione - SR VP National Sales Advisor', 'Wendy Scipione - SR VP National Sales Advisor', '2025-11-07 17:09:16', '2025-11-07 17:09:16'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000173219006', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000112994002', 'Carol VerMeer', NULL, '11-7-25 Carol has an HMA Account and according to above it''s at the 10000 level but she was remembering a $200 or so payment. It would be $198 for the 15,000 HMA. She definitely started at the 10,000 level. Records above show she enrolled on 2-6-23. She never pulled anything out of the account. I gave her the FBI link to submit her information. She will do that once she figures out which payment method she was using.', 'Wendy Scipione - SR VP National Sales Advisor', 'Wendy Scipione - SR VP National Sales Advisor', '2025-11-07 16:54:35', '2025-11-07 16:54:35'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000173219001', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000139791002', 'Maryjean Starr', NULL, '11-7-25 Maryjean loves HAB and does thermography, dental, vision, gym etc. I have nothing to replace it. She doesn''t need a pap screening for another 2 years. It doesn''t make sense to upgrade at this point. She will stay with Care+ at $1250/$298.', 'Wendy Scipione - SR VP National Sales Advisor', 'Wendy Scipione - SR VP National Sales Advisor', '2025-11-07 16:22:48', '2025-11-07 16:22:48'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000173206101', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000082058002', 'Andrea Andersson', '11/7/25', 'Followed up with Andrea regarding her difficulty obtaining a referral for her labs for Lyric. I made multiple three-way calls to help connect her with a provider; however, each time Lyric attempted to call her back, she missed their calls.<br>At one point, Andrea requested that the concierge provide her with a referral directly. I explained that we are not licensed providers and therefore cannot issue referrals.<br>After numerous follow-ups, we are making progress and getting closer to meeting her needs. I will send a follow-up email to ensure the process continues smoothly. AC', 'Concierge', 'Concierge', '2025-11-07 14:59:47', '2025-11-07 15:02:32'),
