  ('zcrm_1579374000173138029', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000171503002', 'Resa Hayes', NULL, '11-7-25 Resa is just too nervous with the political landscape right now. She kept her other insurance and will maintain that through the end of the year and onward. Once the dust settles, she may be interested in making the switch at that time.  She completed the cancellation form and got the confirmation page. All set or now! Has local broker for C4 and no APTC this year either for her.', 'Wendy Scipione - SR VP National Sales Advisor', 'Wendy Scipione - SR VP National Sales Advisor', '2025-11-07 13:39:53', '2025-11-07 13:39:53'),
