  ('zcrm_1579374000173138019', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000069438001', 'Beth Blacker', NULL, '11-6-25 Beth forgot that she got a settlement from the Marshall Fire and needs to ask her accountant if that''s taxable income or not included for income on 2026 taxes. It''s $33K and will put her over the threshold for APTC in 2026 if it counts towards her income. She was instructed to put $50K without the settlement money included.', 'Wendy Scipione - SR VP National Sales Advisor', 'Wendy Scipione - SR VP National Sales Advisor', '2025-11-07 11:39:09', '2025-11-07 11:39:09'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000173129031', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000059563258', 'Brandi Stanley', NULL, '11/7/25<br>Helped brandi with her login issues and got her all set<br>AJ', 'Concierge', 'Concierge', '2025-11-07 11:37:18', '2025-11-10 08:20:28'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000173170001', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000127076002', 'Lisa Nasby', 'Zoho SalesIQ chat with Concierge', 'Visit ID : 4475 Question : Hello! Is it possible to have someone contact the hospital I went to for the ER to negotiate the bill?', 'MPB Health Member Notification', 'MPB Health Member Notification', '2025-11-07 11:36:21', '2025-11-07 11:36:21'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000173138011', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000171119022', 'Ashley Coburn', NULL, '11-7-25 Ashley is on the CO Connect side and she can renew her plan. Total cost will be $480.98. Jennifer Abbott will need to approve the 2026 prices. Jennifer''s cost will be $318.96. Ashley''s cost will be $79.39 per pay check.  Her total cost is $172.02 per month up from $132. Therefore her monthly is increasing by $40 which turns out to be about $20 increase per paycheck.  Once the enrollment is complete with CO Connect I just call Cigna to verify that her auto pay will continue successfully into 2026!  Ashley will look at her husband''s plan over the weekend to see if that''s a better option for her. She doesn''t think so, but will double check and let me now next week what she wants.', 'Wendy Scipione - SR VP National Sales Advisor', 'Wendy Scipione - SR VP National Sales Advisor', '2025-11-07 11:25:09', '2025-11-07 11:26:43'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000173136050', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000134767002', 'Kara Weld', NULL, '11/7/25<br>Assisted via sales iq chat she wanted to know if vaccines are covered. I infomred he they were notand to reach out to wendy to see if HAB would cover it AC<br>', 'Concierge', 'Concierge', '2025-11-07 11:19:42', '2025-11-07 11:20:02'),
