  ('zcrm_1579374000173158006', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000134767002', 'Kara Weld', 'Zoho SalesIQ chat with Concierge', 'Visit ID : 4474 Question : Hi, i''d like to get a flu shot, covid booster and looks like my dr is recommending pneumonia vaccine. Would these be covered with our care+? my dr''s office and the local pharmacy are quoting over $500 for all 3 without insurance. 09:48 AM Operator Enter your last name 09:47 AM Weld Weld 09:47 AM Operator Enter your email address 09:47 AM Weld krweld@gmail.com 09:48 AM hello', 'MPB Health Member Notification', 'MPB Health Member Notification', '2025-11-07 11:07:43', '2025-11-07 11:07:43'),
