  ('zcrm_1579374000173138006', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000132624011', 'Roger Keeler', NULL, '11-7-25 Lena and Roger will need to cancel medical, dental and vision for Dec. 31st. They both know this. Roger is having a meeting with HR tonight. He believes he gets all of those benefits through Costco. I also let them know I reached out to C4 re their escalation to get that moving forward. They will pay what they''ve been paying to avoid having to pay money back in taxes. They agreed and will proceed. They are all set for now!', 'Wendy Scipione - SR VP National Sales Advisor', 'Wendy Scipione - SR VP National Sales Advisor', '2025-11-07 10:39:29', '2025-11-07 10:39:29'),
