  ('zcrm_1579374000173036170', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000170925002', 'Bryan Amundson', '11/6/25', 'Unfortunately, the member’s area is very limited, and we were unable to find which facility offers the best price for a prostate MRI. All other available options appear to be far from the member’s ZIP code.<br>The average and fair price for a prostate MRI is approximately <b>$1,709</b>.<br>This may be <b>eligible for a sharing request once the member meets their $1,500 IUA</b>.', 'Concierge', 'Concierge', '2025-11-06 14:56:38', '2025-11-06 14:56:38'),
