  ('zcrm_1579374000173036109', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000141419020', 'Scott Lofgren', NULL, '11/6/25<br>Called back Scott he wants to open a sharing request and wanted to know the proccess AC', 'Concierge', 'Concierge', '2025-11-06 13:51:36', '2025-11-06 13:51:36'),
