  ('zcrm_1579374000173036099', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000010954027', 'Lynn Ryan', '11/6/25', 'Lynn called to know if physical therapy would be eligible for a sharing request I explained how that process would look like AC', 'Concierge', 'Concierge', '2025-11-06 13:50:03', '2025-11-06 13:50:03'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000173040085', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000171404019', 'Aryn Graham', NULL, 'Member submitted cancellation eff 12/1/25 after only 6 days on the membership.  She cited getting other coverage.', 'Patti Baron', 'Patti Baron', '2025-11-06 13:45:55', '2025-11-06 13:45:55'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000173042060', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000082058002', 'Andrea Andersson', '11/6', 'issue with lab transferred to acelyn', 'Tupac Manzanarez', 'Tupac Manzanarez', '2025-11-06 13:42:32', '2025-11-06 13:42:32'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000173079053', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000150772121', 'Robert Straka', NULL, '11-6-25 Rob chose to keep his plan bc it''s the path of least resistance. He didn''t want to fill out extra paperwork and worry about the dr. network. He''s having some health issues now and is willing to pay the cost for peace of mind. All set for 2026. He''ll call in two weeks and make sure his payment is all set for 2026.', 'Wendy Scipione - SR VP National Sales Advisor', 'Wendy Scipione - SR VP National Sales Advisor', '2025-11-06 13:38:45', '2025-11-06 13:38:45'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000173079043', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000150772121', 'Robert Straka', NULL, '11-6-25 <br><p style="background-color:rgb(232, 241, 212);display:flex;"><span style="color:rgb(43, 49, 60);background-color:rgb(232, 241, 212);"><b>Enrolled member(s):</b></span><span style="color:rgb(43, 49, 60);background-color:rgb(232, 241, 212);">Robert Straka</span></p><p style="display:flex;"><span style="color:rgb(43, 49, 60);"><br></span></p><p style="display:flex;"><span style="color:rgb(43, 49, 60);"><b>Anthem Bronze Pathway Essentials 8300 for HSA</b></span></p><p style=""><span style="color:rgb(43, 49, 60);">Family Deductible</span></p><p style=""><span style="color:rgb(43, 49, 60);">Family Out-of-Pocket Max</span></p><p style=""><span style="color:rgb(43, 49, 60);">Primary Care Coinsurance</span></p><p style=""><span style="color:rgb(43, 49, 60);">N/A</span></p><p style=""><span style="color:rgb(43, 49, 60);">N/A</span></p><p style=""><span style="color:rgb(43, 49, 60);">$0 (after deductible)</span></p><p style=""><span style="color:rgb(43, 49, 60);">Individual Deductible</span></p><p style=""><span style="color:rgb(43, 49, 60);">Individual Out-of-Pocket Max</span></p><p style=""><span style="color:rgb(43, 49, 60);">Specialist Coinsurance</span></p><p style=""><span style="color:rgb(43, 49, 60);">$8,300</span></p><p style=""><span style="color:rgb(43, 49, 60);">$8,300</span></p><p style=""><span style="color:rgb(43, 49, 60);">$0 (after deductible)</span></p><p style=""><span style="color:rgb(43, 49, 60);">Urgent Care Coinsurance</span></p><p style=""><span style="color:rgb(43, 49, 60);">$0 (after deductible)</span></p><p style="display:flex;background-color:rgb(227, 246, 255);"><span style="color:rgb(43, 49, 60);background-color:rgb(227, 246, 255);"><b>Payment required from:</b></span></p><p style="display:flex;background-color:rgb(227, 246, 255);"><span style="color:rgb(43, 49, 60);background-color:rgb(227, 246, 255);">01/01/26 - 12/31/26</span></p><p style="display:flex;background-color:rgb(227, 246, 255);"><span style="color:rgb(43, 49, 60);background-color:rgb(227, 246, 255);">$0.00 </span></p><p style="display:flex;margin-inline-start:0.5rem;"><span style="color:rgb(43, 49, 60);"><b>Exchange policy number:</b></span><span style="color:rgb(43, 49, 60);"> 6305690608</span></p><p style="display:flex;margin-inline-start:0.5rem;"><span style="color:rgb(43, 49, 60);"><b>Coverage dates:</b></span><span style="color:rgb(43, 49, 60);"> 01/01/26 - 12/31/26</span></p><p style="display:flex;margin-inline-start:0.5rem;"><span style="color:rgb(43, 49, 60);"><b>Last updated:</b></span><span style="color:rgb(43, 49, 60);"> 11/06/25</span></p>', 'Wendy Scipione - SR VP National Sales Advisor', 'Wendy Scipione - SR VP National Sales Advisor', '2025-11-06 13:29:02', '2025-11-06 13:29:02'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000173059106', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000058247082', 'Anne-Marie Marron', NULL, '11/6/25<br>Called anne to follow up and left a VM, wrote a script to address all the issues and i went through it in the voicemail to try and de-escalate the situation since she was upset<br>AJ', 'Concierge', 'Concierge', '2025-11-06 13:11:36', '2025-11-06 13:11:36'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000173076052', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000132041011', 'Bobbi Shiflett', NULL, '11/6/25<br>called to discuss dental quote, left VM<br>AJ', 'Adam Jordano', 'Adam Jordano', '2025-11-06 13:06:26', '2025-11-06 13:06:26'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000173059101', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000128863010', 'Angela Agenlian-Neuert', NULL, '11/6/25<br>helped her by discussing some codes and letting her know if she wants to do what she is asking she would need her provider to speak with ARM directly and i gave her the number she would need. Let her know if she is not able to get the answers that way then call us back so i can help her out<br>AJ', 'Concierge', 'Concierge', '2025-11-06 13:04:05', '2025-11-06 13:04:05'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000173079036', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000153956002', 'Jennifer Shedd', NULL, '11-6-25 Jenny upgraded to Premium HSA for Jan. 1st onward with the loss of HAB. She will do a colonoscopy, mammo, wellness visits, etc.', 'Wendy Scipione - SR VP National Sales Advisor', 'Wendy Scipione - SR VP National Sales Advisor', '2025-11-06 12:36:48', '2025-11-06 12:36:48'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000173060037', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000070067085', 'Kayla Boettcher', NULL, '11.06.25 Kayla reached out wondering if there is sharing for hormone replacement therapy, specifically MediHealth. Spoke with Zion and advised to open a sharing request for determination with treatment notes, and a good faith estimate. Advised telehealth option with MPB as well. JA', 'MPB Health Member Notification', 'MPB Health Member Notification', '2025-11-06 11:58:26', '2025-11-06 11:58:26'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000173059077', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000107450002', 'Sarah Miklos', NULL, '11/6/25<br>assisted her on using telehealth and showed her how to fihnd results from visits and how to get in toiuch with the dr for more info if they needed it<br>AJ', 'Concierge', 'Concierge', '2025-11-06 11:54:13', '2025-11-06 11:54:13'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000173059072', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000043575167', 'Peggy Neises', NULL, '11/6/25<br>Made 3 way call with zion to help peggy open her portal and start a share request because she wanted to have an exact answer on if the implant for her cataract surgery would be shared on. They helped her get in so she could upload good faith estimate and treatment plan so they can make a determination for her<br>AJ', 'Concierge', 'Concierge', '2025-11-06 11:51:57', '2025-11-06 11:51:57'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000173079031', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000157412021', 'Christopher Ochs', NULL, '11-6-25 Chris might have a group of 3. He''s been put in charge of researching healthcare options for a new biz. I left him a vm just now.', 'Wendy Scipione - SR VP National Sales Advisor', 'Wendy Scipione - SR VP National Sales Advisor', '2025-11-06 11:50:34', '2025-11-06 11:50:34'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000173079017', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000156321001', 'Brianne Davis', NULL, '11-6-25 Communications all in email. She''s looking to upgrade to Premium HSA and completed the form already. I sent her all of the supporting documents.', 'Wendy Scipione - SR VP National Sales Advisor', 'Wendy Scipione - SR VP National Sales Advisor', '2025-11-06 11:43:02', '2025-11-06 11:43:02'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000173040077', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000162940002', 'Susan Fisher', NULL, 'Member submitted Cancellation request eff 12/25 due to gettin employer coverage.  I will process.', 'Patti Baron', 'Patti Baron', '2025-11-06 11:38:19', '2025-11-06 11:38:19'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000173079012', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000152284778', 'David Spear', NULL, '11-6-25 My husband as well as myself and our daughter, Sophie, will be receiving health insurance coverage from his workplace, the City of Montrose starting Jan 1, 2026. We will not be enrolling for health care coverage through the marketplace. What do I need to do if anything?<br><br>Thank you,<br>Shelby Spear<br>970-433-8982<br><span><br></span>Will tell her next steps.', 'Wendy Scipione - SR VP National Sales Advisor', 'Wendy Scipione - SR VP National Sales Advisor', '2025-11-06 11:35:08', '2025-11-06 11:35:08'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000173040062', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000141274002', 'Ayad Amary', 'New Membership eff 12/1/25', 'Member &amp; Sp $5000 IUA Secure', 'Patti Baron', 'Patti Baron', '2025-11-06 11:25:34', '2025-11-06 11:25:34'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000173079003', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000174963059', 'Laura Waldman', NULL, '11-6-25 Laura''s interviewing with a new company who has Kaiser ins but she would have to wait a few months before they kick in. She doesn''t want Kaiser. She will need something for a few months at the very least.', 'Wendy Scipione - SR VP National Sales Advisor', 'Wendy Scipione - SR VP National Sales Advisor', '2025-11-06 11:25:30', '2025-11-06 22:58:30'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000173040038', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000141274002', 'Ayad Amary', NULL, 'Member submitted Change Form to increase IUA to $5000 eff 12/25.  I will process.', 'Patti Baron', 'Patti Baron', '2025-11-06 11:23:07', '2025-11-06 11:35:44'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000173037188', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000171991002', 'Theresa Norman', NULL, 'Welcome call complete. Vanessa Orozco', 'Concierge', 'Concierge', '2025-11-06 11:02:25', '2025-11-06 11:02:25'),
