  ('zcrm_1579374000173036086', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000123883002', 'Kiya Wiedis', NULL, '11/6/25<br>Kiya called because she had a consultation with the dermatologist how ever they called her at 11pm, I transfered her so she could reschedule AC', 'Concierge', 'Concierge', '2025-11-06 10:13:28', '2025-11-06 10:13:28'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000173060030', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000024844090', 'Valerie Yaw', NULL, '11.05.25 - MSEAP advised that the provider only billed them for 1 session. They can refund the member and bill them directly, but only for 4 sessions since that is what was initially approved.MSEAP updated and said 12 sessions can be billed. JA', 'MPB Health Member Notification', 'MPB Health Member Notification', '2025-11-06 10:12:02', '2025-11-24 11:42:13'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000173037144', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000172041002', 'Theodore Ning', NULL, 'Welcome call complete. Vanessa Orozco', 'Concierge', 'Concierge', '2025-11-06 10:02:27', '2025-11-06 10:02:27'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000173059067', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000119069002', 'Jeffrey Davenport', NULL, '11/6/25<br>spoke to Uyen to see if a test she is getting was preventative, After running the codes it says it is diagnostic. Let her know to ask Dr to put preventativ codes on there if he can but if not it would end up falling outside of preventative care coverage.<br>AJ', 'Concierge', 'Concierge', '2025-11-06 09:57:19', '2025-11-06 09:57:19'),
