  ('zcrm_1579374000173060025', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000172083002', 'Keith Phillips', NULL, 'PHI ON FILE FOR WIFE JULIE. JA', 'MPB Health Member Notification', 'MPB Health Member Notification', '2025-11-06 09:39:52', '2025-11-06 09:39:52'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000173036081', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000082058002', 'Andrea Andersson', NULL, '11/6/25<br>Andrea called because she is unable to access her lab refreal, we did a three way call with lyric so they can assist her with getting the referral AC', 'Concierge', 'Concierge', '2025-11-06 09:36:35', '2025-11-06 09:36:35'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000173059006', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000116613002', 'Timothy Foley', NULL, '11/6/25<br>Called her to return the VM she left but she was at the doctor and busy so she said she will call back<br>AJ', 'Concierge', 'Concierge', '2025-11-06 09:27:16', '2025-11-06 09:27:16'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000173059001', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000172083002', 'Keith Phillips', NULL, '11/6/2Spoke with keiths wife. Helped her with some guidance on how to go about getting him a prescription for maintenance he needs and some annual blood work. Let her know the different options she has to take care of this. She is going to see if their current provider is still in the PHCS network and if not they will try the telehealth. If Keith does not want to use telehealth we will look into another PCP that is in netowrk and help them get in to see the dr.<br>AJ', 'Concierge', 'Concierge', '2025-11-06 09:26:39', '2025-11-06 09:26:39'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000173037127', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000171959002', 'Autumn Jones', NULL, 'Welcome call complete. Vanessa Orozco', 'Concierge', 'Concierge', '2025-11-06 09:02:38', '2025-11-06 09:02:38'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000173040025', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000165758017', 'Jay Wright', NULL, 'Member called in and  asked if there was naythign he needed to do for his renewal.  I told him no that it woulld automatically renew.  I advised him of the 1/26 price increase and he said that he did see somthing about that.  his price will be increasein $9 and he was very happy about that.  I also asked if he downloaded the app and he had.  Member very happy.', 'Patti Baron', 'Patti Baron', '2025-11-06 08:44:57', '2025-11-06 08:44:57'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000173037096', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000171733002', 'Kyle Moss', NULL, 'Welcome call complete. Member is now able to get into Health Wallet. Vanessa Orozco', 'Concierge', 'Concierge', '2025-11-06 08:44:05', '2025-11-06 08:44:05'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000173037091', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000171733002', 'Kyle Moss', NULL, 'Welcome call complete. Member is now able to get into Health Wallet. Vanessa orozco', 'Concierge', 'Concierge', '2025-11-06 08:43:59', '2025-11-06 08:43:59'),
