  ('zcrm_1579374000172993208', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000124293077', 'Paul Dreyer', NULL, '11-5-25 Amanda wants access to PT for knee issues. Used to want mental health but fine with that now. The best option for price and benefits is Cigna Connect Flex Bronze 7200. She chose that. They don''t get a tax credit bc earn too much. She knows to wait 10 days and call to set up payment. She''s good to go for 2026!', 'Wendy Scipione - SR VP National Sales Advisor', 'Wendy Scipione - SR VP National Sales Advisor', '2025-11-05 15:50:50', '2025-11-05 15:50:50'),
