  ('zcrm_1579374000172993198', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000126212014', 'Cheryl Adams', NULL, '11-5-25 Cheryl was brutalized by the covid vaccine, Within 15 min she had heart inflammation/myocarditis and then whole body tremors. By morning she could barely walk. She has blood clotting. She''s been her own advocate to return to health. She uses World Healthcare site for the most current natural treatments. She nuses natokinase, half aspirin, and a few other supplements. Her spike protein was at 25,000 which is insanely high! She does her own vitamin C infusions for about $15-$20 instead of paying $250 for IV Therapy to be given to her. She''s at about 17 extended family members die in the past few years!  She and her mom are still hanging in there. Her mom had some TIA''s and the drs. ignored her. She has endless nightmare stories. She also went and got microcurrent therapy with a chiropractor name Greg Mortimer at FXP Wellness Center in Englewood. Sounds like that might be a form of light therapy. The sessions only cost about $45. Her friend who is also 63 doesn''t have any ins. Her friend earns about $36K and thinks she can''t afford anything. She will refer her to contact me since she will get a big APTC. Cheryl earns about $60K. We left her income at $65K and she was over the $62K threshold for an APTC. She thinks it will more likely be $58K-$60K after deductions. That gave her a $754.21 APTC!  This makes no sense. But, she can fortunately get the tax credits now and she chose the 2nd cheapest Select Health option with a $6900 ded. She pays most out of pocket, cash already and will use her HSA to pay for many expenses. She''s all set for 2026!', 'Wendy Scipione - SR VP National Sales Advisor', 'Wendy Scipione - SR VP National Sales Advisor', '2025-11-05 14:58:00', '2025-11-05 14:58:00'),
