  ('zcrm_1579374000172994087', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000173018002', 'Kimberly Vernachio', NULL, '11/5- Request for Tax ID sent to member &amp; advisor via em.  Member replied to my email stating the following:  <br><p style="background-color:rgb(255, 255, 255);"><span style="color:rgb(0, 0, 0);background-color:rgb(255, 255, 255);">In my discussion with Leslie there was no mention of a requirement to sign up through a business. </span></p><p style="background-color:rgb(255, 255, 255);"><span style="color:rgb(0, 0, 0);"><br></span></p><p style="background-color:rgb(255, 255, 255);"><span style="color:rgb(0, 0, 0);background-color:rgb(255, 255, 255);">I am wanting to become an health sharing arrangement for my husband and myself as individuals. </span></p><p style="background-color:rgb(255, 255, 255);"><span style="color:rgb(0, 0, 0);background-color:rgb(255, 255, 255);">We are retired but we are not yet 65 and will will lose ACA insurance coverage in 2026.</span></p><p style="background-color:rgb(255, 255, 255);"><span style="color:rgb(0, 0, 0);"><br></span></p><p style="background-color:rgb(255, 255, 255);"><span style="color:rgb(0, 0, 0);background-color:rgb(255, 255, 255);">Both SS# for my husband and I were put into your application. What more is required? (Escalated to Reba to review with Leslie)</span></p>', 'Michele R', 'Michele R', '2025-11-05 13:30:32', '2025-11-10 13:42:44'),
