  ('zcrm_1579374000173009003', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000131623002', 'William Pullano', NULL, '11/5/25<br>Karen called because she wanted to know who the eap was, I explained we switched to lyric she was upset at this change I did informed her that we did send out email notifications of this change.<br>She also wants to appeal a lab bill that zion did not accept has part of her sharing request they claim it was not part of her diagnoses AC', 'Concierge', 'Concierge', '2025-11-05 12:57:18', '2025-11-05 12:57:18'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000172993175', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000044118411', 'Nathalie Joly', NULL, '11-5-25 Nathalie wants to make sure she has more benefits now that she''s losing HAB. She never even used it. She will find her receipts for their dental cleanings, vision screening, ski pass, etc. I sent her the instructions. I also sent her information to help with getting a mammogram affordably on the Front Range. She really wants Redirect Health again for the smaller in person items and no network. She''s willing to pay the extra $271 ES for the convenience of it. She will enroll directly in Dec. for a Jan. 1st start date. She was comfortable with their app and how it works. She''s all set for now.', 'Wendy Scipione - SR VP National Sales Advisor', 'Wendy Scipione - SR VP National Sales Advisor', '2025-11-05 12:52:59', '2025-11-05 12:52:59'),
