  ('zcrm_1579374000172999024', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000157983003', 'Remy Godwin', NULL, '11/5/25<br>Talked to remy after he called since the provider tried to tell them they did not have coverage. I walked him through what to do for preverntative care and he said he would let his wife know so she could tell the provider. Let them know to reach out if they still have issues<br>AJ', 'Concierge', 'Concierge', '2025-11-05 12:19:38', '2025-11-05 12:19:38'),
