  ('zcrm_1579374000172927110', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000036593010', 'Suzanne Martinek', NULL, '11-5-25 Suzy hasn''t had a good experience with MPB lately. I helped talk through everything to get her back on track. We found Armour Thyroid for $1.09 per tablet or $38 per month of $300 for 300 days. We looked up her labs and found them for $101 vs through her Dr. for $95. Concierge quoted $300+. She has property in Breckenridge for self-employment. But, she doesn''t do the ACA compliant screenings, so not worth paying for that. She really liked Redirect but probably doesn''t need them either. She had gotten good at using their services. She will get her skin check reimbursed through Health Access and possibly the thyroid labs as well. She''s not sure of her income yet. She''s applying for a job this week. She thinks her income could be around $50K but it wasn''t that this year. It was much less. She also has a $170K assessment to deal with for the Breck property which is really tough. She''ll keep her membership as is for now and use the services I showed her to get the best prices on stuff.', 'Wendy Scipione - SR VP National Sales Advisor', 'Wendy Scipione - SR VP National Sales Advisor', '2025-11-05 09:49:53', '2025-11-05 09:49:53'),
