  ('zcrm_1579374000172924252', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000038280209', 'STEVEN FRADIN', '11/05/2025', 'Called asking about the services covered in his Annual Wellness visit, I explained, then I reccomended him a doctor in network to call and schedule an appointment, I explained how to use his card and to specify preventive services( the doctor is ( <br><a style="color:rgb(0, 120, 57);display:inline;" target="_blank" href="https://providersearch.multiplan.com/#"><b><u>Hallmark, Belton, D,M.D.</u></b></a><br><span style="color:rgb(0, 0, 0);">Family Practice</span><br><span style="color:rgb(0, 0, 0);">Gender: Male</span><br><span style="color:rgb(0, 0, 0);">Telemedicine Services Available: Yes</span><br><span style="color:rgb(0, 0, 0);"><br></span><span style="color:rgb(0, 0, 0);">1189 S Perry St</span><br><span style="color:rgb(0, 0, 0);">Ste 230</span><br><span style="color:rgb(0, 0, 0);">Castle Rock, CO 80104</span><br><a style="color:rgb(0, 120, 57);display:inline;" target="_blank" href="tel:3036883434"><b><u>303-688-3434</u></b></a>)  -<br><span><br></span>I also had him download the app and explained how to register/login and how useful it is - Tupac Manzanarez.', 'Tupac Manzanarez', 'Tupac Manzanarez', '2025-11-05 09:06:45', '2025-11-05 09:06:45'),
