  ('zcrm_1579374000172995001', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000148733002', 'Lauren Laqua', NULL, 'Member submitted Change Form to remover herself &amp; her dependents from the membership and make spouse the Primary Member.  We cannot do this as we cannot change the primary.  I emailed the member &amp; advisor letting them know this and if they wanted to proceed they would have to cancel this membership and re-enroll the spouse separately.', 'Patti Baron', 'Patti Baron', '2025-11-05 06:51:55', '2025-11-05 06:51:55'),
