  ('zcrm_1579374000172953037', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000130373002', 'Lisa Wiesen', NULL, 'Lisa called to review her membership. She does all naturopathic wellness that won''t work with MEC. So, we will use HAB for the rest of the year and keep her Care+ membership as is. No changes needed. Her new IUA $1250 and $381 will come into effect for Jan. 2026. Her HAB will auto end.  That''s all for now!', 'Wendy Scipione - SR VP National Sales Advisor', 'Wendy Scipione - SR VP National Sales Advisor', '2025-11-04 17:00:09', '2025-11-04 17:00:09'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000172953032', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000131950002', 'Gabe Rothkamp', NULL, 'Angie came to me via Kristy Barber. Her son is already a member. Angie watched the 9-minute video but needs something for her daughter who has hip dysplasia and needs hip surgery soon. She''s in college at Grand Canyon State as a student. She''s 20 and in AZ for school but CO for permanent residence. After we talked for about 30 min. she let me know her son is a member and enrolled through Kirk. She''s thinking of doing a joint membership with her son. I told her to do so via Kirk. For her daughter she needs a specific complex surgery that they want to get donw at Steadman''s Clinic in Vail. Daughter might qualify for Medicaid while her income is $1000 per month with a marketing job for a turf company. Work picks up in May onward at closer to $3K per month. But, if she has a hip surgery, she won''t be able to work and her income will remain low. Angie will call Steadman''s to see if they accept Medicaid. If not, she will join an ACA plan when she moves back to CO after the semester and get her on a C4 plan. I''ll help her at that point. She also let me know they have CHSM now but mentioned Medishare too. With Medishare she was told to mention private health sharing and by doing so, the price jumped up by $9K for a new Need! She was horrified that they are encouraging not to say self-pay and how much the price increased. Ins thorugh school is $8K per semester. They might keep that through April of 2026.', 'Wendy Scipione - SR VP National Sales Advisor', 'Wendy Scipione - SR VP National Sales Advisor', '2025-11-04 15:55:09', '2025-11-04 15:55:09'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000172953027', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000120893013', 'Ashley Sargent', NULL, 'Ashley wanted to review her membership with losing HAB at the end of the year. She can simply upgrade to Secure HSA for ACA compliant wellness screenings. It will be $359/$1250. The network looks very slim in northern VT and even in BTV. But, ARM will work out an agreement on her behalf with the providers since practically nobody within a 50 mile radius. She''s still healthy and coaching. She got good at submitting to HAB but it''s not her fortay. She and Harper hiked in Austria this summer in Zermatt in Aug. 2 of her kids are graduating/graduated from college and little Harper is the youngest still in school, I think. She also went to Dartmouth Hitchcock for her mammogram and something else and it wonly cost $300 cash pay. She was pleased to see that.', 'Wendy Scipione - SR VP National Sales Advisor', 'Wendy Scipione - SR VP National Sales Advisor', '2025-11-04 15:02:53', '2025-11-04 15:02:53'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000172983103', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000169157001', 'Shawn Aycock', NULL, '11/4/25<br>Called back no response lvm AC', 'Concierge', 'Concierge', '2025-11-04 14:59:47', '2025-11-04 14:59:47'),
