  ('zcrm_1579374000172983006', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000154385019', 'Richard Frazee', NULL, '11/4/25<br>Richard called he went to get his anual wellness check and the provider claims that we never responded to the call to veryfy eligblty so he paid out of pocket. He wanted assistance on how to get reinbursment so i providde him with loris email AC', 'Concierge', 'Concierge', '2025-11-04 13:57:16', '2025-11-04 13:57:16'),
