  ('zcrm_1579374000172970022', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000059725045', 'Michelle Skellion', NULL, 'Michelle called the Concierge line, stating Planstin has been denying the bills for the past 3 years. She is on the phone with them now. Knows that 2025 is with ARM. Will call us back if she has any further questions. JA', 'MPB Health Member Notification', 'MPB Health Member Notification', '2025-11-04 12:14:49', '2025-11-04 12:14:49'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000172970001', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000153327002', 'Rachel Klobucher', NULL, '11.04.2025 - Rachel is having issues with RX Valet filling her script for Estrace estradiol cream. Confirmed with RX Valet that the price is $98.50 for 3 tubes and found a coupon from Good RX for $56.82. JA', 'MPB Health Member Notification', 'MPB Health Member Notification', '2025-11-04 12:08:04', '2025-11-04 12:08:04'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000172953022', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000009143063', 'Adam Rothberg', NULL, 'Adam was inquiring about losing HAB and mentioned Andre had said to  move his membership. However, he has the most affordable option for 50+. He''s using ALL of HAB''s benefits and loves it. He was curious about creating a group for HAB but doesn''t make sense. He can save his $107 and keep Premium Care. He will do his colonoscopy after waiting 6 months. He''s willing to travel to the front range to save $1000+ on the colonoscopy. He knows he has up to $2500 for preventive colonoscopy. I will give him the details for where to go on Front Range this spring/summer when he''s ready.', 'Wendy Scipione - SR VP National Sales Advisor', 'Wendy Scipione - SR VP National Sales Advisor', '2025-11-04 11:53:34', '2025-11-04 11:53:34'),
