  ('zcrm_1579374000172956008', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000168816001', 'Carla London', 'Zoho SalesIQ chat with Concierge', 'Visit ID : 4466 Question : I made an appointment to have my annual figs with Dr. Alejandra Reyes with fusion medical. She is referring me to a place to get a colonoscopy, but when I called to make the appointment, they don’t accept my insurance. Could you please find me some places that accept PHCS?', 'MPB Health Member Notification', 'MPB Health Member Notification', '2025-11-04 11:18:43', '2025-11-04 11:18:43'),
