  ('zcrm_1579374000172927064', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000171404019', 'Aryn Graham', NULL, '11/4/25<br>Followed up with Aryn for missed chat AC<br><span><br></span>Aryn called in later asking the same questions discussed in the chat. She mentioned that her advisor did not disclose that she needed to include her pre-existing condition on the application when she first signed up. Aryn wanted to know how to add this information. I advised her to reach out directly to Zion for assistance (after confirming the process with Patti). Aryn appeared frustrated with the process and requested the cancellation form (AC).<br>', 'Concierge', 'Concierge', '2025-11-04 10:47:20', '2025-11-04 12:55:38'),
