  ('zcrm_1579374000172953009', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000173079093', 'Claire House', NULL, 'Claire makes about $50K with multiple mental health counseling jobs. She and her husband Caleb adopted their son and are paid $1500 a month to care for him. Their income is estimated at just over $50K. They will get a $1618.97 APTC, $1509.97 is APTC and $109 is CO assistance. Husband takes Wellbutrin which is $2 on GoodRX and Concerta which is $34 and up on GoodRX for the generic. She needs a shoulder surgery  for the removal of a lympoma. We discussed the max out of pocket in case it reaches that expense for the surgery. She chose RMHP for $2 her cost and $3350 MOP, $950 Ded. She knows to call RMHP to set up auto pay and initial pay. She couldn''t login to her own account bc she was getting an error message.', 'Wendy Scipione - SR VP National Sales Advisor', 'Wendy Scipione - SR VP National Sales Advisor', '2025-11-04 10:03:43', '2025-11-04 10:03:43'),
