  ('zcrm_1579374000172923182', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000010331041', 'Karen Tips', NULL, 'Member called in about receiving a notice of her payment declining and wanted to update it.  I explained to her that we had reached out to her several times after 10/20 billing date to get a payment update and that the deadline for the November payment was 10/31.  She asked if it could be reinstated.  I told her it was too late and that she would have to contact Darius Kohanim to re-enroll for a December 1, 2025 start date.  She stated she tried to reach him and that he is no longer with the company.  I confirmed that he is still active and with the same company. I gave her his number to reach out.  She asked if it would still be the same pricing.  I told her eff 12/20 that there is a modest price increase with Zion and Darius would be able to review the new pricing schedule.', 'Michele R', 'Michele R', '2025-11-04 08:30:31', '2025-11-04 08:30:31'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000172944001', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000141795002', 'Stephen Hillmer', NULL, '11/04/2025<br>Member called after going to the hospital for a heart issue. He had not been hospitalized or anything like that but did have cholesterol and was on statins. Again he said it was under control and was being maintained through medicaton But Sedera is calling it a ore-ex and not covering anything on a $145,000 bill. Going to assist them in the appeals process and let Catherine and Julia know about this so we can try and help these members.<br>AJ', 'Concierge', 'Concierge', '2025-11-04 08:30:30', '2025-11-04 08:30:30'),
