  ('zcrm_1579374000172923082', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000155243095', 'Christian Mason', NULL, 'Member called in to check on the Payment Update Form that he submitted on 11/3 for his 11/25 share amount that was declined and subsequently Membership was cancelled on 10/31.  I explained that we tried to reach out to him via em and vm to update his payment by 10/31/25 for his November payment, and unfortunately had to cancel his Membership eff 11/1.  He asked if there was anyway to be reinstated for November.  I told him not at this time - that he would have to reach out to Zac Masters to re-enroll for a December 1, 2025. start date.  He said he would contact Zac to do so.', 'Michele R', 'Michele R', '2025-11-04 08:10:31', '2025-11-04 08:10:58'),
