  ('zcrm_1579374000172798114', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000125085043', 'Myles Vlachos', NULL, 'Member submitted payment update form. I will process.  I also emailed him the Member Update Form to let us know which email address is best, as he indicated several different email addresses on the Payment Update Form.', 'Michele R', 'Michele R', '2025-11-03 13:53:11', '2025-11-03 13:53:11'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000172808148', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000065366082', 'Irene Mendyuk', NULL, 'Member submitted cancellation eff 11/3.  I spoke to Karina and she authorized me to refund the 11/25 Share Amount so member will calm down.  Reba will be in contact with Sutart Lubline /advisor &amp; Jeff Kanter to reach ou to this member and smooth the situation out.', 'Patti Baron', 'Patti Baron', '2025-11-03 13:43:35', '2025-11-03 13:43:35'),
