  ('zcrm_1579374000172798104', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000128554002', 'George Wilson', NULL, 'Member called in needing to cancel his Membership.  I will send him out the cancellation link to submit.', 'Michele R', 'Michele R', '2025-11-03 13:18:06', '2025-11-03 13:18:06'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000172809090', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000129985028', 'Phil Welch', NULL, '11/3/25<br>Brittnay called because her son had a shoulder injury and wanted to know how to use the plan AC', 'Concierge', 'Concierge', '2025-11-03 13:10:00', '2025-11-03 13:10:00'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000172809085', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000081920010', 'Daniel Minerva', NULL, '11/3/25<br>Assisted Daniel with loging into the health wallet App Ac<br><span><br></span>', 'Concierge', 'Concierge', '2025-11-03 13:09:46', '2025-11-03 13:09:46'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000172808143', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000154754002', 'Kelly Brown', NULL, 'Member called in and asked why she had been getting charged since 2/25 when she wanted to cancel.  I looked at the notes and they reference the fact that Jnae sent her to wrong cancellation form and she wanted to cancel her Short Term Medical.  When I explained this to member she told me that Jane has been "a nightmare" and now wants to cancel.  I will send her out the Cancellation Link.', 'Patti Baron', 'Patti Baron', '2025-11-03 12:52:07', '2025-11-03 12:52:07'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000172809080', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000128527002', 'James Regli', NULL, '11/3/25<br>James called becuase he needed the assistance fiiling out the update form to add his child Ac', 'Concierge', 'Concierge', '2025-11-03 12:51:02', '2025-11-03 12:51:02'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000172813074', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000166515002', 'Millard ANGE', NULL, '11/3/25 sent RX quotes<br><ul style="list-style-type:disc;list-style-position:inside;"><li style="list-style-image:none;"><p style="display:inline;"><span style="color:rgb(17, 17, 17);font-weight:normal;font-style:normal;">Name of medicine: Pharmacy name = $</span></p></li><li style="list-style-image:none;"><p style="display:inline;"><span style="color:rgb(17, 17, 17);font-weight:normal;font-style:normal;">Fenofibrate: CVS = $33.42 or Walgreens = $123.62</span></p></li><li style="list-style-image:none;"><p style="display:inline;"><span style="color:rgb(17, 17, 17);font-weight:normal;font-style:normal;">Lisinopril: Walgreens = $21.86</span></p></li><li style="list-style-image:none;"><p style="display:inline;"><span style="color:rgb(17, 17, 17);font-weight:normal;font-style:normal;">Atorvastatin: Walgreens = $23.45</span></p></li><li style="list-style-image:none;"><p style="display:inline;"><span style="color:rgb(17, 17, 17);font-weight:normal;font-style:normal;">Bisoprlol Fumarate: CVS - $31.09 or Walgreens for $120.31</span></p></li><li style="list-style-image:none;"><p style="display:inline;"><span style="color:rgb(17, 17, 17);font-weight:normal;font-style:normal;">Sildenafil:</span><span style="color:rgb(17, 17, 17);background-color:rgba(0, 0, 0, 0);font-weight:normal;font-style:normal;">Walgreens = $18.15</span></p></li><li style="list-style-image:none;color:rgb(17, 17, 17);font-style:normal;"><p style="display:inline;"><span style="color:rgb(17, 17, 17);background-color:rgba(0, 0, 0, 0);font-weight:normal;font-style:normal;">Aj</span></p></li></ul>', 'Concierge', 'Concierge', '2025-11-03 12:50:01', '2025-11-03 12:50:01'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000172808138', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000065366082', 'Irene Mendyuk', NULL, 'Member called in and demanded that she be cancelled due to the fact that we were "under  investigation".  I will send out Cancellation to be effective 11/30/2025', 'Patti Baron', 'Patti Baron', '2025-11-03 12:45:02', '2025-11-03 12:45:02'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000172813069', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000157242002', 'Christopher Mitchell', NULL, '11/3/25<br>used Sales IQ to reach out and find out what to do about an injury, it might be torn bicep, let him know he could get a scan ordered from the telehealth. Explained how telehealth could help and guided him to it<br>AJ', 'Concierge', 'Concierge', '2025-11-03 12:36:24', '2025-11-03 12:36:24'),
