  ('zcrm_1579374000172809069', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000131743016', 'Anna Suchowian', NULL, '11/3/25<br>Anna had some expenses related to her breast and a biopsy. I advised her to open a sharing request and explaied to her how her plan works AC', 'Concierge', 'Concierge', '2025-11-03 12:05:07', '2025-11-03 12:05:07'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000172808121', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000131323002', 'Jonathan Cockrill', NULL, 'Member called in and had many questions as she had been submitted bill to Planstin.  I told her that we notified the members when we parted ways with Planstin and I then found out that they requested to go to ARM early eff 11/1/24.  I told her to download the app and she could get her new card that way.  I explained the difference between Preventative &amp; Diagnostic and how they are handled.  I advised she needs to have her provider re-submit all the Preventative visits to ARM and that diagnostic visits would be out of pocket.', 'Patti Baron', 'Patti Baron', '2025-11-03 11:47:55', '2025-11-03 11:47:55'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000172813035', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000170439002', 'Raymond Balgie', NULL, '11/3/25<br>Ray called to get advice on his wifes ER visit and upcoming treatment. explained IUA and share requests. Then sent him a list of PCP and OBGYN for them to schedule yearlys after choosing some providers off the list<br>AJ', 'Concierge', 'Concierge', '2025-11-03 11:30:59', '2025-11-03 11:30:59'),
