  ('zcrm_1579374000172809049', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000168235002', 'Andrew Swisher', NULL, '10/31/25<br>Andre called back again because zion still could not assist him, after the IT department looked into is they saw the file transfer was sent correctly I attempted to do a three way call with zion but the recodring stated they where away for a meeting . AC', 'Concierge', 'Concierge', '2025-11-03 10:07:20', '2025-11-03 10:07:20'),
