  ('zcrm_1579374000172662006', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000132391010', 'Robert Skubiak', NULL, '10/30/2025<br>Called with questions about how the IUA would work for an MRI for their son. I called back and expained how the process works and what to do with bills, also let her know to call for help if she gets confused or overwhelmed so we can help her. Going to email her what to say to the doctors to begin the process of starting a share request<br>AJ', 'Concierge', 'Concierge', '2025-10-30 13:09:16', '2025-10-30 13:30:11'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000172631108', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000043575167', 'Peggy Neises', '10/30', 'called with questions on her cataract surgery coming up, told her based on that amount of the time shes been on the plan (3 years) she meets the criteria for sharing on it and then i explained the nuances. Also is in need of a bone marrow biopsy, explained that would be a separate iua. then i had her download the mpb health app  - Tupac manzanarez', 'Tupac Manzanarez', 'Tupac Manzanarez', '2025-10-30 13:03:09', '2025-10-30 13:03:09'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000172662001', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000163360001', 'Blythe Burge', NULL, '10/30/2025<br>Blythe called to just get some info on her membership since she was confused. answered her questions on how preventative works and how to get RX needs taken care of<br>AJ', 'Concierge', 'Concierge', '2025-10-30 12:55:13', '2025-10-30 12:55:13'),
