  ('zcrm_1579374000172631082', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000168816001', 'Carla London', '10/30', 'She called in Frustrated about her experience finding a provider, I let her know to fill out the schedule appointment form and we would find her a provider /appointment for her annual physical, also had her download the app and told her to text my direct line if she needed anything escalated(she''s my member) - Tupac Manzanarez', 'Tupac Manzanarez', 'Tupac Manzanarez', '2025-10-30 12:20:50', '2025-10-30 12:20:50'),
