  ('zcrm_1579374000172575060', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000170542002', 'David Daniel', NULL, '10/29/25<br>David Called to see if vison was included in his plan. He also wanted to know if there any updaes regarding his plan. I let him know about the price increase and the health wallet app AC', 'Concierge', 'Concierge', '2025-10-29 13:43:21', '2025-10-29 13:43:21'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000172568119', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000154665002', 'Leslie Ashley', NULL, '10/29/2025<br>questions about how share request works and where to put the bills she has. let her know she needs to speak to zion also if she has a couple specific questions on where zion is in the process. <br>AJ', 'Concierge', 'Concierge', '2025-10-29 13:35:41', '2025-10-29 13:35:41'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000172575055', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000064277164', 'Raissa Wilkes', NULL, '10/29/25<br>Advised Raissa that the IUA must meet within a <b>6-month period from the first date of service</b>, so she may still be eligible to <b>open a sharing request</b>. Explained that the program is <b>not traditional insurance</b> and functions differently. Clarified that the <b>$2,500 IUA</b> applies <b>per medical incident</b> and does <b>not work like a deductible</b>. Noted that a <b>broken foot</b> can be an expensive medical incident and encouraged her to <b>gather all related bills</b> and <b>submit a sharing request</b> for review AC', 'Concierge', 'Concierge', '2025-10-29 13:31:07', '2025-10-29 13:31:07'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000172575050', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000000165383', 'Tyler McMahon', NULL, '10/29/25<br>responded to email Apologized for any confusion regarding lab services. Advised the member to contact <b>Laboratory Assist</b> directly at <b>1-888-531-2030</b> for further assistance. Informed them that a <b>referral is required</b> to complete lab work and that they can obtain one <b>for free through our telemedicine service</b>. AC', 'Concierge', 'Concierge', '2025-10-29 13:25:11', '2025-10-29 13:25:11'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000172568097', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000086852002', 'Brandon Ciullo', NULL, '10/29/2025<br>Called back to return VM - Left VM - spoke to him and he wanted dental insurance quotes.<br>AJ<br>AJ', 'Concierge', 'Concierge', '2025-10-29 13:20:51', '2025-10-29 13:26:06'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000172568092', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000110082002', 'Elizabeth Sayre', NULL, '10/29/2025<br>Provider called so i called back and left a VM<br>AJ', 'Concierge', 'Concierge', '2025-10-29 13:19:39', '2025-10-29 13:19:39'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000172566029', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000027674051', 'Michelle Searles', NULL, '10-29-25 Shelly will change to Premium HSA and had a change of address all to take effect Jan. 1st 2026. They will lose HAB and still want ACA wellness. It will be $988 instead of $877+$250. Savings money but losing many benefits and flexibility. They already did their colonoscopies so they don''t have those to worry about for another 10 years or so. She completed the Change Form and got the confirmation page.', 'Wendy Scipione - SR VP National Sales Advisor', 'Wendy Scipione - SR VP National Sales Advisor', '2025-10-29 13:18:03', '2025-10-29 13:18:03'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000172575045', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000012273746', 'David Peck', '10/29/25', 'David called because the telemedicine provider wrote him a ref real and could not find it in the dashboard. I assisted the member is finding the referral AC', 'Concierge', 'Concierge', '2025-10-29 13:13:45', '2025-10-29 13:13:45'),
