  ('zcrm_1579374000172575001', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000170338002', 'Jeremiah Headrick', NULL, '10/29/25<br>Cathernie called after abandoning the chat she had questions on how her plan works. I went over every single detail of the plan. I pretty much a welcome call with her. I still advised her to go through the welcome call AC', 'Concierge', 'Concierge', '2025-10-29 12:37:51', '2025-10-29 12:37:51'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000172568074', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000156744038', 'David Descoteaux', NULL, '10/29/2025<br>David called to find out a little more about what is and isnt covered with preventative care. He got extra diagnostic tests and they did not pay for the office visit itself which was a general physical. So we called ARm together to see why they did not pay for the office visit charge. ARM spoke with him and the bill was very mixed up. She got his info and is going to send him what they have on file so they can figure out what is going on with that bill. <br>AJ', 'Concierge', 'Concierge', '2025-10-29 12:33:24', '2025-10-29 12:33:24'),
