  ('zcrm_1579374000172566006', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000009850101', 'Elizabeth Spano', NULL, '10-29-25 Lizzy wants th keep HAB if possible by including her employer in the conversation. But, he''s most interested in having co-pays for Dr. visits. None of our usual options allow for that. Perhaps SW Co-Pay can meet their needs. I''ll research and get back to her. Owner is 38 with a family. No pre-x that she knows of but who knows. She uses the ACA wellness visits, mental health and gym. She can still get the ACA wellness and virtual mental health.', 'Wendy Scipione - SR VP National Sales Advisor', 'Wendy Scipione - SR VP National Sales Advisor', '2025-10-29 11:59:27', '2025-10-29 11:59:27'),
