  ('zcrm_1579374000172518018', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000011752368', 'Jill Fields', NULL, '10/29/2025<br>Jill called to get assitance logging into her app. had to add her in the system then she was able to login.<br>AJ', 'Adam Jordano', 'Adam Jordano', '2025-10-29 08:57:16', '2025-10-29 08:57:16'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000172525070', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000080945002', 'Macay Hunter', NULL, 'Member called in with questions about eligibility.  I advised that he would be eligible as long as he is a business owner.  He told me that he is negotiating with the business owner where he works to take over the business when he retires.  So this potentially won''t happen until then.  I told him that there could be tax consequences if he was not yet a business owner. He did not feel comfortable doing this as yet and asked me to delete his request..   He also asked about opening a HSA and I told him that he could open that anywhere he wants, however we had a relationship with HSA Bank.  He is fine for now.', 'Patti Baron', 'Patti Baron', '2025-10-29 08:34:09', '2025-10-29 08:34:09'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000172538001', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000149298019', 'Jeremy Pevahouse', NULL, '10/29/25<br>Sent Jeremy to apologize for the delay in researching a dermatologist AC', 'Concierge', 'Concierge', '2025-10-29 08:25:17', '2025-10-29 08:25:17'),
