  ('zcrm_1579374000172494176', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000173079093', 'Claire House', NULL, '10-27-25 Claire is 42, husband is 42 and kid 10. She wants to have some surgery as quickly as possibly in Jan. So, she wanted to choose her plan now but it''s not available. They had Medicaid and didn''t know they were kicked off back in May of 2025. We set an appointment at 9:00 am on the Tuesday upon my return. If she has chosen a plan on her own before that time, she will let me know.', 'Wendy Scipione - SR VP National Sales Advisor', 'Wendy Scipione - SR VP National Sales Advisor', '2025-10-28 20:57:29', '2025-10-28 20:57:29'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000172494166', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000172499002', 'Mary Dube', NULL, '10-28-25 Mary is 53 and moved here from CA. It looks like she was a member before but I forgot. She was referred to me again by Nancy Gentry. Mary just finished her job and her BC/BS plan will be ending Oct. 31st. She will join Cobra only if something arises before Dec. 1st. Cobra will be about $3200! She was recently divorced. She earns a little with a 1099 contract job. She thinks $8K or so. She''s looking for her next job. She does her wellness visits and will fund an HSA. Her previous company called Monterey Peninsula Foundation, a non-profit an CA has the most extraordinary benefits I''ve ever heard of. They paid the full monthly payment, they funded an FSA at $18K and they paid ALL of their out of pocket health expenses! They are funded by major golf tournaments and events. She had a thyroid nodule that was inconclusive. However more recent results came back saying it''s 99% NOT cancer. She''s not worried about it at all. I shared Premium HSA and Secure HSA and she chose Secure HSA in case caps are added with the Premium memberships. She has a Dec. 1st start date at the $1000/$419 and then  $1250/$448 for 2026.  She all set and will schedule her Welcome call. She made sure to put Nancy Gentry''s name on the app as well.', 'Wendy Scipione - SR VP National Sales Advisor', 'Wendy Scipione - SR VP National Sales Advisor', '2025-10-28 20:52:19', '2025-10-28 20:52:19'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000172466251', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000128851002', 'Erin Swietlik', NULL, '10/28/25<br>Erin called to see if she should provide the dermatologist her mpb health card. I explained that it wont be covered and it would be an out of pocket expense AC', 'Concierge', 'Concierge', '2025-10-28 15:10:45', '2025-10-28 15:10:55'),
