  ('zcrm_1579374000172481224', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000011521138', 'Jamie Solow', 'Spouse Aging into Medicare Eff 01/01/26 (Green Side)', '10/28- 1st notice sent to member &amp; advisor via em<br>10/29- Member called in regarding the notice.  Wanted to know how to complete the form. I told him not to send it in until after December 1st, and that we would be sending him a second notice in a month.  He asked when Gina would be off this membership. I told him effective Jan 1 2026. He stated that he has never had to submit a need, but his wife did and mentioned that Zion did an excellent job in handling the need. He was pleased.<br>12/11-2nd notice sent to member via em  spouse removed.', 'Michele R', 'Michele R', '2025-10-28 14:31:57', '2025-12-11 10:09:26'),
