  ('zcrm_1579374000172466105', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000122615027', 'Sean Conroy', NULL, '10/28/25<br><br>Contacted member regarding lab charges. Advised that their responsibility is <b>$125.82</b> out of <b>$774.30</b>. Explained that the labs were <b>not coded as preventive</b>, therefore <b>not covered</b> under preventive benefits. Informed member they may contact their provider’s office or insurance carrier for further clarification regarding coding or coverage.<br>AC', 'Concierge', 'Concierge', '2025-10-28 14:15:54', '2025-10-28 14:15:54'),
