  ('zcrm_1579374000172481186', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000139351002', 'Debra Rankin', 'Member Aging into Medicare Eff 01/01/26', '10/28- 1st notice sent to member &amp; advisor via em<br>11/4-Member submitted Cancellation eff 11/30 I will process.<br>11/10-Member called in to check on the status of her cancellation.  She never received the email cancellation notice that Patti sent out on 11/4.  Patti resent it to her today.  She confirmed receipt.', 'Michele R', 'Michele R', '2025-10-28 13:52:53', '2025-11-10 07:37:37'),
