  ('zcrm_1579374000172501153', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000156613002', 'Roberto Valle', NULL, '10/28/2025<br>Called to find out what to do if he gets employed again. Let him know since he is on MEC plan he needs to maintain 1099 or some form of EIN/TIN type status or he could get a penalty. LEt him know to also talk to a tax pro.<br>AJ', 'Concierge', 'Concierge', '2025-10-28 13:26:37', '2025-10-28 13:26:37'),
