  ('zcrm_1579374000172466059', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000108294002', 'John Mone', NULL, '10/28/25<br>John called in to see is it was true that they only cover up to 3k for weight loss reduction. We went over the Guidelines, I followed regarding his appeal for the sharing request for terzepitide. They informed me Zion approved the appeal and are good to go on the sharing request AC', 'Concierge', 'Concierge', '2025-10-28 13:12:36', '2025-10-28 13:12:36'),
