  ('zcrm_1579374000172457042', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000160141002', 'Sabrina Reich', NULL, 'Member called in and let me know that she had now started a new job and was going to be starting benefits.  I will send out Cancellation Link.  Leo is aware.', 'Patti Baron', 'Patti Baron', '2025-10-28 12:35:45', '2025-10-28 12:35:45'),
