  ('zcrm_1579374000172481045', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000164264001', 'Carrie Stone', 'Spouse Turning 50 Eff 01/26', '10/28- 1st notice sent to member &amp; advisor via em<br>12/11-2nd notice sent to ember &amp; advisor via em price updated', 'Michele R', 'Michele R', '2025-10-28 11:49:58', '2025-12-11 08:07:30'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000172501020', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000132391010', 'Robert Skubiak', NULL, '10/28/2025<br>VM return, wanted more info on mental health options. also going to send her the guidelines and info for her advisor since she is questioning the features of the membership and wants more options for substance abuse treatment. i then put everything she asked for in an email and sent her the information. Her advisors contact info, info on mental health, and tried to give guidance on where to go for help.<br>AJ', 'Concierge', 'Concierge', '2025-10-28 11:45:55', '2025-10-29 11:56:40'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000172501001', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000167582001', 'Rodney Spangler', NULL, '10/28/2025<br>Helping Jessica with login issues. need IT to assist since it looks like the data was never sent out for them to be added to the app for health wallet login<br>AJ', 'Concierge', 'Concierge', '2025-10-28 11:44:00', '2025-10-28 11:44:00'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000172481031', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000153844002', 'Eric Hill', 'Spouse Turning 30 Eff 01/26', '10/28- 1st notice sent to member &amp; advisor via em<br>12/8-2nd notice sent to member &amp; advisor via em price updated', 'Michele R', 'Michele R', '2025-10-28 11:32:09', '2025-12-08 13:42:06'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000172466051', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000144941008', 'Scott Stier', NULL, '10/28/25<br>Scott called to verify if a vision exam for his children would be covered I informed him that it would not AC<br>', 'Concierge', 'Concierge', '2025-10-28 11:06:45', '2025-10-28 11:07:00'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000172494023', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000071157012', 'Kia Tolan', NULL, '10-28-25 Per the HMA email, "<span style="color:rgb(36, 36, 36);">Hi Wendy,</span><br><p style=""><span style="color:rgb(36, 36, 36);"><br></span></p><p style=""><span style="color:rgb(36, 36, 36);">Thanks for letting me know. I thankfully closed my account a couple of years ago. </span></p><p style=""><span style="color:rgb(36, 36, 36);"><br></span></p><p style=""><span style="color:rgb(36, 36, 36);">I was actually planning to reach out to you this week because I wanted to chat through my options with my Health Access Solutions plan coming to an end in December. Do you have time to chat this week or next? Thanks!"</span></p>', 'Wendy Scipione - SR VP National Sales Advisor', 'Wendy Scipione - SR VP National Sales Advisor', '2025-10-28 10:37:06', '2025-10-28 10:37:06'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000172466044', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000036593010', 'Suzanne Martinek', NULL, '10/28/25<br>Assisted Suzanne with accessing her dermatologist benefit in telemedacine AC', 'Concierge', 'Concierge', '2025-10-28 10:30:10', '2025-10-28 10:30:10'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000172494018', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000043959250', 'Brigitte Fleeman', NULL, '10-28-25 Per the HMA, <span style="color:rgb(36, 36, 36);">"Hi Wendy,</span><br><p style=""><span style="color:rgb(36, 36, 36);"><br></span></p><p style=""><span style="color:rgb(36, 36, 36);">Thank you for the information, indeed bad news. I assume it’s best not to pay the monthly contribution anymore or does that impact whatever money we would get paid out through a class action lawsuit? If we quit paying, then the contract is voided as one of the victims stated, that’s how they kept us hostage. What do you recommend? Thank you for your help and support!</span></p><p style="">Brigitte" </p>', 'Wendy Scipione - SR VP National Sales Advisor', 'Wendy Scipione - SR VP National Sales Advisor', '2025-10-28 10:27:42', '2025-10-28 10:27:42'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000172494013', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000081869008', 'Frederick Koen', NULL, '10-28-25 Per the HMA, <span style="color:rgb(36, 36, 36);">"Hi Wendy,</span><br><p style=""><span style="color:rgb(36, 36, 36);"><br></span></p><p style=""><span style="color:rgb(36, 36, 36);">Thank you for your email. I should have listened to my husband like 2 years ago but we are now where we are. With the FBI being involved, I imagine now that they will halt any withdrawals? I am not hopeful for us getting back money.</span></p><p style=""><span style="color:rgb(36, 36, 36);"><br></span></p><p style=""><span style="color:rgb(36, 36, 36);">Thanks,</span></p><p style=""><span style="color:rgb(36, 36, 36);">Tina Koen"</span></p>', 'Wendy Scipione - SR VP National Sales Advisor', 'Wendy Scipione - SR VP National Sales Advisor', '2025-10-28 10:26:32', '2025-10-28 10:26:32'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000172494008', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000071712080', 'James Fuson', NULL, '10-28-25  Per the HMA email I sent, <br><p style=""><span style="">"Totally not surprised. I new this was a scam when they kept giving me the run around and wouldn’t stop taking money out of my bank! I had to put a stop payment in through my bank! Crooks!</span></p><p style=""><span style="">Yes, I had a few thousand dollars I had to write off. I called my attorney, but he said unless it was in the 10s of thousands of dollars it wasn’t worth it. That’s the game they play. Well I hope they get busted big with the new DOJ.\\</span></p><p style=""><span style=""> </span></p><p style=""><span style="">Thanks for the heads up though.</span></p><p style=""><span style=""> </span></p><p style=""><span style="">Jim"</span></p>', 'Wendy Scipione - SR VP National Sales Advisor', 'Wendy Scipione - SR VP National Sales Advisor', '2025-10-28 10:25:24', '2025-10-28 10:25:24'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000172494001', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000035480088', 'Sheila Finch-Manzagol', NULL, '10-28-25 Sheila called to better understand what''s happening with the HMA. I let her know what I know so far. I''ll keep her in the loop if I learn anything more.  She has about $14K in the account. She was finally able to get her cataract surgery reimbursed for 50%, ie. $3600 of the $7200 bill last year. She had made progress but knew she couldn''t get her money out any other way. UGH! She was very nice and will keep my phone number.', 'Wendy Scipione - SR VP National Sales Advisor', 'Wendy Scipione - SR VP National Sales Advisor', '2025-10-28 10:24:01', '2025-10-28 10:24:01'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000172453060', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000018505034', 'Mary Sundblom', 'Followup - 10/28', 'I followed up and left a voicemail about her app login status and pcp virtual appointment.', 'Tupac Manzanarez', 'Tupac Manzanarez', '2025-10-28 10:07:40', '2025-10-28 10:07:40'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000172482028', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000167583028', 'Benjamin Wilkey', NULL, 'Welcome call complete. Member didn''t get email with link to create Zion member portal. Sent info over to Acelyn. Vanessa Orozco', 'Concierge', 'Concierge', '2025-10-28 10:02:28', '2025-10-28 10:32:09'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000172453052', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000005692772', 'Marguerite Sherwin', '10/28', 'She called me back and let me know that she feels like she''s paying for nothing, she''s been on the plan for 8 years and has almost never used it. She wants preventative care, so I reccomended scure hsa, sent her over a list of clinics in network and also an email with the member change form and link to secure hsa overview. I also compared our coverage to aca coverage to show her the cost difference and what the real benefit of our plans are in comparsion. she said she''ll look into secure hsa and make her decision soon. She also said she has no money coming in currently and will potentially end up not being able to afford our monthly fees. I will followup next month a week before the deadline 11/13 - Tupac Manzanarez', 'Tupac Manzanarez', 'Tupac Manzanarez', '2025-10-28 09:56:32', '2025-10-28 09:56:32'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000172481011', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000129985028', 'Phil Welch', 'Member Turning 50 Eff 01/26', '10/28- 1st notice sent to member &amp; advisor via em<br>12/8-2nd notice sent to member &amp; advisor via em price updated', 'Michele R', 'Michele R', '2025-10-28 09:38:15', '2025-12-08 13:11:41'),
