  ('zcrm_1579374000172453001', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000135320002', 'Wilfred Thibodeau', '10/28', 'Charlene thibodeaux called in saying she thinks we have a data breach, because she was texted that her medication was recalled (atorvastatin calcium) , the pharmacy(walgreens) never heard of the recall. Her family physician(Jason Goldie) prescribed it. After doing research I found out they recalled her atorvastatin nationwide, and I informed her to call the pharmacy she picked up the last bottle of it for her husband to confirm if that one should have been recalled as well.', 'Tupac Manzanarez', 'Tupac Manzanarez', '2025-10-28 07:46:03', '2025-10-28 07:46:03'),
