  ('zcrm_1579374000172447035', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000073820044', 'Kathryn Schneider', NULL, 'Member called in wanting assistance on how to change her last name.  I told her I would send her the member update form.  She also asked if it was going to be a problem with processing claims as she is going to her annual physical tomorrow and will change the name there as well.  I told her it is best practice to update her name with every provider, and that we would update our systems and Zion as soon as she submits the form. Sent Member Update Form to submit.', 'Michele R', 'Michele R', '2025-10-28 07:26:24', '2025-10-28 07:28:43'),
