  ('zcrm_1579374000172413003', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000043386031', 'Robert Eberlein', NULL, '10-27-25 Robert is an HMA member and he discovered his account looks wiped out and found some articles about the FBI raid! I just got an email this morning from Rod about it that I just read. Robert has about $14K in his account and hopes to get some of that money back of course. He has several outstanding bills that he was hoping to pay from there. Now he will have to wait to see if the FBI is able to recover the funds.', 'Wendy Scipione - SR VP National Sales Advisor', 'Wendy Scipione - SR VP National Sales Advisor', '2025-10-27 12:18:38', '2025-10-27 12:18:38'),
