  ('zcrm_1579374000172390048', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000153947018', 'Maritza Galaviz', NULL, '10/27/2025<br>Maritze called to see when her last well visit was so we called ARM together to make sure we know the exact date. It was in march so she is not able to get another one until march 2026. She needed to go to update her records since she has foster kids and they need it for that. She will just go to a place and do cash pay after i even recommended telehealth and she said that would not work for her. <br>AJ', 'Concierge', 'Concierge', '2025-10-27 11:11:18', '2025-10-27 11:11:18'),
