  ('zcrm_1579374000172391001', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000172068008', 'Christopher Price', NULL, '10/27- Becky Ottoman from HSA for America called in stating that she is taking over this Member from Advisor Chris Felix, who was working with the Member Christopher Price.  The Member called Becky wanting to know if his Tax ID was completed and also how to access his benefits starting 12/1/25.  I reviewed that the Tax ID has been updated and that he was notified via email on 10/21.  I also reviewed that the Member will not have access to the app until 12/1 and gave her the Concierge Department number to give Member to schedule his Welcome Call and to review the App features on or after 12/1.  She asked to receive a link to see the App. I told her that only Members have access to the app.  I also told her to get in touch with Reba regarding the switch from Advisor Chris Felix to her to be sure we have our records updated.  She will send an email to Reba to review and, will also call Christopher Price with these updates.', 'Michele R', 'Michele R', '2025-10-27 09:31:17', '2025-10-27 09:33:18'),
