  ('zcrm_1579374000172375025', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000164305005', 'Ryan Roche', 'Decline of 11/25 Share Amount', '10/27- 1st notice sent to member &amp; advisor via em &amp; vm but it stated that the number was not a working number. Resent email to member &amp; advisor about the number not working<br>10/29- 2nd attempt to send Final notice to member &amp; advisor via em. Email  bounced permanently blocked.<br>10/31-Member cancelled due to non pmt<br>11/3-Final notice sent', 'Michele R', 'Michele R', '2025-10-27 07:25:28', '2025-11-03 07:51:40'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000172376003', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000155313028', 'Jeffrey Veden', NULL, 'Member called in on 10/24/25 wanting to change his IUA to $1000 from $5000.  He was told by Mel that I would be able to do that for him.  I advised that Sedera members are only allowed to lower their IUA during the groups Open Enrollment which is 5/1-5/20 every year.  Member asked why I was the only one who knew that.  Member asked me to have Mel Fonseca call him back.  I made Reba aware of this and she will be getting back with Mel', 'Patti Baron', 'Patti Baron', '2025-10-27 07:22:55', '2025-10-27 07:22:55'),
