  ('zcrm_1579374000172330037', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000173398002', 'Dave Carpenter', NULL, '10-24-25 <br><span style="color:rgb(34, 34, 34);">Thank you for reaching out! Cory and I have been besties forever! She told me about you last year and now I''m finally taking the plunge. </span><br><span style="color:rgb(34, 34, 34);"><br></span><span style="color:rgb(34, 34, 34);">Some info for you...</span><br><span style="color:rgb(34, 34, 34);">Dave and I are self-employed and we have one daughter in college. We are both turning 60 soon (yuck).</span><br><span style="color:rgb(34, 34, 34);">Currently we are on the Blue Shield Bronze 60 HDHP PPO plan thru Covered California.  The plan premium is increasing from $3360 to $4021 in 2026. Our 2025 premium help credit for 2025 is $1435. Since our income went up from 2024 we will owe some of the money back to the government once we file our 2025 taxes. Our deductible is $6650 indiv/$13300 family. </span><br><span style="color:rgb(34, 34, 34);">Dave has a preexisting condition with back problems. No surgeries or planned surgeries. We pay out of pocket for his chiropractor. We have no dental or vision. </span><br><span style="color:rgb(34, 34, 34);"><br></span><span style="color:rgb(34, 34, 34);">We would like to look into a less expensive plan where we can go to our same doctors. If Dave''s situation is an issue maybe we can look at Cassady and myself on a self-insured plan. </span><br><span style="color:rgb(34, 34, 34);"><br></span><span style="color:rgb(34, 34, 34);">We are heading out of town tomorrow afternoon and will be home Nov. 3rd. Can we set up a time that week?</span><br><span style="color:rgb(34, 34, 34);">If you have any info you can share with me in an email please feel free. </span><br><span style="color:rgb(34, 34, 34);"><br></span><span style="color:rgb(34, 34, 34);">Thank you very much.</span><br><span style="color:rgb(34, 34, 34);">I look forward to chatting with you.</span><br><span style="color:rgb(34, 34, 34);"><br></span><span style="color:rgb(34, 34, 34);">Cheers </span><br><span style="color:rgb(34, 34, 34);">Kim Carpenter</span><br><span style="color:rgb(34, 34, 34);"><br></span>', 'Wendy Scipione - SR VP National Sales Advisor', 'Wendy Scipione - SR VP National Sales Advisor', '2025-10-24 21:29:01', '2025-10-24 21:29:01'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000172276027', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000045739067', 'Rachel Namordi', NULL, '10-24-25 Her email is showing up as Rachel Klein now.', 'Wendy Scipione - SR VP National Sales Advisor', 'Wendy Scipione - SR VP National Sales Advisor', '2025-10-24 15:39:06', '2025-10-24 17:39:19'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000172276022', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000045739067', 'Rachel Namordi', NULL, '10-24-25 Rachel called bc she''s receiving a bunch of old balance bills from mammogram in 2023, ER in Dec. 2024, mammo Jan 16, 2025 for various amounts. Redirect and Sedera have both paid their portion already. I told her to contact BCH and make sure they don''t have any insurance on file and to remove all balance bills. She also went and got labs from Lab Corp which were $100 in the past and now $700 this time around. I told her to contact the MPB Concierge Team for help with labs next time to avoid this problem.  She will go back to them and encourage a bill adjustment for self-pay again. She was a good sport and will follow through. She had a bunch of health issues which is why she''s only just now focusing on it.', 'Wendy Scipione - SR VP National Sales Advisor', 'Wendy Scipione - SR VP National Sales Advisor', '2025-10-24 15:38:13', '2025-10-24 15:38:13'),
