  ('zcrm_1579374000172249346', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000061161060', 'Lauren Wagner', NULL, '10/24/25<br>Emailed member to confirm they have preventive coverage. Explained that their plan has two portions — Zion covers catastrophic events only, and MPB Health covers preventive and routine care. Advised that there are no network restrictions under Zion. Informed member that for preventive services to be fully covered, they must present their MPB Health card, ensure the provider is in the PHCS network, and have the provider send the claim to the P.O. Box listed on the back of the<a style="" target="_blank"> card.AC</a>', 'Concierge', 'Concierge', '2025-10-24 13:50:11', '2025-10-24 13:50:18'),
