  ('zcrm_1579374000172249329', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000163372002', 'Omari Bernard', NULL, '10/24/25<br>Omari called needing help find a discount on Jublia medication, after searching most discount card are around $700 his provider sent it to a local pharmacy where they have it for $70. I told him that that might just be the best prices AC', 'Concierge', 'Concierge', '2025-10-24 13:30:57', '2025-10-24 13:30:57'),
