  ('zcrm_1579374000172276017', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000175064001', 'Mary Luna', NULL, '10-23-25 Mary Luna, 60 was referred by April Porterfield.  She''s been with Kaiser pretty much her entire life and mostly with a large group plan. She''s now paying $500 and her APTC is $400. No matter what happens with the APTC''s she can get Secure HSA for less than her portion of the cost. I recommended Secure HSA since she wants wellness and what April Porterfield speaks highly about. She has MS but hasn''t had it treated in about 27 years. She doesn''t take any meds, no tobacco. She wants a Jan. 1st start date. She''s apprehensive since   this is totally new and different from anything she''s known. I quoted Secure HSA $1250/$448 and $125/$25. She takes some vitamins, so maybe could use the supplements discount.', 'Wendy Scipione - SR VP National Sales Advisor', 'Wendy Scipione - SR VP National Sales Advisor', '2025-10-23 15:20:56', '2025-10-23 15:20:56'),
