  ('zcrm_1579374000172264001', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000129286002', 'Axel Korn', NULL, '10/23/2025<br>provider called to verify benefits for a cat scan. Let them know how it would work in this situation and to charge the cash pay rate to the customer until her IUA is met then the rest of the treatment can be shared on.<br>AJ', 'Concierge', 'Concierge', '2025-10-23 09:10:18', '2025-10-23 09:10:18'),
