  ('zcrm_1579374000172249055', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000170995020', 'Michael Jarrett', NULL, '10/23/25<br>I explained to Eric that for her colonoscopy to be covered at 100%, the provider must be in-network. I also informed her that if she chooses to go out-of-network, she may risk the procedure not being covered and could be subject to balance billing. I emphasized this information multiple times at least five but she stated that regardless of whether the provider is contracted or not, she intends to proceed with the appointment she already has scheduled. AC<br>', 'Concierge', 'Concierge', '2025-10-23 09:00:01', '2025-10-23 09:13:37'),
