  ('zcrm_1579374000172187039', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000172187023', 'Patricia Beckvermit', NULL, '10-22-25 Trish enrolled in Select Health for 1 month since she missed the deadline to join for Nov. 1st by 1 day. She knows to contact Select Health to set up payment in 10 days and to cancel near the end of Nov for Dec. 1st to begin with MPB. All set! I showed her how to upload the end of insurance/Cobra letter from her husband''s job. He will use Cobra since he''s treating something now.<br><span><br></span><p style="background-color:rgb(232, 241, 212);display:flex;"><span style="background-color:rgb(232, 241, 212);"><b>Enrolled member(s):</b></span><span style="background-color:rgb(232, 241, 212);">Patricia Beckvermit</span></p><p style="display:flex;"><span style="color:rgb(43, 49, 60);"><br></span></p><p style="display:flex;"><span style=""><b>Select Health Value Bronze $6900 Medical Deductible</b></span></p><p style=""><span style="color:rgb(43, 49, 60);">Family Deductible</span></p><p style=""><span style="color:rgb(43, 49, 60);">Family Out-of-Pocket Max</span></p><p style=""><span style="color:rgb(43, 49, 60);">Primary Care Coinsurance</span></p><p style=""><span style="color:rgb(43, 49, 60);">N/A</span></p><p style=""><span style="color:rgb(43, 49, 60);">N/A</span></p><p style=""><span style="color:rgb(43, 49, 60);">N/A</span></p><p style=""><span style="color:rgb(43, 49, 60);">Individual Deductible</span></p><p style=""><span style="color:rgb(43, 49, 60);">Individual Out-of-Pocket Max</span></p><p style=""><span style="color:rgb(43, 49, 60);">Specialist Coinsurance</span></p><p style=""><span style="color:rgb(43, 49, 60);">$6,900</span></p><p style=""><span style="color:rgb(43, 49, 60);">$9,200</span></p><p style=""><span style="color:rgb(43, 49, 60);">$70 (after deductible)</span></p><p style=""><span style="color:rgb(43, 49, 60);">Urgent Care Coinsurance</span></p><p style=""><span style="color:rgb(43, 49, 60);">N/A</span></p><p style="display:flex;"><span style=""><b>Payment required from:</b></span></p><p style="display:flex;"><span style="">11/01/25 - 12/31/25</span></p><p style="display:flex;"><span style="color:rgb(43, 49, 60);">$0.00 </span></p><p style="display:flex;margin-inline-start:0.5rem;"><span style=""><b>Exchange policy number:</b></span><span style="color:rgb(43, 49, 60);"> 9057977030</span></p><p style="display:flex;margin-inline-start:0.5rem;"><span style=""><b>Coverage dates:</b></span><span style="color:rgb(43, 49, 60);"> 11/01/25 - 12/31/25</span></p><p style="display:flex;margin-inline-start:0.5rem;"><span style=""><b>Last updated:</b></span><span style="color:rgb(43, 49, 60);"> 10/22/25</span></p>', 'Wendy Scipione - SR VP National Sales Advisor', 'Wendy Scipione - SR VP National Sales Advisor', '2025-10-22 16:32:57', '2025-10-22 16:32:57'),
