  ('zcrm_1579374000172227006', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000125720001', 'Amber Raisanen', 'Zoho SalesIQ chat with Concierge', 'Visit ID : 4418 Question : I have the Care Plan and I am wondering if Behavioral Therapy or Occupational Therapy are services that my plan covers<br><span><br></span>I informed Amber that the behavioral health would only be covered through the telehealth AC', 'MPB Health Member Notification', 'MPB Health Member Notification', '2025-10-22 13:32:10', '2025-10-22 13:43:17'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000172198167', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000028115365', 'Elizabeth Bennett', NULL, '10/22-Member called in asking how she can cancel her Membership or pause it if possible due to financial issues, as she noticed the charge on her account.  I emailed her the cancel form to complete and get back to us before the end of October and told her we can cancel her eff 11/1, and issue a refund once the billing items clear - probably by early next week.  She was fine with that.<br>10/29- Resent Member the Cancellation Link to submit before 10/31 in order to issue a refund.<br>10/31- Left member a voicemail reminder to complete the cancellation form in order to issue a refund for 11/25 share amount. Deadline 3PM est today.', 'Michele R', 'Michele R', '2025-10-22 13:19:11', '2025-10-31 07:35:13'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000172212116', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000106317002', 'Kathryn Reishus', NULL, '10/22/25<br>Called Kathryn to follow up on her sharing she is currently uploading all bills to zion AC', 'Concierge', 'Concierge', '2025-10-22 13:18:30', '2025-10-22 13:32:56');
