  ('zcrm_1579374000172212111', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000168816001', 'Carla London', NULL, '10/22/25<br>called back carla after having a missed call she did not responde, She later called me back but her connection was bad she said she would give me a call back but never did AC', 'Concierge', 'Concierge', '2025-10-22 12:54:29', '2025-10-22 12:54:29'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000172224001', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000120423002', 'Shannon Kenyon', 'Zoho SalesIQ chat missed', 'Visit ID : 4417 Question : Are there any discounts got glp 1 injections for weight loss?<br><span><br></span>10/23/25<br>Responded to missed chat via email AC', 'MPB Health Member Notification', 'MPB Health Member Notification', '2025-10-22 12:36:14', '2025-10-23 07:50:21'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000172204017', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000131323002', 'Jonathan Cockrill', NULL, '10/22/2025<br>Stephanie called to see what she should do about some bloodwork she is getting. I explained the difference between preventative and diagnostic and told her what to do in each scenario.<br>AJ', 'Concierge', 'Concierge', '2025-10-22 12:29:44', '2025-10-22 12:29:44'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000172187009', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000121976011', 'Robin Kruel', NULL, '10-22-25 <span style="color:rgb(34, 34, 34);"> Robin Lynette Kruel is now Ava Loyal Christman.  My husband that you were communicating with regarding our policy with you, was Brent Kruel and is now Loyal Christman. Our 2 children that are on the policy are having the official court hearing this Friday the 24</span><span style="color:rgb(34, 34, 34);">th</span><span style="color:rgb(34, 34, 34);">.  They will be changing from</span><br><ol style="list-style-type:decimal;list-style-position:inside;"><li style="list-style-image:none;margin-inline-start:0in;"><p style="display:inline;"><span style="color:rgb(34, 34, 34);font-weight:normal;font-style:normal;">Connor Kruel will be Loyal Christman II</span></p></li><li style="list-style-image:none;margin-inline-start:0in;"><p style="display:inline;"><span style="color:rgb(34, 34, 34);font-weight:normal;font-style:normal;">Isabella Kruel will be Hannah Loyal Christman.</span></p></li></ol>', 'Wendy Scipione - SR VP National Sales Advisor', 'Wendy Scipione - SR VP National Sales Advisor', '2025-10-22 12:01:23', '2025-10-22 12:01:23'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000172212106', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000088732002', 'Sean Saulsbury', NULL, '10/22/25<br>Informed member that the Cologuard test is covered under their current MPB Health plan. Advised them to have their provider request the test and submit the bill to the P.O. Box listed on the back of their MPB Health card.<br>Also provided a link for scheduling and pre-paying for an ultrasound through Radiology Assist (<a style="display:inline;" href="https://radiologyassist.com/ra-search-results/"><u>https://radiologyassist.com/ra-search-results/</u></a>). Noted that prices listed are lower than typical cash discount rates. AC', 'Concierge', 'Concierge', '2025-10-22 11:36:24', '2025-10-22 11:36:24'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000172212101', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000140549002', 'Patricia Nilsen', NULL, '10/21/25<br>Patricia called she is not able to loginot the telehealth AC<br><span><br></span>', 'Concierge', 'Concierge', '2025-10-22 11:26:13', '2025-10-22 11:26:13'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000172212096', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000151014002', 'Troy Mason', NULL, '10/22/25<br>Sent email to confirm whether the member has completed the required steps to access mental health benefits via telehealth. Informed them that they must first speak with an intake clinician. Once completed, they will receive a list of in-network providers and coverage instructions. Awaiting confirmation. AC', 'Concierge', 'Concierge', '2025-10-22 11:22:00', '2025-10-22 11:22:00'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000172212077', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000060921229', 'Jared Allomong', NULL, '10/22/25<br>Jared Called wanting to know how a sharing request works for an upcoming surgury. We went over the details AC', 'Concierge', 'Concierge', '2025-10-22 11:16:16', '2025-10-22 11:16:16'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000172212072', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000010282165', 'Alicia Turbidy', NULL, '10/22/25<br>Assiste Alicia with login into the app but we got discounted i tired calling back no response AC', 'Concierge', 'Concierge', '2025-10-22 11:15:01', '2025-10-22 11:15:01'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000172200057', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000153694002', 'Silas Slusher', NULL, 'Employer submitted form to cancel this member.  I will process.', 'Patti Baron', 'Patti Baron', '2025-10-22 11:08:45', '2025-10-22 11:08:45'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000172187004', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000136256011', 'Brian Coffey', NULL, '10-22-25 Brian has a new job with Integrity Marketing and will be using his insurance license forFinal Expense, Annuities and he''s working on getting his Series 7 again. He''s working on a big deal that could bring in significant money in 2026. He also has income from the Final Expense business from the past few months. He''ll be getting an inheritance of $200K-$250K. He''s taken $50K of that already and will be reporting it to Medicaid very soon. He''s gettingn through some Dr. appts until the end of the month. He didn''t used to qualify for life insurance bc of a major brain injury 11 years ago. However, he''s been doing very well now. He hasn''t been hospitalized since 2017. He had an infected spenoid cavity next to his brain and was about to be rushed into surgery. Then his spirit guide came and laughed and said he won''t need surgery. When the dr. came in 4 hours later to complete the surgery, he said the infection was gone!  He''s been on the mend ever since. He will review the medical questions for the Cigna EPO plan to see if that''s a good option. He''s fine with health surveys. When he was applying for disability 11 years ago they looked at every possible medical record, so he''s already had that experience. He did have fibromyalgia at some point. Not sure if that is still relevant or not. If we look at doing C4 then he should take the rest of the inheritance in 2025, so he has a clean slate for income in 2026.', 'Wendy Scipione - SR VP National Sales Advisor', 'Wendy Scipione - SR VP National Sales Advisor', '2025-10-22 11:03:36', '2025-10-22 11:03:36'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000172212067', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000065104032', 'Clove Berger', NULL, '10/22/25<br>Assisted with Identifying her current mec card AC', 'Concierge', 'Concierge', '2025-10-22 11:03:03', '2025-10-22 11:03:03'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000172200049', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000169680002', 'Andrew Chapman', NULL, 'Member submitted new ACH Pmt Method since his CC was expiring this month.  I will update.  Method already on file it was what he enrolled with.', 'Patti Baron', 'Patti Baron', '2025-10-22 10:53:56', '2025-10-22 10:58:28'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000172212053', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000107479026', 'Jaclyn Peters', '10/22/25', 'Responded to Jaclyn to let her know that no claims for the date of service have been submited AC', 'Concierge', 'Concierge', '2025-10-22 10:50:17', '2025-10-22 10:50:17'),
