  ('zcrm_1579374000172212033', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000120206002', 'Nick Jones', '10/22/25', '<br>Advised member that we prefer providers send claims directly to the P.O. Box listed on the back of their MPB Health card, as certain procedures occur in this process. Instructed member to request a refund from the provider if they paid upfront and to have the provider submit the claim to the P.O. Box. Informed member that if the provider is out-of-network (not in PHCS), we cannot guarantee full coverage and a balance bill may apply. AC<br>', 'Concierge', 'Concierge', '2025-10-22 09:50:12', '2025-10-22 09:50:12'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000172212020', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000152386019', 'Michael Owen', NULL, '10/22/25<br>Assisted Micheal with logging into his health wallet AC', 'Concierge', 'Concierge', '2025-10-22 09:39:24', '2025-10-22 09:39:24'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000172212015', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000111531001', 'MARIA Colon-Gonzalez', NULL, '10/22/25<br>transferred to Vanessa so she can have her welcome call AC', 'Concierge', 'Concierge', '2025-10-22 09:31:12', '2025-10-22 09:31:12'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000172212010', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000170783021', 'Hari P Cheedella', NULL, '10/22/25<br>Hari called because he is taking his wife to get labs and wanted to know if he would be reimbursed as well if he could be reimbursed for his prescription for vitamin D. I explained that it would be cash pay for the labs as it could potentially be a sharing request. I also explained that vitamin D is not part of the formulary and it could not be reimbursed I offered to do lab and rx quotes but he declined the offer at this time AC', 'Concierge', 'Concierge', '2025-10-22 09:29:05', '2025-10-22 09:29:05'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000172212005', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000123378002', 'Benjamin Brown', NULL, '10/22/25<br>Kristina called wanting to know the best way of getting an x-ray I sent her the quote link and explained this could potentially be a sharing request AC', 'Concierge', 'Concierge', '2025-10-22 09:24:14', '2025-10-22 09:24:14'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000172200044', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000152386019', 'Michael Owen', NULL, 'Member called in and told me that he will be going through a divorce possibly Q1 of 2026.  He will be removing spouse from membership at that time and needed to know the pricing for MC and for MO to get the difference for child support purposes.  I gave him the 2026 pricing numbers.', 'Patti Baron', 'Patti Baron', '2025-10-22 09:23:44', '2025-10-22 09:23:44'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000172199026', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000111531001', 'MARIA Colon-Gonzalez', NULL, 'Spoke to member she needs to reschedule welcome call. Sent an email to do so. Member not able to get into Health Wallet. Sent info over to Vinnie. Vanessa Orozco', 'Concierge', 'Concierge', '2025-10-22 08:55:51', '2025-10-22 08:57:06'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000172204001', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000083686002', 'Jeffrey Lee', NULL, '10/22/2025<br>Dina''s daughter is having login issues. i sent her a possible solution through email and let her know to reach out if they are still having troubles<br>AJ', 'Concierge', 'Concierge', '2025-10-22 08:26:08', '2025-10-22 08:26:08'),
