  ('zcrm_1579374000172200001', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000060856035', 'Maia Toll', NULL, 'I received ticket from Diane about this member.  They had a address Change &amp; Payment Update &amp; will be in Scotland for a couple of months.  Diane asked if we could cancel their draft from old bank account .  I advised no that we would have to wait and let it decline.  Meantime I will update address, Pmt has been update and will be rerun when we receive decline', 'Patti Baron', 'Patti Baron', '2025-10-22 07:21:43', '2025-10-22 07:21:43'),
