  ('zcrm_1579374000172179035', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000140549002', 'Patricia Nilsen', NULL, '10-21-25 Patty is considering Premium HSA to fill in for no more HAB. She also wants to try again to see if she can get a waiver for college for sons!', 'Wendy Scipione - SR VP National Sales Advisor', 'Wendy Scipione - SR VP National Sales Advisor', '2025-10-21 21:33:53', '2025-10-21 22:15:46'),
