  ('zcrm_1579374000172149077', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000153593020', 'Jordan Gosney', NULL, 'This member called in and asked how he could go about changing the primary on the membership to his spouse.  I told him that in order to do this they would have to re-enroll with a unique email address.  He will be remaining on the membership, since his spouse will be getting some sort of tax break thru her business.  I spoke to Adam and he will be in contact with member to re-enroll eff 12/1/25.  I told him about the price increase.', 'Patti Baron', 'Patti Baron', '2025-10-21 09:58:13', '2025-10-21 09:58:13'),
