  ('zcrm_1579374000172137055', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000103630001', 'Julia Fleming', 'Decline of 11/25 Share Amount', '10/21-1st notice sent to member &amp; advisor via em &amp; vm<br>10/23- 2nd notice sent to member &amp; advisor via em<br>10/27- 3rd &amp; Final notice sent to member &amp; advisor via em<br>10/- Member submitted payment update form. I will process.', 'Michele R', 'Michele R', '2025-10-21 07:59:50', '2025-10-31 06:42:00'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000172137048', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000099851002', 'Ronald Guerra', 'Decline of 11/25 Share Amount', '10/21- 1st notice sent to member &amp; advisor via em &amp; stm.  He received the email.  His wallet was stolen so he will send in a new payment method to run.<br>10/23- 2nd notice sent to member &amp; advisor via em<br>10/27- 3rd/Final notice sent to member &amp; advisor via em<br>10/31 -  Member submitted payment update form. I will process.', 'Michele R', 'Michele R', '2025-10-21 07:55:49', '2025-10-31 06:28:36'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000172137041', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000083256010', 'Marc DiNunzio', 'Decline of 11/25 Share Amount', '10/21- 1st notice sent to member &amp; advisor via em &amp; stm.  Member stated that his company got bought out and he is now on BCBS insurance with the company.  Sent via email the cancellation link to confirm his cancellation request eff 11/1.<br>10/22--Member submitted cancellation request due to above.  I will process no refund necessary', 'Michele R', 'Michele R', '2025-10-21 07:51:08', '2025-10-22 08:05:35'),
