  ('zcrm_1579374000172147001', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000130553001', 'Keith Barbour', NULL, '10/21/2025<br>Keith called in to see what he needed to do with a bill for preventative care. I let him know to get the provider to send the bill in to ARM so they can pay directly. Let him know if they give him any issues with that then we can assist with submitting it<br>AJ<br><span><br></span>', 'Concierge', 'Concierge', '2025-10-21 07:43:51', '2025-10-21 07:43:51'),
