  ('zcrm_1579374000172137007', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000170338002', 'Jeremiah Headrick', NULL, 'Member''s spouse Catherine called in wanting to update her payment method.  I told her that billing was last night, 10/20, so I can send her out the form to update her payment method going forward for 11/20 billing.  She was fine with that.  She asked if she could use a card, and I mentioned that there would be a processing fee.  She also inquired about the ARM card and preventative services.  I reviewed  that card is for preventative services only and that she has a $5000 IUA for injury or illness per need.  She understands that and I told her for any further questions to contact the Concierge to help her going forward.', 'Michele R', 'Michele R', '2025-10-21 06:44:31', '2025-10-21 07:29:28'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000172125024', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000172130002', 'Tami Schweitzer', NULL, '10-20-25 Kristy Barber referred Tami. Tami was not going to get accepted on one of final questions for new Cigna 500 EPO. We had to abort mission bc she got injections for her hip and knee when it asked about any type of injections. She said the injections helped and she may need it again. She joined Premium HSA to fund the HSA account possibly. They had a good year financially and her husband Ivan got a large severance. Next year that might change. She will talk with her accountant about their income to see what makes sense moving forward. They have multiple businesses and she''s not sure which income counts and what doesn''t. They have rental income but she says they show a loss on that part. She has a sole proprietorship and a business with an EIN plus investments. She has type II diabetes. It was pre-diabetes and now it''s diabetes but she will be handling it with diet and exercise. She''s not on any medications. She enrolled in Premium HSA ES $720/$1000.', 'Wendy Scipione - SR VP National Sales Advisor', 'Wendy Scipione - SR VP National Sales Advisor', '2025-10-20 23:27:07', '2025-10-20 23:28:19'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000172125019', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000143664002', 'Mary Ellen Francescani', NULL, '10-20-25 Talked with Mary Ellen about HAB and options moving forward. She will want to add MEC and her patients might want to add MEC or choose Direct instead. I sent her the prices and timing of the change.', 'Wendy Scipione - SR VP National Sales Advisor', 'Wendy Scipione - SR VP National Sales Advisor', '2025-10-20 23:22:12', '2025-10-20 23:22:12'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000172122064', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000130894002', 'Amanda Unrein', '10/20', 'Jeffrey Called in about his sleep apnea(potentially just a deviated septum) . gave him member id for app login, and sent him colonoscopy surgical centers in network near him. will find a provider through healthcare blue book tommorow for sleep apnea diagnosis. - Tupac Manzanaez', 'Tupac Manzanarez', 'Tupac Manzanarez', '2025-10-20 15:09:08', '2025-10-20 15:09:55'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000172115288', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000012351133', 'Brian DeCamp', NULL, '10/20/2025<br>Lori is now assisting me with getting something set up for him. Will let him know when i get something closer now that we have the option from arm<br>AJ', 'Concierge', 'Concierge', '2025-10-20 14:51:38', '2025-10-20 14:51:38'),
