  ('zcrm_1579374000172115247', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000157494002', 'Isaiah Taylor', NULL, '10/20/2025<br>Helped give guidance on what to do with an estimate he has for possible procedure. Let him know how to start share request and what to do after.<br>AJ', 'Concierge', 'Concierge', '2025-10-20 14:41:34', '2025-10-20 14:41:34'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000172122042', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000018505034', 'Mary Sundblom', '10/20', 'wanted to schedule an appointment with telehealth primarycare, upset about not being able to use cirrusmd, no member account for app was made, we made one, but her telehealth through lyric was pending, vinnie and julia updated but her app didnt. aba lmk next time to update healthwallet/call sarah. I transferred her over to lyric to schedule primarycare for tommorow, and she needed this because she needed her antidepressant prescribed asap. - Tupac Manzanarez, followup tommorow.', 'Tupac Manzanarez', 'Tupac Manzanarez', '2025-10-20 14:39:23', '2025-10-20 14:39:36'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000172115225', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000078485100', 'Jeanne Klimowski', NULL, '10/20/2025<br>Helped her by walking her through making an appointment with telehealth then giving her the number to schedule department when they were late with her appointment<br>AJ', 'Concierge', 'Concierge', '2025-10-20 14:39:03', '2025-10-20 14:39:03'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000172115220', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000160692002', 'Charles Ritenour', NULL, '10/20/2025<br>Provider called to verify benefits. Let them know member does have preventative care and they can bill ARM directly. Gave her the info to ARM<br>AJ', 'Concierge', 'Concierge', '2025-10-20 14:37:43', '2025-10-20 14:37:43'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000172122037', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000170902001', 'Val Hunter', '10/20', 'called asking about his annual physical, told him he''s on care+ which makes him cash pay, let him know he can use his current doctor or i can find him one, he said hell use his, told him ask for cash pay discount', 'Tupac Manzanarez', 'Tupac Manzanarez', '2025-10-20 14:37:06', '2025-10-20 14:37:06'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000172104160', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000109180012', 'Cameron Sutter', '10/20/25', 'Cameron called to see is he can get reimbursed for his sons mental health visits. I informed him it would not but that he could see a counselor through our tele service he declined the offer AC', 'Concierge', 'Concierge', '2025-10-20 14:20:33', '2025-10-20 14:20:33'),
