  ('zcrm_1579374000171948112', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000171948081', 'Sheridan Skouge', NULL, '10-15-25 <br><p style="background-color:rgb(232, 241, 212);display:flex;"><span style="background-color:rgb(232, 241, 212);"><b>Enrolled member(s):</b></span><span style="background-color:rgb(232, 241, 212);">Sheridan Skouge</span></p><p style="display:flex;"><span style="color:rgb(43, 49, 60);"><br></span></p><p style="display:flex;"><span style=""><b>RMHP Valley Colorado Option Silver</b></span></p><p style=""><span style="color:rgb(43, 49, 60);">Family Deductible</span></p><p style=""><span style="color:rgb(43, 49, 60);">Family Out-of-Pocket Max</span></p><p style=""><span style="color:rgb(43, 49, 60);">Primary Care Coinsurance</span></p><p style=""><span style="color:rgb(43, 49, 60);">N/A</span></p><p style=""><span style="color:rgb(43, 49, 60);">N/A</span></p><p style=""><span style="color:rgb(43, 49, 60);">N/A</span></p><p style=""><span style="color:rgb(43, 49, 60);">Individual Deductible</span></p><p style=""><span style="color:rgb(43, 49, 60);">Individual Out-of-Pocket Max</span></p><p style=""><span style="color:rgb(43, 49, 60);">Specialist Coinsurance</span></p><p style=""><span style="color:rgb(43, 49, 60);">$4,000</span></p><p style=""><span style="color:rgb(43, 49, 60);">$9,000</span></p><p style=""><span style="color:rgb(43, 49, 60);">N/A</span></p><p style=""><span style="color:rgb(43, 49, 60);">Urgent Care Coinsurance</span></p><p style=""><span style="color:rgb(43, 49, 60);">N/A</span></p><p style="display:flex;"><span style=""><b>Payment required from:</b></span></p><p style="display:flex;"><span style="">01/01/25 - 12/31/25</span></p><p style="display:flex;"><span style="color:rgb(43, 49, 60);">$0.00 </span></p><p style="display:flex;margin-inline-start:0.5rem;"><span style=""><b>Exchange policy number:</b></span><span style="color:rgb(43, 49, 60);"> 7772225003</span></p><p style="display:flex;margin-inline-start:0.5rem;"><span style=""><b>Coverage dates:</b></span><span style="color:rgb(43, 49, 60);"> 01/01/25 - 12/31/25</span></p><p style="display:flex;margin-inline-start:0.5rem;"><span style=""><b>Last updated:</b></span><span style="color:rgb(43, 49, 60);"> 06/14/25</span></p>', 'Wendy Scipione - SR VP National Sales Advisor', 'Wendy Scipione - SR VP National Sales Advisor', '2025-10-16 21:39:57', '2025-10-16 21:39:57'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000171948071', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000171985001', 'Bryce Wilson', NULL, '10-16-25 Bryce 32 came to me via Mindy Grabau from a conversation they had at the gym! They just met. Shana Moss 31 is his partner as of 11 years. They live together. They live in Boulder. Bryce is currently a member witH LHS and paying $89 a month for up to $300K sharing after he spends $10K. They are both super healthy, no pre-x, no meds, no tobacco.   They don''t qualify for Medicaid. Shana does a pap but is willing to pay cash since that will cost less than including it in the membership. Bryce just wants to gets some basic labs done. He will call the Concierge for assistance once his membership begins. They are big proponents of supplements but already get them at wholesale prices due to Shana''s business. They love that the membership offers such high discounts. They also really like the Membership Principles!  They are so done with the traditional ins world and the failures that lie within that system.   Bryce also uses a Concierge Dr., I think he said. So, they joined Care+ ES $2500/ $364, $125/$25.', 'Wendy Scipione - SR VP National Sales Advisor', 'Wendy Scipione - SR VP National Sales Advisor', '2025-10-16 18:02:43', '2025-10-16 18:02:43'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000171948056', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000010543087', 'Tania Dibbs', NULL, '10-16-25 Left vm for Tania to help her with her dental/vision needs. She called and was told she doesn''t have a membership. I don''t see that she ever joined 1Dental. So, she may not have done so.', 'Wendy Scipione - SR VP National Sales Advisor', 'Wendy Scipione - SR VP National Sales Advisor', '2025-10-16 17:43:37', '2025-10-16 17:43:37'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000171907371', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000130129020', 'Lynne Turner', NULL, '10/16/2025<br>called lynne back to return her call for login issue help. Her son called in for help before i got back to her and that is why she was calling. He was able to get help and get logged in so she was ok and did not need anything<br>AJ', 'Concierge', 'Concierge', '2025-10-16 14:37:56', '2025-10-16 14:37:56'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000171907366', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000129027021', 'Kim Driftmier', NULL, '10/16/2025<br>Returned overnight missed call-left VM<br>AJ', 'Concierge', 'Concierge', '2025-10-16 14:36:24', '2025-10-16 14:36:24'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000171958285', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000167033002', 'Matthew Redling', NULL, '10/16/25<br>Called Matthew to follow up on the cancer surgery. The provider’s office requires payment upfront and will then provide an itemized bill for reimbursement. The surgery is expected to cost around $2,000.<br>I advised Matthew to request a Good Faith Estimate from the provider and to submit a sharing request as soon as possible so he wouldn’t have to cover the full amount out of pocket initially. However, he was not very receptive to this advice, stating that it is the provider’s policy.<br>I explained that he can still open the sharing request now, which could potentially expedite the reimbursement process. Despite this, he politely declined to follow my recommendation. AC', 'Concierge', 'Concierge', '2025-10-16 14:35:35', '2025-10-16 14:35:35'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000171907347', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000130562001', 'Philip Ender', NULL, '10/16/2025<br>Esther called having issues loggin in just for herself. everyone else is set up so i need to speak to IT and get them to reach out to health wallet and see what is going onand why she can nog login<br>AJ', 'Concierge', 'Concierge', '2025-10-16 14:32:59', '2025-10-16 14:32:59'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000171907328', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000157103002', 'Nicole Feenstra', NULL, '10/16/2025<br>Talking to her through email on helping her do a provider search. after she lets me know if it is for preventative or not i will give her a list of in and out of network dr''s<br>AJ', 'Concierge', 'Concierge', '2025-10-16 14:28:52', '2025-10-16 14:28:52'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000171907323', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000128863010', 'Angela Agenlian-Neuert', NULL, '10/16/2025<br>Called her to return a VM and left a VM<br>AJ', 'Concierge', 'Concierge', '2025-10-16 14:26:09', '2025-10-16 14:26:09'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000171907318', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000170906002', 'Denise Hess', NULL, '10/16/2025<br>Called in with questions on colonoscopies. Let her know they are covered under preventative and she could go to her provider because he was in the network. I also explained how the network works and how she should go about getting these procedures done. <br>AJ', 'Concierge', 'Concierge', '2025-10-16 14:23:59', '2025-10-16 14:23:59'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000171907313', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000169206007', 'Sharon McCann', NULL, '10/16/2025<br>helped her get logged in to the app<br>AJ', 'Concierge', 'Concierge', '2025-10-16 14:22:53', '2025-10-16 14:22:53'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000171907308', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000168238002', 'Linda Kenny', NULL, '10/16/2025<br>Called in to find out how to get a flu shot and if they were covered. Let her know where the RX valet card is and what to do with it.<br>AJ', 'Concierge', 'Concierge', '2025-10-16 14:22:17', '2025-10-16 14:22:17'),
