  ('zcrm_1579374000171958225', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000132824002', 'Jane Pietruszka', NULL, '10/16/25<br>Answered some questions for Jane on where to get her vaccines AC', 'Concierge', 'Concierge', '2025-10-16 13:39:48', '2025-10-16 13:39:48'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000171958220', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000152338040', 'Yang Rich', NULL, '10/15/25<br>Yang had an appoitment with a proivder that lori had contated to ensure he was in the phcs but it turns out they made a mistake and they are not in the network. I told yang i would assit her finding a provider in network AC', 'Concierge', 'Concierge', '2025-10-16 13:22:56', '2025-10-16 13:22:56');
