  ('zcrm_1579374000171958200', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000164387002', 'Karl Bowers', NULL, '10/15/25<br>Sophia called because she wanted to know what vaccines are covered we went over that list AC<br><span><br></span>', 'Concierge', 'Concierge', '2025-10-16 13:11:27', '2025-10-16 13:11:27'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000171907256', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000153149001', 'Jennifer McClurg', NULL, '10/16/2025<br>looked at the codes she gave me and all but one would not be covered under preventative and that one might not be covered because it is diagnostic. If it was for a mammo screening for preventative it would be a different code<br>AJ', 'Concierge', 'Concierge', '2025-10-16 13:11:15', '2025-10-16 13:11:15'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000171958195', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000163372002', 'Omari Bernard', NULL, '10/15/25<br>Omari called because he wanted a copy of his physical card AC', 'Concierge', 'Concierge', '2025-10-16 13:09:24', '2025-10-16 13:09:24'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000171907234', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000129524001', 'Kathryn Jarrett', NULL, '10/16/2025<br>Dave from arm called me to reach out to her but then kathryn called in so i was able to just speak to her then. She wanted to ask some questions about possibly changing up her plan and i exaplined how she could use it for an upcoming procedure. Let her know get a good faith estimate and treatment plan if she wants to initiate the share request before getting the procedure. <br>AJ', 'Concierge', 'Concierge', '2025-10-16 13:02:43', '2025-10-16 13:02:43'),
