  ('zcrm_1579374000171968042', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000006824147', 'Andrew Malishenko', NULL, 'Member submitted Change form to change membership to Secure HSA since the HAB option that Wendy sold him is going away.  I initially told the member that this was not possible to Change his membership since it was changed in 6/25, however since the MEC is no longer with Planstin this would not be any difference to them.  Member has not changed his IUA since inception of the membership back in 2020 so they will allow this.  I will process.', 'Patti Baron', 'Patti Baron', '2025-10-16 11:50:56', '2025-10-16 11:50:56'),
