  ('zcrm_1579374000171948006', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000171945016', 'Dylan Webster', NULL, '10-15-25 Dyaln is Damian Webster''s son. He turned 24 Sept. 11 and was kicked off Christian Healthcare Sharing Ministry as of either today or the 11th of Oct. He''s fine for two more weeks. He''s super healthy. He''s been working at various retreat centers. He''s working at one near Aspec right now. He will be going to HA to work on his friend''s vanilla farm for the entire winter. It''s more of a trade or volunteer situation. His friend just bought the farm and needs more hands. Dylan doesn''t go to the Dr. for wellness screenings bc he keeps up with his health on his own. So, Care+ is best for him and he chose $1000/$245 and knows it will increase to $268/$1250 for Jan. 1st onward. I waived the $100 fee since he''s Damian''s son and can use the money! He was very appreciative. He''s all set to go and was setting up the Welcome Call and downloaded the QRG.', 'Wendy Scipione - SR VP National Sales Advisor', 'Wendy Scipione - SR VP National Sales Advisor', '2025-10-15 13:01:55', '2025-10-15 13:01:55'),
