  ('zcrm_1579374000171931003', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000152324020', 'John Weller', '10/15/2025', 'Jacqueline called in asking about why her mammogram that she scheduled was being asked for a prepayment from the facility Julia let me know that the facility needs to call arm since they already have the arm card on file ( <span style="color:rgb(232, 232, 232);background-color:rgb(28, 29, 32);">Corewell Health Grand Rapids Hospitals Laboratory - Wyoming - 6105 Wilson Ave SW, Grandville, MI 49418) </span><span style="color:rgb(51, 51, 51);">Julia let me know that the facility needs to call arm since they already have the arm card on file, I explained her this and she said she''ll call the facility about it. - Tupac Manzanarez</span>', 'Tupac Manzanarez', 'Tupac Manzanarez', '2025-10-15 09:42:23', '2025-10-15 09:42:23'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000171907078', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000056556027', 'Rikki Mor', NULL, 'Welcome refresher call complete. Vanessa Orozco', 'Concierge', 'Concierge', '2025-10-15 09:35:31', '2025-10-15 09:35:31'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000171914005', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000017243295', 'Brooke Spencer', NULL, '10.14.25:  Recvd. a text from Brooke (10.10)  asking if Zion needs cover functional doctors to find root cause for a gut issue.  <br>I responded Zion determines alternative medicine services on a case-by-case basis. I suggested she call Zion to confirm the  process she should follow to submit a Need and gave her Zion''s phone #. I also reminded her of Zion''s Guideline about decreasing their sharing amount if she decides to use both alternative and allopathic services.  I told her to schedule a call with me if she wants to discuss this further.  JSP', 'Joan Phelps', 'Joan Phelps', '2025-10-15 09:26:02', '2025-10-15 09:26:02'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000171928001', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000170721005', 'Harish Kuram', 'Zoho SalesIQ chat with Concierge', 'Visit ID : 4399 Question : Hello I just downloaded the mpb health app. I entered my member id to activate the account but I didn''t recognise my id', 'MPB Health Member Notification', 'MPB Health Member Notification', '2025-10-15 09:11:00', '2025-10-15 09:11:00'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000171915031', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000049780037', 'Adriana Rojas Vargas', NULL, '10/15/2025<br>Called to get help finding a form her telehealth dr loaded in to the system. walked her through finding it. she could not find it so i sent her to lyric to see if they could just send her the document or guide her to it.  <br>AJ', 'Concierge', 'Concierge', '2025-10-15 08:52:47', '2025-10-15 08:52:47'),
