  ('zcrm_1579374000171916001', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000130562001', 'Philip Ender', NULL, 'Member submitted Member Change Form to add spouse to membership.  I reached out to member to ask about this since spouse was already on the membership.  Member was unaware that his spouse requested this.  I also advised member that since he was on a a list bill that this request would have to come from his employer.  I marked as complete.', 'Patti Baron', 'Patti Baron', '2025-10-15 08:43:45', '2025-10-15 08:43:45'),
