  ('zcrm_1579374000171910020', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000155861001', 'Lynne McCarren', '10/15/25', 'Lynee is seeking a therapist for her adult son, who is currently in college and on the autism spectrum. She is hoping to find someone who can manage his condition and ideally see him through the end of the year. I explained that our behavioral health services are primarily designed for short-term, acute concerns—such as stress related to college—and not for ongoing or specialized care. I informed her that we typically begin with six sessions, and after the intake, the counselor will determine if additional sessions are clinically necessary. Lynee asked if it would be possible to extend services until January, and I clarified that any extension beyond the initial six sessions would be at the discretion of the counselor. She also inquired whether her son could continue if he needs more than six sessions, and I explained that if he requires long-term therapy, it would fall outside the scope of  the program and may involve additional costs. Finally, she asked if her son would be able to continue with the same therapist. I explained that if long-term care is needed, he would likely be referred to an long term provider, as the behavioral health therapists may not have the appropriate credentials to provide that level of care.', 'Concierge', 'Concierge', '2025-10-15 07:20:56', '2025-10-15 07:20:56'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000171910001', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000155179001', 'Roxanne Olsen', NULL, '10/14/25<br>Roxaane called because her husband need to get an mri once a year and wanted to see if the plan would cover it, I explained to her that unless she meets the iua it would not. I explained how she can use our telehealth services for a primary care provider and we can help her find a better price for that mri so she can save money Ac', 'Concierge', 'Concierge', '2025-10-15 07:09:20', '2025-10-15 07:09:20'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000171908010', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000171901002', 'Kelli Cooper', 'Member & Family $5000 IUA Secure HSA Eff 01/01/2026', 'TAX ID/EIN: Need TIN: 81-3983551<br><br>10/15- 1st request sent to member &amp; advisor via em. Member submitted form to update Tax ID. I will add to A123', 'Michele R', 'Michele R', '2025-10-15 07:09:02', '2025-10-15 09:39:33'),
