  ('zcrm_1579374000171888033', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000044571065', 'Anna Menz', NULL, '10-14-25 Anna was on PDHC until Dec. 31st 2022 and SDHC Jan. 1st, 2023 until May 31st 2025 and moved to Premium Care June 1st, 2025. No lapse in membership.  So, she should show as Active since Jan. 1st, 2020! She might need a hip surgery and wants to discuss it.', 'Wendy Scipione - SR VP National Sales Advisor', 'Wendy Scipione - SR VP National Sales Advisor', '2025-10-14 20:56:48', '2025-10-14 20:56:48'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000171888028', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000045798106', 'richard rosin', NULL, '10-14-25 Ricki called to review his benefits and understand HAB. He will submit for reimbursements which he has a ton of receipts. He can just keep his membership as is since he already has MEC included. If I find something great, I''ll let him know.', 'Wendy Scipione - SR VP National Sales Advisor', 'Wendy Scipione - SR VP National Sales Advisor', '2025-10-14 16:40:22', '2025-10-14 16:40:22'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000171888023', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000134180005', 'Lisa Ben-Zeev', NULL, '4-14-25 Lisa called bc she forgot how to access her dental benefits for cleanings. I reminded her it''s through HAB and to pay cash and submit for reimbursement for her cleaning. She''s happy to know that. She thought she had Delta Dental but they old her no.', 'Wendy Scipione - SR VP National Sales Advisor', 'Wendy Scipione - SR VP National Sales Advisor', '2025-10-14 16:34:47', '2025-10-14 16:34:47'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000171888018', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000078032492', 'Jani Osborne', NULL, '10-14-25 Jani is wanting the best price on HRT. She was asking if it makes sense to join ZionRX Share.  I just left her a long vm recommending she calls the MPB Concierge first to get help finding the best pricing. Also she should download the HW app and check out Health Wallet. Julia will have Concierge reach out as well.', 'Wendy Scipione - SR VP National Sales Advisor', 'Wendy Scipione - SR VP National Sales Advisor', '2025-10-14 15:34:00', '2025-10-14 15:34:00'),
