  ('zcrm_1579374000171876026', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000171891001', 'Keith Markle', 'Member Only $5000 IUA Secure HSA', 'TAX ID/EIN: Need TIN<br><br>Request sent to member &amp; advisor via em.  Member''s wife Julie, who is the cardholder on this account, called in asking if she can put her Tax ID on file.  She stated that he is unemployed and not an owner of the business.  Therefore we cannot use that tax ID.  She initially was going to be on the Membership, and then said that she had to stay with another plan for the time being. However, she wanted to get her husband benefits, and then she would add herself later when she could do so.  I spoke with Leo who will reach back out to her to discuss other options for the Member.', 'Michele R', 'Michele R', '2025-10-14 11:36:42', '2025-10-14 12:09:49'),
