  ('zcrm_1579374000171802031', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000047238442', 'Anne DeWaters', NULL, '10-13-25 Annie called to understand her wellness benefits for mammo and colonoscopy. I told her there''s a 6 month waiting period and she her current membership began 6-1-25. Then she gets up to $600 for preventive mammo and $2500 for preventive colonoscopy. She also asked about chiro and acupuncture. I read the exact verbiage from the sharing guidelines.', 'Wendy Scipione - SR VP National Sales Advisor', 'Wendy Scipione - SR VP National Sales Advisor', '2025-10-13 16:16:53', '2025-10-13 16:16:53'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000171802026', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000054641074', 'Kerek Swanson', NULL, '10-13-25 Kerek got a new job and they are unexpectedly providing full benefits starting Nov. 1st. He triple checked to make sure they''re starting that fast. The company changed providers and somehow that changed the equation and timing of everything. He''ll complete the cancellation form online. I''ll send it now.', 'Wendy Scipione - SR VP National Sales Advisor', 'Wendy Scipione - SR VP National Sales Advisor', '2025-10-13 15:42:50', '2025-10-13 15:42:50'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000171802021', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000012010011', 'Elizabeth Wood', NULL, '10-13-25 Elizabeth wanted to understand how to handle Medicaid and MCS. She was approved for Medicaid and they will pay for backpay of outstanding bills for June, July and August. I think she must have been approved for her start date to be Sept. onward. She had 4 ER visits due to a blood clot that she didn''t know about. She''s about 61. She was considering canceling but then will have to have a new Pre-x clause start over when her income is back up. So, we priced out changing the IUA and it made no sense to do so since the price barely dropped. If only dropped to about $640/$5000 vs $700/$1500. She will likely stay put for now. She''ll decide by Oct. 17th for changes or Oct. 31st for canceling.', 'Wendy Scipione - SR VP National Sales Advisor', 'Wendy Scipione - SR VP National Sales Advisor', '2025-10-13 15:12:43', '2025-10-13 15:12:43'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000171798095', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000135103002', 'Donna Williams', '10/13/2025', 'called asking about how to fet vaccines (flu shot and covid shot), I referred her to use the rx valet id card at her pharmacy through the healthwallet app, or call the number for rx valet to confirm just in case.', 'Tupac Manzanarez', 'Tupac Manzanarez', '2025-10-13 14:58:23', '2025-10-13 14:58:23'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000171812075', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000153431002', 'Darin Thomas', NULL, '10/13/2025<br>updated him on scheduling colonoscopy and apologized for delay due to short staff. will update him in next day or so with an appointment<br>AJ', 'Concierge', 'Concierge', '2025-10-13 14:58:18', '2025-10-15 08:08:36'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000171812070', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000169940023', 'Nathan Erickson', NULL, '10/13/2025<br>explained coverages and walked her through a gameplan to help daughter with possible ADHD. Let her know to try telehealth first and then see were she should go to try and save a little money in the process<br>AJ', 'Concierge', 'Concierge', '2025-10-13 14:56:20', '2025-10-13 14:56:20'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000171812065', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000151804001', 'Claudio Zeballos', NULL, '10/13/2025<br>called to verify if provider was in network. after searching i could confirm they were but recommended she verify that with provider since they are responsible for updating site<br>AJ', 'Concierge', 'Concierge', '2025-10-13 14:55:31', '2025-10-13 14:55:31'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000171828011', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000018819616', 'David Assell', NULL, '10.13.25 - David emailed that his RX Valet app is crashing on his order of Accutane. Emailed Sarah, suggested the home delivery option and also provided an <a style="display:inline;" target="_blank" href="http://rx.go/"><u>RX.Go</u></a> coupon in the meantime. JA', 'MPB Health Member Notification', 'MPB Health Member Notification', '2025-10-13 14:54:31', '2025-10-13 14:54:31'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000171812060', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000153618002', 'Benjie Brubacher', NULL, '10/13/2025<br>They called to see what to do about possible surgery so i walked them through how to handle proceudres coming up. let them know get a treatment plan and a good faith estimate and all paid/unpaid bills to start a share request to get exact answer on how much sharing and if they will<br>AJ', 'Concierge', 'Concierge', '2025-10-13 14:53:47', '2025-10-13 14:53:47'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000171812055', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000111395009', 'Eric Hove', NULL, '10/13/2025<br>Aimee called to see if she could get meds cheaper through us. Was quoted 500 and i showed her the available discount on RXvalet. She got everything for less than 20. She is happy with discounts since she did not know about them<br>AJ', 'Concierge', 'Concierge', '2025-10-13 14:51:58', '2025-10-13 14:51:58'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000171812050', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000126312002', 'Russ Carpenter', NULL, '10/13/2025<br>Russ called to see if he could get colo at 4 yearts instead of 5. we called arm and short story is no<br>AJ', 'Concierge', 'Concierge', '2025-10-13 14:50:32', '2025-10-13 14:50:32'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000171812045', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000112215002', 'Brenda Harms', NULL, '10/13/2025<br>assistance needed setting up derma appointment on telehealth. walked her through it<br>AJ', 'Concierge', 'Concierge', '2025-10-13 14:49:50', '2025-10-13 14:49:50'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000171812026', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000122615027', 'Sean Conroy', NULL, '10/13/2025<br>EMailed with questions about telehealth after the MSEAP change. i explained the upgrades<br>AJ', 'Concierge', 'Concierge', '2025-10-13 14:45:42', '2025-10-13 14:45:42'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000171812021', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000131800001', 'Bradley Heintz', NULL, '10/13/2025<br>Walked bradley through the whole memnbesrhip expaining everything on the way. He was very happy with customer service <br>AJ', 'Concierge', 'Concierge', '2025-10-13 14:44:44', '2025-10-13 14:44:44'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000171812016', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000104457002', 'Normandie Rainwater', NULL, '10/13/2025<br>Called in to reschedule teleheath visit, tranfer to lyric<br>AJ', 'Concierge', 'Concierge', '2025-10-13 14:43:32', '2025-10-13 14:43:32'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000171828006', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000058023086', 'Lisa Schuster', NULL, '10.13.25 Lisa emailed asking for telehealth access. Advised to download the app. JA', 'MPB Health Member Notification', 'MPB Health Member Notification', '2025-10-13 14:36:53', '2025-10-13 14:36:53'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000171798073', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000162279009', 'Anna Lavenhar', '10/13/2025 pt 2', 'Submitted bloodwork from quest to arm, and wellwomans visit bill for reimbursment - followup in two weeks and update the member on bill submission.', 'Tupac Manzanarez', 'Tupac Manzanarez', '2025-10-13 14:27:05', '2025-10-13 14:27:05'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000171821021', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000134444002', 'Bonnie Nkrumah', NULL, 'Member called in and had many questions.  She is thinking about switching to the Direct membership.  Her questions were mostly about childhood immunizations.I also gave her pricing for the new membership.  She also brought up possibly adding her husband or enrolling him in a Sedera membership since he will be turning 50 next year.  I told her that I could not reccomend anything to her,  that her advisor needs to do that.  I will call advisor and let him know.', 'Patti Baron', 'Patti Baron', '2025-10-13 14:23:06', '2025-10-13 14:23:06'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000171798068', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000162279009', 'Anna Lavenhar', '10/13/2025', 'She called into confirm network for her obgyn ( <a style="color:rgb(0, 120, 57);display:inline;" target="_blank" href="https://providersearch.multiplan.com/#"><b><u>Van Scriver, Kimberly, Pauline,M.D.</u></b></a>, who was in network - Phcs specific services). Then she emailed us a bill to submit to arm that she already paid for(it was her annual well womans visit) next we called quest (to submit arm card for bloodwork billing). I also instructed her on how to use her preventative vs when she should classify herself as cashpay.', 'Tupac Manzanarez', 'Tupac Manzanarez', '2025-10-13 14:10:02', '2025-10-13 14:27:15'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000171795010', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000125146002', 'Jacob Lee', NULL, 'Member submitted payment update form. I will process.', 'Michele R', 'Michele R', '2025-10-13 14:07:11', '2025-10-13 14:07:11'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000171798060', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000129638010', 'Douglas Merrifield', '10/13/2025', 'He called in to see if he was going to have his annual wellness visit through <a style="color:rgb(0, 120, 57);display:inline;" target="_blank" href="https://providersearch.multiplan.com/#"><b><u>Callaghan, Daniel, Patrick,M.D.</u></b></a> covered (he''s in network - phcs specific services). and his annual bloodwork (through quest, in network with arm as well. I told him to just present the card and hell be good to go. Also had him download the MPB HEALTH app, and let him know that for his cardiology followup and ekg (he''s paid over 600 so far this year for it, and has a $1,000) to begin opening the need if it seems like it''s going to go over the IUA from this next cardiology visit.', 'Tupac Manzanarez', 'Tupac Manzanarez', '2025-10-13 13:39:50', '2025-10-13 14:06:49'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000171821016', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000047084237', 'Mark DeRespinis', 'Tax ID', '83-3575933', 'Patti Baron', 'Patti Baron', '2025-10-13 13:10:54', '2025-10-13 13:10:54'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000171821006', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000047084237', 'Mark DeRespinis', 'New Membership eff 11/25', 'Member &amp; Child $1000 IUA Secure', 'Patti Baron', 'Patti Baron', '2025-10-13 13:04:27', '2025-10-13 13:04:27'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000171821001', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000047084237', 'Mark DeRespinis', NULL, 'After reviewing his membership with Wendy, Mark submitted a Change form to change membership to Secure HSA eff 11/1/25.  He submitted his EIN.  I will also inform him of the 1/25 price increase.', 'Patti Baron', 'Patti Baron', '2025-10-13 13:02:27', '2025-10-13 13:02:27'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000171802016', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000047084237', 'Mark DeRespinis', NULL, '10-13-25 Mark wants to fund his HSA and get benefits for Nila for wellness and vax, etc. He''s self-employed with his own EIN. We upgraded his membership to Secure HSA for Nov. 1st. He knows to call Concierge for help with staying in network and to present the card for wellness visits only, including for ACA compliant vax.', 'Wendy Scipione - SR VP National Sales Advisor', 'Wendy Scipione - SR VP National Sales Advisor', '2025-10-13 12:58:16', '2025-10-13 12:58:16'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000171798055', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000168819001', 'Diane Moore', '10/13/2025', 'called in asking about her member id cards, explained to her she can use them through the app.', 'Tupac Manzanarez', 'Tupac Manzanarez', '2025-10-13 12:48:00', '2025-10-13 12:48:00'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000171802011', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000134180005', 'Lisa Ben-Zeev', NULL, '10-13-25 Lisa is inquiring about her 1095-A form via text. I sent her instructions to access it in C4.', 'Wendy Scipione - SR VP National Sales Advisor', 'Wendy Scipione - SR VP National Sales Advisor', '2025-10-13 12:37:50', '2025-10-13 12:37:50'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000171812011', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000170826001', 'Vanessa Shinmoto', NULL, '10/13/2025<br>Vanessa called to find a physical therapist after having an injury so i looked up some in her are through the bluebook and will email those over to her. <br>AJ', 'Concierge', 'Concierge', '2025-10-13 12:25:56', '2025-10-13 12:25:56'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000171812006', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000171629002', 'Brooke Mccclellan', NULL, '10/13/2025<br>Brooke sent an email a little confused about the welcome call. i let her know she can go before starting but it is preferred to do it after once she has access to everything<br>AJ', 'Concierge', 'Concierge', '2025-10-13 11:54:43', '2025-10-13 11:54:43'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000171812001', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000086852002', 'Brandon Ciullo', NULL, '10/13/2025<br>Called back with general questions on how the IUA works and the membership in general. Walked him through how share requests work and how he should proceed with a possible surgery.<br>AJ', 'Concierge', 'Concierge', '2025-10-13 11:53:25', '2025-10-13 11:53:25'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000171798048', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000085146002', 'Rebecca Snyder', '10/13/2025', 'called in asking about how to use her preventative benefits, also needed to update her on using arm card instead of planstin card, had her set up her mpb health app and explain to her how to use benefits through the app.', 'Tupac Manzanarez', 'Tupac Manzanarez', '2025-10-13 11:26:34', '2025-10-13 11:26:34'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000171809001', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000061091330', 'Krista Rogers', NULL, '10.13.25. Spoke with Krista who stated that the provider never called on Friday and she received a message that no one was available on Saturday. Will Follow up with Lyric to determine the cause/solution for the future. JA', 'MPB Health Member Notification', 'MPB Health Member Notification', '2025-10-13 11:25:10', '2025-10-13 11:25:29'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000171796109', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000170826001', 'Vanessa Shinmoto', NULL, 'Welcome call complete. Vanessa Orozco', 'Concierge', 'Concierge', '2025-10-13 11:20:32', '2025-10-13 11:20:32'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000171798043', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000011610190', 'Andrea Lowery', '10/13/2025', 'she called about a preventative annual wellness visit, when she submitted her card they said her plan had expired in december 2024. She was on the bridge plan but we shifted her to secure hsa with ARM for the mec. I had her login to the health wallet app, and send her id card to the doctors office so they can bill arm and reimburse her.', 'Tupac Manzanarez', 'Tupac Manzanarez', '2025-10-13 10:54:43', '2025-10-13 10:54:43'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000171802006', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000128483001', 'Leonardo Cicino Padovani', NULL, '10-13-25 I called Leo back and he had called C4 to learn how to download his 1095-A form. He mentioned Rodney set up the account. Apparently the email <a style="display:inline;" target="_blank" href="http://drmrsearch@yahoo.com/"><u>drmrsearch@yahoo.com</u></a> is his step dad''s email address. He was able to login to the C4 account and download the form which correctly shows his name, according to him. He''s all set.', 'Wendy Scipione - SR VP National Sales Advisor', 'Wendy Scipione - SR VP National Sales Advisor', '2025-10-13 10:42:51', '2025-10-13 10:42:51'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000171802001', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000011610190', 'Andrea Lowery', NULL, '10-13-25 Andrea called bc she just went to her annual wellness visit and gave them her old Planstin card. They rejected it obviously. She was very nice! She realizes she might have missed seeing the new card bc her boyfriend was diagnosed with pancreatic cancer this year and already passed away. She''s now picking up the pieces and managing her own life.  She will call the Concierge Team right now and submit it to her drs. portal today. Sounds like they were flexible as well.', 'Wendy Scipione - SR VP National Sales Advisor', 'Wendy Scipione - SR VP National Sales Advisor', '2025-10-13 10:32:57', '2025-10-13 10:32:57'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000171798031', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000163262002', 'Jesse Worsham', '10/13/2025', 'He called into today asking about the maternity benefits (his wife is pregnant and conception happened before 6 month waiting period ended) he had been told by his advisor (Mike Montes) that his waiting period for maternity was only 2 months.', 'Tupac Manzanarez', 'Tupac Manzanarez', '2025-10-13 10:26:02', '2025-10-13 10:26:02'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000171798024', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000166776002', 'Raymond Urciuoli', '10/13/2025', 'I followed up and left a voicemail. Julia let me know that EAP should be reaching out to him to help him schedule his leftover sessions.', 'Tupac Manzanarez', 'Tupac Manzanarez', '2025-10-13 10:17:19', '2025-10-13 10:17:19'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000171798005', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000064277164', 'Raissa Wilkes', '10/13/2025', 'Raissa broke her foot this weekend and called into start a sharing request. her zion login had an issue with the password forgot email not being sent. I called zion and got them on a 3way phone call to start her sharing request and fix the password issue. followup activity in two weeks - Tupac Manzanarez', 'Tupac Manzanarez', 'Tupac Manzanarez', '2025-10-13 10:11:39', '2025-10-13 10:11:39'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000171779076', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000086852002', 'Brandon Ciullo', NULL, '10/13/2025<br>Returned his missed call. left VM<br>AJ', 'Concierge', 'Concierge', '2025-10-13 09:43:06', '2025-10-13 09:43:06'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000171779036', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000109662008', 'Juan Enriquez', NULL, '10/13/2025<br>Juan called in to request 1095C for 2024. Let him know i would need to request this from accounting and it might take up to 48 hours for him to get those. <br>AJ', 'Concierge', 'Concierge', '2025-10-13 09:20:22', '2025-10-13 09:20:22'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000171779031', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000083676002', 'Shannon Carley', NULL, '10/14/2025<br>Returned her missed call and left a VM<br>AJ', 'Concierge', 'Concierge', '2025-10-13 08:33:11', '2025-10-14 14:38:50'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000171779026', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000170553002', 'Leslie Peters', NULL, '10/13/2025<br>Called to help with login issues. she was busy and said she will call back later.,<br>AJ', 'Concierge', 'Concierge', '2025-10-13 08:30:21', '2025-10-13 08:30:21'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000171729292', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000169926041', 'Carolyn Freeman', '10/13/2025', 'Called in to setup her MPB health app for her and her husband, her member was not working for registering her app login but with IT we resolved that issue. For her husband he needs to use his dependant id because there was no email for him.', 'Tupac Manzanarez', 'Tupac Manzanarez', '2025-10-13 08:28:33', '2025-10-13 08:28:33'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000171729287', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000146981001', 'Suzanne Wos', '10/13/2025', 'Wanted to schedule her annual wellness visit and blood work but she had a hard time finding the doctor she wanted in network, since <span style="color:rgb(0, 0, 0);">(</span><a style=" display:inline;" target="_blank" href="https://providersearch.multiplan.com/#"><u>Gray, Aimalohi, ,M.D.</u></a><span style="color:rgb(0, 0, 0);">), shows up as in network on phcs, but her medical st peters health partners is potentially out of network. I also explained to her how to use her medicaiton benefits. Followup after loris email</span>', 'Tupac Manzanarez', 'Tupac Manzanarez', '2025-10-13 08:26:35', '2025-10-13 08:26:35'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000171779021', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000107844010', 'Sheri Auten', NULL, '10/13/2025<br>Provider gail mitchell called to verify benefits for upcoming colo. <br>AJ', 'Concierge', 'Concierge', '2025-10-13 08:23:48', '2025-10-13 08:23:48'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000171729268', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000079410001', 'Christopher Duncan', NULL, 'called about getting a visit setup for her husband who had an injury over the weekend, I let his wife know the difference between arm and planstin and that this visit would not be preventative so they would need to open up a need.', 'Tupac Manzanarez', 'Tupac Manzanarez', '2025-10-13 08:15:01', '2025-10-13 08:15:01'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000171779016', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000171761002', 'John Ristvey', NULL, '10/13/2025<br>Emailed us to ask why he can not access portal/app. His membership does not activate until nov 1st and i informed him he will not be able to use the online functions until his start date. <br>AJ', 'Concierge', 'Concierge', '2025-10-13 07:59:50', '2025-10-13 07:59:50'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000171779011', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000165215002', 'Kurt Smith', NULL, '10/13/2025<br>Kurt emailed in to ask us how to use the telemedicine for his under 18 year old kids. I let him know how he can toggle between the names in the health wallet by clicking the initials at the top of the app. Let him know to tell us if that does not help or if he has troubles after that. <br>AJ', 'Concierge', 'Concierge', '2025-10-13 07:54:43', '2025-10-13 07:54:43'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000171779006', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000155365021', 'Scott Trossen', NULL, '10/13/2025<br>Scott called in to see what to do in order to start a share request. I guided him to his portal and let him know if he needs any assistance throughout the process we are here for him and we can also connect him with zion if he has trouble getting the portal set up since this will be the first time he uses it. <br>AJ', 'Concierge', 'Concierge', '2025-10-13 07:53:12', '2025-10-13 07:53:12'),
