  ('zcrm_1579374000171777013', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000156818038', 'Kimberly Derden', NULL, 'Member submitted cancellation eff 11/25 due to the fact that she found other coverage.  She spoke to Adam.  I will process.', 'Patti Baron', 'Patti Baron', '2025-10-13 07:20:58', '2025-10-13 07:20:58'),
