  ('zcrm_1579374000171775014', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000171577002', 'Elizabeth Turley', NULL, 'Decline of Enrollment Fee of $125.00 Eff 11/25<br>10/13- sent notice to member &amp; advisor via em &amp; vm. Member replied to email that she updated her payment information.  Received Payment Update Form.  I will process.', 'Michele R', 'Michele R', '2025-10-13 07:04:25', '2025-10-13 07:51:58'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000171775001', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000171761002', 'John Ristvey', 'Member & Family $5000 IUA Secure HSA', 'TAX ID/EIN: <span style="color:rgb(0, 0, 0);background-color:rgb(255, 255, 255);">173485844</span><br><br>Request sent to member &amp; advisor via em. Member submitted update form with number. I will process.  Via the email, Member also requested a Letter of Coverage.  I told them to contact ARM and gave them the contact number, on or after 11/1/25.', 'Michele R', 'Michele R', '2025-10-13 06:42:35', '2025-10-13 10:27:55'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000171771001', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000061091330', 'Krista Rogers', NULL, '10-12-25 <span style="color:rgb(34, 34, 34);">"Thanks, Wendy, for your response. I appreciate your putting in an urgent ticket. Unfortunately I still never got a call. And then I got a notification that the consult was canceled. I rescheduled for today and just got a call from someone who said there is no vet available today to talk to me. I will have to reschedule for tomorrow. In the meantime, Gabby is slightly better but we are still quite concerned. Thanks for the tip on calling the concierge service if I''m not able to get through to you for issues like this. </span><br><span style="color:rgb(34, 34, 34);"><br></span><span style="color:rgb(34, 34, 34);">Not sure if I told you that we sold our house and a lot of our belongings and took off in our motorhome about 5 weeks ago to see North America. It has been overall a great experience, with the exception of our dog getting sick. "</span>', 'Wendy Scipione - SR VP National Sales Advisor', 'Wendy Scipione - SR VP National Sales Advisor', '2025-10-12 17:37:41', '2025-10-12 17:37:41'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000171746049', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000132790011', 'Marilynn Piche', NULL, '10-10-25 <br><span style="color:rgb(34, 34, 34);">Hello Wendy,</span><br><span style="color:rgb(34, 34, 34);"><br></span><span style="color:rgb(34, 34, 34);">Marilynn Piche membership has been cancelled effective11/1/2025 per the member''s request. </span><br><span style="color:rgb(34, 34, 34);"><br></span><span style="color:rgb(34, 34, 34);">Warm regards,</span><br><p style=""><span style="color:rgb(34, 34, 34);">MICHELLE FITZPATRICK</span></p><p style=""><span style="color:rgb(34, 34, 34);">Customer Care Coordinator</span></p>', 'Wendy Scipione - SR VP National Sales Advisor', 'Wendy Scipione - SR VP National Sales Advisor', '2025-10-10 15:53:15', '2025-10-10 15:53:15'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000171746039', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000011610171', 'Melinda Grabau', NULL, '10-10-25 Mindy wanted to see what is next for preventive. I told her I''m looking for alternative solutions. But, we can go back to the norm if necessary. She understands.', 'Wendy Scipione - SR VP National Sales Advisor', 'Wendy Scipione - SR VP National Sales Advisor', '2025-10-10 15:00:43', '2025-10-10 15:00:43'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000171749136', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000085146002', 'Rebecca Snyder', NULL, '10/10/25<br>Sent txt to follow up with rebecca AC', 'Concierge', 'Concierge', '2025-10-10 14:59:13', '2025-10-10 14:59:13'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000171749131', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000126312002', 'Russ Carpenter', NULL, '10/10/25<br>Provider called the wanted to check eligibility for a wellness check for lynn. They wanted to know if she was still actvie and her start date. Provided them with all that information AC', 'Concierge', 'Concierge', '2025-10-10 14:57:26', '2025-10-10 14:57:26'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000171746034', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000136382001', 'Eliza Volk', NULL, '10-10-25 Eliza called to get her 1095-A form. I left a vm telling her how to access it via her C4 portal.', 'Wendy Scipione - SR VP National Sales Advisor', 'Wendy Scipione - SR VP National Sales Advisor', '2025-10-10 14:56:18', '2025-10-10 14:56:18'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000171746029', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000132624011', 'Roger Keeler', NULL, '10-10-25 Here''s what I wrote to Roger, "<span style="color:rgb(34, 34, 34);">I''ve updated your income per the estimate below from your accountant. Since you and Lena have different plans, the Connect for Health system had a glitch.  So, Connect for Health is sending the change completion to the Escalations Team. They will be notifying you via your gmail account once the change has been completed. They might call it a re-enrollment.  But, they''ve confirmed with me that nothing will change other than the tax credit amount. The new tax credit amount if $841.58. In my calculations that will make your cost for Nov. $340.44. The Ref # for the call and change request is CAS446967X3G4L4. This is all documented on their call log. </span><br><br><span style="color:rgb(34, 34, 34);">They did not give me a time estimate but my best guess is a week or so for it to get fixed."</span>', 'Wendy Scipione - SR VP National Sales Advisor', 'Wendy Scipione - SR VP National Sales Advisor', '2025-10-10 14:51:51', '2025-10-10 14:51:51'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000171729259', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000083404002', 'Robert M. Gullinese', NULL, 'called in looking to find a primary care provider in network for his annual wellness visits.', 'Tupac Manzanarez', 'Tupac Manzanarez', '2025-10-10 14:46:04', '2025-10-10 14:46:04'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000171746018', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000132624011', 'Roger Keeler', NULL, '10-10-25 Roger got the best guess at income for 2025 which is $74K vs the $77K originally put in.   I changed it.  I kept Lena''s at $17K and Roger''s at $15K rental and $42 Aristocrat. He will be getting benefits for Dec. 1st from Costco. They have excellent benefits with Aetna. They are in 22 countries! I have Amy with C4 helping me since the income change didn''t reflect on the plan price. Their APTC is $841.58. I found his communications with me under <a style="display:inline;" target="_blank" href="http://thearistocratstudio@gmail.com/"><u>thearistocratstudio@gmail.com</u></a>.', 'Wendy Scipione - SR VP National Sales Advisor', 'Wendy Scipione - SR VP National Sales Advisor', '2025-10-10 14:39:53', '2025-10-10 14:51:15'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000171749112', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000044904073', 'Andrew Culbertson', NULL, '10/10/25<br>April wants to open a sharing request from an injury she had back in January&gt; I adviced her of the 6 month deadline and that she might have to appeal this sharing request AC', 'Concierge', 'Concierge', '2025-10-10 14:38:36', '2025-10-10 14:38:36'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000171749107', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000130894002', 'Amanda Unrein', NULL, '10/10/25<br>called to provider back they called for eligibility no response lvm AC', 'Concierge', 'Concierge', '2025-10-10 14:28:59', '2025-10-10 14:28:59'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000171729240', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000169726005', 'Gregory Walzer', NULL, 'called in to open a need/sharing request for a hospitalization and er visit, with followups and surgery for a broken nose. transferred to zion to create a member portal login and open need, has not recieved any bills yet, followup in two weeks.', 'Tupac Manzanarez', 'Tupac Manzanarez', '2025-10-10 14:18:52', '2025-10-10 14:18:52'),
