  ('zcrm_1579374000171749097', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000088509010', 'Scott Blossom', NULL, '10/10/25<br>Scott called because he needs to admit his child for psychiatric care and wanted some advice on how to negotiate the price. I advised him to ask if they have any financial assistance and provided him with instruction on how to use HCBB to compare prices for different places AC', 'Concierge', 'Concierge', '2025-10-10 14:10:09', '2025-10-10 14:10:09'),
