  ('zcrm_1579374000171749082', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000065985001', 'Denise Uhlig', NULL, '10/10/25<br>Assistad Denise with navigating the rx valet so she can get her medications AC<br><span><br></span>', 'Concierge', 'Concierge', '2025-10-10 13:57:11', '2025-10-10 13:57:11'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000171749074', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000139300235', 'Corey Maillet', NULL, '10/10/25<br>Sandy called to see how long she had to submit the bills after she received treatmeant. I inormed her 6 months AC', 'Concierge', 'Concierge', '2025-10-10 13:45:15', '2025-10-10 13:45:15'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000171758020', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000170822008', 'Joanna Hunter', NULL, 'Joanna merged to MPB from a previous Zion membership. For the month of Oct, she was double billed from both companies. Planstin will issue her a refund, but needs her Zion membership ID for the merger of her account to be effective. Called and left a vm, will send an email as well. JA', 'MPB Health Member Notification', 'MPB Health Member Notification', '2025-10-10 13:41:48', '2025-10-10 13:41:48'),
