  ('zcrm_1579374000171727045', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000154906036', 'Naomi Schwartz', NULL, 'Member called in and left a VM to update her address.  I sent out the link to the Member Update Form.  When I tried to return her call all I got was dead air.  I sent member out an email explanation and also sent instructions on how to download the app.', 'Patti Baron', 'Patti Baron', '2025-10-10 12:09:21', '2025-10-10 12:09:21'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000171751001', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000153431002', 'Darin Thomas', 'Zoho SalesIQ chat missed', 'Visit ID : 4395 Question : I have been given a referral to have a Colonoscopy performed. It looks like there is only one office in my city that is in Network. My wife has used them recently and they were very difficult on the billing and made her wait over 3 hours after she was prepped. This is the second time we have had issues with that office on billing and I would like to go somewhere else. I would like to discuss my options. My phone is 919-302-4467', 'MPB Health Member Notification', 'MPB Health Member Notification', '2025-10-10 11:55:12', '2025-10-10 11:55:12'),
