  ('zcrm_1579374000171696146', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000153149001', 'Jennifer McClurg', NULL, '10/09/2025<br>Jennifer called for me to explain how everything works. She thought she only had catastrophic coverage. I explained the whole membership, preventative and not, and the app with telehealth. Going to send an email with a list of providers off bluebook for some procedures she gave me the codes for.<br>AJ', 'Concierge', 'Concierge', '2025-10-09 14:19:58', '2025-10-09 14:19:58'),
