  ('zcrm_1579374000171681015', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000114056002', 'David Mell', NULL, 'I received notification from Planstin that they have to cancel this member  eff 11/1/25 due to the fact that he resides in state of WA.  Leo has been in contact with him and will suggest the ACA to him as there are no HS options available in WA.  I have also requested from Planstin something that will outline why he is being cancelled.', 'Patti Baron', 'Patti Baron', '2025-10-09 12:19:27', '2025-10-09 12:19:27'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000171696014', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000110082002', 'Elizabeth Sayre', NULL, '10/09/2025<br>Elizabeth called looking for diana to help her with share request. I let her know that might be someone at Zion if it was about her share request and offered to call them with her and she just requested i give her the number so she could call.<br>AJ', 'Concierge', 'Concierge', '2025-10-09 12:11:25', '2025-10-09 12:11:25'),
