  ('zcrm_1579374000171663001', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000112215002', 'Brenda Harms', 'Zoho SalesIQ chat with Concierge', 'Visit ID : 4392 Question : Good morning. I got a text about using the app for "App-Pet Telehealth, 3 Free Virtual Dermatology Consults, Virtual Primary Care &amp; Mental Health." but I don''t see those options on my dashboard. Is it possible that the text didn''t apply to my plan? Or can you help me find those options?', 'MPB Health Member Notification', 'MPB Health Member Notification', '2025-10-09 09:05:10', '2025-10-09 09:05:10'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000171662001', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000086964002', 'Lani Cordova', NULL, 'I received notification from Planstin that this member will need to be cancelled eff 11/1/25 due to living in the state of WA.  I got in contact with Cari and she will be notifying them and will be back in contact with me to send out notification after speaking with member.', 'Patti Baron', 'Patti Baron', '2025-10-09 09:01:16', '2025-10-09 09:01:16'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000171634080', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000168419065', 'Eden Dowler Thurber', NULL, 'Welcome call complete. Requested to Acelyn to have link resent from Zion to create her Zion member portal. Vanessa Orozco', 'Concierge', 'Concierge', '2025-10-09 08:57:10', '2025-10-09 09:01:08'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000171655001', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000161622001', 'Eric Dickmann', 'Zoho SalesIQ chat with Concierge', 'Visit ID : 4391 Question : Good morning. Just a quick question. Are annual wellness shots like flu and Covid covered expenses? Also, at some point I’d also like to get the shingles vaccine. What about that one?', 'MPB Health Member Notification', 'MPB Health Member Notification', '2025-10-09 08:23:08', '2025-10-09 08:23:08'),
