  ('zcrm_1579374000171642011', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000171627002', 'Gema Terrones', 'Member Only $2500 IUA Secure HSA', 'TAX ID/EIN: <span style="color:rgb(0, 0, 0);background-color:rgb(255, 255, 255);">609051344</span>', 'Michele R', 'Michele R', '2025-10-09 07:19:10', '2025-10-09 07:19:10'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000171642001', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000171621002', 'Beth Gangel', 'Member ONly $2500 IUA Premium HSA', 'TAX ID/EIN: 39-4683359<br><span><br></span>Request sent to member &amp; advisor via em. Member submitted form to add Tax ID', 'Michele R', 'Michele R', '2025-10-09 07:02:18', '2025-10-09 14:22:48'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000171606126', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000172130002', 'Tami Schweitzer', NULL, '10-8-25 <span style="color:rgb(51, 51, 51);">Lives in Brighton 80601 and moving to Sterling 80751 very soon. Has herb business and rentals so can qualify for self-employment and Premium HSA.  </span>Tami was diagnosed with diabetes recently which she can address with diet and exercise. Non tobacco. Cobra ends at the end of Oct. Yes, they want wellness. Husband gets prostate test 2x year. He''s had absolutely no issues since his prostate was removed. We reviews Premium HSA $720/$1000, $125/$25. <br>Then she inquired about ACA plans which are $1400-$1700+ a month. Tami''s DOB is 2/15/68, Ivan''s is 3/8/62.  The most important Dr. is Dr. Merklyn Jones. Their PCP is less imp and is Emily Henler. Ivan takes testosterone cypionate injection 4x a month.<br>Tami watched the video also before the previous appt.', 'Wendy Scipione - SR VP National Sales Advisor', 'Wendy Scipione - SR VP National Sales Advisor', '2025-10-08 16:59:56', '2025-10-08 17:03:20'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000171606115', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000021695264', 'Lorie Moreno-Roch', NULL, '10-8-25 Lorie needs to remove her daughter from their family plan. Her daughter is super healthy and travels a ton.  Her son is the one on the separate ins plan. He also travels a bunch. Neither are good at submitting info for MCS. Samantha with C4 said we can keep her daughter on the plan through the end of the year as a newly 26 year old.  Then  we will need to remove her daughter from the family plan. Her daughter will need to create her own C4 account for Jan. 1st onward. All 26 year olds can remain on the plan through the end of the year now according to Samantha. Case # is CAS-4454471-Q8G4J3.  <br>We can consider Cigna LifeX for both kids since they are both healthy and travel a bunch. This way thery are protected when they are moving about. Christian (daughter) may may a new job by Jan. She does mostly contract work or short term gigs.', 'Wendy Scipione - SR VP National Sales Advisor', 'Wendy Scipione - SR VP National Sales Advisor', '2025-10-08 16:06:13', '2025-10-08 16:26:54'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000171606110', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000171627002', 'Gema Terrones', NULL, '10-8-25 Gema is in her mid 40''s. She got divorced about 2 years ago. Her x works for Sony and has the kids on his plan. So, she''s open to new options. Her ACA plan will go up about $100 in Jan. She''s open to self-pay. She watched the video. She just has an IUD, no tobacco, just a possible rosacea skin issue, migraines sometimes and peri menopause. Nothing she''s worried about. I explained the pre-x clause. She''s a 1099 worker for a local marketing agency. She was referred to me by Mara Simoneau. She needs Secure HSA bc she lives in CA. She joined Secure HSA $2500/$276 and she knows it will increase to $289 for 2026.  She also has Renaissance for dental and vision which she can keep if she wants. She''ll send me the info in case I have something better.', 'Wendy Scipione - SR VP National Sales Advisor', 'Wendy Scipione - SR VP National Sales Advisor', '2025-10-08 15:53:08', '2025-10-08 15:53:08'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000171615054', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000005667255', 'Kathleen Kronz', NULL, '10/8/25<br>Called Kathleen back no response lvm AC', 'Concierge', 'Concierge', '2025-10-08 14:51:33', '2025-10-08 14:51:33'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000171615049', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000170906002', 'Denise Hess', NULL, '10/8/25<br>Denis called because he wants to pair his MEC with his DPC for some extensive blood work he needs. I explained this the provider is out of network we can not guarantee it will be fully covered AC', 'Concierge', 'Concierge', '2025-10-08 14:42:38', '2025-10-08 14:42:38'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000171615044', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000168816001', 'Carla London', NULL, '10/8/25<br>Provided the member with a list of family practice providers in the 85262 area that may accept PHCS. Included practices such as Scottsdale Family Physicians, Grayhawk Family Practice, Troon Family &amp; Preventative Care, HonorHealth Medical Group – Osborn Primary Care, and Pueblo Family Physicians. Shared that PHCS is listed as an accepted plan on the Scottsdale Family Physicians website and included this link for reference: <a style="display:inline;" target="_blank" href="https://www.scottsdalefp.com/plans.html"><u>https://www.scottsdalefp.com/plans.html</u></a>. Advised the member to contact providers directly to confirm network status and appointment availability. Offered assistance if they need help connecting with any of the clinics.<br>Ac', 'Concierge', 'Concierge', '2025-10-08 14:27:37', '2025-10-08 14:27:37'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000171615037', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000049780037', 'Adriana Rojas Vargas', NULL, '10/8/25<br>Informed the member that we do not handle prior authorizations. Advised that the provider should be able to prescribe a refill directly. Also clarified that the amount prescribed is ultimately at the provider’s discretion. AC', 'Concierge', 'Concierge', '2025-10-08 14:08:34', '2025-10-08 14:08:34'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000171605172', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000129295002', 'Michael Stoltzfus', NULL, '10/08/2025<br>Michael called to see if a vasectomy was covered. Let him know the guidelines says there is no sharing for that<br>AJ', 'Concierge', 'Concierge', '2025-10-08 14:08:32', '2025-10-08 14:08:32'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000171605153', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000028419199', 'Jane Rosenberg', NULL, '10/08/2025<br>Talked with patti about calling jane to explain how to login and help navigate new features. Could not reach her today will attempt again tomorrow<br>AJ', 'Concierge', 'Concierge', '2025-10-08 14:03:45', '2025-10-08 14:03:45'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000171615032', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000130371001', 'Dawn Weitzel', NULL, '10/8/25<br>Dawn called to see if her provider was still in network, she stated she asked them and they said not, but wanted to make sure, I advised her it is always best to get this information straight from the provider for it to be the most accurate AC', 'Concierge', 'Concierge', '2025-10-08 13:49:56', '2025-10-08 13:49:56'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000171615027', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000060442360', 'Whitney Hammond', NULL, '10/8/25<br><span style="color:rgb(0, 32, 96);">UT Health Physicians called to check the statues of a claim for 06/02/25 emailed the provider the EOB AC</span><br><span style="color:rgb(196, 89, 17);"><br></span>', 'Concierge', 'Concierge', '2025-10-08 13:46:28', '2025-10-08 13:46:28'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000171616048', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000122070012', 'Cristin Harris', 'New Membership eff 11/25', 'Member &amp; Family $2500 IUA Care +', 'Patti Baron', 'Patti Baron', '2025-10-08 13:44:37', '2025-10-08 13:44:37'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000171616039', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000122070012', 'Cristin Harris', NULL, 'Member submitted Change Form to add spouse eff 11/1/25 due to his canceling Employer membership.  I will process', 'Patti Baron', 'Patti Baron', '2025-10-08 13:40:57', '2025-10-08 13:40:57'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000171619001', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000171617002', 'Bengt Boyesen', 'Member Only $5000 IUA Secure HSA', 'TAX ID/EIN: request sent to member &amp; advisor via em. Leslie responded to my email stating that the Member already submitted his SS# on the application.  I will put his SS # in the Tax ID field with no dashes. <span style="color:rgb(0, 0, 0);background-color:rgb(255, 255, 255);">189689634</span>', 'Michele R', 'Michele R', '2025-10-08 13:40:02', '2025-10-08 14:00:55'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000171615006', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000167033002', 'Matthew Redling', NULL, '10/8/25<br><br>Matthew called in regarding his wife, who was recently diagnosed with cancer. He was upset after their surgery claim was denied by ARM and expressed frustration, as they were unaware of how to properly use the plan. I explained that for major medical incidents like this, the correct process is to present as self-pay, meet their IUA, and then upload the treatment plan and a good faith estimate to Zion for review. He appeared frustrated and asked, “So I have to pay out of pocket for this surgery?” I clarified that while the process begins with self-pay, there are multiple ways it can play out once the required documentation is submitted correctly. I encouraged him to request a detailed treatment plan and good faith estimate from the provider and assured him that we’re here to support him through each step.<br>AC', 'Concierge', 'Concierge', '2025-10-08 13:31:23', '2025-10-08 13:31:23'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000171616031', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000122286002', 'Morgan Harris', NULL, 'Member submitted Cancellation to be taken off List bill eff 11/1/25.  Spouse Christi Harris will be adding him to her membership at the same time.  I will process.', 'Patti Baron', 'Patti Baron', '2025-10-08 13:28:32', '2025-10-08 13:28:32'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000171605111', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000012351133', 'Brian DeCamp', NULL, '10/08/2025<br>Putting together list of providers for mammo then sending to Brian. Site was not working when we spoke. Also explained options for him to use HSA and recommended speaking to his tax pro for more info on that since we are not tax pros.<br>AJ', 'Concierge', 'Concierge', '2025-10-08 13:25:21', '2025-10-08 13:25:21'),
