  ('zcrm_1579374000171615001', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000085146002', 'Rebecca Snyder', NULL, '10/8/25<br><ul style="list-style-type:disc;list-style-position:inside;"><li style="list-style-image:none;"><p style="display:inline;"><span style="color:rgb(51, 51, 51);font-weight:normal;font-style:normal;">Submitted a request for a replacement physical health card.</span></p></li><li style="list-style-image:none;"><p style="display:inline;"><span style="color:rgb(51, 51, 51);font-weight:normal;font-style:normal;">Advised member that the new card will be reissued.</span></p></li><li style="list-style-image:none;"><p style="display:inline;"><span style="color:rgb(51, 51, 51);font-weight:normal;font-style:normal;">Provided instructions to access the digital health card via the Health Wallet app.</span></p></li><li style="list-style-image:none;"><p style="display:inline;"><span style="color:rgb(51, 51, 51);font-weight:normal;font-style:normal;">Shared direct login link: </span><a style="display:inline;font-weight:normal;font-style:normal;" href="https://web.thehealthwallet.com/login"><u>https://web.thehealthwallet.com/login</u></a></p></li><li style="list-style-image:none;"><p style="display:inline;"><span style="color:rgb(51, 51, 51);font-weight:normal;font-style:normal;">Informed member that login credentials are SSN and DOB.</span></p></li><li style="list-style-image:none;"><p style="display:inline;"><span style="color:rgb(51, 51, 51);font-weight:normal;font-style:normal;">Encouraged member to reach out with any questions.  AC</span></p></li><li style="list-style-image:none;color:rgba(51, 51, 51, 1);font-style:normal;"><p style="display:inline;"><span style="color:rgb(51, 51, 51);font-weight:normal;font-style:normal;"><br></span></p></li></ul>', 'Concierge', 'Concierge', '2025-10-08 12:56:29', '2025-10-08 12:56:29'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000171606014', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000012351133', 'Brian DeCamp', NULL, '10-8-25 Brian wanted to review his membership. He thought perhaps it would be better to move to Premium HSA but when we talked it doesn''t make sense. He''s dealing with a frozen should now and will likely use up his 35 visits or $7500 for PT and Massage Therapy. Zion told him no for massage. I read the guidelines to him that includes massage. He will inquire. At the $2500 IUA level he only saves very little by switching. So, it''s not worth it. By changing to Direct since he has Cloud Medical DPC the price increased by $3. So weird! That was the case for 2025 and 2026. So, must not be a mistake. He will stay put with Secure HSA.  He will also fund an HSA. He didn''t think he could because he''s retired. His wife is still working for school district. They moved to Salida. I told him to call MPB Concierge for help with HSA and to find dr in network for mammo.', 'Wendy Scipione - SR VP National Sales Advisor', 'Wendy Scipione - SR VP National Sales Advisor', '2025-10-08 12:50:23', '2025-10-08 12:51:35'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000171605025', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000016068021', 'Ryan Donovan', NULL, '<span style="color:rgb(51, 51, 51);">10/08/2025</span><br><span style="color:rgb(51, 51, 51);">SEnt an email to  respond to his in order to help Ryan login to his health wallet by giving him some instructions and letting him know we were able to login with his credentials. Let Ryan know all of this and to reach out if he is still experiencing issues logging in. </span><br><span style="color:rgb(51, 51, 51);">AJ</span>', 'Concierge', 'Concierge', '2025-10-08 12:02:17', '2025-10-08 12:02:17'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000171605020', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000170925002', 'Bryan Amundson', NULL, '10/08/2025<br>SEnt an email to help Bryan login to his health wallet by giving him some instructions and letting him know IT looked into it and after not being able to login during welcome call we were able to login with his credentials. Let Bryan know all of this and to reach out if he is still experiencing issues loggin in. <br>AJ', 'Concierge', 'Concierge', '2025-10-08 12:00:46', '2025-10-08 12:00:46'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000171606006', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000171606056', 'Mary Ann Hanlon', NULL, '10-7-25 Mary Ann came to me via Amy Moore. Mary Ann is 60 and planning to retire around March of 2026. Her husband is 55 and he''s the one that''s self-employed. He needs to be the primary member. She watched the video. She wants <span style="color:rgb(34, 34, 34);"> gynecological visits, mammograms, and dermatologist screenings with my existing doctors at Mount Nittany State College PA, for gynecological. I forget the other place. I don''t find them in the network but I did find radiology accepting the PHCS network. I told her to call the providers she wants to use for wellness to double check. She already had a colonoscopy 5 years ago and doens''t need another one until she Medicare age. She had an ovarian cyst removed about a year ago I think. She currently has an FSA but less familiar with HSA. She wants to use Dr. Mazza and Dr. Doucette who I couldn''t find in the list.   Mary Ann takes HRT, no tobacco and otherwise healthy. Her husband is healthy, no meds, no tobacco. She''s interested in Secure HSA as first choice if she can find in network drs. or Care+ if not. Husband is self-employed.  If they go with ACA ins through marketplace it will be $600+ x 2 = $1200+ with $18K mop. Secure HSA will be $1000/$733 or $633/$2500 and $125/$25. </span>', 'Wendy Scipione - SR VP National Sales Advisor', 'Wendy Scipione - SR VP National Sales Advisor', '2025-10-08 11:44:47', '2025-10-08 11:52:50'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000171605001', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000084653001', 'Marianne Aultz', NULL, '10/08/2025<br>Got Jason an appointment with Dr. Crystal flores alamo for 3:45 on oct, 23rd. Informed marianne since i have not been able to reach jason directly.<br>AJ', 'Concierge', 'Concierge', '2025-10-08 11:40:38', '2025-10-08 11:40:38'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000171598028', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000108211002', 'Karen Sachs', 'New Membership eff 11/1/25', 'Member Only $2500 IUA Secure', 'Patti Baron', 'Patti Baron', '2025-10-08 11:40:11', '2025-10-08 11:40:11'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000171598023', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000108211002', 'Karen Sachs', NULL, 'Member has submitted Change Form to update IUA to $2500 eff 11/1/25.  I will process.', 'Patti Baron', 'Patti Baron', '2025-10-08 11:39:14', '2025-10-08 11:39:14'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000171596154', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000170826001', 'Vanessa Shinmoto', NULL, 'Spoke to member she needed to reschedule her welcome call. Sent an email to do so. Vanessa Orozco', 'Concierge', 'Concierge', '2025-10-08 11:09:50', '2025-10-08 11:09:50'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000171602069', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000044486166', 'Elizabeth Collins', NULL, 'Elizabeth called to inquire about the possibility of receiving a discount on the flu shot. I explained that, unlike prescriptions, immunizations typically do not have discounts available. Additionally, pharmacies are unable to provide exact pricing, as several factors can affect the final<a style="" target="_blank"> cost.AC</a>', 'Concierge', 'Concierge', '2025-10-08 11:06:28', '2025-10-08 11:06:28'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000171602064', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000166720002', 'John Peart', NULL, '10/8/25<br>Dakin called from Mountain Heights Community Health Center in Provo to ask about eligibility. It looks like he is in for a weight loss consultation, I informed them it would be self pay  AC<br><span><br></span>', 'Concierge', 'Concierge', '2025-10-08 10:53:39', '2025-10-08 10:53:39'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000171602059', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000168615016', 'Jeri Roper', NULL, '10/8/25<br>Jeri called because he wanted to find a provider in network so he can renew is prescription, I advised him he could also use our telehealth serveries for that AC', 'Concierge', 'Concierge', '2025-10-08 10:49:38', '2025-10-08 10:49:38'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000171596144', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000153149001', 'Jennifer McClurg', NULL, 'Welcome call complete. Vanessa Orozco', 'Concierge', 'Concierge', '2025-10-08 10:46:07', '2025-10-08 10:46:07'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000171596100', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000170553002', 'Leslie Peters', NULL, 'Welcome call complete. Member is able to get into Health Wallet now. Vanessa Orozco', 'Concierge', 'Concierge', '2025-10-08 10:39:11', '2025-10-08 10:39:11'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000171596090', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000044486166', 'Elizabeth Collins', NULL, 'Welcome call complete. Vanessa Orozco', 'Concierge', 'Concierge', '2025-10-08 10:22:03', '2025-10-08 10:22:03'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000171602054', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000025330216', 'Nelson Oldham', NULL, '10/8/25<br>Nelson called with questions regarding HAB, I advised him to speak to wendy for more info on them AC', 'Concierge', 'Concierge', '2025-10-08 09:59:50', '2025-10-08 09:59:50'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000171598013', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000120913002', 'Charlie Gomez', NULL, 'Member submitted cancellation eff 11/1/25 due to the fact that he will now have employer coverage.  I will process.', 'Patti Baron', 'Patti Baron', '2025-10-08 09:46:07', '2025-10-08 09:46:07'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000171596071', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000170925002', 'Bryan Amundson', NULL, 'Welcome call complete verbally. Member not able to get into Health Wallet. Sent information over to Julia. Vanessa Orozco', 'Concierge', 'Concierge', '2025-10-08 09:28:38', '2025-10-08 09:28:38'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000171602049', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000170743002', 'James Robinson', NULL, '10/8/25<br>Karen needed assistance reaching her mental health benefits AC', 'Concierge', 'Concierge', '2025-10-08 09:23:23', '2025-10-08 09:23:23'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000171602044', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000169416002', 'Ashley Caldwell', NULL, '10/8/25<br>Ashley needed assistance accessing her telehealth AC', 'Concierge', 'Concierge', '2025-10-08 09:21:44', '2025-10-08 09:21:44'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000171602025', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000124631253', 'Ilysa Keeley', NULL, '10/8/25<br>Ilysa called because she is looking to get her labs discounted, but for this we recommended she go through lyric due to her being in new jersey and it being a heavily regulated state for pre paid labs. The provider from lyric request she get proper documentation for her primary that these labs a necesary. She uploaded them and a specialty care team member will reach out to her to further assist her AC', 'Concierge', 'Concierge', '2025-10-08 09:20:00', '2025-10-08 09:20:00'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000171602006', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000145456002', 'Richard Gow', NULL, '10/8/25<br>Richard had a heart scan and he has a high calcium score and need to see a cardiologist to see what can be done. I advised him to open a sharing<a style="" target="_blank"> request.AC</a>', 'Concierge', 'Concierge', '2025-10-08 09:03:24', '2025-10-08 09:03:24'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000171598008', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000168270081', 'Fletcher Yaw', NULL, 'Member called in asking questions about the IUA.  He told me that one of his dependents ( who are on ex-spouses Zion membership) had an health emergency and that he was responsible for 1/2 of the IUA.  I explained that the IUA is the responsibility of the member and that it was like a deductible but did not reset every year.   I only told him what his IUA was as he did not tell me until the end of the conversation that his dependents were not on his membership.  (they are on ex-spouses Valerie Yaw''s green side membership)', 'Patti Baron', 'Patti Baron', '2025-10-08 08:52:15', '2025-10-08 08:52:15'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000171561194', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000170906002', 'Denise Hess', NULL, '10/08/2025<br>Chris emailed asking about labwork and if Labcorp was a place we had a relationship with already. I notified him that our teleheath actually does have a relationship with them and they could use that to also get the labs ordered if they would like. Let him know he could go either with telehealth or with an in person provider they would jsut need to be coded preventative to be covered at 100%<br>AJ', 'Concierge', 'Concierge', '2025-10-08 08:48:38', '2025-10-08 08:48:38'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000171602001', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000001165323', 'Kevin Schill', NULL, '10/8/25<br>Kevin called again to ask if he needed to open a sharing request for his diagnostic colo AC', 'Concierge', 'Concierge', '2025-10-08 08:48:33', '2025-10-08 08:48:33'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000171561189', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000168419065', 'Eden Dowler Thurber', NULL, '10/08/2025<br>Ran RX Quote for:<br><ul style="list-style-type:disc;list-style-position:inside;"><li style="list-style-image:none;"><p style="display:inline;"><span style="color:rgb(0, 0, 0);font-weight:normal;font-style:normal;">Tirzepatide - CVS = $2,158.48 (8 x 0.5ml pens)  or Walgreens = $2,161.99 (8 x 0.5ml pens)</span></p></li></ul><span style="color:rgb(0, 0, 0);">AJ</span>', 'Concierge', 'Concierge', '2025-10-08 08:32:44', '2025-10-08 08:32:44'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000171561179', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000128543002', 'Eugene Small', NULL, '10/08/2025<br>Eugene called in wanting to know what to do next for an upcoming procedure. He already paid enough to meet the IUA and the provider wanted payment before doing the procedure. We called Zion together to verify next steps. He needs to upload his receipts to show he paid the IUA before Zion can make a payment to the provider. He already uploaded a good faith estimate so he should be good to go once he uploads his receipts.<br>AJ', 'Concierge', 'Concierge', '2025-10-08 08:25:05', '2025-10-08 08:25:05'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000171596047', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000171281004', 'Jenny Angelica', NULL, 'Spoke to member she needs to reschedule the welcome call after her start date of November 1, 2025. Sent an email to do so. Vanessa Orozco', 'Concierge', 'Concierge', '2025-10-08 08:05:59', '2025-10-08 08:05:59'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000171561160', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000145456002', 'Richard Gow', NULL, '10/08/2025<br>Sent an email experiencing login issues. I sent him some instructions to get into the health wallet for him and his spouse. Let him know to reach back out if those do not work so we can troubleshoot.<br>AJ', 'Concierge', 'Concierge', '2025-10-08 07:19:22', '2025-10-08 08:26:16'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000171597016', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000171599002', 'Delancey Fortin', 'Member Only $2500 IUA Secure HSA', 'Tax ID/EIN: <span style="color:rgb(0, 0, 0);background-color:rgb(255, 255, 255);">620628075</span>', 'Michele R', 'Michele R', '2025-10-08 07:16:35', '2025-10-08 07:16:35'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000171597009', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000171587002', 'Dhananjay Bendre', NULL, '10/8-Request sent to member &amp; advisor for TAX ID/EIN. Member submitted Tax ID Form: 156626839.  I will process.<br>', 'Michele R', 'Michele R', '2025-10-08 07:11:00', '2025-10-08 08:52:15'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000171596027', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000171026001', 'Barbee Decker', NULL, 'Welcome call complete. Vanessa Orozco', 'Concierge', 'Concierge', '2025-10-08 07:07:37', '2025-10-08 07:07:37'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000171598001', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000107450016', 'Tammy Rossi', NULL, 'Member submitted 2 Cognito forms, also left 2 voice mails to update her pmt method.  She also updated pmt method online.   No action needed on our part.', 'Patti Baron', 'Patti Baron', '2025-10-08 06:52:42', '2025-10-08 06:52:42'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000171584011', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000003848047', 'Aine Carlisle', NULL, '10-7-25 Aine called bc she wanted form 1095-B instead of C. I told her I believe C is the correct form at this point in time with the group size. She will work with her accountant.', 'Wendy Scipione - SR VP National Sales Advisor', 'Wendy Scipione - SR VP National Sales Advisor', '2025-10-07 16:55:18', '2025-10-07 16:55:18'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000171560200', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000028471248', 'Charles Christian Figge VI', NULL, '10/7/25<br>Char less called to reschedule his telehealth visit transfer to lyric and also wanted to nominate his therapist to lyric AC', 'Concierge', 'Concierge', '2025-10-07 15:01:17', '2025-10-07 15:01:23'),
