  ('zcrm_1579374000171391232', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000171119022', 'Ashley Coburn', NULL, 'I spoke with Brandy with Cigna Broker Services. She confirmed Ashley''s binder payment posted yesterday probably just after the email went out. Her account is all set and active with binder and auto pay set to go.', 'Wendy Scipione - SR VP National Sales Advisor', 'Wendy Scipione - SR VP National Sales Advisor', '2025-10-02 09:49:37', '2025-10-02 09:49:37'),
