  ('zcrm_1579374000171394423', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000159238002', 'Steven Kleinberg', NULL, '10/02/2025<br>Sent laura the results of lab quote request. Jason health has her CMP w/ CBC ( w/ diff) for $31<br>Let her know the results and will f/u to see if she needs assistance with scheduling <br>AJ', 'Concierge', 'Concierge', '2025-10-02 09:15:42', '2025-10-02 09:15:42'),
