  ('zcrm_1579374000171394404', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000090686002', 'Brandee Poland', NULL, '10/02/2025<br>Brandee called back and i got her to send me her bills so i can assist with submitting them since it has been a while for a couple. going to send to ARM then update her on the progress.<br>AJ', 'Concierge', 'Concierge', '2025-10-02 09:13:52', '2025-10-02 09:13:52'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000171391222', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000170990026', 'Carra Gilson', NULL, '10-1-25 Per Carra, <span style="color:rgb(34, 34, 34);">"Both payments and auto-pay set ups have been confirmed! </span><br><span style="color:rgb(34, 34, 34);"><br></span><span style="color:rgb(34, 34, 34);">Thanks for your help with all of this! Ive been trying to contact my PCP about getting referrals going, since this is an HMO plan, but I hope to catch her soon!</span><br><span style="color:rgb(34, 34, 34);"><br></span><span style="color:rgb(34, 34, 34);">Sincerely,</span><br><span style="color:rgb(34, 34, 34);">Carra"</span>', 'Wendy Scipione - SR VP National Sales Advisor', 'Wendy Scipione - SR VP National Sales Advisor', '2025-10-02 09:11:07', '2025-10-02 09:11:07'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000171391217', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000002630141', 'Cameron Elmendorf', NULL, '10-2-25 Patti realized she sent Cam the increase in rate email by accident. Her membership renews in June, ie. her price remains the same until then. So, we will leave her membership alone for now. She might want to upgrade by June for wellness benefits.', 'Wendy Scipione - SR VP National Sales Advisor', 'Wendy Scipione - SR VP National Sales Advisor', '2025-10-02 09:09:54', '2025-10-02 09:09:54'),
