  ('zcrm_1579374000171394367', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000090686002', 'Brandee Poland', NULL, '10/02/2025<br>returned Brandee''s call, calling about some bills for preventative care. did not see any active claims with ARM so i am trying to reach her to discuss this and see if the bills were sent to the right place for processing. left VM<br>AJ', 'Concierge', 'Concierge', '2025-10-02 08:40:17', '2025-10-02 08:40:24'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000171394362', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000154723001', 'Madeleine McGuire', NULL, '10/02/2025<br>Advent health called to find the status for a claim for madeline. $500 on 5/27/25.<br>ARM paid a discount, probably not a preventative visit, only paid $75<br>Gave provider ARM number since they said they have not gotten any payment. <br>AJ', 'Concierge', 'Concierge', '2025-10-02 08:31:35', '2025-10-02 08:31:35'),
