  ('zcrm_1579374000171433102', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000134793011', 'Juan Carlos Garcia Benitez', NULL, 'No response. Left a detailed message on vm. Sent email to reschedule welcome call. Vanessa Orozco', 'Concierge', 'Concierge', '2025-10-02 08:02:57', '2025-10-02 08:02:57'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000171395277', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000103810012', 'Paul Dagnese', NULL, '10/2/25<br>Dr. Albert called in to verify eligibility, Paul went in to a wellness check and did not present his Mec card, the providers was able to confirm the are in the phcs network and they too down his Mec info to submit a claim AC', 'Concierge', 'Concierge', '2025-10-02 07:58:19', '2025-10-02 07:58:40'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000171433075', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000170140033', 'Michael Robison', NULL, 'Rescheduled welcome call for Tuesday, October 7, 2025 at 9:30 am EST. Vanessa Orozco', 'Concierge', 'Concierge', '2025-10-02 07:54:42', '2025-10-02 07:54:42'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000171395217', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000108523001', 'Charles Holliday', '10/1/25', 'Stephanie called because she took all three of her children to the hospital for preventative visit back in February, The hospital claims we have repeatedly denied the claims stating her coverage ended in December. I doubled check with her to see if she presented the correct Card and she states she provided the ARM info. I infomred her that we did not recive any claims for her children, and i would follow up with ARM so they can reach out to the hospital and get this sorted out AC<br><span><br></span><span><br></span><span><br></span>3218412596 #', 'Concierge', 'Concierge', '2025-10-02 07:46:25', '2025-10-02 07:46:25'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000171395212', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000059281121', 'Dechen Hawk', NULL, '10/1/25<br>Dechen called because the provider claims he called MPB health and we told him the colonoscopy would not be covered, I explaied to dechen that we do not have record of the provider calling in. I advice him to reach out to the provider and have him call us directly to clarify coverage AC', 'Concierge', 'Concierge', '2025-10-02 07:44:54', '2025-10-02 07:44:54'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000171395204', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000163360001', 'Blythe Burge', '10/2/25', 'Blythe called to see how she can nominate a provider into the phcs network AC', 'Concierge', 'Concierge', '2025-10-02 07:40:53', '2025-10-02 07:41:08'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000171433053', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000163360001', 'Blythe Burge', NULL, 'Welcome call complete. Vanessa Orozco', 'Concierge', 'Concierge', '2025-10-02 07:34:23', '2025-10-02 07:34:23'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000171394357', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000083452001', 'Peter Martino', NULL, '10/02/2025<br>Alicia called to see what she should tell pediatrician so they know what her insurance is. I let her know to explain it is the PHCS network and altrisk is the company that pays the bill. Gave her alternate number to call ARM if problems arise and she would like a 3 way call with the provider to explain to them. Als offered to be on the call to assist. <br>AJ', 'Concierge', 'Concierge', '2025-10-02 07:15:54', '2025-10-02 07:15:54'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000171434015', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000065153602', 'Agnieszka Fuksa', NULL, 'Member submitted payment update. I will process.', 'Michele R', 'Michele R', '2025-10-02 07:12:35', '2025-10-02 07:12:35'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000171434004', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000141685002', 'Laura Murtha', NULL, 'Member submitted Dependent Over 18 Form.  I will process.', 'Michele R', 'Michele R', '2025-10-02 06:59:02', '2025-10-02 06:59:02'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000171391212', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000132624011', 'Roger Keeler', NULL, '10-1-25 See notes on Lena''s account. We need to change their income back according to their accountant.<br><span><br></span><span style="color:rgb(34, 34, 34);">"I am estimated your modified adjusted gross income at $74K for 2025.  If you and or Lena are out of work, you will qualify for Medicaid and possibly food stamps.  Food stamps are a debit card at this point.  If I remember correctly, it should last up to 3 months after you get another job.  I know it is not the most appealing option, but it will keep your household stable until you have more money coming in."</span><br><span style="color:rgb(34, 34, 34);"><br></span><span style="color:rgb(34, 34, 34);">Looks like it was set at $77K before according to my notes. So, this should give them a small break in monthly cost. I''m waiting for Roger to get back to me for next steps.</span>', 'Wendy Scipione - SR VP National Sales Advisor', 'Wendy Scipione - SR VP National Sales Advisor', '2025-10-01 17:28:06', '2025-10-01 17:28:06'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000171391207', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000073820131', 'Danielle Lynn', NULL, '10-1-25 From Danielle, "<span style="color:rgb(34, 34, 34);">I was able to provide them with my credit card information, and the transition seems to have been successful. Thanks again."</span>', 'Wendy Scipione - SR VP National Sales Advisor', 'Wendy Scipione - SR VP National Sales Advisor', '2025-10-01 16:53:50', '2025-10-01 16:53:50'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000171391202', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000163576188', 'Daniel McCarthy', NULL, '10-1-25 Dan called back and C4 is giving him the same run around. So, I called with him on the line and connected with Leah at C4. She said the same exact story probably from the notes. Leah is digging deeper and we''re on hold.', 'Wendy Scipione - SR VP National Sales Advisor', 'Wendy Scipione - SR VP National Sales Advisor', '2025-10-01 16:33:06', '2025-10-01 16:33:06'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000171391187', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000134767002', 'Kara Weld', NULL, '10-1-25 Kara should be back from vacation. I left her a vm to complete the more detailed census for HA. Told her open enrollment for group is today to Oct. 15th for Nov. 1st start date.', 'Wendy Scipione - SR VP National Sales Advisor', 'Wendy Scipione - SR VP National Sales Advisor', '2025-10-01 16:03:02', '2025-10-01 16:03:02'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000171391182', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000011307064', 'Thomas White-O''Connor', NULL, '10-1-25 I left a vm for Beth bc she sent me an email to help with daughter I think. She never responded to my email, so I figured I''d call her in case she didn''t see the email.', 'Wendy Scipione - SR VP National Sales Advisor', 'Wendy Scipione - SR VP National Sales Advisor', '2025-10-01 15:59:56', '2025-10-01 15:59:56'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000171391157', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000163576188', 'Daniel McCarthy', NULL, '10-1-25 Dan called bc he called C4 and RMHP to remove himself from their plan bc he''s turning 65 this month. In doing this, C4 cancelled their plan and re-enrolled Mary into her own plan moving forward. She had already met her ded for the year and it''s now starting over with the new plan. He has his case # with C4 and they can see that he clearly requested for him to be removed from their current plan not to cancel out the plan. They told him the plan had to be cancelled from a family plan to an individual plan! That is Not accurate information. They were already on an IFP. I told him to call C4 and correct their mistake and they''d have to resend the data to RMHP. I told him to elevate it to a Manager. If that all fails then we''ll have to escalate it on my end.', 'Wendy Scipione - SR VP National Sales Advisor', 'Wendy Scipione - SR VP National Sales Advisor', '2025-10-01 15:56:10', '2025-10-01 15:56:10'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000171394352', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000100610002', 'Jenna Kulik', NULL, '10/01/2025<br>Informed her that new cards have been ordered for her and asked her to let us know if she does not so we can make sure she gets them<br>AJ', 'Concierge', 'Concierge', '2025-10-01 14:34:45', '2025-10-01 14:34:45'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000171394333', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000159238002', 'Steven Kleinberg', NULL, '10/01/2025<br>Spoke to steven about preventative care and what is covered and walked him through how to submit a quote request<br>AJ', 'Concierge', 'Concierge', '2025-10-01 14:27:14', '2025-10-01 14:27:14'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000171394328', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000156437001', 'Zachery Poulter', NULL, '10/01/2025<br>Zach called because of some numbness he is experiencing. Let him know since that is not preventative he can go wherever, no network, and just hold on to his bills in case the treatment goes above his IUA so he can begin a share request <br>AJ', 'Concierge', 'Concierge', '2025-10-01 14:26:12', '2025-10-01 14:26:12'),
