  ('zcrm_1579374000171394303', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000169135002', 'Adam Jackson', NULL, '10/01/2025<br>Olivia called with basic membership questions and also to find out more about mammograms and if they are covered completely under the preventative care which i let her know yes they are<br>AJ', 'Concierge', 'Concierge', '2025-10-01 14:13:47', '2025-10-01 14:13:47'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000171394298', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000170995020', 'Michael Jarrett', NULL, '10/01/2025<br>Called sent text and left VM to let michael know that he can now log in to the health wallet. I called ARM earlier and found out it is due to the fact health wallet only lets ARM send the names of people to add once they are active and not before so there is a slight delay on the first day for people starting to gain access<br>AJ', 'Concierge', 'Concierge', '2025-10-01 14:11:32', '2025-10-01 14:11:32'),
