  ('zcrm_1579374000171394241', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000016570002', 'Michael Wisner', NULL, '10/01/2025<br>Called in to ask about tier one and two discounts. I explained all of that and showed him where his rx valet card was. Also sending an email with the tier one and two lists of meds over to him for future reference.<br>AJ', 'Concierge', 'Concierge', '2025-10-01 13:44:30', '2025-10-01 13:44:30'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000171394236', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000059281121', 'Dechen Hawk', NULL, '10/01/2025<br>Dechen called to make sure colo was covered. He is in secure HSA. yes screening colo is covered and i advised him of that. he gave me provider number so i could call and clear up any confusion and make sure they know this is covered. <br>AJ', 'Concierge', 'Concierge', '2025-10-01 13:38:29', '2025-10-01 13:38:29'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000171391152', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000002630141', 'Cameron Elmendorf', NULL, '10-1-25 Cam is turning 50 in Dec. Amount will change from $496 SDHC to $670. If we add MEC and make it PSDHC it will be $736. If we can move her to the new membership of Premium HSA it will be $670. I left Cam a vm to make sure she''s self-employed. After speaking with Patti, I''ll email Juliet to see if we can switch her to the Premium memberships for Dec. 1st, 2025.', 'Wendy Scipione - SR VP National Sales Advisor', 'Wendy Scipione - SR VP National Sales Advisor', '2025-10-01 13:31:47', '2025-10-01 13:31:47'),
