  ('zcrm_1579374000171391102', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000157910087', 'Lena Wenzel', NULL, '9-30-25 Talked with Lena and then Roger. Lena agreed that we should remove Roger''s Abo''s pizza income. However when I logged in there was no income labeled as Abo''s. It was all under Aristocrat biz. I changed the income per her recommendations which qualified them for Medicaid with less than $29K. Then Roger walked in and took over. He''s getting paid through mid October and had 4 interviews, most of which offer benefits. He also has rental income. His mortgage is $1200 and rent is $2500 11 months of the year and one month only $2200. So, I put that income back  into the system and it gave them a huge APTC which covers all but $2.50 or so. He has a call into his accountant to give us more accurate numbers so he doesn''t have to pay any $ back in taxes. He has a little money saved for the rest of the year for insurance. He doesn''t want Medicaid at this point.', 'Wendy Scipione - SR VP National Sales Advisor', 'Wendy Scipione - SR VP National Sales Advisor', '2025-09-30 21:01:41', '2025-09-30 21:01:41'),
