  ('zcrm_1579374000171394184', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000164262010', 'Sandrine Lisk', NULL, '09/30/2025<br>Sandrine called in having trouble logging into health wallet and receiving emails. The emails she said she could not get were from health wallet. I think it was that she did not use the correct format when entering in her DOB. After troubleshooting everything she said did not work i was able to make work. If she calls back it is more than likely user error but be patient and help her walk through it<br>AJ', 'Concierge', 'Concierge', '2025-09-30 14:35:13', '2025-09-30 14:35:13'),
