  ('zcrm_1579374000171394144', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000162648002', 'Zach Meschi', NULL, '09/30/2025<br>Talked to her and gave my direct line for the future. Let her knopw how her membership works and let her know the only not covered things are mainly going to be written in the guidelines which she has a copy of. going to look into ABUS mammos for her and let her know what i find. <br>AJ', 'Concierge', 'Concierge', '2025-09-30 14:30:21', '2025-09-30 14:30:21'),
