  ('zcrm_1579374000171346177', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000171119022', 'Ashley Coburn', NULL, '9-29-25 Total cost is $393.92. Company portion is $261.07. employee cost is $132.85 and $61.32 per paycheck. Jennifer Abbott needs to login to her Employer Portal to access and cross check this information. She will also need to make sure within the Enrolled Census the date is set to 10/1/25. Then she should see all of the numbers to confirm everything.', 'Wendy Scipione - SR VP National Sales Advisor', 'Wendy Scipione - SR VP National Sales Advisor', '2025-09-29 17:19:35', '2025-09-29 17:19:35'),
