  ('zcrm_1579374000171346054', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000047084237', 'Mark DeRespinis', NULL, '9-29-25 I called Mark bc his payment didn''t go through. He said he closed down that bank account. I asked him to complete the form online but he wasn''t near a computer and wanted to make sure he gave MPB the information before it was too late. I took the account details and gave it to Patti to run. He''s using ACH bank draft with his High Plains Bank account. He also wants to review his membership. He was curious about wellness and HSA compliance. He knows about Function Health labs for $500 I think it is. He just wants to review everything since he hasn''t done so in a long time and his wife is complaining that it''s not covering enought for their daughter. However, it sounds like they are also paying for a DPC for their daughter. We will review everything on Thurs.', 'Wendy Scipione - SR VP National Sales Advisor', 'Wendy Scipione - SR VP National Sales Advisor', '2025-09-29 12:17:20', '2025-09-29 12:19:50'),
