  ('zcrm_1579374000171313024', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000032122001', 'Eileen Fagan', NULL, 'Called Member from a voicemail that she wanted to cancel her membership.  We advised Tupac and he had been trying to call her and left multiple voicemails.  I was able to speak with her today.  She had been travelling on conferences and had been out of town.  She told me that she had an open need that would need to be satisfied before she could cancel her membership.  Therefore, she will not be canceling for October 1, 2025. She will submit the cancellation link that Tupac sent her after the open need is satisfied, and will cancel at that time.', 'Michele R', 'Michele R', '2025-09-29 07:43:01', '2025-09-29 07:43:01'),
