  ('zcrm_1579374000171243024', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000130447001', 'Dewayne Nelson III', NULL, '9/26/25: Spoke to provider regarding Dewayne''s screening colo. Ended up tranferring to ARM to discuss billing codes. AM', 'Concierge', 'Concierge', '2025-09-26 07:33:09', '2025-09-26 07:33:09'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000171241017', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000065038037', 'Jeff Bolf', 'Decline of 10/25 Share Amount', '9/26-1st notice sent to member &amp; advisor via em &amp; vm<br>9/29- 3rd/Final notice sent to member &amp; advisor via em<br>9/30- Member submitted payment update. I will process.<br>10/6- Member''s new submitted ACH bank info declined.  Sending notice to member &amp; advisor via em and vm<br>10/7-I received no response from member re: alt Pmt method I will cancel.', 'Michele R', 'Michele R', '2025-09-26 07:28:56', '2025-10-07 13:34:30'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000171242023', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000159240001', 'Elliot Ash', 'Decline of 10/25 Share Amount', '9/26-1st notice sent to member &amp; advisor via em &amp; vm<br>9/26-Member submitted new CC I will rerun', 'Patti Baron', 'Patti Baron', '2025-09-26 07:23:11', '2025-09-26 07:46:22'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000171243013', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000012630172', 'Jessica Lynn Showalter', NULL, '9/26/25: Jessica emailed in asking how to log into HW app and that she needs to update her address. I explained that she would actually use the MPB app, and shared link to download as well as member update form. AM', 'Concierge', 'Concierge', '2025-09-26 07:22:25', '2025-09-26 07:22:25'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000171241010', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000064056212', 'Daryl Mackie', 'Decline of 10/25 Share Amount', '9/26-1st notice sent to member &amp; advisor via em &amp; vm. Member replied to email directing me to rerun his share amount as there are now sufficient funds.  I will process.<br>10/2- Payment declined by bank, "IF" Insufficient Funds.  Sent email to member &amp; advisor with payment update form to submit.<br>10/3- Member replied to my email directing us to rerun again the share amount, as his account had a deposit of a third party check that held up his funds being available. I will process.', 'Michele R', 'Michele R', '2025-09-26 07:18:47', '2025-10-03 11:22:38'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000171244001', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000155188020', 'Gaia Brown', NULL, '09/26/2025<br>Sent email asking to add spouse to ARM site. let her know it only displays primary members info but all claims will display there for the membership.<br>AJ', 'Concierge', 'Concierge', '2025-09-26 07:18:17', '2025-09-26 07:18:17'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000171242016', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000160027002', 'Hannah Rackley', 'Decline of 10/25 Share Amount', '9/26-1st notice sent to member &amp; advisor via em &amp; vm<br>9/29-final notice sent o member &amp; advisor via em. Member submitted payment update. I will process.', 'Patti Baron', 'Patti Baron', '2025-09-26 07:17:53', '2025-09-29 09:22:12'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000171243008', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000079055002', 'Dale Leder', NULL, '9/26/25: Cynthia called wanting to know how to access her telehealth - she was trying to log into cirrus. I walked her through logging into HW and gave her a brief overview of the new telehealth upgrades. AM', 'Concierge', 'Concierge', '2025-09-26 07:17:08', '2025-09-26 07:17:08'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000171242006', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000123908002', 'Charlotte Westbrook', NULL, 'Member submitted cancellation eff 10/25 due to getting married and moving out of the country.  I will cancel &amp; process refund.', 'Patti Baron', 'Patti Baron', '2025-09-26 07:10:03', '2025-09-26 07:10:03'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000171242001', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000034059166', 'Deanna Johnson', NULL, 'Member submitted payment update.  I will process.', 'Patti Baron', 'Patti Baron', '2025-09-26 07:05:31', '2025-09-26 07:05:31');
