  ('zcrm_1579374000171230033', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000173079093', 'Claire House', NULL, '9-25-25 Came via Bev! <span style="color:rgb(43, 49, 60);">INACTIVE 2025. 2024 was RMHP Valley Silver Value ($0 Virtual Urgent Care + $0 PCP Visits, $5 Tier 2 Rx, $0 Insulin, Rx Copay).</span>', 'Wendy Scipione - SR VP National Sales Advisor', 'Wendy Scipione - SR VP National Sales Advisor', '2025-09-25 21:20:22', '2025-09-25 21:25:21'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000171217133', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000171217095', 'Megan Hubbard', NULL, '9-25-25 <br><p style="background-color:rgb(232, 241, 212);display:flex;"><span style="background-color:rgb(232, 241, 212);"><b>Enrolled members:</b></span><span style="background-color:rgb(232, 241, 212);">Megan Hubbard, Sutton Hubbard and Jackson Godbe</span></p><p style="display:flex;"><span style="color:rgb(43, 49, 60);"><br></span></p><p style="display:flex;"><span style=""><b>RMHP Valley Colorado Option Gold</b></span></p><p style=""><span style="color:rgb(43, 49, 60);">Family Deductible</span></p><p style=""><span style="color:rgb(43, 49, 60);">Family Out-of-Pocket Max</span></p><p style=""><span style="color:rgb(43, 49, 60);">Primary Care Coinsurance</span></p><p style=""><span style="color:rgb(43, 49, 60);">$3,750</span></p><p style=""><span style="color:rgb(43, 49, 60);">$17,400</span></p><p style=""><span style="color:rgb(43, 49, 60);">N/A</span></p><p style=""><span style="color:rgb(43, 49, 60);">Individual Deductible</span></p><p style=""><span style="color:rgb(43, 49, 60);">Individual Out-of-Pocket Max</span></p><p style=""><span style="color:rgb(43, 49, 60);">Specialist Coinsurance</span></p><p style=""><span style="color:rgb(43, 49, 60);">N/A</span></p><p style=""><span style="color:rgb(43, 49, 60);">N/A</span></p><p style=""><span style="color:rgb(43, 49, 60);">N/A</span></p><p style=""><span style="color:rgb(43, 49, 60);">Urgent Care Coinsurance</span></p><p style=""><span style="color:rgb(43, 49, 60);">N/A</span></p><p style="display:flex;"><span style=""><b>Payment required from:</b></span></p><p style="display:flex;"><span style="">01/01/25 - 12/31/25</span></p><p style="display:flex;"><span style=""><b>$109.10 /month </b></span><span style="color:rgb(43, 49, 60);">after$1,090.81 financial help</span></p><p style="display:flex;margin-inline-start:0.5rem;"><span style=""><b>Exchange policy number:</b></span><span style="color:rgb(43, 49, 60);"> 2886003575</span></p><p style="display:flex;margin-inline-start:0.5rem;"><span style=""><b>Coverage dates:</b></span><span style="color:rgb(43, 49, 60);"> 01/01/25 - 12/31/25</span></p><p style="display:flex;margin-inline-start:0.5rem;"><span style=""><b>Last updated:</b></span><span style="color:rgb(43, 49, 60);"> 11/04/24</span></p>', 'Wendy Scipione - SR VP National Sales Advisor', 'Wendy Scipione - SR VP National Sales Advisor', '2025-09-25 17:23:03', '2025-09-25 17:23:03'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000171217082', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000162515002', 'Jackson Lawrie', NULL, '9-25-25 <br><span style="color:rgb(34, 34, 34);">Hello Wendy,</span><br><span style="color:rgb(34, 34, 34);"><br></span><span style="color:rgb(34, 34, 34);">Thank you for reaching out to 1Dental!</span><br><span style="color:rgb(34, 34, 34);"><br></span><span style="color:rgb(34, 34, 34);">I have cancelled Jackson Lawrie.</span><br><span style="color:rgb(34, 34, 34);"><br></span><span style="color:rgb(34, 34, 34);">Let us know if we can help further!</span><br><span style="color:rgb(34, 34, 34);"><br></span><span style="color:rgb(34, 34, 34);"><br></span><p style=""><span style="color:rgb(34, 34, 34);">Best Regards,</span></p><p style=""><span style="color:rgb(34, 34, 34);"> </span></p><p style=""><span style="color:rgb(34, 34, 34);">Cailyn</span></p><p style=""><span style="color:rgb(34, 34, 34);"><br></span></p><p style=""><span style="color:rgb(34, 34, 34);"><br></span></p>', 'Wendy Scipione - SR VP National Sales Advisor', 'Wendy Scipione - SR VP National Sales Advisor', '2025-09-25 16:17:59', '2025-09-25 16:17:59'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000171217072', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000123908002', 'Charlotte Westbrook', NULL, '9-25-25 Charlotte is getting married in Austria and will be moving there to live with her new husband. They have healthcare for all people. She will be covered that way. I sent her a nice email just now congratulating her. Not much more I can do.', 'Wendy Scipione - SR VP National Sales Advisor', 'Wendy Scipione - SR VP National Sales Advisor', '2025-09-25 16:00:09', '2025-09-25 16:00:09'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000171217067', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000171700002', 'Jake Johnson', NULL, '9-25-25 Jake still need to deposit a check he just got. So, we will wait until Monday at 3:00 MST to enroll. It won''t begin ''til Nov. 1st, so we have time. He just doesn''t want to bounce the account.', 'Wendy Scipione - SR VP National Sales Advisor', 'Wendy Scipione - SR VP National Sales Advisor', '2025-09-25 15:07:23', '2025-09-25 15:07:23'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000171217062', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000169157001', 'Shawn Aycock', NULL, '9-25-25 Lisa called to get help logging in for her dental plan. I don''t see any dental plan. So, I''m not sure what she signed up for. I left her a vm.', 'Wendy Scipione - SR VP National Sales Advisor', 'Wendy Scipione - SR VP National Sales Advisor', '2025-09-25 14:55:24', '2025-09-25 14:55:24'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000171207127', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000044650228', 'Tom Schramer', NULL, '09/25/2025<br>Me and Aba just cleared all info out and started over. I let her know we did this and also trying to organize a phone call so i can walk her though logging in if she still can not figure it out<br>AJ', 'Concierge', 'Concierge', '2025-09-25 14:45:50', '2025-09-25 14:45:50'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000171217034', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000012010011', 'Elizabeth Wood', NULL, '9-25-25 Elizabeth called to find out if she can get onto Medicaid since everyone is the hospital system is telling her to apply. I explained that Medicaid will be the primary and health sharing is secondary. Medicaid will go 3 months back. Everything before that she''s responsible for and will pay her $1500 IUA. She had multiple ER visits and ICU visits due to blood clots. No v but agrees it''s the spike protein wreaking havoc from getting covid. She''s doing much better now.  She''ll apply. She doesn''t want to be on Medicaid for long but she hasn''t been able to work for months, since May when this all started.', 'Wendy Scipione - SR VP National Sales Advisor', 'Wendy Scipione - SR VP National Sales Advisor', '2025-09-25 14:42:51', '2025-09-25 14:42:51'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000171207119', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000159338001', 'Kimberly Ticknor', NULL, '09/25/2025<br>Called in to see what would be covered in a annual physical bloodwork. Let her know to save all the bills and pay as a cash pay patient so she could open a share request if treatment goes above the IUA<br>AJ', 'Concierge', 'Concierge', '2025-09-25 14:42:14', '2025-09-25 14:42:14'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000171207114', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000153327002', 'Rachel Klobucher', NULL, '09/25/2025<br>Rachel called in to find out more on her benefits with RX valet and to get assistance with the telehealth. Got her signed in and explained all the upgrades<br>AJ', 'Concierge', 'Concierge', '2025-09-25 14:40:49', '2025-09-25 14:40:49'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000171207109', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000167033002', 'Matthew Redling', NULL, '09/25/2025<br>Matthew called in to see what he could do for a dermatology visit he is being referred to. I explained that would be diagnostic therefore would go towards an IUA<br>AJ', 'Concierge', 'Concierge', '2025-09-25 14:38:27', '2025-09-25 14:38:27'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000171207090', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000155432018', 'Marshall Pickett', NULL, '09/25/2025<br>Wife called in to see what to do for him since he has kidney stones. I advised to maybe speak to the cost share also in case they have a different idea on what would be shared on since the provider wants to try a treatment first before the usual route. <br>AJ', 'Concierge', 'Concierge', '2025-09-25 14:35:54', '2025-09-25 14:35:54'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000171207085', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000123908002', 'Charlotte Westbrook', NULL, '09/25/2025<br>Getting married so she requested to cancel. sent her the link<br>AJ', 'Concierge', 'Concierge', '2025-09-25 14:34:19', '2025-09-25 14:34:19'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000171217029', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000004876167', 'Coreen (Cory) Nickerson', NULL, '9-25-25 Cory wants to review her options.', 'Wendy Scipione - SR VP National Sales Advisor', 'Wendy Scipione - SR VP National Sales Advisor', '2025-09-25 14:25:28', '2025-09-25 14:25:28'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000171217024', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000011447148', 'Marie-Christine Carel', NULL, '9-25-25 Marie-Christine just got home from out of the country and found her wellness visit was denied by Planstin. I called her and left a vm letting her know she should have a new digital and hard copy card to present. I told her to call the MPB Concierge Team to get the card and resubmit the information.', 'Wendy Scipione - SR VP National Sales Advisor', 'Wendy Scipione - SR VP National Sales Advisor', '2025-09-25 14:18:15', '2025-09-25 14:18:15'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000171217019', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000059611038', 'Heidi McGuire', NULL, '9-25-25 Heidi is all set and understands her Medicare options. She''s good to go but sad to leave MPB.', 'Wendy Scipione - SR VP National Sales Advisor', 'Wendy Scipione - SR VP National Sales Advisor', '2025-09-25 14:14:44', '2025-09-25 14:14:44'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000171202174', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000131309012', 'Tyler Dalton', NULL, 'Member called in regarding the September payment that was charged to his credit card.  He wanted to change the payment method to the bank account that he has on file.  He wanted to know if we could rerun the September payment using the bank account.  I told him we could not do that, however going forward for the October payment we will use his bank account on file. I checked with Patti and she confirmed that we cannot recharge September payement.  I left Tyler a voiceamail with this information .  I will process and change payment method to his bank account.', 'Michele R', 'Michele R', '2025-09-25 14:12:38', '2025-09-25 14:12:38'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000171207037', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000146981001', 'Suzanne Wos', NULL, '09/25/2025<br>Suzanne called because she wanted a physical ARM card. I ordered a new one and sent a temp card. Guided her to health wallet and explained everything there, showed her how to get her cards use rx valet etc. <br>AJ', 'Concierge', 'Concierge', '2025-09-25 13:17:21', '2025-09-25 13:17:21'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000171207032', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000059281121', 'Dechen Hawk', NULL, '09/25/2025<br>Sent a follow up text after we spoke last just to double check up with him and see if he still was in need of any assistance with his colonoscopy. he responded asking for help since he does not have the time to call the colo place. let him know i will assist<br>AJ', 'Concierge', 'Concierge', '2025-09-25 12:15:54', '2025-09-25 14:46:58'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000171207027', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000079996013', 'Justin Barney', NULL, '09/25/2025<br>Called provider Katrina from AMBRE genetics. Let her know what the guidelines say about genetic testing and how it would only be shareable if used for treatment towards a condition such as breast cancer<br>AJ', 'Concierge', 'Concierge', '2025-09-25 12:02:37', '2025-09-25 12:02:37'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000171207008', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000011610497', 'Adam Burstein', NULL, '09/25/2025<br>Helped allyson submit a bill for prreventative care to ARM. Now they are processing it and i will update her on that in a couple of days.<br>AJ', 'Concierge', 'Concierge', '2025-09-25 11:53:26', '2025-09-25 11:53:26'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000171203113', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000098614002', 'Joseph Whitman', NULL, '9/25/25: Called ARM to check on Jessica''s well child bills. Karen had no idea and Lori had just stepped out. Requested that if Lori call back, to leave a detailed message with Adam or shoot over an email. AM', 'Concierge', 'Concierge', '2025-09-25 11:37:15', '2025-09-25 11:37:15'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000171221001', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000128665002', 'Matthew Weum', 'Zoho SalesIQ chat missed', 'Visit ID : 4382 Question : How do I submit a preventative care claim', 'MPB Health Member Notification', 'MPB Health Member Notification', '2025-09-25 11:34:03', '2025-09-25 11:34:03'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000171203108', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000084187002', 'Jon Jenkins', NULL, '9/25/25: Provider called again to verify Cathy''s eligibility. AM', 'Concierge', 'Concierge', '2025-09-25 11:27:12', '2025-09-25 11:27:12'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000171203103', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000148609002', 'Yaron Shvets', NULL, '9/25/25: Regina called asking how to search for an in-network provider - guided her to multiplan site and how to search PHCS. She also wanted to know where she could get a flu shot - with PCP or pharmacy. AM', 'Concierge', 'Concierge', '2025-09-25 11:21:16', '2025-09-25 11:21:16'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000171203098', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000170826025', 'James Robert coleman', NULL, '9/25/25: James called wondering why he can''t log into app? I explained that it''s bc his plan hasn''t officially started yet. AM<br><span><br></span>', 'Concierge', 'Concierge', '2025-09-25 10:50:42', '2025-09-25 10:50:42'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000171203093', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000130447001', 'Dewayne Nelson III', NULL, '9/25/25: Provider called and LVM regarding eligibility for Dewayne. Unable to connect - left number for a call back. AM', 'Concierge', 'Concierge', '2025-09-25 10:25:38', '2025-09-25 10:25:38'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000171203088', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000144606012', 'Julie Cohen', NULL, '9/25/25: returned Julie''s call from yesterday - she needed help getting into app. I got her into MPB app, but let her know that she wouldn''t have access to health wallet until 10/1. AM', 'Concierge', 'Concierge', '2025-09-25 10:21:53', '2025-09-25 10:21:53'),
