  ('zcrm_1579374000171203024', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000115820002', 'Adam Schwindt', NULL, '9/25/25: Adam called to request 2024 1095. Put request into teams 1095 chat and let Adam know we''d email him the form soon. AM', 'Concierge', 'Concierge', '2025-09-25 07:53:37', '2025-09-25 07:53:37'),
