  ('zcrm_1579374000171203016', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000169135002', 'Adam Jackson', NULL, '9/25/25: Olivia called to discuss appointments she''d like to schedule. She has a mamm scheduled for next week, Raleigh Radiology - they are showing in network. I just let her know how to present for appt.<br>She needs to schedule a colo. We discussed making sure provider is in network and presenting. <br>Her long time pediatrician is not in network so she''s going to look for another. <br>Her daughter needs a physical and is having stomach issues, and wanted to know what to do if she needs to see a specialist. We discussed using telehealth first, and how the health share would work, no-network restrictions, submitting bills, etc. AM<br>Also offered out appt scheduling services and provided link to form via email. AM', 'Concierge', 'Concierge', '2025-09-25 07:47:11', '2025-09-25 07:47:34'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000171203009', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000166776002', 'Raymond Urciuoli', NULL, '9/25/25: Called Lyric mental health and spoke to Christine (224-534-3539). She is going to look into why Ray''s therapist (Vivienne Cotton) is stating he is only approved for 6 sessions. Christine is going to look into this and email the concierge line back  with what she finds out. AM<br><span><br></span>(previously Ray said he was going through MSEAP, but after calling them learned that the therapist is actually with Essentra).', 'Concierge', 'Concierge', '2025-09-25 07:19:44', '2025-09-25 09:15:54'),
