  ('zcrm_1579374000171178003', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000059611038', 'Heidi McGuire', NULL, '9-24-25 Heidi called after I sent her the Aging into Medicare email from Patti. She was bummed to hear she has to be kicked out of the membership. She''s been really happy with it. She only needed it once but it worked very well for her. She is all set with Medicare. She signed up to learn about Medicare from some group in UT. They are telling her once she chooses a plan she can never upgrade it years down the road. Sounds pretty fishy to me. I''ll inquire with Andrea.', 'Wendy Scipione - SR VP National Sales Advisor', 'Wendy Scipione - SR VP National Sales Advisor', '2025-09-24 16:23:58', '2025-09-24 16:23:58'),
