  ('zcrm_1579374000171159195', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000064218045', 'Eric Lipp', NULL, '9/24/25: Eric called wanting to talk to one of our "higher ups" aka Leo, and asked to be transferred to his VM. Transferred over. AM', 'Concierge', 'Concierge', '2025-09-24 11:34:11', '2025-09-24 11:34:11'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000171159176', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000011939033', 'Tal Diamant', NULL, '9/24/25: Tal called with a question about rx valet. He looked on there for an inhaler - symbicort and took the coupon to pharmacy but it didn''t work, called rx valet and they said, no it''s not going to work. Apparenlty he changed the gram amount to 3 thinking it was the number of inhalers, which came back with a great price, but not accurate to his prescription. Regardless the real price is no where near what he can get it for now via canadian pharmacy. <br><span><br></span>He is also needing to have a Cardiac Ablation done. I suggested to go ahead and open a sharing request for issue and get it approved from Zion. If approved, he''s looking at paying $2500 for everything. AM', 'Concierge', 'Concierge', '2025-09-24 11:28:03', '2025-09-24 11:28:03'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000171156194', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000166355002', 'Jason Yim', NULL, 'Welcome call complete with Jason and Cindy. Vanessa Orozco', 'Concierge', 'Concierge', '2025-09-24 11:21:13', '2025-09-24 11:21:13'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000171159171', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000168251003', 'Edward Moore', NULL, '9/24/25: Edward called wondering why he can only get a 30 day supply of his meds at his pharmacy. I explained that he can use the mail order option if he''d like to get 90 days and walked him through logging into HW and reading through mail order guide. AM', 'Concierge', 'Concierge', '2025-09-24 11:08:11', '2025-09-24 11:08:11'),
