  ('zcrm_1579374000171159008', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000155318072', 'Randall Mosser', NULL, '9/24/25: Jenny emailed in to check on the vaccine receipts she supposedly sent in on the 19th - Let her know this is the first time I''m seeing an email from her and to please re-attach the images as I can''t see from previous email she mentioned. <br>Forwarded vaccine bills to Lori and let Jenny know we''d reach out when we hear back.<br>AM', 'Concierge', 'Concierge', '2025-09-24 07:22:37', '2025-09-24 10:40:03'),
