  ('zcrm_1579374000171119074', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000170990026', 'Carra Gilson', NULL, '9-23-25 <br><span style="color:rgb(34, 34, 34);">Call 844-833-8440 or go to </span><a style="display:inline;" target="_blank" href="https://directvisioninsurance.com/"><u>https://directvisioninsurance.com</u></a><br><span style="color:rgb(34, 34, 34);">Dear Carra Lee Gilson,</span><br><span style="color:rgb(34, 34, 34);">Congratulations on purchasing a Direct Vision plan! You have just made a great investment in protecting your vision health. Please SAVE this important membership information. If you have any questions, call us at </span><a style="display:inline;" target="_blank" href="tel:800-620-5010"><u>844-833-8440</u></a><span style="color:rgb(34, 34, 34);"> or e-mail us at </span><a style="display:inline;" target="_blank" href="mailto:directbenefits@directbenefits.com"><u>directbenefits@directbenefits.com</u></a><span style="color:rgb(34, 34, 34);">. Please do not respond to this confirmation email.</span><br><span style="color:rgb(34, 34, 34);">Here is what you need to know.</span><br><span style="color:rgb(34, 34, 34);"><b>If you chose electronic delivery of your plan documents, you will not receive paper copies.</b></span><span style="color:rgb(34, 34, 34);"> Instead, you will be able to access your information through your member portal. If you chose to have your plan documents delivered via direct mail, please allow up to 10 days for delivery to the address you provided in the Primary Applicant sec tion. Your provider will verify benefits using your 9 digit policy # below. Do not use your SSN.</span><br><span style="color:rgb(34, 34, 34);"><b>Access your ID cards, benefits, claims, and more electronically via your member portal account (s).   </b></span><br><ul style="list-style-type:disc;list-style-position:inside;"><li style="list-style-image:none;"><p style="display:inline;"><span style="color:rgb(34, 34, 34);margin-inline-start:25px;font-weight:normal;font-styl