 Inc, 7900 International Drive, Suite 1040, Bloomington, MN 55425</span><br><span style="color:rgb(34, 34, 34);">CA Agency License: 600496</span>', 'Wendy Scipione - SR VP National Sales Advisor', 'Wendy Scipione - SR VP National Sales Advisor', '2025-09-23 21:21:22', '2025-09-23 21:21:22'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000171119064', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000155863302', 'Kymberli Collins', NULL, '9-23-25 Kymberli just removed me at their agent. Not sure why. I sent her a quick email just now to check in.', 'Wendy Scipione - SR VP National Sales Advisor', 'Wendy Scipione - SR VP National Sales Advisor', '2025-09-23 20:20:30', '2025-09-23 20:20:30'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000171119056', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000171119022', 'Ashley Coburn', NULL, '9-23-25 Ashely chose <span style="color:rgb(43, 49, 60);background-color:rgb(227, 246, 255);">Cigna Connect Colorado Option Silver Off Exchange</span><br><p style="display:flex;"><span style="color:rgb(77, 77, 79);"><b>Ashley</b></span></p><p style="display:flex;"><span style="color:rgb(77, 77, 79);">Ashley M Coburn</span></p><p style="display:flex;"><span style=""><b>Medical Plan</b></span></p><p style="display:flex;"><span style="">Cigna Connect Colorado Option Silver Off Exchange</span></p><p style="display:flex;"><span style="">Silver/EPO</span></p><p style="display:flex;"><span style=""><br></span></p><p style="display:flex;"><span style="">1-877-900-1237</span></p><p style="display:flex;"><span style="color:rgb(77, 77, 79);"><b>Monthly Plan Payment$393.92/mo</b></span></p>', 'Wendy Scipione - SR VP National Sales Advisor', 'Wendy Scipione - SR VP National Sales Advisor', '2025-09-23 16:36:12', '2025-09-23 16:36:42'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000171119051', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000171119022', 'Ashley Coburn', NULL, '9-23-25 Ashley is now enrolled through Colorado Connect since it''s the only place to enroll a client into the Cigna CO Options plans that are Off-Exchange! It''s also the only place to enroll the Anthem CO Option GOLD plans Off-X. I won''t be able to find these on C4HCO or directly with the carrier for these plans only. The rest I should be able to enroll on the carrier platform. I will contact Cigna on Monday, Sept. 29th at submit Ashley''s binder payment and ongoing auto pay. This is paid for by Jennifer Abbott via the info supplied in IC Quotes under the Make Payment tab. I may need the ICHRA Notice letter for Cigna as the SEP which is saved in Ashley''s folder in Abbott''s folder. Then in Nov. I need to reach out to Sean to re-enroll Ashley into her plan. If I fail to do so, Sean and his team go in and push through all enrollments remaining to be renewed for 2026.', 'Wendy Scipione - SR VP National Sales Advisor', 'Wendy Scipione - SR VP National Sales Advisor', '2025-09-23 16:26:25', '2025-09-23 16:26:25'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000171102087', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000170998024', 'Satish Turlapati', NULL, 'Member &amp; Sp 1000 IUA Secure', 'Patti Baron', 'Patti Baron', '2025-09-23 14:40:19', '2025-09-23 14:40:19'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000171119011', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000164112010', 'Megan Berry', NULL, '9-23-25 Meg is contemplating cancelling since she''s not seeing the value of the membership. She has some items she wants to address but they likely won''t reach the $2500 IUA. She prefers alternative care and it may be a combo of alternative such as acupuncture, massage, chiro, etc. It may be a lot of work to get all modalities approved when it might not reach $2500. But, if they cancel she understands they won''t be protected for the big items. She sees the value of cash pay.  She did an ultrasound which was billed at $600+ and the cash price was lowered to about $180. She will discuss with Chris to decide if they are willing to take the risk of no benefits at all. She also now better understands the mental health benefits through the new and old system. They prefer to see someone in person but might be willing to explore virtual visits if they see someone they like.', 'Wendy Scipione - SR VP National Sales Advisor', 'Wendy Scipione - SR VP National Sales Advisor', '2025-09-23 14:37:50', '2025-09-23 15:19:03'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000171114103', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000155936002', 'Lyndsy Nunn', NULL, '09/23/2025<br>Called in with general membership questions so she could understand how share requests and IUA works. I walked her through all of it, <br>AJ', 'Concierge', 'Concierge', '2025-09-23 14:36:44', '2025-09-23 14:36:44'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000171114082', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000170902001', 'Val Hunter', NULL, '09/23/2025<br>Called to try and use his telehealth but his membership does not begin until oct 1st<br>AJ', 'Concierge', 'Concierge', '2025-09-23 14:30:56', '2025-09-23 14:30:56'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000171114063', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000146978002', 'Seamus Mullen', NULL, '09/23/2025<br><span><br></span>Seamus called in for some guidance on continuing a share request. I let him know he would need to speak with zion for them to be able to help him with that so i transferred him over.<br>AJ', 'Concierge', 'Concierge', '2025-09-23 14:29:00', '2025-09-23 14:29:00'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000171114044', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000036593010', 'Suzanne Martinek', NULL, '09/23/2025<br>Suzy called having issues loggin into her app. I was able to give her some help and get logged in by going to IT for them to reset her credentials so i could get her logged in. She was also having the same issues that a few others were having using the mental health features. We called and spoke to lyric and they said they would be returning our call to let us know how members will use the behavioral health features on telehealth.<br>AJ', 'Concierge', 'Concierge', '2025-09-23 14:27:05', '2025-09-23 14:27:05'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000171114039', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000140329015', 'Preston Pitcher', NULL, '09/23/2025<br>Helped him through sales IQ so he could login to the MPB app.<br>AJ', 'Concierge', 'Concierge', '2025-09-23 14:23:33', '2025-09-23 14:23:33'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000171114034', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000038280209', 'STEVEN FRADIN', NULL, '09/23/2025<br>Spoke with Steven about him getting an MRI. He talked to angee and was calling back after they last spoke. I let him know we would get back to him after i could figure out where everything was in this process. Tried to reach him but could not so i sent a text for him to reach back out tomorrow for us to help him get his MRI.<br>AJ', 'Concierge', 'Concierge', '2025-09-23 14:19:26', '2025-09-23 14:19:26'),
