  ('zcrm_1579374000171114021', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000114217020', 'Troy Nickell', NULL, '09/23/2025<br>Lori from ARM called up due to Troy going get a colonoscopy and hving to stop half way because the prep was not done as it should have been. We are not sure who is at fault for that the dr or the patient but Troy told the dr he did not think the prep was done correct and the dr decided to do the colo anyway and had to stop mid way. <br>Lori is going to flag this account since the claim will look like a duplicate now and they will be willing to override it. We just need to have on file that the first bill for around $800 will be the one from the not finished colo. Any new bill that comes in from a second colo done really close to when the first one was is a prat of this situation.<br>AJ', 'Concierge', 'Concierge', '2025-09-23 11:47:17', '2025-09-23 12:56:22'),
