  ('zcrm_1579374000171055154', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000049780037', 'Adriana Rojas Vargas', NULL, '9/22/25: Spoke to Adriana 3x trying to help her access telehealth. We got her into MPB app, but she cannot access telehealth - it''s telling her that her account is not active. I reached out to Lyric and they have no record of her. Asking IT for assistance and will reach back out to Adriana tomorrow. AM', 'Concierge', 'Concierge', '2025-09-22 16:00:42', '2025-09-22 16:00:42'),
