  ('zcrm_1579374000171057016', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000169950023', 'Michelle Maziar', NULL, '9-22-25 Michelle is upset about needing to get a treatment plan for alternative care bc she thought she had to get the treatment plan from an MD after talking with Julia. But, Julia''s email simply uses an MD as and example of a licensed professional, not saying it must be an MD. So, I clarified what Julia wrote to her again. I expressed concern that she''s seeking treatment day 2 of her membership and it might be deemed as pre-x. Julia mentioned in her email that she''s waiting for a response from Zion for next steps. Michelle will wait for Julia lead on how to proceed from here. She kept saying Shoshana told her how simple it is. I expressed that alternative care such as acupuncture needs pre-approval. However, I''ve never heard PT needing pre-approval since that is more standard care. But, it''s listed in the Therapeutic Care category indicating that it might be considered an alternative. IDK.', 'Wendy Scipione - SR VP National Sales Advisor', 'Wendy Scipione - SR VP National Sales Advisor', '2025-09-22 14:49:46', '2025-09-22 14:49:46'),
