  ('zcrm_1579374000171038105', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000126645002', 'Jessica Lau', 'Decline of 10/25 Share Amount', '9/22- 1st notice sent to member &amp; advisor via em &amp; vm<br>9/24-2nd notice sent to member &amp; advisor via em<br>9/26-3rd notice sent to member &amp; advisor via em<br>9/30-No contact from member I will cancel membership<br>10/1- Final Notice of Cancellation sent to member &amp; advisor via em. Member called from Sri Lanka regarding the cancellation.  She has reached out to Leah Garcia in the past asking her to contact her on WhatsApp if there is any questions.  She is temporarily overseas and travels between there and California.  I sent her the Payment Update link to submit a new payment method to reinstate her Membership and asked that she get that back to us today so we can process the payment for October 1. Member submitted payment update.  We will reactivate and process.', 'Michele R', 'Michele R', '2025-09-22 13:25:40', '2025-10-01 12:59:42'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000171040189', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000159998004', 'Bryndon Tarafa', 'Decline of 10/25 Share Amount', '9/22-1st notice sent to member &amp; advisor via em &amp; vm Spoke to member he lost his card and needs to update.<br>9/23-Member submitted new bank info I reran', 'Patti Baron', 'Patti Baron', '2025-09-22 13:23:50', '2025-09-23 07:02:47'),
