  ('zcrm_1579374000171055119', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000140532002', 'Mary Covarrubias', NULL, '9/22/25: Mary emailed in stating that she still hasn''t gotten an EOB from ARM regarding lab bills. Called ARM and Karen said the EOB went out 9/15 - let Mary know via email. AM', 'Concierge', 'Concierge', '2025-09-22 13:07:25', '2025-09-22 13:07:25'),
