  ('zcrm_1579374000171038079', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000108651002', 'Jason Pellegrin', 'Decline of 10/25 Share Amount', '9/22- 1st notice sent to member &amp; advisor via em &amp; vm<br>9/24-2nd notice sent to member &amp; advisor via em<br>9/26-Member replied to our email stating he just paid the balance on the card so we should be able to reprocess it this morning.', 'Michele R', 'Michele R', '2025-09-22 12:53:42', '2025-09-26 07:06:07'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000171045148', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000095355002', 'STEVEN ADELMAN', NULL, '09/22/2025<br>Called and left a VM to tell Steven that we have ordered new physical cards for him along with explained that we sent emails with instructions on all of this so he should check his email and spam. Aslo explained in the email that he should download the health wallet to get his digital cards. Left him the email address for ARM so he could send in the colo bill he has along with any other preventative care bills he has so he can get those processed before to much time passes. In the VM i also let him know to reach out with any questions about any of this.<br>AJ', 'Concierge', 'Concierge', '2025-09-22 12:44:06', '2025-09-22 12:44:06'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000171057011', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000172130002', 'Tami Schweitzer', NULL, '9-22-25 Tami found me via her sister(who moved from (CO to FL) who knew of me through my member named Kristen. She can find out which Kristen it is. Tami 57 and her husband 63 are moving from Brighton to Sterling right now. She was hauling a trailer when I called. Tami''s a nurse. Her husband was in the manufacturing business for his whole career for 40 years. He''s retiring but actually still planning to work but doing something totally different, TBD. Tami says she''s obese but working on changing that with diet and exercise. Her plan is to lose 40-50 lbs I think she said. She has asthma and hyperlipidemia. Her husband had prostate cancer in 2017 or 2018 and was treated and it''s never returned since. His prostate was removed. He takes testosterone and gets a PSA test 2x a year to make sure everything is looking good. He hasn''t had any problems. He had gout 5-6 years ago and hernias about 12 years ago or farther back. They don''t drink or smoke. I suggested we look at ACA plans but she''s more intrigued by MCS and wants to learn. I will send her the video. They need a Nov. 1st start date. They were making $250K-$300K but not sure what they''ll be making in 2026. They have rental properties but they are able to show those as loses or no gains on taxes.', 'Wendy Scipione - SR VP National Sales Advisor', 'Wendy Scipione - SR VP National Sales Advisor', '2025-09-22 12:43:58', '2025-10-08 16:54:08'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000171055111', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000059964144', 'Christopher Loven', NULL, '9/22/25: Spoke to Christopher about sharing request. He has ER bills - I walked him through opening the request, how to pay IUA, and what to expect. Connected to Zion to open portal. AM', 'Concierge', 'Concierge', '2025-09-22 12:43:38', '2025-09-22 12:43:38'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000171055090', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000167503002', 'Tammy Lindemulder', NULL, '9/22/25: Called Tammy to get her to try it one more time. I noticed her birthday was missing from MPB app - everything works fine now. AM', 'Concierge', 'Concierge', '2025-09-22 12:35:50', '2025-09-22 12:35:50'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000171040165', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000169810007', 'Andrea Lee Nguyen', NULL, 'Member called in to cancel after a month on the plan.  Also didn''t know who her advisor was.  I will send her out the cancellation link.', 'Patti Baron', 'Patti Baron', '2025-09-22 12:35:45', '2025-09-22 12:35:45'),
