  ('zcrm_1579374000171040160', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000168734001', 'Greg Pratt', 'Decline of 10/25 Share Amount', '9/22-1st notice sent to member &amp; advisor via em &amp; vm<br>9/24-2nd notice sent to member &amp; advisor via em<br>9/26-3rd-Final Notice sent to member &amp; advisor via em. Member submitted payment update. I will process.  Card submitted was invalid.  I sent another email and left a voicemail to update the card.<br>9/30- Left final voicemail for member to call me to review the card numbers he submitted or to submit another payment update form by 3PM EST today is the deadline.<br>9/30-Member cancelled<br>10/1- Final Notice of Cancellation sent to member &amp; advisor via em.  Member called in regarding the final notice of cancellation.  His card number was incorrect.  He is submitting the correct card number to be reinstated. Member submitted a new bank account form for reinstatement.', 'Patti Baron', 'Patti Baron', '2025-09-22 12:28:20', '2025-10-01 08:19:36'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000171038066', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000103630001', 'Julia Fleming', 'Decline of 10/25 Share Amount', '9/22- 1st notice sent to member &amp; advisor via em &amp; stm.  She will complete form to update payment.<br>9/24-2nd notice sent to member &amp; advisor via em.<br>9/26-3rd-Final notice sent to member &amp; advisor via em<br>9/29-Member submitted updated CC I will rerun.', 'Michele R', 'Michele R', '2025-09-22 12:27:57', '2025-09-29 13:15:48'),
