  ('zcrm_1579374000171045128', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000011509065', 'Joy Kelley', NULL, '09/22/2025<br>Joy called to see if some providers were in network. I let her know that sally jobe for her mammogram is in network but i could not find if rocky mountatin gastro was to look into  a colo for her. I will be calling ARM just to chat with them and see what options i can find for her if her selection is out of network.<br>AJ', 'Concierge', 'Concierge', '2025-09-22 12:05:28', '2025-09-22 12:05:28'),
