  ('zcrm_1579374000171055050', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000011881315', 'Allisyn Martin', NULL, '9/22/25: Allisyn called about some MEC bills from last year that we sorted out in January. We confirmed that the bills were paid (and checks cashed!) with ARM and she should not owe anything. Karen gave her a reference number just in case the provider continues to tell her she owes on the bill. AM', 'Concierge', 'Concierge', '2025-09-22 11:58:58', '2025-09-22 11:58:58'),
