  ('zcrm_1579374000171055031', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000167503002', 'Tammy Lindemulder', NULL, '9/22/25: Tammy called bc she couldn''t access her telehealth through app.  It was saying there is no DOB on file. Reached out to Lyric and they said it''s bc they haven''t activated her member portal. They activated it and said they would reach out to Tammy to make sure she''s able to get in and schedule an appt. <br>She still couldn''t access- lyric is sending ticket to IT to figure out what is going on. AM', 'Concierge', 'Concierge', '2025-09-22 11:52:51', '2025-09-22 12:27:54'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000171045120', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000059725045', 'Michelle Skellion', NULL, '09/22/2025<br>Proof of membership she requested bounced. I sent it to another email for her along with the link to update her email address.<br>AJ', 'Concierge', 'Concierge', '2025-09-22 11:49:14', '2025-09-22 11:49:26'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000171045101', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000084653001', 'Marianne Aultz', NULL, '09/22/2025<br>Sent Jason a text to try and reach him letting him know the dr he asked for an appointment with is not in network. WIll call tomorrow if i do not hear back to attempt to find a new provider for him and assist with making an appointment,<br>AJ', 'Concierge', 'Concierge', '2025-09-22 11:48:08', '2025-09-22 11:48:08'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000171045096', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000157983003', 'Remy Godwin', NULL, '09/22/2025<br>Kathy requested an appointment with Dr. Karen Snow. I called and attempted to make an appointment. They are not taking new patients currently. I reached out through email and will call in a couple days if i do not hear back from Kathy about this. I asked her if she had another provider in mind or if she would need our help searching for one. <br>AJ', 'Concierge', 'Concierge', '2025-09-22 11:46:06', '2025-09-22 11:46:06'),
