  ('zcrm_1579374000171055021', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000103918002', 'Maggie Sample', NULL, '9/22/25: Maggie emailed in asking if we could change her husband''s email in app and correct the fact that her dependents are listed 2x. Forwarded email to Aba regarding the dependents and suggested Peter activate his acct using dep. ID and choose his email and pw after activating. AM', 'Concierge', 'Concierge', '2025-09-22 11:01:51', '2025-09-22 11:01:51'),
