  ('zcrm_1579374000171055011', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000033577031', 'Margaret Thoreson', NULL, '9/22/25: Returned Margaret''s call regarding options for obtaining paxlovid for a discounted rate. Unfortunately, her only options since it''s not on formulary, is a coupon or submitting as sharing request but since her IUA is 5K, it wouldn''t share into the issue until she exceeded that. The generic is less but not available in her town(unwilling to travel to get it) and she needs the med immediately. AM', 'Concierge', 'Concierge', '2025-09-22 10:46:19', '2025-09-22 10:46:19'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000171055006', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000141685002', 'Laura Murtha', NULL, '9/22/25: Laura emailed in asking why the number on HCBB did not go directly to hospital to book appt. I checked it out, and it''s just a mistake on websites part - however, I found her a closer, less expensive place to get her transvag ultrasound and shared the information and how to order if she''d rather go that route. AM', 'Concierge', 'Concierge', '2025-09-22 10:33:46', '2025-09-22 10:33:46'),
