  ('zcrm_1579374000171045065', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000155395020', 'KRISTEN NEVELN', NULL, '09/22/2025<br>Called due to issues with telehealth. She was able to finally speak with a dr after having issues setting up the appointment. Now she is having gastro distress and wanted to know what to do in case she has to go to the emergency room. I let her know she would just be responsible for her IUA and let her know the process for starting a share request and what to do.<br>AJ', 'Concierge', 'Concierge', '2025-09-22 09:46:51', '2025-09-22 09:46:51'),
