  ('zcrm_1579374000171045060', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000163249002', 'John Pischke', NULL, '09/22/2025<br>Returning Sandras call from the weekend. She left a VM about assistance with the telehealth due to a pain in her side and wanting to know how she should handle it. Left a VM for her to call us back if she still needs help.<br>AJ', 'Concierge', 'Concierge', '2025-09-22 09:37:20', '2025-09-22 09:37:20'),
