  ('zcrm_1579374000171045045', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000001165323', 'Kevin Schill', NULL, '09/22/2025<br>Spoke to ARM kith Kevin to see if they would pay for a colo if it is at the 3 year mark instead of the standard 5-10 year. Left contact info for them to call Kevin but will reach back out later today to get in touch with ARM to answer his questions about this.<br>AJ', 'Concierge', 'Concierge', '2025-09-22 09:31:24', '2025-09-22 09:31:24'),
