="color:rgb(34, 34, 34);">(verification of benefits and claims):</span><br><span style="color:rgb(34, 34, 34);">800-877-7195</span><br><span style="color:rgb(34, 34, 34);">Initial premium will be withdrawn within 3 days of your policies effective date, subsequent premiums are due on the day of the month in which the policy was effective. Plan includes a one-time non-refundable enrollment fee of $25. This charge will be made at the time of purchase and may appear as a separate transaction from your insurance as Direct Vision or Direct Benefits, Inc. </span><br><span style="color:rgb(34, 34, 34);">Your specific coverage information is as follows:</span><br><span style="color:rgb(34, 34, 34);"><br></span><span style="color:rgb(34, 34, 34);">Plan Selected: EyeMed Access Plan B</span><br><span style="color:rgb(34, 34, 34);">Who’s covered: Applicant</span><br><span style="color:rgb(34, 34, 34);">Effective Date: 10/01/2025</span><br><span style="color:rgb(34, 34, 34);">Carrier: Ameritas</span><br><span style="color:rgb(34, 34, 34);">Monthly Charge: </span><span style="color:rgb(34, 34, 34);"><b>$11.53</b></span><br><span style="color:rgb(34, 34, 34);"><br></span><span style="color:rgb(34, 34, 34);">Policy Number: </span><span style="color:rgb(34, 34, 34);"><b>300162044</b></span><br><span style="color:rgb(34, 34, 34);">Agent In fo: </span><span style="color:rgb(34, 34, 34);"><b>Wendy Scipione (Phone : (720) 259-1555)</b></span><span style="color:rgb(34, 34, 34);"> </span><br><span style="color:rgb(34, 34, 34);">Questions? Call (844)833-8440</span><br><span style="color:rgb(34, 34, 34);"><br></span><span style="color:rgb(34, 34, 34);">©2025 Direct Benefits Inc, All rights reserved. </span><br><span style="color:rgb(34, 34, 34);">You are receiving this email from filling out an e-enrollment application form on the Direct Benefits website. </span><br><span style="color:rgb(34, 34, 34);">Our mailing address is: </span><br><span style="color:rgb(34, 34, 34);">Direct Benefits Inc, 7900 International Drive, Suite 1040, Bloomington, MN 55425</span><br><span style="color:rgb(34, 34, 34);">CA Agency License: 600496</span>', 'Wendy Scipione - SR VP National Sales Advisor', 'Wendy Scipione - SR VP National Sales Advisor', '2025-09-18 16:15:31', '2025-09-18 16:15:31'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000170919021', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000171700002', 'Jake Johnson', NULL, '9-18-25 Jake is Mark Johnson''s son and is turning 26 this week! He will lose his ins for October 1st. He''s healthy, no pre-x and no tobacco. I explained everything to him. I suggested that he does his annual wellness visit before the end of the month since it won''t be included in this membership. He agreed. He''s in CA at the moment. Not sure if he''s living there or CO now. Care+ will be the best for his age anyhow. $245/$1000. I''m asking Mark if he wants me to waive the $100 or send it to him? We will connect again tomorrow to walk through the enrollment process. He didn''t have the money available today.', 'Wendy Scipione - SR VP National Sales Advisor', 'Wendy Scipione - SR VP National Sales Advisor', '2025-09-18 16:13:47', '2025-09-18 16:13:47'),
