  ('zcrm_1579374000170921001', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000097899002', 'Amy Jones', NULL, '9/18/25<br>Amy called because she does not have a card to present at her obgyn guided her to the health wallet app AC', 'Concierge', 'Concierge', '2025-09-18 12:42:15', '2025-09-18 12:42:15'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000170889094', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000167659006', 'Richard Armitage', NULL, 'Member submitted cancellation eff 10/25 due to getting Employer Benefits.  I will process.', 'Patti Baron', 'Patti Baron', '2025-09-18 12:23:44', '2025-09-18 12:23:44'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000170919011', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000167659006', 'Richard Armitage', NULL, '9-18-25 Richard called to cancel his membership purely bc he got a new job with incredible benefits. It''s 1/3 of the cost bc employer is paying most. He said it''s the best insurance plan he''s seen in 15 years, so he had to take it. It starts Oct. 3rd. He wasn''t expecting this to happen. He kept my number in case anything changes in the future. All set and completed the form while we were on the phone.', 'Wendy Scipione - SR VP National Sales Advisor', 'Wendy Scipione - SR VP National Sales Advisor', '2025-09-18 12:18:28', '2025-09-18 12:18:28'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000170889089', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000167659006', 'Richard Armitage', NULL, 'Member called in to confirm that he was cancelled eff 10/25.  We received no communications from him.  I asked if he had spoken to Wendy and he had not.  I sent him to speak to her.', 'Patti Baron', 'Patti Baron', '2025-09-18 12:15:46', '2025-09-18 12:15:46'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000170893135', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000123703011', 'Jordan Anderson', NULL, '9/18/25: Jordan called to inquire about submitting a superbill for recent therapy and about a derm visit that she never got a bill for. She was pretty irritable from the very beginning claiming that our website and services have been very difficult to navigate and change too frequently. I explained that her therapy bill wouldn''t be paid for by the plan and showed her how to access new therapy benefits. We walked through HW app and where to go to submit a large medical need. The derm visit was billed to arm - explained what would happen to bill and that she may still be balance billed. Also discussed how to find a provider on PHCS. AM', 'Concierge', 'Concierge', '2025-09-18 12:12:15', '2025-09-18 12:12:15'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000170888044', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000120913002', 'Charlie Gomez', NULL, 'Member''s spouse Jennifer called in requesting to cancel the membership, however she does not want to cancel until November.  I told her that we are billing on September 20th for the month of October. She said that is fine.  I will send her the cancellation link via email and told her not to submit it until October by the 19th of that month, for a cancellation for November.', 'Michele R', 'Michele R', '2025-09-18 11:57:19', '2025-09-18 12:03:42'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000170893130', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000157983003', 'Remy Godwin', NULL, '9/18/25: Kathy emailed in requesting an appointment scheduling - asked her to please fill out the form so we can capture the appropriate details. AM', 'Concierge', 'Concierge', '2025-09-18 11:34:10', '2025-09-18 11:34:10'),
