  ('zcrm_1579374000170893125', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000044342056', 'Fred Blum', NULL, '9/18/25: Fred called requesting to know how much he paid in 2020 - looked in admin, but it only went back to 2021. Transferred to Patti. AM', 'Concierge', 'Concierge', '2025-09-18 11:23:03', '2025-09-18 11:23:03'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000170893113', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000135320002', 'Wilfred Thibodeau', NULL, '9/18/25: Charlene called saying that she never received her cards - someone was going to email them to her. I let her know she can access through HW app, but also sent screenshots of cards to her email. Went to put a request in arm portal for physical ones but it was already done 2 days ago. AM', 'Concierge', 'Concierge', '2025-09-18 10:59:27', '2025-09-18 10:59:27'),
