  ('zcrm_1579374000170893001', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000155332036', 'Joshua Mou', NULL, '9/18/25: Josh called having trouble logging into the app. I got him to activate his account which showed on the back end but he was having issues resetting his password - it just went to a white screen and no link came through to email. Asking Aba for help with this. In the meantime, I advised him to log into health wallet to access telehealth. AM', 'Concierge', 'Concierge', '2025-09-18 07:49:51', '2025-09-18 07:49:51'),
