  ('zcrm_1579374000170862030', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000079920002', 'Rusty Shelton', NULL, '9/17/25<br>Kelli called to receive assistance with the telemedicine Ac', 'Concierge', 'Concierge', '2025-09-17 17:09:31', '2025-09-17 17:09:31'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000170863031', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000178561001', 'Genevieve Choi', NULL, '9-17-25 Genevieve asked a few more questions and shared they will remain on their ins plan until Feb. 1st, 2026. We will meet on Jan.2nd at 3:00 to discuss C4 Ins for William and MCS for Genevieve and the kids. They will do all of their wellness visits now and anything else they need. They''ve maxed out their MOP for 2025. So, it''s best to stay put until their renewal Feb. 1st. William is afraid their plan is not as good as his but she''s been explaining how it works and why it should be good for them.', 'Wendy Scipione - SR VP National Sales Advisor', 'Wendy Scipione - SR VP National Sales Advisor', '2025-09-17 15:30:47', '2025-09-17 15:30:47'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000170863021', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000054286250', 'Sean Barrett', NULL, '9-17-25 I left Sean a vm letting him know the deadline to make sure we get him enrolled by Friday.', 'Wendy Scipione - SR VP National Sales Advisor', 'Wendy Scipione - SR VP National Sales Advisor', '2025-09-17 14:49:22', '2025-09-17 14:49:22'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000170874001', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000134767002', 'Kara Weld', 'Zoho SalesIQ chat missed', 'Visit ID : 4374 Question : I have a 17 yr old son but no dependents are showing. I just added 2 adult dependents ( my husband and 20 yo son)', 'MPB Health Member Notification', 'MPB Health Member Notification', '2025-09-17 14:48:31', '2025-09-17 14:48:31'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000170824230', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000059281121', 'Dechen Hawk', NULL, '09/17/2025<br>Dechen called to see where the referral is for his colonoscopy. I could not find it myself in health wallet so i went ahead and transferred to lyric for them to give him some assistance with finding the referral that should already be available.<br>AJ', 'Concierge', 'Concierge', '2025-09-17 14:45:26', '2025-09-17 14:45:26'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000170863016', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000061255207', 'Rachel Martin', NULL, '9-17-25 <span style="color:rgb(34, 34, 34);">Hi Wendy~ Sorry for my delayed response!  Thank you for reaching out and I will be sure to be in touch should I need anything.  Regards~Rachel Martin</span>', 'Wendy Scipione - SR VP National Sales Advisor', 'Wendy Scipione - SR VP National Sales Advisor', '2025-09-17 14:45:04', '2025-09-17 14:45:04'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000170863011', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000134767002', 'Kara Weld', NULL, '9-17-25 Kara completed the New Group Enrollment Form with my assistance. I think she had 16 FTE. Of those they are paying for the salaried employees not the hourly employees. They will pay the wellness/preventive benefit $107 per FTE employee. They will also pay  100% of the EO cost for all salaried employees, not hourly though. She will allow hourly or PT employees to join and they will pay for their co-op if they wish. PT will pay all of the cost. She''s decided on a Nov. 1st start date. Andrew and his wife other are both cancer survivors! She''s a nurse and gets some benefits from work. But, it sounds like they both want to join. I sent them the information about pre-x and waiting periods. They should be up to speed. I don''t know when either of them reached remission. Andrew didn''t give me any specifics and I told him to connect with me privately to answer further questions. He didn''t reach out but he did get the answers to the questions everyone posed on the call that I forwarded from HA. Kara will be gone this Friday through Oct. 8th. She will still check email but it might take longer to get responses. I''m trying to get as much done before she leaves to take the burden off when she''s away. She and her husband will remain on their current membership unless we need them to reach the 10 person threshold for immediate sharing up to $10K.', 'Wendy Scipione - SR VP National Sales Advisor', 'Wendy Scipione - SR VP National Sales Advisor', '2025-09-17 14:40:20', '2025-09-17 14:40:20'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000170824220', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000157103002', 'Nicole Feenstra', NULL, '09/17/2025<br>responded to an email from a meagon bester saying nicole is trying to submit bills to zion. I let them know if it is the first time then to call zion and they will help open the portal for the first time, show her how to login and how to submit bills to the portal and open sharing requests.<br>AJ', 'Concierge', 'Concierge', '2025-09-17 13:58:27', '2025-09-17 13:58:27'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000170823211', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000170871001', 'Andrea D''Agostini', NULL, 'Tax ID#85-2373943', 'Patti Baron', 'Patti Baron', '2025-09-17 13:51:00', '2025-09-17 13:51:00'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000170824215', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000116114008', 'Robert Hunter', NULL, '09/17/2025<br>Robert called because he needed to change his pharmacy after noticing he sent the meds to the wrong one. I let him know i will have to tranfer him over to lyric for them to assist him with that. If it was before he sent the meds i could have gone in and showed him how to select a pharmacy but since he needs things changed that were already submitted i needed to send him to the 469 number so they could assist him with pharmacy things.<br>AJ', 'Concierge', 'Concierge', '2025-09-17 13:46:33', '2025-09-17 13:46:33'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000170824210', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000130571025', 'Charlotte Cadieux', NULL, '09/17/2025<br>Spoke with Charlotte and Lori from ARM when we found a discrepancy in the search of the PHCS network. The dr''s number was a different provider all together then the one listed on the multiplan search. After speaking with Lori she was able to assist and let Charlotte know how to proceed. AJ', 'Concierge', 'Concierge', '2025-09-17 13:36:43', '2025-09-17 13:36:43'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000170819112', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000000689074', 'Frank Becvar', NULL, 'Member submitted payment update.  I will process', 'Michele R', 'Michele R', '2025-09-17 13:35:32', '2025-09-17 13:35:32'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000170824205', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000156798012', 'Tristan McGlauchlen', NULL, '09/17/2025<br>Members employer Alicia Cottrell called because tristan was having trouble understanding membership and what would be covered. Let Alicia know to tell Tristan to get a treatment plan and a good faith estimate so he can begin a share request if this surgery is going to cost more than the $2,500 IUA. It is a hernia and not a pre existing condition so he should only need to pay for the IUA and the rest should be taken care of by ZION. <br>AJ', 'Concierge', 'Concierge', '2025-09-17 13:34:32', '2025-09-17 13:34:32'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000170824200', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000156184001', 'Anthony Cottrell', NULL, '09/17/2025<br>Spoke with Alicia about employee having issues starting a share request. I let her know to tell the employee to get treatment plan and good faith estimate for upcoming surgery and begin a share request. That way they can see how to proceed after Zion gets involoved as they mentioned this will probably be more than the IUA for the surgery. Also sent a change form for her to update husband Anothony''s birthday to the correct day. <br>AJ', 'Concierge', 'Concierge', '2025-09-17 13:32:19', '2025-09-17 13:32:19'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000170824195', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000116114008', 'Robert Hunter', NULL, '09/17/2025Lisa called with questions about getting 21-year-old son on health wallet to use telehealth. Let her know to tell the son to try SSN and DOB for login credentials and not the member ID as that is tied to the main member. She will reach back out if they still experience login problems<br>AJ', 'Concierge', 'Concierge', '2025-09-17 13:30:14', '2025-09-17 13:30:14'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000170823204', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000170871001', 'Andrea D''Agostini', NULL, 'Member &amp; Children $2500 IUA Premium HSA', 'Patti Baron', 'Patti Baron', '2025-09-17 13:29:20', '2025-09-17 13:29:20'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000170863006', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000132790011', 'Marilynn Piche', NULL, 'Marilynn is changing her name back to her maiden name from Marilynn Manzutto to Marilynn Piche. She''s chosing to keep HAB for now since she will use those benefits most. She will re-join Care+ when she can afford it. She will also be changing her address soon. I let her know that pre-x would reset and she seemed ok with it.  She''s all set for now. She also updated her email address.', 'Wendy Scipione - SR VP National Sales Advisor', 'Wendy Scipione - SR VP National Sales Advisor', '2025-09-17 13:28:22', '2025-09-17 13:28:22'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000170824190', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000084653001', 'Marianne Aultz', NULL, '09/17/2025<br>Picking up were angee left off at getting an appointment for jason. Monitoring for email return about dr. not being in network to see how to proceed.<br>AJ', 'Concierge', 'Concierge', '2025-09-17 13:28:18', '2025-09-17 13:28:18'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000170862025', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000154053002', 'William Schulz Jr', NULL, '9/17/25<br>sent email that Confirmed that UVA Health participates in the <b>PHCS / MultiPlan</b> network per their website (<a style="display:inline;" href="https://uvahealth.com/services/billing-insurance/insurance-plan-participation"><u>https://uvahealth.com/services/billing-insurance/insurance-plan-participation</u></a>).<br>Also called UVA’s billing department to verify – they <b>confirmed they accept and bill under PHCS</b>.<br>Recommended location:<br><b>Primary Care Center</b><br>1st Floor, 1221 Lee St., Charlottesville, VA 22903 – identified as the best option for <a href="http://patient.AC" style="" target="_blank">patient.AC</a>', 'Concierge', 'Concierge', '2025-09-17 13:19:23', '2025-09-17 13:19:23'),
