  ('zcrm_1579374000170823144', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000156798012', 'Tristan McGlauchlen', NULL, 'Member''s employer called in and asked if we knew why this member''s need was being denied. Member will be having surgery next week.  I asked if possibly it could be Pre-Ex since member has been on less than a year. I told her that we would not have access to that information and that the member would be the only one that they would disclose that to.  I gave her the contact number for Zion Customer Care to see waht she could find.', 'Patti Baron', 'Patti Baron', '2025-09-17 10:12:50', '2025-09-17 10:12:50'),
