  ('zcrm_1579374000170818168', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000169908002', 'Kara Dowdall', NULL, '9/17/25: Kara called needing help getting set up on app - added her info on backend and she was able to activate. AM', 'Concierge', 'Concierge', '2025-09-17 09:41:54', '2025-09-17 09:41:54'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000170818163', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000153431002', 'Darin Thomas', NULL, '9/17/25: Called Kristen to see if she was able to open sharing request, she said she did and just in waiting period at this point. AM', 'Concierge', 'Concierge', '2025-09-17 09:34:12', '2025-09-17 09:34:12'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000170823120', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000170823069', 'Zachary Hitzeroth', NULL, 'This member submitted cancellation eff 10/1/25 due to getting Employer Benefits.  This member''s spouse submitted a Change Form to change her name &amp; address.  In processing that we found that when Zach had been enrolled by Adam they used the same email as spouse Alli, so all of her info got overwritten in the CRM.  That info &amp; contact was restored and new contact made for Zach.  I will process.', 'Patti Baron', 'Patti Baron', '2025-09-17 09:32:55', '2025-09-17 09:32:55'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000170818155', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000130571025', 'Charlotte Cadieux', NULL, '9/17/25: Charlotte called wanting to know exactly what was covered with her annual well-woman exam. I explained that as long as it''s preventive and within phcs network, it''s paid at 100% - any diagnostic services would be discounted if ones available, but not paid in full. AM', 'Concierge', 'Concierge', '2025-09-17 09:31:18', '2025-09-17 09:31:18'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000170823115', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000102254002', 'Alli Totzke-Hitzeroth', NULL, 'This member submitted Change from to update name &amp; address since she just got married and moved to a new address.  When I went in to A123 &amp; CRM to update I found this member did not appear in the CRM.  After some investigation we found that member''s spouse had been enrolled by Adam eff 3/25 and when he enrolled he used her email address so her info got overwritten by his in the CRM.  I did finally find his enrollment in A123, so billing ok.  I had to go back and recreate this member and start a new contact for her spouse from Adam''s lead.  So both now appear in the CRM &amp; A123.', 'Patti Baron', 'Patti Baron', '2025-09-17 09:27:29', '2025-09-17 09:27:29'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000170818147', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000108294002', 'John Mone', NULL, '9/17/25: Sent email asking progress of appeal and if he sent one in. AM', 'Concierge', 'Concierge', '2025-09-17 09:26:54', '2025-09-17 09:26:54'),
