  ('zcrm_1579374000170818092', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000120745009', 'Diane Sadowski', NULL, '9/17/25: Sent Diane email letting her know that unfortunately, MPB has discontinued printing physical cards and usrged her to download app for easy and quick access to her services. AM', 'Concierge', 'Concierge', '2025-09-17 09:06:21', '2025-09-17 09:06:21'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000170819028', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000170832002', 'Michael Wirkus', 'Member Only 2500 IUA Secure HSA', 'Tax ID/EIN:  27-4811095<br>Request sent to member &amp; Advisor via em. <br><span><br></span>9/18: Member submitted change form to update TIN.  I will process.', 'Michele R', 'Michele R', '2025-09-17 08:58:34', '2025-09-18 06:59:32'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000170824106', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000135103002', 'Donna Williams', NULL, '09/17/2025<br>Donna called due to her not being able to login in to her zion portal to start a share request. I tried to assist and then sent her to zion for them to get her in her portal. <br>AJ', 'Concierge', 'Concierge', '2025-09-17 08:55:11', '2025-09-17 08:55:11'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000170824101', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000151800001', 'Robin Rosenbaum', NULL, '09/17/2025<br>Robin called about a covid shot. She also said she was charged a co pay for her flu shot. i let her know what they have advised us and that is to bring the rx valet card to the pharmacy and if they try to charge them to use the 855 number given to us. Let her know to reach out with any issues since we have actively been trying to solve the vaccine issues.<br>AJ', 'Concierge', 'Concierge', '2025-09-17 08:53:49', '2025-09-17 08:53:49'),
