  ('zcrm_1579374000170824091', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000120991001', 'Suchada Chaiwechakarn', NULL, '09/17/2025<br>Sent email anserwing his questions about the cost for using a card on sign up instead of a bank draft.<br>AJ', 'Concierge', 'Concierge', '2025-09-17 08:47:27', '2025-09-17 08:47:27'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000170824086', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000107468010', 'Troy Wolfe', NULL, '09/17/2025<br>Troy and his daughter called to see about dropping her from his membership and getting her on her own since she is pregnant. Let her know to reach out to advisor to help with switching between memberships. If advisor can not help told them come back to us and we will see what to do in order for her not to start from the begginging in her own membership and they know she is coming as a dependent from her fathers membership.<br>AJ', 'Concierge', 'Concierge', '2025-09-17 08:46:49', '2025-09-17 08:46:49'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000170818079', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000116236002', 'Lisa D''Onofrio', NULL, '9/17/25: Lisa called asking if her plan will pay for daughter''s preventive dermatology visit - no she would be presenting as self-pay. Explained that if she gets a skin cancer screening at pcp, then that is covered, but since the derm is a specialist it wouldn''t be paid for under the prev portion of plan - sub to IUA. AM', 'Concierge', 'Concierge', '2025-09-17 08:40:28', '2025-09-17 08:40:28'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000170818074', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000084653001', 'Marianne Aultz', NULL, '9/17/25: Began working on Jason''s appt request, but provider listed is not showing in PHCS. Sent email asking if he had an alternative, letting him know there would be a chance of being balance billed and asking how to move forward. AM', 'Concierge', 'Concierge', '2025-09-17 08:33:40', '2025-09-17 08:33:40'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000170818053', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000084653001', 'Marianne Aultz', NULL, '9/17/25: Scheduled appt for Marianne per request - sent email with details. AM<br><b>Annual Wellness Check-Up</b><br>Dr. Kindra Galloway<br>Primary Health Medical Group Nampa<br>208-466-6567<br>1820 Caldwell Blvd, Nampa, ID 83651<br>Thursday, October 23rd at 1:30 PM', 'Concierge', 'Concierge', '2025-09-17 08:18:11', '2025-09-17 08:18:11'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000170830006', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000170821002', 'Jaime Fernandez', NULL, '09.17.25:  Enrolled Jaime today. He decided on going w/Care+, even though it''s $53/mo. more than Premium Care w/Sedera because he doesn''t want to worry that Sedera will not share for a possible illness they deem would be a pre-x condition. I informed him that during his first need submission w/Zion, he must let them know he has been a long-standing member w/them from 9/1/20 - 9/30/25 and if he has any issues w/them to let us know.  I also told him to be sure to schedule a welcome call to learn how to access and use our new MPB App.  JSP', 'Joan Phelps', 'Joan Phelps', '2025-09-17 08:08:44', '2025-09-17 08:09:39'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000170824048', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000109090013', 'Clinton Sexton', NULL, '09/16/2025<br>Talked with Zion and Lisa about some hormone therapy she wanted to know if they woudl share on. She was advised to reach out to the provider to get a treatment plan and a good faith estimate to start a share request and see what zion would be willing to share if any.<br>AJ', 'Concierge', 'Concierge', '2025-09-17 08:04:57', '2025-09-17 08:04:57'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000170818046', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000156798012', 'Tristan McGlauchlen', NULL, '9/17/25: Returned provider''s call to confirm Tristan''s eligibility. AM', 'Concierge', 'Concierge', '2025-09-17 08:03:33', '2025-09-17 08:03:33'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000170830001', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000055816343', 'Mary Ann Harpenau', NULL, '09.17.25:  Called Mary Ann to confirm with her that her plan was cancelled as of 9/30/25. She informed me she did get a $2000 check from Zion for her colonoscopy, so she is very happy - and sad to have to leave MPB.', 'Joan Phelps', 'Joan Phelps', '2025-09-17 08:02:10', '2025-09-17 08:02:10'),
