  ('zcrm_1579374000170818027', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000080945002', 'Macay Hunter', NULL, '9/17/25: Macay is still having trouble getting Emily into app and thinks it might be bc it is under his email instead of hers. I tried to update the email in backend but it keeps reverting back. Asked IT chat in teams for assistance and let Macay know I''d get back to him when I learn more. <br><span><br></span>They were able to get it to work. Good to go. AM', 'Concierge', 'Concierge', '2025-09-17 07:30:25', '2025-09-17 08:41:33'),
