  ('zcrm_1579374000170818006', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000132108009', 'Joy Smith', NULL, '9/17/25: Joy responded to my FU regarding Linzess medication stating that she needed to open a sharing request, asking for assistance. I gave her brief instructions and advised her to call us directly for help getting the portal set up if this is her first one. AM', 'Concierge', 'Concierge', '2025-09-17 07:22:57', '2025-09-17 07:22:57'),
