  ('zcrm_1579374000170775037', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000170990026', 'Carra Gilson', NULL, '9-16-25 From Carra, "<span style="color:rgb(34, 34, 34);">I finally got some clearer answers from them and it sounds like they would accept the Anthem pathways or pathways essentials plans if I got a referral from my primary care provider."</span><br><span style="color:rgb(34, 34, 34);"><br></span><span style="color:rgb(34, 34, 34);">In separate email,</span><br><span style="color:rgb(34, 34, 34);">"I was able to add in details for final support and it did qualify us for a tax credit! </span><br><span style="color:rgb(34, 34, 34);"><br></span><span style="color:rgb(34, 34, 34);">I will talk with you tomorrow at 10 to discuss next steps and what I need to be thinking about before I settle on a plan. </span><br><span style="color:rgb(34, 34, 34);"><br></span><span style="color:rgb(34, 34, 34);">Sincerely,</span><br><span style="color:rgb(34, 34, 34);">Carra"</span>', 'Wendy Scipione - SR VP National Sales Advisor', 'Wendy Scipione - SR VP National Sales Advisor', '2025-09-16 18:25:24', '2025-09-16 18:25:24'),
