  ('zcrm_1579374000170797240', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000006176011', 'Dona Tolan', NULL, '9/16/25<br>Dona called to go over how her plan works her son is having surgery on his collar bone. We went over diffrent scenarios AC', 'Concierge', 'Concierge', '2025-09-16 17:35:05', '2025-09-16 17:35:05'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000170775019', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000168256006', 'Nytashia Allbritton', NULL, '9-16-25 <span style="color:rgb(34, 34, 34);"><a target="_blank" href="http://allbritton.nytashia@gmail.com" style="color:rgb(34, 34, 34);">allbritton.nytashia@gmail.com</a> just purchased a plan from your link! You will earn commission once the member is active beyond the 30-day trial period.</span>', 'Wendy Scipione - SR VP National Sales Advisor', 'Wendy Scipione - SR VP National Sales Advisor', '2025-09-16 17:27:01', '2025-09-16 17:27:01'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000170775009', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000162515002', 'Jackson Lawrie', NULL, '9-16-25 Per a note from Patti Jackson needs a medication that he''s not able to get virtually for mental health. I sent him  a note reminding him of his HAB benefits, in case that''s helpful.', 'Wendy Scipione - SR VP National Sales Advisor', 'Wendy Scipione - SR VP National Sales Advisor', '2025-09-16 17:25:46', '2025-09-16 17:25:46'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000170797235', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000059725045', 'Michelle Skellion', NULL, '9/16/25<br>Michelle Skellion needs proof of travel insurance for school so I wanted to check if that was possible to add to the regular document', 'Concierge', 'Concierge', '2025-09-16 17:25:36', '2025-09-16 17:25:36'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000170797230', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000169950023', 'Michelle Maziar', NULL, '9/16/25<br>Mitchell called regarding her active sharing request with Zion for alternative therapies, including massages and acupuncture. She expressed frustration over receiving conflicting information from Zion and MPB Health.<br>Mitchell stated that Zion is requiring a letter from her massage therapist for <b>each</b> massage visit, which she finds excessive and did not expect. I clarified that Zion does require appropriate documentation to determine whether a treatment is <b>medically necessary</b> and not elective. I advised that a treatment plan from her provider can often help simplify the process and reduce the need for repeated documentation.<br>This upset Mitchell, as she felt she was not informed of this earlier. She claimed that because she signed up through us, we should have disclosed these documentation requirements. I asked if she had reviewed Zion’s guidelines, and I read the following directly to her from Zion’s documentation:<br>“Zion HealthShare may request additional documents that may be required throughout the sharing request process. Document types can include, but are not limited to, receipts, proofs of payment, itemized bills and statements.”<br>I explained that "not limited to" means Zion may ask for other types of documentation as needed.<br>Mitchell remained frustrated, saying the process is overly complicated and that she is receiving inconsistent information from multiple sources. She expressed concerns that the practices involved in her onboarding were misleading.', 'Concierge', 'Concierge', '2025-09-16 17:20:27', '2025-09-16 17:20:27'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000170797225', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000109785015', 'Ivonne Gonzales', NULL, '9/16/25<br>Ivonne wanted to know if she had to renew her plan with us, I informed her that we dont de renewals all she has to do is cancel AC', 'Concierge', 'Concierge', '2025-09-16 16:57:31', '2025-09-16 16:57:31'),
