  ('zcrm_1579374000170797078', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000125140011', 'Ailin Lojo', NULL, '9/15/25<br>Ailin called regarding her husband’s recent visit to a provider for an issue with his hand. She requested a list of preferred or in-network providers in her area.<br>I explained that her plan does <b>not have network restrictions</b>, meaning she may visit any licensed provider, as long as the proper documentation is submitted. Ailin appeared confused by this concept and asked how she was expected to pay for all of her husband''s appointments.<br>I clarified that she is responsible for meeting her <b>Initial Unshareable Amount (IUA)</b> before Zion can begin to reimburse or provide funds for eligible expenses.', 'Concierge', 'Concierge', '2025-09-16 15:45:25', '2025-09-16 15:45:25'),
