  ('zcrm_1579374000170797058', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000145456002', 'Richard Gow', NULL, '9/16/25<br>Called Monica back she wanted to see if her obgyn submitted her bill to us for date of service 02/04/25 AC', 'Concierge', 'Concierge', '2025-09-16 14:42:01', '2025-09-16 14:42:01'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000170797053', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000162648002', 'Zach Meschi', NULL, '9/16/25<br>Alexis called to obtain more information on her plan and to see what is eligble for a sharing request AC', 'Concierge', 'Concierge', '2025-09-16 14:41:37', '2025-09-16 14:41:37'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000170797048', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000164831002', 'Greg Jerum', NULL, '9/16/25<br>Jennifer called to inquire more information on our mental health benefits. I informed her that why would be through the health wallet app AC', 'Concierge', 'Concierge', '2025-09-16 14:40:04', '2025-09-16 14:40:04'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000170797043', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000111982002', 'Steven Tracy', NULL, '9/16/25<br>Assisted Steven with downloading the health wallet app in order to access his telehealth AC', 'Concierge', 'Concierge', '2025-09-16 14:08:33', '2025-09-16 14:08:33'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000170797038', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000083455010', 'Leron Levy', NULL, 'Spoke with Leron regarding provider network concerns. I explained that the PHCS website includes a disclaimer stating they do their best to keep the directory updated, but members are always advised to call the provider’s office directly to confirm network participation.<br>Leron shared that he had researched eight providers, and none were in network. He asked if he could pay out of pocket for an appointment, referencing that other members have done so. I explained that while this is an option, there is a risk he may not be fully reimbursed and could be responsible for a remaining balance.<br>Leron requested documentation outlining this policy, and I provided him with ARM''s welcome letter, which clearly states that the provider must be in network to receive full benefits.<br>I also offered to assist in finding in-network providers for him. He declined, stating he was uncomfortable being seen by any provider who attended medical school outside of the U.S. Specifically, he expressed distrust toward providers who graduated from schools in LATAM AC', 'Concierge', 'Concierge', '2025-09-16 13:29:53', '2025-09-16 13:29:53'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000170780012', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000170805002', 'Nikita Nathan', 'Member & Spouse $5000 IUA Secure HSA', 'Tax ID/EIN: request sent to member &amp; advisor via em', 'Michele R', 'Michele R', '2025-09-16 13:26:11', '2025-09-16 13:26:11'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000170797033', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000018819616', 'David Assell', NULL, '9/16/25<br><br>Informed member that we are now able to source <b>generic Xifaxan (Rifaximin) 550mg – 50 tablets for $150.85 + $9.95 shipping</b>. Provided instructions for submitting the prescription: either by fax to <b>407-949-6724</b> or by email to <a style="display:inline;" target="_blank" href="mailto:trao@canadianmedstore.com"><b><u>trao@canadianmedstore.com</u></b></a>.<br>AC', 'Concierge', 'Concierge', '2025-09-16 13:22:17', '2025-09-16 13:22:17'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000170797025', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000165316002', 'Timothy Swieter', NULL, '9/16/25<br>Lauren called because she is receiving random emails from a califonrina hospital to pay a bill on a person she has never meet. She thought this was the process of the health share. I explaied that we would never make her pay for anyones bills and to disregards those email AC', 'Concierge', 'Concierge', '2025-09-16 13:20:02', '2025-09-16 13:20:02'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000170797020', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000018819616', 'David Assell', NULL, '9/15/25<br>David called with to see if we had any update on the Xifaxan&gt; i infomred him that at this time the generic was not avaible to be shipped and that i would keep him posted AC<br>', 'Concierge', 'Concierge', '2025-09-16 13:13:42', '2025-09-16 13:21:42'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000170770186', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000032516180', 'Samer Alhallak', NULL, 'Member called in wanting to know hwere his card was.  I told him that he did not have any Preventative Benefits as that membership was discontinued eff 6/1/25.  Advisor should have been in touch with member to go over options.', 'Patti Baron', 'Patti Baron', '2025-09-16 13:05:12', '2025-09-16 13:05:12'),
