  ('zcrm_1579374000170771142', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000108507002', 'Daria Volkova', NULL, '9/16/25: Member came through chat wanting to know how to find telehealth on app. Attempted to acquire screenshots and advise as best possible. She disconnected so I assume she figured it out. AM', 'Concierge', 'Concierge', '2025-09-16 11:59:47', '2025-09-16 11:59:47'),
