  ('zcrm_1579374000170771137', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000132108009', 'Joy Smith', NULL, '9/16/25: Provider called requesting Joy''s eligibility for ultrasound. Let them know for an us, she would be a self-pay patient and to call if she has any questions. AM', 'Concierge', 'Concierge', '2025-09-16 11:55:02', '2025-09-16 11:55:02'),
