  ('zcrm_1579374000170770145', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000066206016', 'Jacqueline Olivier', NULL, 'Member submitted cancellation eff 10/1 due tot he fact that she now has Employer coverage.  I will process.', 'Patti Baron', 'Patti Baron', '2025-09-16 11:32:04', '2025-09-16 11:32:04'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000170771118', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000159872002', 'Robyn Hugar', NULL, '9/16/25: Robyn called asking if shingles is paid for through plan and how to obtain it? Yes, she can get at pcp or through local pharmacy. AM', 'Concierge', 'Concierge', '2025-09-16 11:27:50', '2025-09-16 11:27:50'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000170770135', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000161687004', 'Brian Banks', NULL, 'Member submitted cancellation eff 7/1/25.  There was some confusion, Leo spoke to member back in that timeframe and sent out the cancellation link.  Member never submitted it.  Now member is looking for a refund for July, August &amp; September.  I will process eff 10/1/25.', 'Patti Baron', 'Patti Baron', '2025-09-16 11:25:19', '2025-09-16 11:25:19'),
