  ('zcrm_1579374000170797006', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000012010011', 'Elizabeth Wood', NULL, '9/16/25<br>Elizabeth called to request a letter verifying her membership in order to qualify for a cash discount related to a recent ambulance ride to the hospital.<br>Before proceeding, I consulted with upper management to confirm whether providing such a letter was permissible. I received approval to move forward, and the letter has been sent accordingly. AC', 'Concierge', 'Concierge', '2025-09-16 10:37:57', '2025-09-16 10:37:57'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000170770130', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000120745001', 'Louis Marchetti', NULL, 'Member called in wanting to cancel.  I told him to be in touch with his advisor, however he did not know who that was.  He said that he would like to cancel eff 10/1.  I will send him out the link to the cancellation form', 'Patti Baron', 'Patti Baron', '2025-09-16 10:29:53', '2025-09-16 10:29:53'),
