  ('zcrm_1579374000170771061', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000159324002', 'Daniel Kilkeary', NULL, '9/16/25: Provider called to check eligibility. AM', 'Concierge', 'Concierge', '2025-09-16 08:53:59', '2025-09-16 08:53:59'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000170771056', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000128686021', 'Toni Denise Boucher', NULL, '9/16/25: Toni came through chat needing help logging into app. Looks like she was trying to use zion member ID instead of MPB ID. Provided correct one, she disconnected - guess it worked. AM', 'Concierge', 'Concierge', '2025-09-16 08:46:13', '2025-09-16 08:46:13'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000170771051', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000080945002', 'Macay Hunter', NULL, '9/16/25: Macay emailed in asking how to Emily can access MPB app and set up dependents. Provided Emily''s ID # and let him know that the dependents can be added within the app. AM', 'Concierge', 'Concierge', '2025-09-16 08:44:52', '2025-09-16 08:44:52'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000170781001', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000128686021', 'Toni Denise Boucher', 'Zoho SalesIQ chat with Concierge', 'Visit ID : 4372 Question : Trying to log into to new mpb health app and I am told that neither my member number or email and date of birth are on record to complete process.', 'MPB Health Member Notification', 'MPB Health Member Notification', '2025-09-16 08:34:34', '2025-09-16 08:34:34'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000170771032', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000170212009', 'Kristen Douhan', NULL, '9/16/25: Kristen called wanting to know if her rx are paid for through this plan or what price they will - Lo Loestrin Fe (bc) and another will be paid for through her plan. The second med showed up as $0 in HW, but BC showing very pricey - asked Lori, she''s going to do a test claim to make sure it is paid for and call us back. AM', 'Concierge', 'Concierge', '2025-09-16 08:34:26', '2025-09-16 08:34:26'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000170779026', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000167582001', 'Rodney Spangler', NULL, 'Spoke to member she will reschedule the welcome call after start date of October 1, 2025. Sent an email to do so. Vanessa Orozco', 'Concierge', 'Concierge', '2025-09-16 08:33:37', '2025-09-16 08:33:37'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000170770054', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000044265014', 'Rebecca Rechtman', NULL, 'Member emailed me and then submitted cancellation.  She was interested "pausing" her membership.  I told her that Zion didn''t do that so we could not offer that.  She will be canceling eff 10/1/25.   <br><span><br></span>', 'Patti Baron', 'Patti Baron', '2025-09-16 08:32:47', '2025-09-16 08:32:47'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000170770039', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000165305002', 'Liv Ladendorff', NULL, 'Member submitted Cancellation after speaking with Wendy due to having issues with the Vitamin discount program.  I will process.', 'Patti Baron', 'Patti Baron', '2025-09-16 08:21:44', '2025-09-16 08:21:44'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000170770034', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000152321002', 'Zachary Lamkin', 'New Membership eff 10/1/25', 'Member &amp; Fam $1000 IUA Secure', 'Patti Baron', 'Patti Baron', '2025-09-16 08:16:18', '2025-09-16 08:16:18'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000170770026', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000152321002', 'Zachary Lamkin', 'Previous Membership', '12/1/2024-3/1/25', 'Patti Baron', 'Patti Baron', '2025-09-16 08:13:09', '2025-09-16 08:13:09'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000170780001', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000170773001', 'Chandon Williams', 'Member Only $5000 IUA Secure HSA', 'Tax ID/EIN:  84-3115900<br><span><br></span>Request sent to member &amp; advisor via em.  Member replied and submitted the Tax ID.  I will update A123.', 'Michele R', 'Michele R', '2025-09-16 08:12:30', '2025-09-16 09:14:17'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000170771011', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000111239002', 'Lois Hurst', NULL, '9/16/25: Lois called about her preventive services and recent orders her obgyn wants her to get prior to her appt. She had an IUD removed and before getting another one put back in and her annual, her dr ordered labs, pelvic us, uterine biopsy and routine mamm. Some of these are preventive, some are related to the symptom Lois discussed which was unusual period - which she thinks is only bc she is perimenopausal. We brought ARM into call to go over situation, in-network facilities etc. Also emailed Lois quote form just in case she''d like us to quote some of the other tests so she doesn''t end up with surprise bills. AM', 'Concierge', 'Concierge', '2025-09-16 08:09:45', '2025-09-16 08:09:45'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000170779016', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000170743002', 'James Robinson', NULL, 'Spoke to member will reschedule welcome call after his start date of October 1. 2025. Sent an email to do so. Vanessa Orozco', 'Concierge', 'Concierge', '2025-09-16 08:09:01', '2025-09-16 08:09:01'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000170771006', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000170142007', 'Patrick Dittoe', NULL, '9/16/25: Patrick called needing help finding a pcp. guided him on how to search multiplan. AM', 'Concierge', 'Concierge', '2025-09-16 08:08:41', '2025-09-16 08:08:41'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000170771001', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000156834039', 'Andrew Thomsen', NULL, '9/16/25: Michelle called needing help logging into app - Gave her dependent ID so she can log in. AM', 'Concierge', 'Concierge', '2025-09-16 07:28:16', '2025-09-16 07:28:16'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000170767009', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000170701029', 'Jessica Wenger McPhaul', 'Member & Family $1000 IUA Secure HSA', 'Tax ID/EIN: Request sent to member &amp; advisor via em', 'Michele R', 'Michele R', '2025-09-16 06:56:18', '2025-09-16 06:56:18'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000170663644', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000129592136', 'Robert Baker', NULL, 'Member''s spouse called in and let us know that he will be aging into Medicare eff 11/1/25 (dob 12/1).  I will send out the Cancellation Form and then follow up with the member', 'Patti Baron', 'Patti Baron', '2025-09-16 06:54:13', '2025-09-16 06:54:13'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000170767001', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000170721041', 'Suzanne Finder', 'Member Only $1000 IUA Secure HSA', 'Tax ID/EIN:  098-52-6027<br><span><br></span>Request sent to member &amp; advisor via em.  <br>9/17: Member submitted form to add Tax ID/EIN.  I will process.', 'Michele R', 'Michele R', '2025-09-16 06:43:04', '2025-09-17 07:18:01'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000170662045', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000054286250', 'Sean Barrett', NULL, '9-15-25 Sean wants to re-enroll. I let him know we can get it done for Oct. 1st.', 'Wendy Scipione - SR VP National Sales Advisor', 'Wendy Scipione - SR VP National Sales Advisor', '2025-09-15 18:35:38', '2025-09-15 18:35:38'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000170737258', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000164754002', 'Catherine Rottinghaus', NULL, '9/15/25: Catherine called with a few questions:<br><ol style="list-style-type:decimal;list-style-position:inside;"><li style="list-style-image:none;color:rgba(51, 51, 51, 1);font-style:normal;"><p style="display:inline;"><span style="color:rgb(51, 51, 51);font-weight:normal;font-style:normal;">How to access new telehealth - helped her log into mpb app and we discussed new options, how to set appt etc</span></p></li><li style="list-style-image:none;color:rgba(51, 51, 51, 1);font-style:normal;"><p style="display:inline;"><span style="color:rgb(51, 51, 51);font-weight:normal;font-style:normal;">Covid and Flu vaccines - let her know Sedera reimburses for a flu shot, but I''m not sure about covid</span></p></li></ol>She also wondered if the Lyric doctors can request her previous lab results from Dr. Redfield (Cirrus/Labcorp).<br>I let her know I''d find out for sure about records and covid vaccine and shoot her an email tomorrow - along with more detailed info on how the reimbursement works. AM', 'Concierge', 'Concierge', '2025-09-15 17:48:03', '2025-09-15 17:56:51'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000170737248', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000064218045', 'Eric Lipp', NULL, '9/15/25: Emailed Eric RX quote per request. AM', 'Concierge', 'Concierge', '2025-09-15 17:11:52', '2025-09-15 17:11:52'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000170737235', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000011610603', 'Robert Morey', NULL, '9/15/25: Returned Kirsten''s call, LVM. AM<br>Spoke to Kirsten - they needed their new ARM ID cards - verified address and requested 2 new cards from portal. Also instructed on how to log into HW app to access digital cards. AM', 'Concierge', 'Concierge', '2025-09-15 16:41:38', '2025-09-15 17:54:17'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000170737230', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000062380257', 'Rachel Brisson', NULL, '9/15/25: Emailed Rachel RX quote per request. Also spoke to her briefly to check the name of first medication she listed on request form. AM', 'Concierge', 'Concierge', '2025-09-15 16:38:45', '2025-09-15 16:38:45'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000170737196', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000165305002', 'Liv Ladendorff', NULL, '9/15/25: Liv called to make sure the cancellation form went through - I see that it did and made a few corrections for her such as name and reason why. She complained that it''s just too expensive and the 30% supplements doesn''t even give anything off what the in-store price would be. Let her know I''d let my supervisor know her experience with that. AM', 'Concierge', 'Concierge', '2025-09-15 16:21:43', '2025-09-15 16:21:43'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000170752001', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000112318002', 'Alex Pepper', '9/15/25: Zoho SalesIQ chat with Concierge', 'Visit ID : 4371 Question : How do i view my insurance card - I let Alex know he doesn''t have a card, to present as self pay. AM', 'MPB Health Member Notification', 'MPB Health Member Notification', '2025-09-15 16:07:56', '2025-09-15 16:23:41'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000170737177', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000155861001', 'Lynne McCarren', NULL, '9/15/25:Quinn called needing help logging into HW to use telehealth. Advised him to log in using SSN which worked fine. AM', 'Concierge', 'Concierge', '2025-09-15 16:07:25', '2025-09-15 16:07:25'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000170662040', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000132790011', 'Marilynn Piche', NULL, '9-15-25 Marilynn called to figure out the best way to lower her costs due to financial reasons. She was going to cancel Care+ and keep HAB. But, I showed her there are ways to lower her cost with Care+ to the $2500 or $5000 IUA options. She will ponder this and we will revisit it on Wed. She understands if she cancels HAB that she will lose it forever, hence she wants to keep it.', 'Wendy Scipione - SR VP National Sales Advisor', 'Wendy Scipione - SR VP National Sales Advisor', '2025-09-15 15:50:29', '2025-09-15 15:50:29'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000170692129', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000170821002', 'Jaime Fernandez', NULL, '09.09.25:  Recvd. a response from Patti to my inquiry, saying if Jaime stays w/Zion and has no gap in membership, he will not lose any of his pre-x time. When he first speaks to Zion he must reference the fact that he was on a membership w/his spouse and give them the dates (9/1/20 - 9/30/25).  They will be able to bring that info. up and will credit him for that time. When he enrolls he must have a unique email address. I told Patti they''ve been using Jaime''s email address, so can he use it when he signs up for himself? She responded that she will change the primary email from Jaime''s to Mary Ann''s on their current plan profile so Jaime can use his email when he enrolls in his new plan.  JSP', 'Joan Phelps', 'Joan Phelps', '2025-09-15 15:39:47', '2025-09-15 15:39:47'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000170737156', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000167304001', 'Elizabeth Norvell', NULL, '9/15/25: Emailed Elizabeth RX quote per request. AM', 'Concierge', 'Concierge', '2025-09-15 15:34:43', '2025-09-15 15:34:43'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000170692121', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000170821002', 'Jaime Fernandez', NULL, '09.08.25:  Mary Ann called to schedule a mtg. w/Jaime to finalize the decision on a plan for him and enroll him. He said he''ll be available on Wed., 9/17.25 at 9 a.m.  I will set up a Teams call and send him and Mary Ann an invite. Since he won''t need a colonoscopy until he''s 65, he could take the Care+ plan but that plan w/Zion is $352/mo., whereas the Premium Care plan w/Sedera, which includes colonoscopy, is $299/mo.<br>He''s concerned that if he goes w/Sedera, and if, for some reason, they tell him he has a pre-existing condition, he''ll have to wait 1 year for it to be shared. I told him I would check w/Zion to ensure they will honor his long-standing membership w/them and not require a waiting period once he changes plans. I texted Mary Ann to ask which email addresses she wants me to use to send the invite for the Teams meeting next week.  Jaime responded he will be at the mtg. Sent Jaime the invite for the Teams call on 9/17.  JSP', 'Joan Phelps', 'Joan Phelps', '2025-09-15 15:34:19', '2025-09-15 15:42:04'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000170692116', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000170821002', 'Jaime Fernandez', NULL, '08.27.25:  Mary Ann called me to ask about a plan for Jaime once she ages out of their plan as of Oct. 1, 2025. Since they have a DPC provider they''re paying for, I discussed the Direct and Premium Care plan options and pricing. She asked me to email the Premium Care plan summary and pricing. I sent her the link to my website explaining the Premium Care plan and price schedule. I will call to follow up.  JSP', 'Joan Phelps', 'Joan Phelps', '2025-09-15 15:28:55', '2025-09-15 15:28:55'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000170737147', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000165569002', 'Yvette Heryford', NULL, '9/15/25: Yvette came through chat needing help getting into MPB app - she is active on backend and all looks good. Asked her to try resetting her pw. AM', 'Concierge', 'Concierge', '2025-09-15 15:09:02', '2025-09-15 15:09:02'),
