  ('zcrm_1579374000170667181', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000064218045', 'Eric Lipp', NULL, 'Eric is having a tough time reaching his Care Coordinator at Zion. He has a open need regarding quadruple by-pass and defib. Currently, he is seeking reimbursement for a weight loss drug that was prescribed by his cardiologist regarding his heart problems. He reached out to Zion to have this submitted, Zion said to get in contact with his care cordinator. He left her a voicemail and has yet to here back. He is requesting that we speak to Zion on his behalf. PHI Form sent. I took down the information and passed to Julia to connect with Zion regarding this open need.', 'Leonardo Moraes', 'Leonardo Moraes', '2025-09-15 14:52:04', '2025-09-15 14:52:04'),
