  ('zcrm_1579374000170728063', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000004808067', 'Elisa Gustafson', NULL, '9/15/25<br><br>Follow-up completed regarding the customer’s recent vaccine visit to Safeway.<br>Safeway pharmacy has confirmed they can now process the vaccine at <b>$0 cost</b>.<br>Customer was advised that the <b>fastest reimbursement method</b> is to return to the <b>same pharmacy location</b> and request that the transaction be <b>reprocessed through their system</b>.<br>Customer was also informed to <b>contact us for further assistance</b> if any issues arise at the pharmacy.<br><b>Status:</b> Awaiting customer action / Monitoring for follow-up.<br>AC', 'Concierge', 'Concierge', '2025-09-15 14:18:23', '2025-09-15 14:18:23'),
