  ('zcrm_1579374000170692089', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000076535957', 'Ryan Koehler', NULL, '09.15.25:  Recvd. an email from Ryan explaining they needed to cancel their SECURE plan as of 10.1.25, since, through a job change, the new employer is providing health insurance. Responded to Ryan''s email: 1) thanked him for notifying me, 2) told him if, in the future, their health care plans change again, to contact me and 3) if they refer prospective members who enroll, they''ll receive a $100 gift per new member. JSP', 'Joan Phelps', 'Joan Phelps', '2025-09-15 14:08:21', '2025-09-15 14:08:21'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000170727177', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000107468010', 'Troy Wolfe', NULL, 'Advisor called in asking me if members daughter who is married and now pregnant could continue coverage and not loose any Pre-Ex time.  The problem is that a member cannot be pregnant for the 1st 6 months with Zion.    I directed Sally to have member reach out to Zion to see whether they will allow this.', 'Patti Baron', 'Patti Baron', '2025-09-15 13:58:07', '2025-09-15 13:58:07'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000170663482', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000011881479', 'Desiree Childs', NULL, '09/15/2025<br>helped her by sending her an update form for her to change her address and then i explained hre preventative benefits along with her telehealth. Let her know a few things she could use it for to stay out of the dr office and save some money.<br>AJ', 'Concierge', 'Concierge', '2025-09-15 13:47:59', '2025-09-15 13:47:59'),
