  ('zcrm_1579374000170662035', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000128483001', 'Leonardo Cicino Padovani', NULL, '9-15-25 Cinzia called bc Leo doesn''t know what his plan is and how to access it. He never got a card to be able to use the plan. I gave her the RMHP # 1-800-557-6718. Leo will call them to get his plan benefits, card and all supporting documentation.', 'Wendy Scipione - SR VP National Sales Advisor', 'Wendy Scipione - SR VP National Sales Advisor', '2025-09-15 13:17:36', '2025-09-15 13:17:36'),
