  ('zcrm_1579374000170710006', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000130451011', 'William Siskey', 'Will''s question re vaccinations etc.', '<span style="color:rgb(0, 0, 0);">I spoke with Will and he is good to go.  He''s going to work with his family physician on the well-baby/vaccinations etc and negotiate a package. He also knows that if we move him to SecureHSA (which he does qualify for), it will run him an additional $108 per month.  He will stay put for now with Care+</span>', 'Kirk Bennett', 'Kirk Bennett', '2025-09-15 13:01:03', '2025-09-15 13:01:03'),
