  ('zcrm_1579374000170663466', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000064218045', 'Eric Lipp', NULL, '09/15/2025<br>Eric called said he was talking to julie. wants to have her call back since he is already in the middle of working with her on an ongoing issue with zion. did not want to elaborate and explain everything again. Going to find out if julia was talking to him or someone else and try and help him.<br>AJ', 'Concierge', 'Concierge', '2025-09-15 12:34:25', '2025-09-15 12:34:46'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000170737132', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000169021002', 'Robert Dallmann', NULL, '9/15/25: Robert called wondering if he''s going to receive any cards or letter in the mail with plan details. I said he should - told him to give it till the end of the week and if he still doesn''t have anything, we''ll resend his info. There''s no note about fulfillment letter being sent - asked Jocobo through teams. <br>Also walked Robert through accessing ID cards and services through health wallet app. AM', 'Concierge', 'Concierge', '2025-09-15 12:30:57', '2025-09-15 12:30:57'),
