  ('zcrm_1579374000170737112', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000096033002', 'Carl Loven', NULL, '9/15/25: Mary called stating that the ortho has said Carl needs immediate hip replacement and scheduled a surgery for Monday. I suggested to go ahead and get request started and speak to Zion to see if there''s anyway they can rush the processing to get funds ahead of time. Connected to Zion. Will reach back out in a couple of days - Mary was super upset about everything and on the verge of tears as we spoke. Tried to calm her as much as possible - but it was prob just a very sudden and disruptive event. AM', 'Concierge', 'Concierge', '2025-09-15 12:09:35', '2025-09-15 12:09:35'),
