  ('zcrm_1579374000170737018', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000006176011', 'Dona Tolan', NULL, '9/15/25: Dona called needing guidance for what to do next - her son broke his collar bone and seeing an orthopedic dr today. She''s wondering if she should go ahead and submit a need. I advised to collect itemized statments from the providers and if she anticipates it will go over IUA, then call us back and we''ll walk her through getting it started. AM', 'Concierge', 'Concierge', '2025-09-15 10:38:07', '2025-09-15 10:38:07'),
