  ('zcrm_1579374000170737006', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000168986002', 'Shaunt Hartounian', NULL, '9/15/25: Returned Shaunt''s call. He set up a derm telehealth appt for his 5 year old but needs to speak to someone about rescheduling since they tentatively set it up for 10:05 (when she''ll be in school). Let him know I''d call him right back after confirming correct number to get him to - tried to reconnect 2x but unable to reach him. Sent email and text. AM', 'Concierge', 'Concierge', '2025-09-15 10:15:31', '2025-09-15 10:15:31'),
