  ('zcrm_1579374000170661120', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000170661091', 'Joel Krueger', NULL, '9-12-25 Joel called bc he was a client of Bev''s. He or his wife is aging into Medicare in April of 2026. He wants help with Medicare Supplements. I was going to refer him to Andrea and Alyssa but he wants to find someone locally to support them. He will find someone on his own. He was very nice.', 'Wendy Scipione - SR VP National Sales Advisor', 'Wendy Scipione - SR VP National Sales Advisor', '2025-09-12 16:21:28', '2025-09-12 16:21:28'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000170661068', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000171119022', 'Ashley Coburn', NULL, '9-12-25 Ashley has been very flexible with the changes in scheduling due to challenges in working with Venteur. A meeting has been schedule with the employees and Jennifer at 10:00 on Monday. However, I have a conflict at that time.', 'Wendy Scipione - SR VP National Sales Advisor', 'Wendy Scipione - SR VP National Sales Advisor', '2025-09-12 15:17:54', '2025-09-12 15:17:54'),
