  ('zcrm_1579374000170700225', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000154723001', 'Madeleine McGuire', NULL, '9/12/25<br>The providers office called to see the status of a claim and to see if it was processed. I informed them that the claim was for a diagnostic concern and would not be covered. AC', 'Concierge', 'Concierge', '2025-09-12 14:45:33', '2025-09-12 14:45:33'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000170700220', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000131814002', 'Karyn Adams', NULL, '9/12/25<br>Karyn called because she has an open sharing request and Zion is requesting additional information from her but she is unsure what more info they could possibly need. We did a three way call to see exactly what they needed AC', 'Concierge', 'Concierge', '2025-09-12 14:43:46', '2025-09-12 14:43:46'),
