  ('zcrm_1579374000170663340', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000153824002', 'Samuel Young', NULL, '09/12/2025<br>Samuel called after being told there is a copay for his flu shot.  That is not supposed to happen. We called 855 together and they said they could not let us know ahead of time if there will be a copay only after the memebr gives the pharmacy the rxvalet card will they know. Julia will be reaching out to sarah after i find out what goes on with another member and the 855 number. then after we can figure out how this process is supposed to go then we will reach back out and let members like samuel know.<br>AJ', 'Concierge', 'Concierge', '2025-09-12 14:29:32', '2025-09-12 14:29:32'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000170663335', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000144055012', 'Kate Wasserman', NULL, '09/12/2025<br>Kate called in just to verify how to handle billing with prevnetative care. Let her know just to give the information on her Altrisk card for them to bill them directly.<br>AJ', 'Concierge', 'Concierge', '2025-09-12 14:27:19', '2025-09-12 14:27:19'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000170663330', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000165569002', 'Yvette Heryford', NULL, '09/12/2025<br>Yvette called to find out how to get a quote on RX, guided her to RX quote form<br>AJ', 'Concierge', 'Concierge', '2025-09-12 14:26:09', '2025-09-12 14:26:09'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000170663322', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000128863010', 'Angela Agenlian-Neuert', NULL, '09/12/2025<br>Sent f/u messgae to her and let her know i am still looking into the questions she asked me and will have an email sent to her when i get all the information put together for her.<br>AJ', 'Concierge', 'Concierge', '2025-09-12 14:22:39', '2025-09-12 14:22:39'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000170663314', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000005291752', 'Christine Harvey', NULL, '09/12/2025<br>Called Christine back yesterday to return her call and let her know she should reach out to wendy about her preventative since she has the HAB benefit. left VM<br>AJ', 'Concierge', 'Concierge', '2025-09-12 14:21:03', '2025-09-12 14:21:18'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000170661053', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000170990026', 'Carra Gilson', NULL, '9-12-25 Carra wants to use these doctors and counselors<br><span style="color:rgb(77, 77, 79);">Kearney, Whitney Gayle</span><br><span style="color:rgb(77, 77, 79);">Wagner, Kathleen Theresa</span><br><span style="color:rgb(77, 77, 79);">Russell, Allison Gabriel</span><br><span style="color:rgb(77, 77, 79);">Botts, Jessica</span><br><span style="color:rgb(77, 77, 79);">She has to decide who she''s willing to possibly lose or go as self pay. Anthem covers all but Dr. Wagner. So, she''s focusing on Anthem. Also focusing on the Anthem CO Option plans for $0 mental health counseling. Cigna CO Options are NOT $0. So, hence we are focusing on Anthem. She will ask Dr. Wagner''s office if they will honor continuity of care to allow one of the C4 Anthem plans. If not, she will find out the cash pay price. She and I will revisit on Wed. Her income might be closer to $59K vs $68K for household. The plan she''s offered through her husband that he gets through school is not afforable. It''s $600+. When I do 9% of income that would bring it to $435 max for the cost. She says the lowest cost plan is $600. So, she should qualify for about $99 APTC with household income at $59K. She will update the income and his SS # once she has it.  Dr. Allison Russell is in both Anthem and Cigna networks.</span>', 'Wendy Scipione - SR VP National Sales Advisor', 'Wendy Scipione - SR VP National Sales Advisor', '2025-09-12 14:18:48', '2025-09-12 15:54:38'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000170667157', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000110260002', 'William Burg Jr', NULL, 'Scheduled a call with William for Monday 09/15 4:15 PM EST to re go over his program details.', 'Leonardo Moraes', 'Leonardo Moraes', '2025-09-12 14:17:47', '2025-09-12 14:17:47'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000170700196', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000159254002', 'Marcelle McGee', NULL, '9/12/25<br>sent email to Marcelle to follow up on d/c procedure AC', 'Concierge', 'Concierge', '2025-09-12 13:37:20', '2025-09-12 13:37:20'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000170700185', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000065985001', 'Denise Uhlig', NULL, '9/12/25<br>Sent email to follow up on recent ER inquery AC', 'Concierge', 'Concierge', '2025-09-12 12:57:24', '2025-09-12 12:57:24'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000170700174', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000080021001', 'Amy Fowler', NULL, '9/12/25<br>Sent email to follow up on rx <br>AC', 'Concierge', 'Concierge', '2025-09-12 12:52:37', '2025-09-12 12:52:37'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000170700169', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000110260002', 'William Burg Jr', NULL, '9/12/25<br>William called regarding a remaining balance from a recent visit to the dermatologist. He stated that he provided his ARM card at the time of service and is confused about why he still owes a balance.<br>I explained to William that the ARM card is only intended for ACA-compliant <b>preventive services</b>. He responded by saying that his visit was preventive in nature, as it was meant to "prevent skin cancer." I clarified that while the visit may feel preventive, only services explicitly defined as preventive under the <b>Affordable Care Act (ACA)</b> guidelines are eligible for coverage through ARM. Since we follow federal ACA definitions, we must rely on those standards when determining eligibility.<br>I advised him to contact the provider and ask them to <b>reprocess the claim as self-pay</b>. If the cost exceeds his $1,000 IUA (Initial Unshareable Amount), he may submit a <b>sharing request</b> for the eligible portion of the bill through the health share.<br>I also took the time to explain how the <b>sharing request</b> process works and provided an overview of <b>Zion HealthShare</b>. However, William appeared to be confused and was mixing terminology between <b>MEC (Minimum Essential Coverage)</b> and <b>HealthShare</b>. I made multiple attempts to clarify the key differences between the two and explained which types of services fall under each part of the program AC', 'Concierge', 'Concierge', '2025-09-12 12:50:23', '2025-09-12 12:50:23'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000170700164', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000163473002', 'Tammy Chiarelli-Kelling', NULL, '9/12/25<br>Tammy called to see if we had an update or resolution on the waiting period for a maternity sharing request. She also informed me that the advisor told her that we never reached out to inform him of this situation which is false. I did let Tammy that we are unable to waive this waiting period Ac', 'Concierge', 'Concierge', '2025-09-12 12:42:19', '2025-09-12 12:42:19'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000170708390', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000165240025', 'Keith VandenAkker', NULL, 'Member submitted Change From to update email address.  I will process.', 'Patti Baron', 'Patti Baron', '2025-09-12 12:29:09', '2025-09-12 12:29:09'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000170663284', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000119469002', 'Steven Snead-Smith', NULL, '09/12/2025<br>Jennifer called about a bill from a physical. We spoke to Lori at ARM together and she realized all the codes were diagnostic. We let Jennifer know she needs to speak with provider to apply the proper CPT codes and re submit.<br>AJ', 'Concierge', 'Concierge', '2025-09-12 12:07:23', '2025-09-12 12:07:23'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000170707150', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000165569002', 'Yvette Heryford', NULL, '9/12/25: Emailed Yvette RX quote per request. AM', 'Concierge', 'Concierge', '2025-09-12 10:45:32', '2025-09-12 10:45:32'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000170707139', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000141070002', 'Jerry Barnwell', NULL, '9/12/25: Karis called saying that when she tries to log in, her account is inactive. She was trying to get into Cirrus. Let her know the new telehealth provider and walked her through downloading HW app. AM', 'Concierge', 'Concierge', '2025-09-12 10:37:07', '2025-09-12 10:37:07'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000170700159', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000155097001', 'Rosanne Garza', NULL, '9/12/25<br>Provider called to check eligibility for diagnostic labs and wanted to know if those would be covered. I infomred the office that the memebr is to present as self pay AC', 'Concierge', 'Concierge', '2025-09-12 10:12:53', '2025-09-12 10:12:53'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000170707120', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000096033002', 'Carl Loven', NULL, '9/12/25: Carl having extreme hip pain on right hand side. He scheduled an appt with on ortho for Monday and wondering if they need to open sharing request now. I suggested to wait till after appt when they have an itemized statement and more info from dr. Suggested Carl call us back afterwards so we can help in getting the request started. Also let them know an estimate for how much we can get the MRI cost down just in case they order one immediately. AM', 'Concierge', 'Concierge', '2025-09-12 09:46:04', '2025-09-12 09:46:04'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000170711001', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000159997002', 'Kira Lewis', 'Zoho SalesIQ chat with Concierge', 'Visit ID : 4369 Question : Hi can I use the telehealth option to speak to a psychologist about learning disabilities assessments?', 'MPB Health Member Notification', 'MPB Health Member Notification', '2025-09-12 09:39:40', '2025-09-12 09:39:40'),
