  ('zcrm_1579374000170707101', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000125344002', 'David Powders', NULL, '9/12/25: Called provider back to confirm David''s eligibility however the office staff didn''t have any details. Suggested Patrice (who left initial message) just give us a call back if need be. <br>Tried reaching out again to return a second vm however I can''t get connected to same person who is calling. Gave as much info as I could about David''s benefits. AM', 'Concierge', 'Concierge', '2025-09-12 09:09:47', '2025-09-12 11:04:34'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000170707096', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000137251002', 'Llywellyn Jones', NULL, '9/12/25: Llywellyn called asking about rx quote. It looks like the email bounced. Re-sent to both members and guided on how to access telehealth services. AM', 'Concierge', 'Concierge', '2025-09-12 09:01:31', '2025-09-12 09:01:31'),
