  ('zcrm_1579374000170707038', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000066091021', 'Yadira Butkovich', NULL, '9/12/25: Emailed Yadira requesting she share the determination email she received from Zion - called and spoke to Bill and resent to a different email address per request. <br>Also had Zion send another PHI form since she filled out the last one for her husband. AM', 'Concierge', 'Concierge', '2025-09-12 07:35:02', '2025-09-12 11:54:37'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000170707001', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000153824002', 'Samuel Young', NULL, '9/12/25: Sun called asking if covid and flu shots are covered under their plan - yes. She also asked about finding a good neuro surgeon for her son - he has a condition that requires regular maintenance visits by a nurologist but is not tied to current one. Let her know I''d do some research and email her a list of options today or Monday. <br>She also asked if she should open a need for son''s condition. I advised to def keep records and be aware of 6 month deadline, but if it''s just a yearly MRI and visit, then they wouldn''t come close to IUA amount. AM<br><br><span><br></span>', 'Concierge', 'Concierge', '2025-09-12 07:19:52', '2025-09-12 07:19:52'),
