  ('zcrm_1579374000170700054', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000168094002', 'Maria Marshall', NULL, '9/11/25<br>Ella called because she is unable to log into the health wallet app after testing out the app it seems to be down, I adviced her to wait 24 hours AC', 'Concierge', 'Concierge', '2025-09-11 17:13:21', '2025-09-11 17:13:21'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000170700049', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000134978019', 'Angel Cachero', NULL, '9/11/25<br>Angel called to see if <span style="color:rgb(38, 58, 80);background-color:rgb(253, 251, 248);">NIPT testing- Services are eligible for sharing for her pregnancy. I infomred her that according to zions guidlines it will not be eligble AC</span>', 'Concierge', 'Concierge', '2025-09-11 17:11:57', '2025-09-11 17:11:57'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000170700030', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000139300235', 'Corey Maillet', '9/11/25', 'Corey called with questions on how to use his plan. They are heading to the ER for possible kindney stones. I adviced them to present as self pay and to opne a sharing request through the sedera website AC', 'Concierge', 'Concierge', '2025-09-11 17:08:33', '2025-09-11 17:08:33'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000170700011', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000018819616', 'David Assell', NULL, '9/11/25<br>David is interested in getting <span style="color:rgb(17, 17, 17);">Xifaxan (generic) 550mg through the Canadian pharmacy. Sent Thomas at the Canadian pharmacy an email to get updates prices AC</span>', 'Concierge', 'Concierge', '2025-09-11 15:55:26', '2025-09-11 15:55:26'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000170693028', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000005291752', 'Christine Harvey', NULL, '9-11-25 Christine called back and wanted to understand her preventive benefits and if she could switch her dr. I explained she can go where she chooses and will submit for reimbursement. She will do her annual wellness screening including pap screening with new dr in Niwot.  All set!  Concierge did not call her back. She tried them first.', 'Wendy Scipione - SR VP National Sales Advisor', 'Wendy Scipione - SR VP National Sales Advisor', '2025-09-11 15:52:39', '2025-09-11 15:52:39'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000170700006', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000124631253', 'Ilysa Keeley', NULL, '9/11/25<br><br>Llysa called requesting assistance with uploading a document to the Lyric portal. The provider at Lyric requires a copy of her referral in order to rewrite it and help Llysa obtain the items at a discounted rate.<br>AC', 'Concierge', 'Concierge', '2025-09-11 15:52:16', '2025-09-11 15:52:16'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000170700001', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000153932105', 'Allison O''Connor', NULL, '9/11/25<br>Allison Calle called to clarify some confusion regarding booking her appointment through Lyric. She mentioned that the representatives at Lyric were asking for additional information that we were not provided with. I explained that the booking process should be straightforward, but that the issue has been escalated to my manager. I assured her that I will contact her as soon as we receive more information.<br>The second issue we discussed was regarding the additional labs she would like to have done. Lyric is currently unable to add these labs for her. I advised that the best course of action would be for her to see a provider in person, have the MEC (Minimum Essential Coverage) cover the wellness check and labs, and then submit the results to the telehealth provider to continue treatment.<br>She expressed concern that the Vitamin B12 lab might not be covered. I informed her that as long as the labs are coded as preventive, they should be covered. AC<br>', 'Concierge', 'Concierge', '2025-09-11 15:37:50', '2025-09-11 15:37:50'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000170663201', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000012010011', 'Elizabeth Wood', NULL, '09/11/2025<br>Elizabeth called to ask about an ongoing share request and how to handle additional expenses. Let her know to submit those as soon as she can to initiate the process for sedera to give her the money to pay the providers. Let her know tell them she is cash pay and to call sedera if she gets an unexpected estimate at a high cost cause they might want a second opinion. She also wanted to know if she should apply for financial assistance and again i let her know to talk to sedera about that directly. She said they have been paying and getting the money to her in about 4-6 weeks each time.<br>AJ', 'Concierge', 'Concierge', '2025-09-11 14:36:12', '2025-09-11 14:36:12'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000170693023', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000005291752', 'Christine Harvey', NULL, '9-11-25 Left vm for Christine returning her call.', 'Wendy Scipione - SR VP National Sales Advisor', 'Wendy Scipione - SR VP National Sales Advisor', '2025-09-11 14:34:49', '2025-09-11 14:34:49'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000170663196', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000093412002', 'Aaron Smith', NULL, '09/11/2025<br>Spoke to aaron about labs from telehealth and ended up tranferring him to lyric for them to assist him with that.<br>AJ', 'Concierge', 'Concierge', '2025-09-11 14:32:12', '2025-09-11 14:32:12'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000170663191', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000120995010', 'Tom Trimmer', NULL, '09/11/2025<br>Thomas called to ask about new mental health for possible marriage counseling. He wanted in person but i let him know we only have virtual and unfortuantely no option for in person like MSEAP had.<br>AJ', 'Concierge', 'Concierge', '2025-09-11 14:31:08', '2025-09-11 14:31:08'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000170663172', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000077566026', 'MaiLan Boris', NULL, '09/11/2025<br>Going to reach out and let her know that RXvalet has given us a pone number that should help with this situation. They are supposed to be able to call when at the pharmacy to get vaccines and other things at the pharmacy paid for if they are covered preventative care. Once i speak with the people at that number i will validate that is what should happen then let mailan and other members know to do this<br>AJ', 'Concierge', 'Concierge', '2025-09-11 14:08:44', '2025-09-11 14:08:44'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000170663167', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000071380029', 'Trevor Berry', NULL, '09/11/2025<br>Spoke with melissa about an old bill they were still getting notices about. We called ARM together and they notified us it was a wrong code being surgical instead of preventative and all will be taken care of. They said they would pay the bill and told Melissa do not worry anymore about it.<br>AJ', 'Concierge', 'Concierge', '2025-09-11 13:16:12', '2025-09-11 13:16:12'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000170692069', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000084653001', 'Marianne Aultz', 'New Membership eff 10/1/25', 'Member &amp; Sp $1000 IUA Secure', 'Patti Baron', 'Patti Baron', '2025-09-11 13:12:12', '2025-09-11 13:12:12'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000170662030', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000134859002', 'Kristofer Tosczak', NULL, 'Member submitted payment update.  I will process in A123', 'Michele R', 'Michele R', '2025-09-11 13:09:37', '2025-09-11 13:09:37'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000170692064', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000084653001', 'Marianne Aultz', NULL, 'Member submitted Change Form to change membership from Direct to Secure eff 10/1/25.  I will process.', 'Patti Baron', 'Patti Baron', '2025-09-11 13:09:00', '2025-09-11 13:09:00'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000170693018', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000166676002', 'Cecilia DeLise', NULL, '9-11-25 Cecilia just got a new job and they are paying 100% for all medical, dental and vision!  So, she is cancelling for Oct. 1st. She completed the form for MPB and I gave her the # for vision. She will look for her info from Delta Dental since all of my #''s are for brokers. She was very nice and will keep my contact information for the future!', 'Wendy Scipione - SR VP National Sales Advisor', 'Wendy Scipione - SR VP National Sales Advisor', '2025-09-11 12:56:32', '2025-09-11 12:56:32'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000170692056', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000011610534', 'Amanda Bonfitto', 'New Membership eff 10/1/25', 'Member &amp; Spouse $2500 IUA Care +', 'Patti Baron', 'Patti Baron', '2025-09-11 12:47:41', '2025-09-11 12:47:41'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000170693008', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000073820131', 'Danielle Lynn', NULL, '9-11-25 Rachelle with Planstin is helping us move Danielle to Zion Direct per her request. Patti has sent over the cancellation file automatically on 9-9-25. Rachelle needs to work on it on their end now to make sure there''s no lapse in membership.', 'Wendy Scipione - SR VP National Sales Advisor', 'Wendy Scipione - SR VP National Sales Advisor', '2025-09-11 12:32:43', '2025-09-11 12:32:43'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000170658148', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000093412002', 'Aaron Smith', NULL, '9/11/25: Aaron called asking for Stephanie. I asked if this is regarding a telehealth appt. Yes - transferred over. He needed the order for his labs and stool test. AM', 'Concierge', 'Concierge', '2025-09-11 11:45:11', '2025-09-11 11:45:11'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000170690051', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000155188036', 'Jason Tompkins', NULL, '9/10/25<br>Jason recently had a wellness check and, during the same visit, also received services related to a separate office visit. ARM informed him that only the preventative (wellness) portion of the visit would be covered, and the remaining charges related to the office visit would be his responsibility. He reached out to us to confirm this information. I explained that ARM was correct the non-preventative portion of the visit is not covered and would be his responsibility. AC', 'Concierge', 'Concierge', '2025-09-11 11:42:27', '2025-09-11 11:42:27'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000170690030', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000155432018', 'Marshall Pickett', NULL, '9/10/25<br>Marshall is having some medical complication and went to see a urologist. He as labs and imagining appointments coming up that will most likely get him to his IUA. I advised them to open a sharing request as soon as the get the first receipt AC', 'Concierge', 'Concierge', '2025-09-11 11:37:39', '2025-09-11 11:37:39'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000170690025', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000162775002', 'Lon Manson', NULL, '9/11/25<br>Lon called because we wants to set up his zion protal for the frist time. I conected him with the zion team so they can further assist him AC', 'Concierge', 'Concierge', '2025-09-11 11:36:11', '2025-09-11 11:36:11'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000170658143', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000169603002', 'Amy Heine', NULL, '9/11/25: Amy called wondering how to get her prescriptions to online pharmacy through HW. Guided her to site and order PDF. Let her know if she doesn''t see her medications in her profile, she can contact the pharmacy help desk to view progress. AM', 'Concierge', 'Concierge', '2025-09-11 11:26:23', '2025-09-11 11:26:23'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000170690006', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000070248114', 'John Spalvins', NULL, '9/11/25<br>John called requesting reimbursement for a bill dated back in January. I informed him that ARM has a strict deadline for submitting reimbursement claims, and unfortunately, he is well past that deadline. Additionally, since he is no longer an active member, ARM no longer has his records on file.<br>Despite this, I provided John with the necessary information and guidance to submit the bill directly to LORI at ARM. I advised him to include an explanation of his situation in hopes that they might consider an exception.<br><b>Action Taken:</b><br><ul style="list-style-type:disc;list-style-position:inside;"><li style="list-style-image:none;"><p style="display:inline;"><span style="color:rgb(51, 51, 51);font-weight:normal;font-style:normal;">Explained policy on reimbursement deadlines</span></p></li><li style="list-style-image:none;"><p style="display:inline;"><span style="color:rgb(51, 51, 51);font-weight:normal;font-style:normal;">Advised that records are no longer retained due to inactive membership</span></p></li><li style="list-style-image:none;"><p style="display:inline;"><span style="color:rgb(51, 51, 51);font-weight:normal;font-style:normal;">Provided contact information and instructions for submitting directly to ARM (LORI)</span></p></li></ul><b>Next Steps (if any):</b><br>Await response or follow-up from John or ARM, if applicable.    AC', 'Concierge', 'Concierge', '2025-09-11 11:23:36', '2025-09-11 11:23:36'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000170690001', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000098614002', 'Joseph Whitman', NULL, '9/11/25<br>Jessica call wanting an update on her bill, I did inform her that it does take at least 2 weeks to process and at this time I do not have any updates Ac', 'Concierge', 'Concierge', '2025-09-11 11:18:35', '2025-09-11 11:18:35'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000170657141', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000162775002', 'Lon Manson', NULL, 'Welcome call complete. Vanessa Orozco', 'Concierge', 'Concierge', '2025-09-11 11:10:29', '2025-09-11 11:10:29'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000170658138', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000098614002', 'Joseph Whitman', NULL, '9/11/25: Jessica called hoping for an update on her bills she emailed in. Transferred to Acelyn. AM', 'Concierge', 'Concierge', '2025-09-11 11:03:12', '2025-09-11 11:03:12'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000170663146', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000109045022', 'Liam Reynolds', NULL, '09/11/2025<br>Spoke with Liams mom Shelley. She wanted to know what to do for a regular appointment since Liam is sick with allergies. Let her know they are cash pay until they reach the IUA with any realated treament plan for the allergic episode, if it is that. Also going to send her a link for lab quotes because she needs to try and get some done. <br>AJ', 'Concierge', 'Concierge', '2025-09-11 10:53:22', '2025-09-11 10:53:22'),
