  ('zcrm_1579374000170657109', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000168280025', 'Lynn Nielsen', NULL, 'Spoke to member she needed to reschedule welcome call. Sent an email to do so. Vanessa Orozco', 'Concierge', 'Concierge', '2025-09-11 10:07:38', '2025-09-11 10:07:38'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000170658125', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000168819001', 'Diane Moore', NULL, '9/11/25: Diane called wanting to know her monthly contribution and reps name. AM', 'Concierge', 'Concierge', '2025-09-11 09:58:12', '2025-09-11 09:58:12'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000170657092', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000168819001', 'Diane Moore', NULL, 'Welcome call complete. Vanessa Orozco', 'Concierge', 'Concierge', '2025-09-11 09:55:19', '2025-09-11 09:55:19'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000170658098', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000066091021', 'Yadira Butkovich', NULL, '9/11/25: Yadira and Bill called. <span style="color:rgb(51, 51, 51);">Yadira is having swelling down her leg and doctor recommended physical therapy to get swelling down. </span>They submitted a sharing request and got an email from Zion on August 25th stating the shareable amount for a procedure as well as stating it will be 3 IUAs instead of 1.<br>Zion is considering it 3 sharing requests for bi-lateral knee pain, ankle pain and an unknown 3rd issue - even though it''s just swelling down her leg. <br><br>Brought Chris from Zion into the call. He advised that if they feel like the decision is incorrect, to submit an appeal by replying directly to email as to why you think it should be 1 IUA and connected us to Christina who is working on the request.<br><br>Bill asked where does appeal get sent to? Once Christina receives the email, she''ll send to the appeals committee. He said the first issue is that no one is replying to their email (they replied same day but never got an answer) Christina said she was out of town for a couple weeks. <br><br>Christina tried to get Walter (determination judicature) on the line for more info bc she couldn''t give anyone a clear answer as to why this determination was made. <br><br>I advised Yadira and Bill to go ahead and file the appeal, asked Christina to get with Walter and let the Butkovichs know a reason and urged them to fill out a PHI form with my name so we can discuss the issue with Zion. Christina sent form and said <span style="color:rgb(51, 51, 51);">they can get back to them next week at latest.</span><br>AM', 'Concierge', 'Concierge', '2025-09-11 09:43:12', '2025-09-11 10:01:24'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000170657073', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000169726005', 'Gregory Walzer', NULL, 'Welcome call complete. Vanessa Orozco', 'Concierge', 'Concierge', '2025-09-11 09:26:45', '2025-09-11 09:26:45'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000170663073', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000168214002', 'Sheri Ottosen', NULL, '09/11/2025<br>Went to make f/u and noticed she had been handled by Angee and acelyn for the same thing so i did not want to over notify her and make us look spammy or like we dont speak to each other. <br>AJ', 'Concierge', 'Concierge', '2025-09-11 09:19:13', '2025-09-11 09:19:13'),
