  ('zcrm_1579374000170662013', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000170649002', 'Melissa Ford', 'Member Only $1500 IUA Premium HSA', 'Tax ID/EIN: requested:  sent to member &amp; advisor the member change form link to submit.  Member submitted change form to add her TAX ID/EIN.  I will process. 236-90-6122.  <br><span><br></span>9/12: Member replied to my email and updated her Tax ID as follows:  MK PROPERTY LLC  27-1808710.  I will update in A123', 'Michele R', 'Michele R', '2025-09-11 07:33:56', '2025-09-12 10:03:01'),
