  ('zcrm_1579374000170658013', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000168214002', 'Sheri Ottosen', NULL, '9/11/25: Sent Sheri email asking if the newest thyroid coupon worked out. AM', 'Concierge', 'Concierge', '2025-09-11 07:10:11', '2025-09-11 07:10:11'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000170642023', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000032016379', 'Maurine Killough', NULL, '9-10-25 Maurine is wanting to cancel her HMA bc they are only reimbursing her 50% for her dental visit even though the dentist went through the process become a provider in network. Hollie is saying it''s accurate but when I look at their promises, they say they will reimburse 100%. Geoff Kirk has yet to respond to my 2nd request. Now there''s a class action lawsuit against them, clearly bc many people are having problem. They are increasing rates as well. For the $40 membership it will now be $55 per month which was never part of the agreement. I let Maurine know if she cancels she will lose the money in the account. So, she can also try to spend down the money and then close it out.', 'Wendy Scipione - SR VP National Sales Advisor', 'Wendy Scipione - SR VP National Sales Advisor', '2025-09-10 22:02:04', '2025-09-10 22:02:04'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000170642018', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000163360001', 'Blythe Burge', NULL, '9-10-25 Buffy decided to enroll in Premium HSA $1500/895 EF Oct. 1st start date. I explained how the IUA works for the entire household with 3 max per year. She thought it was per family member. She then realized the lower IUA''s were much better financially and she doesn''t need gap ins on top of it all. She wants to set up an HSA. She will wait for her card and Welcome call to start working on setting that up. She was super appreciative of my patience and help. She''s all set to go.', 'Wendy Scipione - SR VP National Sales Advisor', 'Wendy Scipione - SR VP National Sales Advisor', '2025-09-10 21:15:56', '2025-09-10 21:15:56'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000170638119', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000038280209', 'STEVEN FRADIN', NULL, '9/10/25: Sent Steve an option for his cortisone shot and asked where he ended up going - I see he went ahead and took care of it. AM', 'Concierge', 'Concierge', '2025-09-10 16:17:42', '2025-09-10 16:17:42'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000170638106', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000062380465', 'Kelly Green', NULL, '9/10/25: Kelly called to cancel - she now has insurance through her job. Instructed her to let advisor know and showed her cancellation form. AM', 'Concierge', 'Concierge', '2025-09-10 15:52:04', '2025-09-10 15:52:04'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000170638098', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000153327002', 'Rachel Klobucher', NULL, '9/10/25: Lori let me know that Rachel''s skin cancer screening from derm is not covered bc the derm is a specialist. Let Rachel know. AM', 'Concierge', 'Concierge', '2025-09-10 15:44:15', '2025-09-10 15:44:15'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000170638088', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000086960002', 'Thomas Worley', NULL, '9/10/25: Called Georgina back from the other day. (She called and then had to jump off). She was wondering about the change from Planstin to ARM - I explained and put in request for new physical cards. She had a few questions. Son sees an opthalomologist for vision issues - advised her to ask Zion directly since this is a little different than just visits to check on lenses etc. Also, husband is having knee issue and she was wondering if Therapeutic treatment like acupuncture and physical therapy is shareable - yes- walked her through what it would look like to open a sharing request. AM', 'Concierge', 'Concierge', '2025-09-10 15:29:11', '2025-09-10 15:29:11'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000170638070', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000157103002', 'Nicole Feenstra', NULL, '9/10/25: Nicole emailed in asking specifically which labs are paid for through her plan. She sent a long list. From her email, it seemed like a lot of the labs were to check on a possible autoimmune disorder - which would be her responsibility but let her know if they turned into a large need, then whatever she pays for them can go towards IUA. AM', 'Concierge', 'Concierge', '2025-09-10 15:08:31', '2025-09-10 15:08:31'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000170632096', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000119666009', 'Melinda Deckert', NULL, '9/10/25<br>Called back Melinda to update her on her pending bills ARM has received them and is processing them, I informed her that ARM sends out checks on the 15th of every moth when it comes to reimbursement and to keep an eye out for her mail AC', 'Concierge', 'Concierge', '2025-09-10 14:54:21', '2025-09-10 14:54:21'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000170632088', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000151451002', 'William Madsen', '9/10/25', 'collage called to verify if William was covered under our health plan AC', 'Concierge', 'Concierge', '2025-09-10 14:51:45', '2025-09-10 14:51:54'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000170579670', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000032601439', 'Chelsie Dawydiuk', NULL, '09/10/2025<br>Situation with upgrade has been escalated. It looks like the member bought ARM directly instead of going through us which cause confusion for who they were supposed to call. We did not have any record of upgrading them since it went straight to ARM and the client was upset with customer service when they were attempting to reach ARM and Jane. We let Cat know and Reba or her should be reaching out to Jane to let her know the client is really trying to get in touch with her.<br>AJ', 'Concierge', 'Concierge', '2025-09-10 14:41:52', '2025-09-10 14:41:52'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000170579665', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000059526010', 'Robin Brenneise', NULL, '09/10/2025<br>Called her back to return her VM. She called about a telehealth appointment. Left VM<br>AJ', 'Concierge', 'Concierge', '2025-09-10 14:40:09', '2025-09-10 14:40:09'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000170642013', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000070248114', 'John Spalvins', NULL, '9-10-25 John just received a lab bill from Lab Corp for labs he did with his preventive visit about Jan. 6 or 7. He needs to submit the bill to ARM. I told him to contact the Concierge to learn how to do so. He no longer has his card since he''s on Medicare now.', 'Wendy Scipione - SR VP National Sales Advisor', 'Wendy Scipione - SR VP National Sales Advisor', '2025-09-10 14:39:03', '2025-09-10 14:39:03'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000170642008', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000151451002', 'William Madsen', NULL, '9-10-25 Bill called bc he needed the letter for the college. But, he''s since heard back from them and it sounds like they have what they need. They hadn''t been able to reach the number on the card that he provided originally. Sounds like all is well for now.', 'Wendy Scipione - SR VP National Sales Advisor', 'Wendy Scipione - SR VP National Sales Advisor', '2025-09-10 14:34:06', '2025-09-10 14:34:06'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000170579641', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000107048002', 'Peter Coddington', NULL, '09/10/2025<br>Called peter back after he sent in an email and asked me about issues he was having logging into health wallet. We looked into it and when he was upgraded to the MEC the MEC was not added in E123 so the info was not sent to ARM. Vinnie Called ARM and now he will be able to login in the next 24-48 hours when i will f/u and let him know <br>AJ', 'Concierge', 'Concierge', '2025-09-10 14:23:28', '2025-09-10 14:23:28'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000170642003', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000178561001', 'Genevieve Choi', NULL, '9-10-25 After a long conversation with Genevieve, she thinking of doing Premium HSA for her and kids who are 21, 22 and 23. Their 26 year old is on his own now. Premium HSA is $1000/$676. Genevieve only has high blood pressure medication nebivolol. She gets is from GoodRX but can get it from pharmacy checker for even cheaper. She can get 30 tablets for $10.80 as of today when sort by price. Wiliam takes too many meds for MCS to be  a good idea. His meds are <span style="">Repatha 140 mg, Jardiance 25 mg, Rosuvastatin 20 mg and Mounjaro 5 mg. Willing to take generic versions. They get them every 90 days and 4 x year refills. Daughter Olivia has IBS problems and takes Ibsrela. I found Ibsrela for about $92 a month which she''s fine with. I gave her Pharmacy Checker to see and order on her own. We will wait for Nov. to see the prices and options for William. The best carrier now is RMHP/UHC to include all of his meds. It does not include his Dr. but she says that''s ok. Their Cobra runs out Feb. 1st. They are paying about $2500 per month. She could move off now and save them probably $1000 per month. Her 23 year old daughter has some digestion issues.  I''ll share the video and she will talk it over with William. They earn about $1M per year, so they won''t qualify for any APTC. She''s super nice and thankful for my patience.</span>', 'Wendy Scipione - SR VP National Sales Advisor', 'Wendy Scipione - SR VP National Sales Advisor', '2025-09-10 14:21:10', '2025-09-10 14:21:10'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000170638065', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000153961038', 'Steven Barrows', NULL, '9/10/25: Podiatry office called again bc Jolita is needing foot surgery. Unfortunately, her plan doesn''t help with that. Passed on info to Linda at office. AM', 'Concierge', 'Concierge', '2025-09-10 14:18:37', '2025-09-10 14:18:37'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000170579633', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000083455010', 'Leron Levy', NULL, '09/10/2025<br>LEron called to check if his ARM cards were coming so i ordered a new one and then answered his questions about health wallet and how to go about getting a colonoscopy. I see angee has a task so i will keep an eye out to make sure he gets this colo scheduled<br>AJ', 'Concierge', 'Concierge', '2025-09-10 14:18:31', '2025-09-10 14:19:18'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000170579628', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000157103002', 'Nicole Feenstra', NULL, '09/10/2025<br>Nicole called in order to get help finding out about a provider for her to use. We called ARM together to verify taht her provider was in network and they were.<br>AJ', 'Concierge', 'Concierge', '2025-09-10 14:17:03', '2025-09-10 14:17:03'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000170579609', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000169135002', 'Adam Jackson', NULL, '09/10/2025<br>Responded to his email asking to get his welcome call and sent him the link in order for him to get that scheduled. Let him know to reach out with any issues.<br>AJ', 'Concierge', 'Concierge', '2025-09-10 14:15:05', '2025-09-10 14:15:05'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000170579590', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000077918128', 'Kimber Eastman', NULL, '09/10/2025<br>Sent an email responding to them about physical ARM cards. They requested some and i saw angee ahd already spoke to them and ordered some new ones. I let them know new ones were ordered and should arrive soon.<br>AJ', 'Concierge', 'Concierge', '2025-09-10 14:12:09', '2025-09-10 14:12:09'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000170579579', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000155307001', 'Thomas Manzi', NULL, '09/10/2025<br>Sent an email responding to his asking about a bill for  a colonoscopy. Asked him when a good time would be for us to talk so i could call him then, will call tomorrow if he does not respond and try and reach him<br>AJ', 'Concierge', 'Concierge', '2025-09-10 14:09:31', '2025-09-10 14:10:04'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000170638046', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000157224002', 'Timothy Craig', NULL, '9/10/25: Emailed Tim RX coupons per request. See email for details. AM', 'Concierge', 'Concierge', '2025-09-10 14:04:54', '2025-09-10 14:04:54'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000170638041', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000108421001', 'Tara Dobson', NULL, '9/10/25: Paul called wanting to know if the cost of daughter''s recent urgent care visit is covered. It was about $170. Claim was sent to arm - they discounted it down from $1000 to 170. Let him know that this would be his responsibility since it exceed the $1000 IUA. AM', 'Concierge', 'Concierge', '2025-09-10 14:04:19', '2025-09-10 14:04:19'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000170579541', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000120413002', 'Christina Mullaney', NULL, '09/10/2025<br>Sent F/u text to check in after the telehealth issues she experienced. <br>AJ', 'Concierge', 'Concierge', '2025-09-10 13:51:57', '2025-09-10 14:42:45'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000170579510', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000114234002', 'Kenneth Storm', NULL, '09/10/2025<br>Helped elizabeth by calling RX valet with her in order to get her info adjusted so when she logged into the health wallet and then went to RX valet her name and information would display instead of her husbands so she could order meds. They were able to assist and get her logged in now she is happy<br>AJ', 'Concierge', 'Concierge', '2025-09-10 13:48:33', '2025-09-10 14:24:12'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000170638028', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000169649002', 'Angeline McLean', NULL, '9/10/25: Angeline emailed in asking if flu and covid vaccines are paid for and if she can get them at CVS minute clinic - I said yes, and yes - and if for some reason they ring up for a pice, please call us. AM', 'Concierge', 'Concierge', '2025-09-10 13:28:12', '2025-09-10 13:28:12'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000170630048', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000119666009', 'Melinda Deckert', NULL, 'Melinda called in to check the status of her claims.  I gave her number to Adam to call back when he gets off the phone to review.', 'Michele R', 'Michele R', '2025-09-10 13:21:59', '2025-09-10 13:21:59'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000170632083', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000058781018', 'Michele Brooks', NULL, '9/10/25<br>Michele called to she how her plan works she recently had a colo with a provider out of network which would not be covered, she was not looking to be reimbursed since she claims she got a good deal for it AC', 'Concierge', 'Concierge', '2025-09-10 13:15:41', '2025-09-10 13:15:41'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000170638023', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000154688092', 'Jonathan Bell', NULL, '9/10/25: Returned Jon''s call . He needed help accessing his mental health benefits. Texted number listed in HW since he was driving. AM', 'Concierge', 'Concierge', '2025-09-10 12:56:21', '2025-09-10 12:56:21'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000170638018', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000164917002', 'Daniel Kelley', NULL, '9/10/25: Dan called stating that he got an estimate from Dr. Bond''s office for his wellness visit coming up in October, but he thought this was covered under plan. I double checked that Bond is in network, which he is - and reiterated how to present during appt to have it paid 100%. AM', 'Concierge', 'Concierge', '2025-09-10 12:51:58', '2025-09-10 12:51:58'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000170630043', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000134859002', 'Kristofer Tosczak', NULL, 'Member called in to update payment information.  I will send him the Payment Update Form.', 'Michele R', 'Michele R', '2025-09-10 11:51:05', '2025-09-10 11:51:05'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000170582320', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000109777001', 'Rachel Hinckley', 'New Membership eff 10/1/25', 'Member &amp; Child $5000 Secure HSA', 'Patti Baron', 'Patti Baron', '2025-09-10 11:23:24', '2025-09-10 11:23:24'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000170582310', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000109777001', 'Rachel Hinckley', NULL, 'Member submitted Change Form to add child to membership.  I will process.', 'Patti Baron', 'Patti Baron', '2025-09-10 11:20:03', '2025-09-10 11:20:03'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000170629123', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000169461002', 'Connie Man Lai Wong', NULL, 'Welcome call complete. Vanessa Orozco', 'Concierge', 'Concierge', '2025-09-10 11:04:36', '2025-09-10 11:04:36'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000170629099', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000106699002', 'Kelly McKinney', NULL, 'Welcome call complete. Vanessa Orozco', 'Concierge', 'Concierge', '2025-09-10 10:58:44', '2025-09-10 10:58:44'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000170632064', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000169680002', 'Andrew Chapman', NULL, '9/10/25<br>Called back/ responded to his email he need assisantce locating the sedera member portal. AC', 'Concierge', 'Concierge', '2025-09-10 10:52:16', '2025-09-10 10:52:16'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000170582305', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000168832019', 'Michael Locher', NULL, 'Member submitted Change form to update address.', 'Patti Baron', 'Patti Baron', '2025-09-10 10:46:05', '2025-09-10 10:46:05'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000170582295', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000170614002', 'Susan Duffy', 'New Membership eff 10/1/25', 'Member &amp; Sp $1500 IUA Premium HSA', 'Patti Baron', 'Patti Baron', '2025-09-10 10:35:42', '2025-09-10 10:35:42'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000170629089', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000169680002', 'Andrew Chapman', NULL, 'Welcome call complete. Member didn''t receive Sedera email to link to create member portal transferred call to Concierge. Vanessa Orozco', 'Concierge', 'Concierge', '2025-09-10 10:34:17', '2025-09-10 10:34:17'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000170582290', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000170614002', 'Susan Duffy', NULL, 'Member submitted Change Form to correct her enrollment.  She enrolled in the Secure membership by mistake wanted to enroll in the Premium HSA membership.  I will update,', 'Patti Baron', 'Patti Baron', '2025-09-10 10:33:23', '2025-09-10 10:33:23'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000170630038', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000084653001', 'Marianne Aultz', NULL, 'Member called in asking if we offered other products that can cover for preventative services like wellness.  I directed her to contact her Healthcare Advisor, Misty, to review the best options to upgrade her membership.', 'Michele R', 'Michele R', '2025-09-10 10:32:06', '2025-09-10 10:32:06'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000170632053', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000161676452', 'Kristi Ross', NULL, '9/10/25<br>Sent email to follow up on their MRI AC', 'Concierge', 'Concierge', '2025-09-10 10:25:40', '2025-09-10 10:25:40'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000170613011', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000152321002', 'Zachary Lamkin', '9-10-2025 Called LVM for Zack re a good time to get this re-enrollment done.', NULL, 'Kirk Bennett', 'Kirk Bennett', '2025-09-10 10:23:55', '2025-09-10 10:23:55'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000170632037', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000001063061', 'James Tipple', NULL, '9/10/25<br>sent email to follow up on her sharing request and see if she was able to appeal it Ac', 'Concierge', 'Concierge', '2025-09-10 10:22:46', '2025-09-10 10:23:06'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000170613006', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000170606002', 'Jessica Jacobson', 'Enrolled Jessica and Family on 9-9-2025 in Secure HSA $1K-IUA', 'used same billing as her sister in law Jenny Howellk (Account Rodney Howell).', 'Kirk Bennett', 'Kirk Bennett', '2025-09-10 10:19:15', '2025-09-10 10:19:15'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000170632024', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000159710227', 'Jane Kassel', NULL, '9/10/25<br>sent email to follow up and see if she was able to utilize our mental health services AC', 'Concierge', 'Concierge', '2025-09-10 10:18:52', '2025-09-10 10:18:52'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000170632019', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000140562002', 'Cynthia Farrell', NULL, '9/10/25<br>Sent email Infomr member the the mpb app is not working and to attempt to log in AC', 'Concierge', 'Concierge', '2025-09-10 09:45:37', '2025-09-10 09:45:37'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000170632014', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000135674019', 'Amanda Lewis', NULL, '9/10/25<br>Amanda wanted to know how she can access her mental health benefit insturycted her to download the mpbhealth app AC', 'Concierge', 'Concierge', '2025-09-10 09:42:18', '2025-09-10 09:42:18'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000170632009', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000083404010', 'Michael Schutt', NULL, '9/10/25<br>LIsa Wanted to know what card to present at her wellnes check, I adviced her to use the ARM card. AC', 'Concierge', 'Concierge', '2025-09-10 09:40:54', '2025-09-10 09:40:54');
