  ('zcrm_1579374000170579463', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000032601439', 'Chelsie Dawydiuk', NULL, '09/09/2025<br>Sent text with the link to upgrade membership. We have not seen the other form they claim was submitted. We only got the IUA change. <br>AJ', 'Concierge', 'Concierge', '2025-09-10 08:57:41', '2025-09-10 08:57:41'),
