  ('zcrm_1579374000170631031', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000166952001', 'Mark Basil', NULL, 'Mark submitted cancellation eff 10/1/25 due to not being sastified with the member (HSA model).  he is not as yet on the list bill so I will process.', 'Patti Baron', 'Patti Baron', '2025-09-10 07:58:36', '2025-09-10 07:58:36'),
