  ('zcrm_1579374000170631001', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000069442023', 'Ann Johnson', NULL, 'Member submitted Cancellation Request eff 10/1/25 citing getting Employer benefits.  I will process.', 'Patti Baron', 'Patti Baron', '2025-09-10 07:10:22', '2025-09-10 07:10:22'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000170630006', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000170614018', 'Anya Smith', 'Member Only $1000 IUA Direct', NULL, 'Michele R', 'Michele R', '2025-09-10 07:06:23', '2025-09-10 07:06:38'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000170630001', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000166952001', 'Mark Basil', NULL, 'I returned Member''s voicemail.  Mark received the link from Concierge to cancel his membership, and was asking if he could cancel his membership as of today and receive a refund for the time he is not using it.  I told him that we do not issue refunds, and to submit the cancel form by the 19th of this month to avoid any further charges. He will take care of that.', 'Michele R', 'Michele R', '2025-09-10 07:00:46', '2025-09-10 07:00:46'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000170609215', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000169741002', 'Joyce Throgmorton', NULL, '9/9/25<br>Sent rx quote via email Ac', 'Concierge', 'Concierge', '2025-09-09 17:56:17', '2025-09-09 17:56:17'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000170609192', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000080021001', 'Amy Fowler', NULL, '9/9//25<br>Patient inquired about Aklief medication. Researched multiple sources; medication is confirmed to be expensive with no available discounts at patient''s preferred pharmacy. Recommended patient log into Health Wallet and consider ordering through the international pharmacy, which currently offers the lowest price at $402.87. Awaiting patient response or confirmation. AC', 'Concierge', 'Concierge', '2025-09-09 17:42:30', '2025-09-09 17:42:30'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000170609187', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000165305002', 'Liv Ladendorff', NULL, '9/9/25<br>Liv wanted to know how to access the discount for supplements and I also sent her the RX quote request to assist her with rx AC', 'Concierge', 'Concierge', '2025-09-09 17:18:00', '2025-09-09 17:18:00'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000170609179', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000162515002', 'Jackson Lawrie', '9/9/25', 'Jackson called needing help accessing his account with MPB Health. When asked what he needed to log in for, he stated he was trying to find a provider to renew a prescription. I recommended using our telehealth service, but he explained that telehealth would not renew this particular medication as it is a controlled substance.<br>I informed him that the MEC plan would not cover an office visit to renew this type of medication, even if it was through a PCP, as the plan only includes preventive coverage. I also advised him to reach out to Wendy, as he may be able to submit the bill to HAB for potential reimbursement.<br>Jackson was very quiet during the call and did not communicate much, which made it difficult to assist him to our full <a href="http://potential.AC" style="" target="_blank">potential.AC</a>', 'Concierge', 'Concierge', '2025-09-09 17:16:15', '2025-09-09 17:16:22'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000170609174', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000056140001', 'Betsy Green', NULL, '9/9/25<br>Called back Betsy because she has Dental and vision bills and wants to know where to submit. I explained that those bill do not qualify for a sharing request at this time since they did no reach the IUA but to reach out to Wendy to see if she has an additional add on to her plan like Healthcare access Ac', 'Concierge', 'Concierge', '2025-09-09 17:05:49', '2025-09-09 17:05:49'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000170609166', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000169903033', 'Andrew Woods', NULL, '9/9/25<br>Andrew called needing assistance accessing his telehealth benefit AC', 'Concierge', 'Concierge', '2025-09-09 17:01:11', '2025-09-09 17:01:20'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000170583288', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000170990026', 'Carra Gilson', NULL, '9-9-25 UPDATE I found this plan accepts her mental health counselor - <span style="color:rgb(77, 77, 79);">Anthem Colorado Option Gold Pathway Essentials Std. Ded is $1875 and 20% coinsurance after ded met. </span><br><span style="color:rgb(77, 77, 79);">HMO/Gold. Her cost is $370.20. Dr. Kathleen Wagner is not in network.</span>', 'Wendy Scipione - SR VP National Sales Advisor', 'Wendy Scipione - SR VP National Sales Advisor', '2025-09-09 16:29:18', '2025-09-09 16:30:56'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000170583283', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000170990026', 'Carra Gilson', NULL, '9-9-25 Carra watched the video. She came to me via Teresa Robertson. Carra is working FT at a University and PT at a hospital. The grant funding at the Uni is ending at the end of Sept. and she will lose her benefits Sept. 30th. He husband is on her insurance right now for dental and vision. He has medical on his own. When I put their income at $68K she does not get a subsidy since she''s the only one who needs ins. not him. Her pre-x is mental health counseling. She sees Whitney Gayle Kearney and doesn''t want to lose that benefit. However she''s not showing up in any of the C4 carrier networks. I told her to find out the cash price and what networks she accepts for individuals. She takes fluoxetine HCL 10 mg for anxiety. She was asking about maternity for later in a year or 2. Yes, she does her wellness visits. Their zip is on the adge of Lakewood 80226 in Jefferson County. We are meeting again on Friday.', 'Wendy Scipione - SR VP National Sales Advisor', 'Wendy Scipione - SR VP National Sales Advisor', '2025-09-09 16:26:35', '2025-09-09 16:26:35'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000170609142', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000107479026', 'Jaclyn Peters', NULL, '9/9/25<br>Jaclyn called to see what steps she needed to take in order for her pediatrician bills for her children''s well-vist to be covered, I advised her to please have the providers submit bills the the po box in the back of the card AC', 'Concierge', 'Concierge', '2025-09-09 16:10:05', '2025-09-09 16:11:06'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000170609123', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000114234002', 'Kenneth Storm', NULL, '<b>1. Health Wallet App Access:</b><br>Elizabeth reported being unable to access her own information via the Health Wallet app. She stated that she logged in using Kenneth’s member ID and date of birth, but only saw Kenneth’s name listed under the Rx Valet section. I explained that during enrollment, Kenneth was listed as the primary member, and her email (<a style="display:inline;" target="_blank" href="mailto:eastorm2018@gmail.com"><u>eastorm2018@gmail.com</u></a>) was associated with his account.<br>She requested that we remove her email from Kenneth’s account and reassign it to her own profile. I informed her that doing so would stop email communications for Kenneth and could require assistance from our IT department. For the time being, I advised her to log out of Kenneth’s Health Wallet account and attempt to log in using her own SSN. She declined to try this, stating she had attempted it in the past and it didn’t work. I reassured her that I would assist her through the process, but she refused.<br>I reiterated that this issue would not have an immediate resolution and would need to be escalated to IT for further assistance.<br><b>2. Outstanding Lab Bill:</b><br>Elizabeth also mentioned an outstanding bill from LabCorp for blood work performed in January. She said LabCorp was unable to locate "ARM" in their system and could not process the bill. She asked for further guidance.<br>I advised her to update her insurance manually on LabCorp’s website. She stated that no plan information was listed. I explained that her coverage might be under ARM, PHCS, or MultiPlan, and went over the distinctions between them multiple times. She seemed confused and frustrated and did not fully understand the explanation.<br>I offered to transfer her to ARM directly or to reach out to them on her behalf, but the conversation became repetitive. When I asked what she would prefer, she requested that I call LabCorp directly. I did attempt to contact LabCorp, but their billing department was already closed (after 5 PM). <span style="color:rgb(51, 51, 51);">8008456167 billing AC</span><br><br><span><br></span>', 'Concierge', 'Concierge', '2025-09-09 16:02:46', '2025-09-09 16:02:46'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000170609118', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000059281121', 'Dechen Hawk', NULL, '9/9/25<br>Detchen called to follow up on the status of his colonoscopy referral. We conducted a three-way call with the specialty team and Lyric to verify whether the referral had been sent to Denver Health. Stephan, who assisted us during the call, stated that additional information  was needed before the referral could be processed. We are currently awaiting that information from Lyric in order to proceed with scheduling the appointment.<br>Detchen also inquired again about more affordable options for  OCT/glaucoma eye exams. He expressed frustration that no one had followed up with him. I clarified that I have been the person he has been in communication with and reminded him that, in our previous conversation, he had indicated he was planning to move forward with booking the OCT exam using the referral he already had. He acknowledged this but confirmed he is still interested in finding a more affordable option. AC', 'Concierge', 'Concierge', '2025-09-09 15:39:48', '2025-09-09 15:39:48'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000170609097', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000129877009', 'Diana Miller', '9/9/25', 'Diana miller if having a second mammogram and ultrasound tomorrow and wanted to know what the process was incase she needed to open a sharing request AC', 'Concierge', 'Concierge', '2025-09-09 15:33:06', '2025-09-09 15:33:06'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000170609078', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000169656002', 'Karen Sergeant', NULL, 'Karen called wanting assistance finding an affordable dermatologist, i assisted her through the HCBB website and conducted the research together, as well as assisting her in navigating the RX valet benefit in the health wallet app AC', 'Concierge', 'Concierge', '2025-09-09 15:31:24', '2025-09-09 15:31:24'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000170609073', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000168214002', 'Sheri Ottosen', '9/9/25', 'Sheri called because she was looking at the rx coupon and say that it was based of a 30 day estimate(she has a 60 day supply ) and wanted to know if it would affect the final price. I did let her know that i was not able to pre determinate if that was the case, Unitl the pharmacy runs the discount. AC', 'Concierge', 'Concierge', '2025-09-09 15:27:04', '2025-09-09 15:27:04'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000170609068', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000140562002', 'Cynthia Farrell', NULL, '9/9/25<br>Chris is still unable to log into the mpb app to acces his telehealth and IT has not resolved the issue i transfered chris to the lyric scheduling department to to bypass the app for now AC', 'Concierge', 'Concierge', '2025-09-09 15:24:16', '2025-09-09 15:24:16'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000170583273', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000073820131', 'Danielle Lynn', NULL, '9-9-25 I spoke with Rachelle and she is working on the best way to transition Danielle to Zion Direct from MPB. She cancelled with MPB and couldn''t re-enroll with Zion bc it already recognized her as a member. It took her straight to the member portal. So, Rachelle knows who to speak with to push through the cancellation and then to use the link I sent her to keep it tied to MPB for commissions and for me to continue to support her an her Advisor. Rachelle understands what she needs to do to make this happen. She also checked the call records to make sure their Customer Support staff did not encourage Danielle to cancel MPB and just join Zion directly. That''s good news. They are now taking that very seriously and the Customer Service person will get written up and they document if/when that happens and take action.  I''m awaiting Rachelle''s resolution.', 'Wendy Scipione - SR VP National Sales Advisor', 'Wendy Scipione - SR VP National Sales Advisor', '2025-09-09 14:48:35', '2025-09-09 14:48:35'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000170579455', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000166952001', 'Mark Basil', NULL, '09/09/2025<br>Sent cancellation link at request of mark<br>AJ', 'Concierge', 'Concierge', '2025-09-09 14:48:00', '2025-09-09 14:52:42'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000170579450', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000111239002', 'Lois Hurst', NULL, '09/09/2025<br> basic questions about what is covered and i searched if her provdier was in network. it is<br>AJ', 'Concierge', 'Concierge', '2025-09-09 14:47:13', '2025-09-09 14:47:13'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000170579431', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000128863010', 'Angela Agenlian-Neuert', NULL, '09/09/2025<br>Working with Angela personally to assist her with getting her some info on her plan. was having tech issues finding her in e123 and pulling up the account. Also she would like a link to rx quote and A list of covered blood test on preventative care<br>AJ', 'Concierge', 'Concierge', '2025-09-09 14:43:37', '2025-09-09 14:43:37'),
