  ('zcrm_1579374000170579309', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000168214002', 'Sheri Ottosen', NULL, '9/9/25: Sheri called in bc her coupon did not work. I clipped her a new one per request and emailed it over. AM<br><span style="color:rgb(0, 0, 0);background-color:rgb(255, 255, 204);">Armour Thyroid_90mg_60tablets_</span><span style="color:rgb(0, 0, 0);"><b>$60.99</b></span><span style="color:rgb(0, 0, 0);background-color:rgb(255, 255, 204);">_Safeway Pharmacy_9.9.25</span>', 'Concierge', 'Concierge', '2025-09-09 12:08:09', '2025-09-09 12:09:43'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000170579290', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000099203002', 'Todd Muffley', NULL, '9/9/25: Vicki called to ask about benefit cards, eye ware, colonoscopy, mammogram, and wellness checkups with a blood panel. They still haven''t received cards. Put in a request and emailed Dave. Eye ware is not a benefit of plan. <br>The other services are paid for at 100% if using an in-network provider. Guided Vicki on how to search for providers and present for appts. AM', 'Concierge', 'Concierge', '2025-09-09 12:05:13', '2025-09-09 12:05:13'),
