  ('zcrm_1579374000170579148', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000154494001', 'Anita Wasielewski', NULL, '09/09/2025<br>Anita called to ask about colonoscopies being covered when they ordered every three years. We spoke to Lori at ARM together and this will most likely not be under preventative due to the doctor having found a pollup. Now she can use her IUA for the procedure. Also looked into mammograms and checked that every one was in network. She will let us know if she has issues getting anything ordered or paid for <br>AJ', 'Concierge', 'Concierge', '2025-09-09 10:03:53', '2025-09-09 10:03:53'),
