  ('zcrm_1579374000170579129', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000111961002', 'Philip Kendzior', NULL, '9/9/25: Philip''s wife called. They received a bill in the mail for daughter Ava from Planstin. I explained that the MEC vendor was updated and is now through altrisk, informed on what card to present and that they should resubmit the bill. AM', 'Concierge', 'Concierge', '2025-09-09 10:03:07', '2025-09-09 10:03:07'),
