  ('zcrm_1579374000170583174', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000016132018', 'Robert Campbell', NULL, 'Member submitted Change Form to remove children and update primary email address eff 10/1/25.  I will process.', 'Patti Baron', 'Patti Baron', '2025-09-09 09:47:28', '2025-09-09 09:47:28'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000170579124', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000038280209', 'STEVEN FRADIN', NULL, '9/9/25: Reached out to several places to try to find a location where Steve can get a cortisone shot in his IT band. Finally landed on Advent Health in Castle Rock - they could not tell me cash rate. <br>Pain clinics also offer steroid shots for pain but patient must get MRI first ($300-$500) Large joint shot is $110, lower back between $888-2,000. <br><br>Called Steve to let him know I''m still working on researching some options for him. LVM. AM', 'Concierge', 'Concierge', '2025-09-09 09:41:44', '2025-09-10 16:14:07'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000170579116', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000152620020', 'Lidia Paz Mesa', NULL, '9/9/25: Called ARM to check and see if they have a claim on file for Francis'' lab bill - they do not. Emailed member in our thread reiterating to please have lab mail to claims address on card. AM', 'Concierge', 'Concierge', '2025-09-09 09:38:54', '2025-09-09 09:38:54'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000170579111', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000046294019', 'Melany Matheson', NULL, '09/09/2025<br>Spoke with ARm and Melany to get her flu shot paid for when they paid for her husband (dependent) but not hers. <br>Arm told her to send in the receipt for a reimbursement since using the card at the pharmacy is not working. I let ARM know that this is not isolated and there is a problem with people giving their card at the pharmacy, <br>AJ', 'Concierge', 'Concierge', '2025-09-09 09:37:26', '2025-09-09 09:37:26'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000170583156', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000073820131', 'Danielle Lynn', NULL, 'Per Wendy''s note below member had decided to go direct to Zion eff 10/1/25 as she sees no value in the MPB portion of her membership.  I will process.', 'Patti Baron', 'Patti Baron', '2025-09-09 09:25:45', '2025-09-09 09:25:45'),
