  ('zcrm_1579374000170579092', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000168460025', 'Lisa Edmunds', NULL, '9/9/25: Lisa called. She needs to schedule a mamm and find an internist. Showed her radiology assist and the prices available on there as well as offered to do some research to find an internist in her area. Let her know I''d get back to her in the next couple of days. AM', 'Concierge', 'Concierge', '2025-09-09 09:22:58', '2025-09-09 09:22:58'),
