  ('zcrm_1579374000170579055', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000083455010', 'Leron Levy', NULL, '9/9/25: Leron  called needing help finding a specialist. I did a search in PHCS for colon surgeon for a preventive colo as well as primary care dr. Emailed list of proviers from PHCS, link to search page and link for us to help schedule an appt. AM', 'Concierge', 'Concierge', '2025-09-09 08:27:29', '2025-09-09 08:27:29'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000170579046', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000153932105', 'Allison O''Connor', NULL, '9/9/25: Allison LVM wanting an update on her lab/lyric situation. Returned her call. She said that the lyric provider could not add B12 to her order for some reason - that they couldn''t find it in the "system". She said she just needs help on how to navigate this situation and how to have the MEC pay for some of these labs instead of paying the upfront $478 for everything bc she can''t get it much cheaper elsewhere. Let her know we''d give her a call back. AM', 'Concierge', 'Concierge', '2025-09-09 08:09:09', '2025-09-09 08:36:38'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000170593001', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000055816343', 'Mary Ann Harpenau', NULL, '09.09.25:  Received a response from Patti to my inquiry, saying if Jaime stays w/Zion and has no gap in membership he will not lose any of his pre-x time. When he first speaks to Zion he must reference the fat that he was on a membership with his spouse and give them the dates (9/1/20 - 9/30/25). They will be able to bring that info. up and will credit him for that time. When he enrolls he must have a unique email address.  I told Patti they''ve been using Jaime''s email address, so can he use it when he signs up for himself? She responded that at this time, Zion will not accept the same email address as it will overwrite all the history of their membership. JSP<br>Just spoke with Patti. She said she will change the primary email from Jaime''s to Mary Ann''s so Jaime can use his when he enrolls in his new plan.  JSP', 'Joan Phelps', 'Joan Phelps', '2025-09-09 08:04:15', '2025-09-09 10:38:23'),
