  ('zcrm_1579374000170579027', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000107468010', 'Troy Wolfe', NULL, '9/8/25: Autumn called to let us know she is pregnant and wondering how the maternity benefits work with her plan. I explained how it works and connected her to Zion to open sharing request. AM', 'Concierge', 'Concierge', '2025-09-09 07:40:26', '2025-09-09 07:40:26'),
