  ('zcrm_1579374000170579020', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000161803002', 'Alison Tomlinson', NULL, '9/9/25: Sent Alison an email in response to the missed chat from yesterday providing detailed instructions on how August can access the HW app. <br>Later talked to her on the phone and guided her on how to access app. She was confused bc she initially went to ewb portal and MPB app. AM', 'Concierge', 'Concierge', '2025-09-09 07:25:32', '2025-09-09 08:55:20'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000170579013', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000168615016', 'Jeri Roper', NULL, '9/8/25: Geoff called wanting to check if a provider is in network - which they weren''t. I offered to email the list of options over to him that are available and help with finding a dr in PHCS. He''s going to look through and choose one. AM', 'Concierge', 'Concierge', '2025-09-09 07:13:40', '2025-09-09 07:13:40'),
