  ('zcrm_1579374000170572001', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000161803002', 'Alison Tomlinson', 'Zoho SalesIQ chat missed', 'Visit ID : 4368 Question : I would like my app to work for both me and my son who are members. My member ID is 684226133. Ty, Alison Tonlinson', 'MPB Health Member Notification', 'MPB Health Member Notification', '2025-09-08 18:23:18', '2025-09-08 18:23:18'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000170538352', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000152620020', 'Lidia Paz Mesa', NULL, '9/8/25: Lidia called. Her son received a lab bill from wellness check up. From the looks of it, it wasn''t billed to ARM. Offered to check if they have claim in the morning for her. If they don''t, the lab needs to submit bill to ARM - let her know I''d email her back on our thread. AM', 'Concierge', 'Concierge', '2025-09-08 17:40:01', '2025-09-08 17:40:01'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000170538347', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000059281121', 'Dechen Hawk', NULL, '9/8/25: Dechen emailed in showing an email that the Lyric team emailed him, then stating that their Care Coordination Team never did reach out to him like they said they would in the email. I called Lyric - their notes state they reached out last week and again today trying to reach him regarding his referral and advised he reach out tomorrow between 8am-5pm CST. I wrote him back offering to call and facilitate a 3-way to get make sure everything goes smoothly. AM', 'Concierge', 'Concierge', '2025-09-08 17:32:27', '2025-09-08 17:32:27'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000170538326', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000069290256', 'Lynn MacRitchie', NULL, '9/8/25: Emailed Lynn lab quote per request. AM', 'Concierge', 'Concierge', '2025-09-08 17:29:48', '2025-09-08 17:29:48'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000170538305', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000124631253', 'Ilysa Keeley', NULL, '9/8/25: Ilysa called. I explained the most recent option to help get her lab costs down which is scheduling a telehealth appt and getting the order through there. I walked her through logging onto health wallet and starting an appt. AM', 'Concierge', 'Concierge', '2025-09-08 16:58:24', '2025-09-08 16:58:24'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000170538286', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000165569002', 'Yvette Heryford', NULL, '9/8/25: Emailed RX quote per request. AM', 'Concierge', 'Concierge', '2025-09-08 16:47:41', '2025-09-08 16:47:41'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000170538253', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000095912002', 'Teresa Hostutler', NULL, '9/8/25: Teresa called wondering if botox for Migraines is shareable? There''s nothing in the guidelines that indicates otherwise. Suggested she go ahead and open a sharing request for it. <br>She also wanted to know if we can help with finding the best price/facility for blood work for her son? Yes, shared quote request form. AM', 'Concierge', 'Concierge', '2025-09-08 16:32:37', '2025-09-08 16:32:37'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000170538248', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000059964144', 'Christopher Loven', NULL, '9/8/25: Chris called, he gave hospital card he had but they said they went to process and plan wasn''t in effect. (it was planstin). Advised on how to submit sharing request once he receives bill from ER. Also put in a request for a new physical ARM card and helped him log into HW app. AM', 'Concierge', 'Concierge', '2025-09-08 16:23:42', '2025-09-08 16:23:42'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000170538213', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000069290256', 'Lynn MacRitchie', NULL, '9/8/25: Lynn called, just coming from dr. Dr didn''t know what to do about woman''s wellness visit. Advised to have bill submitted from provider. She also asked about best course of action for hormone labs. Suggested she fill out quote request form and emailed over. AM', 'Concierge', 'Concierge', '2025-09-08 16:11:39', '2025-09-08 16:11:39'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000170538208', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000086715002', 'Nancy Krampetz', NULL, '9/8/25: Nancy calle to check and see if her and husband''s providers are in network -her''s was but husband''s was not. Also checked radiology facilities - SimonMed and Banner were both listed. We discussed labs and what is paid for through MEC. AM', 'Concierge', 'Concierge', '2025-09-08 16:04:36', '2025-09-08 16:04:36'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000170538189', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000152338040', 'Yang Rich', NULL, '9/8/25: Yang called to check on:<br>1) Can she see a PA of an in-network provider? I asked their name to look up in PHCS, but she didn''t know. Advised if she can provide me with name and/or NPI, then I can check.<br>2) She called mental health number - but was told there''s a cap of 6 sessions for mental health. Let her know there shouldn''t be a cap, it is at the discretion of therapist and that I''d flag that with mngmnt tomorrow. AM', 'Concierge', 'Concierge', '2025-09-08 16:03:07', '2025-09-08 16:03:07'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000170541026', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000073820131', 'Danielle Lynn', NULL, '9-8-25 Danielle see no value in MPB once she had a Need and was simply referred to Zion to create the Need. She wants to cancel MPB and go with Zion Direct and add the preventive for only $7 more for a few month and then $22 more once she turns 40 in Dec. She will get up to $175 for her preventive office visit for each family member plus a mammogram as she turns 40. She will get telehealth with Zion as well. She doesn''t use or need mental health but gets that with Zion as well. I sent her the cancellation form and re-enrollment link Direct with Zion to proceed.  I asked her to let me know when she''s done and I will make sure her original start date remains in place.', 'Wendy Scipione - SR VP National Sales Advisor', 'Wendy Scipione - SR VP National Sales Advisor', '2025-09-08 15:35:04', '2025-09-08 15:35:04'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000170538170', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000085553002', 'Georgina Worley', NULL, '9/8/25: Georgina called to discuss planstin and arm change, but then had to let me go suddenly. Said she''d call back. AM', 'Concierge', 'Concierge', '2025-09-08 15:29:05', '2025-09-08 15:29:05'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000170538163', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000154974002', 'David Oberg', NULL, '9/8/25: David called to discuss an ER Visit in January, he said he''s finally getting bills and wanting to open a sharing request. I explained that he does not have health sharing through his MPB account - but he was a Zion member and actually in member portal while we were talking. I explained the 6 month deadline to submit and connected him to Zion to discuss options. He said he waiting a long time and let the bills go to collections in order to get the price down, which I then advised him not to do again and a better way is to call immediately to negotiate. We also discussed the benefits on going directly with MPB versus Zion. AM', 'Concierge', 'Concierge', '2025-09-08 15:15:41', '2025-09-08 15:15:41'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000170525199', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000059281121', 'Dechen Hawk', NULL, '9/8/25<br>Sent email to follow up with Dechen and see if he was able to get a referral for his colo AC', 'Concierge', 'Concierge', '2025-09-08 14:59:15', '2025-09-08 14:59:15'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000170525188', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000168462023', 'David Tracht', NULL, '9/8/25<br>Sent email to follow up on rx quote ac', 'Concierge', 'Concierge', '2025-09-08 14:56:40', '2025-09-08 14:56:40'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000170525148', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000099851002', 'Ronald Guerra', NULL, '9/8/25<br>Ronald wanted to know how to acces his mental health benafits directed him to the mpb health App Ac', 'Concierge', 'Concierge', '2025-09-08 14:54:00', '2025-09-08 14:54:00'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000170525143', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000130526354', 'Sondra Blanchard', '9/8/25', 'Sondra wanted to know how she can acces her mental health benefits directed her to the mpbhealth app AC<br><span><br></span>', 'Concierge', 'Concierge', '2025-09-08 14:53:11', '2025-09-08 14:53:11'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000170525138', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000124631253', 'Ilysa Keeley', NULL, '9/8/25<br><br>Llysa called expressing difficulty with getting her labs done. She does not want to use LabCorp due to higher costs, and Quest will not accept her as a self-pay patient. She also mentioned that she does not want to travel to Pennsylvania just to use discounted lab websites.<br>I suggested that she could pay for her labs directly through the Quest Diagnostics website. However, she declined this option due to the additional fee required to obtain a new referral, as she already has one from her current provider.<br>As an alternative, I advised her to connect with Lyric, where a provider can issue her a new referral and potentially assist with accessing discounted rates for LabCorp. Llysa was hesitant to proceed until we could confirm that Lyric can assist clients in New Jersey.<br>Julia followed up with Lyric, and they confirmed that they <b>can</b> assist clients in New Jersey. AC<br><br><span><br></span>', 'Concierge', 'Concierge', '2025-09-08 14:51:04', '2025-09-08 14:51:04'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000170540164', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000071992038', 'Willa Bonzi', NULL, '<span style="">09/08/2025\</span><br><span style="">Questions about the new telehealth</span><br><span style="">Walked her through all the new features</span><br><span style="">AJ   </span>', 'Concierge', 'Concierge', '2025-09-08 14:49:06', '2025-09-08 14:49:06'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000170540159', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000059526010', 'Robin Brenneise', NULL, '09/08/2025\<br>Questions about the new telehealth<br>Walked her through all the new features<br>AJ', 'Concierge', 'Concierge', '2025-09-08 14:48:34', '2025-09-08 14:48:34'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000170540135', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000168214002', 'Sheri Ottosen', NULL, '09/08/2025<br>RX quote questions. explained how to get a quote. sent her the coupon and explained how to get meds<br>AJ', 'Concierge', 'Concierge', '2025-09-08 14:47:01', '2025-09-08 14:47:28'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000170540130', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000104457002', 'Normandie Rainwater', NULL, '09/08/2025<br>helped her find the results to her labs, and assisted her with deciphering the results. Let her know if she had any other questions to call them at lyric so she could speak to her doctor to explain the results<br>AJ', 'Concierge', 'Concierge', '2025-09-08 14:46:25', '2025-09-10 13:56:27'),
