  ('zcrm_1579374000170538158', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000168280025', 'Lynn Nielsen', NULL, '9/8/25: Lynn called wondering when she''ll receive cards - she should have already. Put in a request in ARM portal. She also hasn''t completed WC yet. Sent link to do so. AM', 'Concierge', 'Concierge', '2025-09-08 14:23:14', '2025-09-08 14:23:14'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000170525125', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000109785008', 'Michael Morrison', NULL, '9/8/25<br>Clemson Eye called to check eligbly/prior auth for a catarac surgery adviced the rep the member woulr present as self pay and contact us for further info AC<br><span><br></span>', 'Concierge', 'Concierge', '2025-09-08 13:39:04', '2025-09-08 13:39:04'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000170525120', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000109090013', 'Clinton Sexton', NULL, '9/8/25Dr. Jesse Kulig,<br>Successfully canceled Lisas appointment with Dr. Jesse Kulig, for sep 9:10 am AC', 'Concierge', 'Concierge', '2025-09-08 13:34:19', '2025-09-08 13:34:19'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000170554001', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000055816343', 'Mary Ann Harpenau', NULL, '09.08.25:  Mary Ann called to schedule a meeting with Jaime to finalize the decision on a plan for him and enroll him. He said he''ll be available on Wed., 9/8/25 at 9 a.m. I will set up a Teams call and send him and Mary Ann an invite. Since he won''t need a colonoscopy until he''s 65, he could take the Care + plan but that plan w/Zion is $352/mo., whereas the Premium Care plan with Sedera, which includes colonoscopy, is $299/mo. <br>He''s concerned that if he goes w/Sedera, and if, for some reason, they tell him he has a pre-existing condition he''ll have to wait 1 year for it to be shared. I told him I would check with Zion to make sure they will honor his long-standing membership w/them and not require a waiting period once he changes plans. Texted Mary Ann to ask which email addresses does she want me to use to send the invite for the Teams meeting next week.', 'Joan Phelps', 'Joan Phelps', '2025-09-08 13:28:06', '2025-09-08 13:28:06'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000170521162', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000089065002', 'Susan Fontana', 'New Membership eff 10/1/25', 'Member Only $2500 IUA Premium HSA', 'Patti Baron', 'Patti Baron', '2025-09-08 13:14:59', '2025-09-08 13:14:59'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000170540025', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000161465002', 'Christopher Hatala', NULL, '09/08/2025<br>Called and left a VM on Lydias phone. Explained in the message that chiropractic is not preventative and therefore no network i snecessary. Also let her know that if it is part of a treatment plan she could possibly open a share request in order to get some help with the cost. Also apologized several times for missing her intitial attempt to reach us<br>AJ', 'Concierge', 'Concierge', '2025-09-08 13:13:50', '2025-09-08 13:14:12'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000170540004', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000016068021', 'Ryan Donovan', NULL, '09/08/20258<br>Spoke with Ryan through text. He was having troubles with starting a share request. Gave him number to zion and let him know to reach out with any issues. They would not talk to me at zion due to hippa. Told him we could do a three way if he needs my assistance to guide the phone call to get his answers.<br>AJ', 'Concierge', 'Concierge', '2025-09-08 13:11:39', '2025-09-08 13:11:39'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000170521154', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000089065002', 'Susan Fontana', NULL, 'Member submitted Change Form to remove dependent Julian from membership eff 10/25.  I will process.', 'Patti Baron', 'Patti Baron', '2025-09-08 13:11:15', '2025-09-08 13:11:15'),
