  ('zcrm_1579374000170525101', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000168201002', 'Emily Armstrong', NULL, '9/8/25<br>Emily wants to know how to get reimbursed for her child''s recent appointment. I informed her that if she has not paid for the bill that the provider can submit the bill to the p.o box on the back of the card AC<br><span><br></span>', 'Concierge', 'Concierge', '2025-09-08 12:45:30', '2025-09-08 12:45:30'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000170521131', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000168215001', 'Dianna Knight', NULL, 'Member submitted Change Form to update address to state of WA.  I do not believe that Sedera will allow this change I have a call into advisor and will try to contact Sedera to ask this question.<br>UPDATE:after speaking with Sedera this member can not longer be on the membership since she now lives in the state of WA.  Let Jane know this and followed up with Jane re:status.  If I do not hear I will cancel on Friday (9/19) prior to billing.', 'Patti Baron', 'Patti Baron', '2025-09-08 12:31:28', '2025-09-15 08:15:37'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000170538153', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000003401007', 'Benjamin Lampert II', NULL, '9/8/25: Allison called wanting to know how to access new therapy benefits. Let her through health wallet and how to start the process. AM', 'Concierge', 'Concierge', '2025-09-08 12:28:33', '2025-09-08 12:28:33'),
