  ('zcrm_1579374000170538089', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000038280209', 'STEVEN FRADIN', NULL, '9/8/25: Returned Steven''s call. He''s wanting to get a cortisone shot without paying too much. Offered to do some research for him. It''s for his IT band on left side. He mentioned he has a client who is a PT - Fyzical Therapy and Balance Center - 2 Oakwood Park Plaza, Ste 200. Called there first for cash rate - LVM. Let Steven know I''d get back to him tomorrow. AM', 'Concierge', 'Concierge', '2025-09-08 11:52:49', '2025-09-08 11:52:49'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000170538084', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000160016005', 'Rebecca Carey', NULL, '9/8/25: Rebecca came through chat asking how to speak to virtual dermatologist. Instructed her on how to access through health wallet. AM', 'Concierge', 'Concierge', '2025-09-08 11:47:27', '2025-09-08 11:47:27'),
