  ('zcrm_1579374000170523146', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000168804019', 'Jerry Robbins', NULL, 'Welcome call complete. Vanessa Orozco', 'Concierge', 'Concierge', '2025-09-08 11:31:32', '2025-09-08 11:31:32'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000170525077', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000163684002', 'Massa Lavant', '9/8/25', 'Massa is seeking costly IVF medications. I encouraged her to obtain them through the international pharmacy offered by the Health Wallet app, as IVF medications are generally expensive and discount cards typically do not apply. Although she was initially hesitant to download the app, I advised her that it would be beneficial to explore it herself to make an informed decision.<br>I assisted her with downloading the app, logging in, and navigating the site. Someone from the international pharmacy is expected to reach out to her soon regarding the medication options.<br>Additionally, Massa requested a list of providers. I let her know that I would need some time to research providers who may offer more affordable pricing and will follow up once I have more information. AC', 'Concierge', 'Concierge', '2025-09-08 11:27:53', '2025-09-08 11:28:23'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000170538065', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000124631280', 'Kasey Summerer', NULL, '9/8/25: Kasey called. went into dr last week bc knee giving him issues. suspect he perhaps tore his meniscus and wanted to make sure he is presenting correctly and following the right steps. I walked him through collecting itemized receipts and submitting sharing request. Connected to ZIon to open member portal. AM', 'Concierge', 'Concierge', '2025-09-08 11:26:37', '2025-09-08 11:26:37'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000170521090', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000016132018', 'Robert Campbell', NULL, 'Member called in and told me that she never received the email that was sent to her spouse email.  It is a work email and doesn''t get monitored as it should.  So in addition to removing her dependents she will update that on the Change form.  I will send to her email', 'Patti Baron', 'Patti Baron', '2025-09-08 11:18:10', '2025-09-08 11:18:10'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000170525072', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000162528011', 'Jamie Levit', NULL, '9/8/25<br>Jamie has a obgyn coming up and what to know how to use her plan, I explained regular office visit would be self pay and out of pocket expense AC<br><span><br></span>', 'Concierge', 'Concierge', '2025-09-08 11:17:18', '2025-09-08 11:17:18'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000170538046', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000137251002', 'Llywellyn Jones', NULL, '9/8/25: Emailed Idelia RX coupon per request. See email for details. AM', 'Concierge', 'Concierge', '2025-09-08 11:09:44', '2025-09-08 11:09:44'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000170538037', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000163473002', 'Tammy Chiarelli-Kelling', NULL, '9/8/25: Tammy called about 6 month waiting period. It appears that her advisor has already been in contact with us about this. Let Tammy know I''d call her back once I learned what has been done so far. <br><br>Let Julia know about Tammy''s situation - that she was unaware of these maternity waiting periods when signed up with the plan and neither was Zack. They did express wanting to have a baby during onboarding call to which Vanessa let them know to review guidelines. The sad part is that the guidelines changed to there being a 6 month waiting period starting April 1 - which was their start date. <br><br>I was informed that Zack will be reaching out to Tammy with her options - called to let her know status of situation and to expect a call from him soon. Acelyn was instructed to reach back out to Tammy in a couple of weeks. AM', 'Concierge', 'Concierge', '2025-09-08 10:51:57', '2025-09-08 12:18:31'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000170525064', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000163473002', 'Tammy Chiarelli-Kelling', NULL, '9/8/25<br>Tammy called because she is pregnant, Unfortunately due to the waiting period of six months she is unable to open a sharing request. She wanted us to back date but we will not able to accommodate her with that request AC', 'Concierge', 'Concierge', '2025-09-08 10:50:43', '2025-09-08 10:50:43'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000170538016', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000129964018', 'MAUREEN SMITH', NULL, '9/8/25: Maureen called with questions regarding her annual well woman visit and mamm. The lab didn''t bill the correct PO box or EDI number and claiming she''ll be responsible for a portion of the bill. Same with a portion of the mamm - which was originally sent to Planstin. I recommended just waiting it out until ARM processed everything, and then if for some reason she got a balance bill, to please reach back out to us. Will check back in a few weeks. AM', 'Concierge', 'Concierge', '2025-09-08 10:41:52', '2025-09-08 10:41:52'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000170523104', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000169680002', 'Andrew Chapman', NULL, 'No response. Left a detailed message on vm. Sent email to reschedule welcome call. Vanessa Orozco', 'Concierge', 'Concierge', '2025-09-08 10:40:54', '2025-09-08 10:40:54'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000170538006', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000152575007', 'Dawna Miller', NULL, '9/8/25: Called Dawna to FU and guide her on how to access mental health benefits through MPB App. LVM and email. AM', 'Concierge', 'Concierge', '2025-09-08 10:27:36', '2025-09-08 10:27:36'),
