  ('zcrm_1579374000170525049', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000161465002', 'Christopher Hatala', NULL, '09.08.25 - Received a message from Reba that Lydia did not receive an answer regarding her nomination of provider. Upon research, it looks like <a style="display:inline;" target="_blank" href="https://www.boostnevada.com/meet-the-doctors/"><u>Meet The Doctors | Chiropractors Reno, NV - Boost Integrated Medical Center</u></a> is a wellness chiropractic center that may not fall under preventive care. Adam will reach out to educate the member. JA', 'MPB Health Member Notification', 'MPB Health Member Notification', '2025-09-08 09:17:31', '2025-09-08 09:17:31'),
