  ('zcrm_1579374000170525039', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000152323002', 'Oranee Daniels', NULL, '9/5/25<br>shutter health called for eligibility for a colonoscopy. I informed the rep that if this is a preventative procedure then it would be covered and that all codes must be preventative. That is when they informed me the de diagnosis code was polyp removal/diagnostic so this will not be covered AC<br>', 'Concierge', 'Concierge', '2025-09-08 08:23:56', '2025-09-08 08:23:56'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000170525020', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000043830088', 'Randal Warwick', NULL, '09.08.25 Randy reached out regarding his wifes lab bill that was not paid. Checked the ARM portal and no claims were submitted. Advised to call the hospital and provide ARM information for billing. JA', 'MPB Health Member Notification', 'MPB Health Member Notification', '2025-09-08 08:14:47', '2025-09-08 08:14:47'),
