  ('zcrm_1579374000170521011', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000130451011', 'William Siskey', NULL, 'Member submitted Change From to add newborn to membership eff 8/30/25.  I will process.', 'Patti Baron', 'Patti Baron', '2025-09-08 08:11:46', '2025-09-08 08:11:46'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000170526004', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000079686002', 'Ronald Flake', NULL, 'Member''s Dependent Toby submitted Dependent Over 18 Form to update his email and phone.  I will process', 'Michele R', 'Michele R', '2025-09-08 08:04:53', '2025-09-08 08:04:53'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000170525001', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000122615027', 'Sean Conroy', NULL, '09.08.25 - Sally called because she received a lab bill for her daughters blood work. Upon checking the ARM member portal, I did not see anything there and suggested to call the lab and present the insurance information for billing. JA', 'MPB Health Member Notification', 'MPB Health Member Notification', '2025-09-08 07:59:15', '2025-09-08 07:59:15'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000170523013', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000169206007', 'Sharon McCann', NULL, 'Welcome call complete. Vanessa Orozco', 'Concierge', 'Concierge', '2025-09-08 07:57:46', '2025-09-08 07:57:46'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000170519001', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000130562001', 'Philip Ender', NULL, '09.08.25 Esther reached out because the daughter needs to see an ophthalmologist. Advised that routine vision is not covered and explained MCS in the event of an illness or an injury. JA', 'MPB Health Member Notification', 'MPB Health Member Notification', '2025-09-08 07:42:37', '2025-09-08 07:42:37'),
