  ('zcrm_1579374000170475416', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000080021001', 'Amy Fowler', NULL, '09/08/2025<br>Called to return her VM, AMy had questions about how to get prices on RX so i led her to the RX quote section. Then she wanted help finding a Dermatologist so i helped her find one on the bluebook.<br>AJ', 'Concierge', 'Concierge', '2025-09-08 07:11:25', '2025-09-08 07:11:25'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000170516009', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000154911001', 'Brandie Hinton', NULL, 'Member submitted Dependent Over 18 Form.  I will process.', 'Michele R', 'Michele R', '2025-09-08 07:11:05', '2025-09-08 07:11:05'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000170516001', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000170510002', 'Zeng Zhu', 'Member & Family $5000 IUA Secure HSA Eff 10/25', NULL, 'Michele R', 'Michele R', '2025-09-08 06:50:06', '2025-09-08 06:50:06'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000170503053', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000109090013', 'Clinton Sexton', NULL, '9/6/25<br>Lisa called earlier for an update regarding her wellness check appointment. I confirmed that it had been booked and was preparing to send her the provider information. During our conversation, she asked whether the appointment was scheduled in Minnesota, where she is currently residing. I apologized for the oversight and began assisting her with booking a provider in Minnesota instead.<br>Lisa was particular about the provider selection—either the locations were too far, or she preferred to choose someone from the PHCS list. I contacted several providers she selected, but none were in-network.<br>To find a workable solution, I offered to schedule the appointment with her OB-GYN, who is also equipped to perform labs and a wellness check. However, when I called Metro Partners (her OB-GYN’s office), they informed me that Lisa had already completed her wellness check, labs, and pap smear.<br>I then called ARM to verify, and they confirmed that Lisa received those services on <b>July 3rd</b>.<br>I attempted to call Lisa back to inform her that she has already completed her wellness check, and there is no need to schedule another appointment. If she still chooses to proceed, it will be considered <b>out-of-pocket</b>.<br>—AC', 'Concierge', 'Concierge', '2025-09-06 11:33:43', '2025-09-06 11:33:43'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000170475381', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000119158002', 'Edward Magee', NULL, '09/05/2025<br>Called with questions about preventative care. Explained how that works and how to handle billing<br>AJ', 'Concierge', 'Concierge', '2025-09-05 14:39:47', '2025-09-05 14:39:47'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000170475362', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000159254002', 'Marcelle McGee', NULL, '09/05/2025<br>Called to see what would and would not be covered for an upcoming procedure. I explained everything related can go under one IUA. She was worried about high cost. I forwarded her to Sedera because she wanted to ask if they still did 2nd opinion and if she could ask them if they would take care of the high bill. let her know to reach out with any troubles or if she still has questions\<br>AJ', 'Concierge', 'Concierge', '2025-09-05 14:37:59', '2025-09-05 14:37:59'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000170475343', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000164387002', 'Karl Bowers', NULL, '09/05/2025<br>Sophia called and asked about preventative care. I explained how it all works and reminded her my direct line for her to call me with any issues at all<br>AJ', 'Concierge', 'Concierge', '2025-09-05 14:35:19', '2025-09-05 14:35:19'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000170475322', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000168397002', 'Yvonne Hawkins', NULL, '<span style="color:rgb(51, 51, 51);">09/05/2025</span><br><span style="color:rgb(51, 51, 51);">Sent email to f.u after issues with telehealth. Let them know what lyric said and to reach out so we can help with anything in the future.</span><br><span style="color:rgb(51, 51, 51);">AJ</span>', 'Concierge', 'Concierge', '2025-09-05 14:33:01', '2025-09-05 14:33:01'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000170475301', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000120413002', 'Christina Mullaney', NULL, '09/05/2025<br>Sent email to f.u after issues with telehealth. Let them know what lyric said and to reach out so we can help with anything in the future.<br>AJ', 'Concierge', 'Concierge', '2025-09-05 14:32:15', '2025-09-05 14:32:15'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000170475264', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000119080002', 'Drew Workman', NULL, '09/05/2025<br>Sent f/u text to see if they still need assistance with bills<br>AJ', 'Concierge', 'Concierge', '2025-09-05 13:36:17', '2025-09-05 13:36:17'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000170503034', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000166711002', 'Natalie Bluhm', NULL, '9/5/25<br>Natalie has a pending bill for her physical and has no idea how to get it paid, I advised her that she should request her provider to submit the bills to the p.o box on the back of the card AC', 'Concierge', 'Concierge', '2025-09-05 13:30:55', '2025-09-05 13:30:55'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000170503029', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000134444002', 'Bonnie Nkrumah', NULL, '9/5/25<br>Bonnie called wanting a refresher on how her plan works, I went over the basics she was interested on perhaps switching to a plan that has preventative care. I briefly went over some of out other plans like the secure hsa and advised her to contact her health advisor so they can go over what better fits her needs AC', 'Concierge', 'Concierge', '2025-09-05 13:29:20', '2025-09-05 13:29:20'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000170503024', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000103921002', 'John Greene', NULL, '9/5/25<br>Received a call for Dave from ARM to ask if this member was still active on our end. It showed inactive on their end John called them to see why a bill was not covered. <br><span><br></span>Later this day John called confused asking why he did not have preventative coverage I explained to him that he sent in a request from to change his plan Ac', 'Concierge', 'Concierge', '2025-09-05 13:27:15', '2025-09-05 13:27:15'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000170475237', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000123624010', 'Heli Ananda', NULL, '09/05/2025<br>Ran Rx quote<br><ul style="list-style-type:disc;list-style-position:inside;"><li style="list-style-image:none;"><p style="display:inline;"><span style="color:rgb(17, 17, 17);font-weight:normal;font-style:normal;">Estradiol: Walgreens = $145.15 (48- twice weekly patches)</span></p></li></ul><span style="color:rgb(17, 17, 17);">AJ</span>', 'Concierge', 'Concierge', '2025-09-05 13:24:54', '2025-09-05 13:24:54'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000170503003', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000159254002', 'Marcelle McGee', NULL, '9/5/25<br>Marcelle called wanting to know if a D/C would be covred since there are muriple bills involved witha procedure like this. I took a quick look at the guidliness and adviced her to request a treatment plan from the provider and upload to sedera so she can they can provide her with a more definative answer AC', 'Concierge', 'Concierge', '2025-09-05 13:24:13', '2025-09-05 13:24:13'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000170505001', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000038689003', 'Eric Lemasters', NULL, '9-5-25 Eric and family are moving to Ireland permanently and plan to cancel for Oct. 1st, 2025!  He''s been happy with the services but will get some coverage over there.', 'Wendy Scipione - SR VP National Sales Advisor', 'Wendy Scipione - SR VP National Sales Advisor', '2025-09-05 13:15:22', '2025-09-05 13:15:22'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000170477128', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000079912017', 'Stephen Padwe', NULL, '9/5/25: Stephen called and explaining that he got sick earlier in year - tongue inflammation, didn''t think it would turn into anything, but has now turned into more than 1K. Advised him on how to navigate to Zion member portal and begin sharing request. Connected to Zion so he could ask about an older request. AM', 'Concierge', 'Concierge', '2025-09-05 11:27:35', '2025-09-05 11:27:35'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000170475230', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000079686002', 'Ronald Flake', NULL, '09/05/2025<br>Ron and toby called when they had troubles logging toby in for telehealth into the health wallet. I sent toby the form to add depenedents info and will reach out after he does it to see if that helped. <br>AJ', 'Concierge', 'Concierge', '2025-09-05 11:21:22', '2025-09-05 11:21:22'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000170475220', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000155097001', 'Rosanne Garza', NULL, 'Spoke to member she needs to reschedule welcome call refresher once again. Look back at notes. Sent an email to do so. Vanessa Orozco', 'Concierge', 'Concierge', '2025-09-05 11:03:55', '2025-09-05 11:05:13'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000170475215', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000169741002', 'Joyce Throgmorton', NULL, 'Welcome call complete. Vanessa Orozco', 'Concierge', 'Concierge', '2025-09-05 10:55:58', '2025-09-05 10:55:58'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000170477109', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000128543002', 'Eugene Small', NULL, '9/5/25: Roi called wondering how the provider needs to put ARM in system. I advised that not knowing what their system looked like - what the provider will likely recognize is the PHCS network or Multiplan, but at the end of the day, if the provider is contracted in network, they can also mail the claim to address on card. AM', 'Concierge', 'Concierge', '2025-09-05 10:29:06', '2025-09-05 10:29:06'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000170487014', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000106027002', 'Eileen Fagan', NULL, 'Member left voice message after hours on 9/4 regarding canceling her membership as of 10/1 due to obtaining other insurance.  I called her back and left a voice message to call back.', 'Michele R', 'Michele R', '2025-09-05 10:16:02', '2025-09-05 10:16:02'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000170475169', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000169957016', 'Janet Rabe-Meyer', NULL, 'Spoke to member she needed to reschedule welcome call for Monday,  September 15th at 11:30 am. Vanessa Orozco', 'Concierge', 'Concierge', '2025-09-05 09:52:03', '2025-09-05 09:52:03'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000170487009', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000134444002', 'Bonnie Nkrumah', NULL, 'Memer called in to receive a quote about adding her husband to membership.  Leonardo to call her back to review.', 'Michele R', 'Michele R', '2025-09-05 09:40:15', '2025-09-05 09:40:15'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000170475149', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000169957016', 'Janet Rabe-Meyer', NULL, 'No response. Left a detailed message on vm. Sent email to reschedule the welcome call. Vanessa Orozco', 'Concierge', 'Concierge', '2025-09-05 09:34:35', '2025-09-05 09:34:35'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000170475130', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000079996013', 'Justin Barney', NULL, '09/05/2025<br>Attempted calling but call did not connect. Sent an email informing member that we only received the change form to remove the child and did not have a cancellation form on file. Sent the link to the cancel form for them to fill out and submit,<br>AJ', 'Concierge', 'Concierge', '2025-09-05 09:19:18', '2025-09-05 09:19:18'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000170493001', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000079996013', 'Justin Barney', NULL, '09.05.25 Received message from Planstin that Lori contacted them stating the whole membership was cancelled. Confirmed Patti''s message below and instructed Adam to reach out to the member for clarification and send a cancellation form if necessary. JA', 'MPB Health Member Notification', 'MPB Health Member Notification', '2025-09-05 09:12:55', '2025-09-05 09:12:55'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000170477104', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000169913008', 'Regan Juhl', NULL, '9/5/25: Regan called needing to be transferred over to Lyric bc she recently missed the call. AM', 'Concierge', 'Concierge', '2025-09-05 09:08:22', '2025-09-05 09:08:22'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000170475119', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000169913008', 'Regan Juhl', NULL, 'No response. Left a detailed message on vm. Sent an email to reschedule welcome call. Vanessa Orozco', 'Concierge', 'Concierge', '2025-09-05 09:06:16', '2025-09-05 09:06:16'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000170477096', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000153327002', 'Rachel Klobucher', NULL, '9/5/25: Still no word back from Lori about Rachel''s bill. Sent her another email checking on it. AM', 'Concierge', 'Concierge', '2025-09-05 08:56:10', '2025-09-05 08:56:10'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000170477088', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000153058003', 'James Longmire', NULL, '9/5/25: Sent FU email asking if Jim was able to get colo appt sched and offered help in setting appt. AM', 'Concierge', 'Concierge', '2025-09-05 08:52:42', '2025-09-05 08:52:42'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000170475104', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000054641074', 'Kerek Swanson', NULL, 'Welcome call complete. Submitted Non Mec telehealth transition form and sent information over to Julia. Updated his correct birthdate and member also filled out membership change form. Vanessa Orozco', 'Concierge', 'Concierge', '2025-09-05 08:46:11', '2025-09-05 14:06:46'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000170477064', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000011740100', 'Rossana Johnston', NULL, '9/5/25: Called to FU with Rossana to make sure provider billed ARM for her. LVM. AM', 'Concierge', 'Concierge', '2025-09-05 08:27:53', '2025-09-05 08:27:53'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000170487001', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000016411196', 'Jeremy Stollings', NULL, 'Member''s spouse Jennifer left a voicemail after hours to ensure the payment is being drafted from the correct account, as she recently changed it.  I called her back and left a voice message to call me back to review. (green side)<br>9/9-Member''spouse Jennifer returned my call and left a voice message.  I called her back to review that the payment update was processed on 8/25 and that going forward her payments will be drafted from that account that was changed.  She confirmed that was correct.', 'Michele R', 'Michele R', '2025-09-05 08:22:29', '2025-09-09 09:08:38'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000170475075', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000169459001', 'David Willis', NULL, 'Welcome call complete. Vanessa Orozco', 'Concierge', 'Concierge', '2025-09-05 08:05:08', '2025-09-05 08:05:08'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000170477039', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000166776002', 'Raymond Urciuoli', NULL, '9/4/25: Ray emailed in again asking how his therapist can join lyric. Provided info from original email with instructions. AM', 'Concierge', 'Concierge', '2025-09-05 08:03:19', '2025-09-05 08:03:19'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000170475063', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000168215001', 'Dianna Knight', NULL, 'Welcome call complete. Updated address and email on file. Member also submitted membership change form. Vanessa Orozco', 'Concierge', 'Concierge', '2025-09-05 08:02:28', '2025-09-05 08:02:28'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000170477020', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000077918128', 'Kimber Eastman', NULL, '9/5/25: Kimber emailed me back letting me know that her address was different than what we have (which would explain why she is still not getting her cards). Sent her update form and let her know I''d have ARM resend once update is complete. AM', 'Concierge', 'Concierge', '2025-09-05 07:57:51', '2025-09-05 07:57:51'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000170477015', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000152575007', 'Dawna Miller', NULL, '9/5/25: Dawna called needing to access mental health benefits. Filled out transition form and lvm letting her know it would take about 24 hours - to resolve. Set task to reach back out on Monday. AM', 'Concierge', 'Concierge', '2025-09-05 07:53:22', '2025-09-05 07:53:22'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000170475006', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000152311057', 'Daniel Richardson', NULL, 'Welcome call complete. Vanessa Orozco', 'Concierge', 'Concierge', '2025-09-05 07:25:59', '2025-09-05 07:25:59'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000170471015', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000170461002', 'Adam Rowe', 'Member Only $1000 IUA Care Plus Eff 10/25', NULL, 'Michele R', 'Michele R', '2025-09-05 07:04:31', '2025-09-05 07:04:31'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000170471001', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000170446023', 'Elena Bensonoff', NULL, '9/5-confirmed with Wendy that the original start date was 11/1 but they want it changed to 10/1.  I will update it in CRM and A123.', 'Michele R', 'Michele R', '2025-09-05 06:51:31', '2025-09-05 06:58:48'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000170458045', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000170461002', 'Adam Rowe', NULL, '9-4-25 Adam is a member of WWSRA. He just lost his ins from his other job. He''s a W2 employee. He doesn''t no his annual wellness screenings. Care+ is the most affordable option for his age. He has no pre-x, no meds, no tobacco. He snowboard and skareboards. Those are his biggest concerns. He chose Care+ $1000/$273, I waived the $100 as WWSRA member and he knows of the $25 annual fee. He watched the video and seemed to understand it well. He''s all set for an Oct. 1st start date.', 'Wendy Scipione - SR VP National Sales Advisor', 'Wendy Scipione - SR VP National Sales Advisor', '2025-09-04 15:27:11', '2025-09-04 15:27:11'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000170458040', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000099710012', 'Shane Lebsack', NULL, '9-4-25 Linda is aging into Medicare in Oct and I sent her instructions to remove herself. Shane is the primary and can keep the membership intact.', 'Wendy Scipione - SR VP National Sales Advisor', 'Wendy Scipione - SR VP National Sales Advisor', '2025-09-04 15:23:45', '2025-09-04 15:23:45'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000170443040', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000011610497', 'Adam Burstein', NULL, '9/4/25<br><br>Allison called upset that her primary provider was no longer in-network and wanted to confirm that her mammogram scheduled for tomorrow would be covered. I checked the UCHealth website and confirmed that they are listed under the PHCS network, so I assured her it should be covered.<br>She also requested assistance with reimbursement for her wellness check from today. I advised her to obtain an itemized bill from her provider, including the CPT code, so we can initiate the reimbursement process.<br>– AC<br><span><br></span>', 'Concierge', 'Concierge', '2025-09-04 15:18:45', '2025-09-04 15:18:45'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000170443035', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000153932105', 'Allison O''Connor', NULL, '9/4/25<br>Allison called after a recent virtual consultation with a Lyric provider. The provider requested a referral for specific labs, but when she returned to the app, the lab orders were missing. I transferred her to the Lyric department for assistance.<br>She later called back stating that Lyric told her they couldn’t help contact the provider to add the missing labs. I asked her to email us the list of the pending labs, and let her know we would forward them to Lyric on her behalf. AC', 'Concierge', 'Concierge', '2025-09-04 15:16:20', '2025-09-04 15:16:20'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000170443030', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000168615016', 'Jeri Roper', NULL, '9/4/25<br>Jeri and his wife wanted to know if we could assist them with finding a holistic provider for their needs, I advised them to send us an email with very precise information on their need and we can do the research AC<br><span><br></span>', 'Concierge', 'Concierge', '2025-09-04 15:12:19', '2025-09-04 15:12:19'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000170443025', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000120922012', 'Kaitlyn Kirkham', NULL, '9/4/25<br>Responded to Kaitlins email and provided the link to the health wallet app I also called and she didnot responde I also left her a vm explaing we no longer use ciruss md AC', 'Concierge', 'Concierge', '2025-09-04 15:11:00', '2025-09-04 15:11:00'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000170443020', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000109090013', 'Clinton Sexton', NULL, '9/4/25<br>Scheduled a wellness check for Lisa at 10am on September 9th with Dr. Jesse Kulig, DO AC', 'Concierge', 'Concierge', '2025-09-04 15:02:26', '2025-09-04 15:02:26'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000170445185', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000120922012', 'Kaitlyn Kirkham', NULL, '09/04/2025<br>Called for telehealth since Cirrus was not working. Explained how we switched to the health wallet. <br>AJ', 'Concierge', 'Concierge', '2025-09-04 14:40:32', '2025-09-04 14:40:32'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000170445164', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000168271008', 'Ekue Deganus', NULL, '09/04/2025<br>Called elyona and she wants proof of membership for her school, got her email and sent it to her<br>AJ', 'Concierge', 'Concierge', '2025-09-04 14:34:09', '2025-09-04 14:34:09'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000170458035', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000061255207', 'Rachel Martin', NULL, '9-4-25 Calling Rachel Martin to introduce myself. JC gave me the information on why they both wish for the change of Advisor. They are both in agreement. I will take it from here.', 'Wendy Scipione - SR VP National Sales Advisor', 'Wendy Scipione - SR VP National Sales Advisor', '2025-09-04 14:31:55', '2025-09-04 14:31:55'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000170445145', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000098138001', 'Barbara Rickford', NULL, '09/04/2025<br>Planstin called because she called them. Will call barbars to explain planstin/ARM switch<br>\AJ', 'Concierge', 'Concierge', '2025-09-04 14:28:25', '2025-09-04 14:28:25'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000170445126', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000156022024', 'Mary Baruch', NULL, '09/04/2025<br>Called to start share request. Sent her to Sedera to open her portal and get the walk through of submitting bills<br>AJ', 'Concierge', 'Concierge', '2025-09-04 14:26:52', '2025-09-04 14:26:52'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000170445121', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000129966020', 'Abigaiel Dalke', NULL, '09/04/2025<br>Abigail called to make sure she could still submit needs to an open need that started last year. Let her know they usually give a year from the last treatment<br>AJ', 'Concierge', 'Concierge', '2025-09-04 14:25:45', '2025-09-04 14:25:45'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000170445102', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000159677037', 'Stacy Otis', NULL, '09/04/2025<br>Spoke to Stacy and helped her understand how her membership and preventative care works. He;ped her find providers to get appointment to get colo<br>AJ', 'Concierge', 'Concierge', '2025-09-04 14:23:37', '2025-09-04 14:23:37'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000170458030', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000155863141', 'Lynn Schulte', NULL, '9-4-25 Lynn called to understand how to submit for reimbursement for eye exam, pharmacy and acu. I sent her the HAB brochure and went over it with her again. She never dropped her son and it paying $200 a month. She was thinking that she should cancel altogether since she can''t remove her son. But, I showed her everything that she getting with it, she will keep it and submit for dental cleanings, gym membership, eye exam and she prefers a thermogram which isn''t included in Premium Care. She will try to submit a vitamin D lab for $70 and may do some of the other labs. She''s a health practitioner and can get labs at wholesale prices I think. She was happy to understand all that she''s paying for and will make use of the benefits and start submitting for reimbursements now. All set!', 'Wendy Scipione - SR VP National Sales Advisor', 'Wendy Scipione - SR VP National Sales Advisor', '2025-09-04 14:01:29', '2025-09-04 14:01:29'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000170418010', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000149209408', 'Mark Newberg', 'Phone numbers', 'Legacy Patient Business Services (karen) - 503-413-4048<br>Oregon Medicaid Line: 1-800-699-9075 (customer service)<br>Oregon anasthesiaology group(billing) - 503-972-7103<br>vancouver clinic <span style="color:rgb(35, 35, 35);background-color:rgb(246, 246, 246);"><b>Accounts:</b></span><span style="color:rgb(35, 35, 35);background-color:rgb(246, 246, 246);"> </span><a style="color:rgb(35, 35, 35);display:inline;background-color:rgb(246, 246, 246);" target="_blank" href="tel:360-397-4040"><b><u>360-397-4040</u></b></a>', 'Tupac Manzanarez', 'Tupac Manzanarez', '2025-09-04 13:49:28', '2025-09-04 13:49:28'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000170458025', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000170446023', 'Elena Bensonoff', NULL, '9-4-25 Elena and Alexandro joined for Oct. 1st. They decided to start Oct instead of Nov. They chose Premium Care $1500/$532, $125/$25.  They chose $1500 since they never go to the doctor. They seem to have a good understanding of it. I explained it to Alexandro this call as well. They don''t have any pre-x and they set the Welcome Call for Oct. 1st. They tried to download the app and set up the account but the system wasn''t accpeting them yet. I told them to wait until the Welcome Call to complete it since it takes time to set it up in the syetem. They are all set!', 'Wendy Scipione - SR VP National Sales Advisor', 'Wendy Scipione - SR VP National Sales Advisor', '2025-09-04 13:40:56', '2025-09-04 13:40:56'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000170411069', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000170446023', 'Elena Bensonoff', 'Member & Spouse $1500 IUA Premium Care Eff 10/25', NULL, 'Michele R', 'Michele R', '2025-09-04 13:40:30', '2025-09-05 06:51:54');
INSERT INTO zoho_import.notes ("note_record_id", "person_type", "person_record_id", "person_name", "note_title", "note_content", "note_owner", "created_by", "created_time", "modified_time") VALUES
  ('zcrm_1579374000170443015', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000089149002', 'Daniel Connelly', NULL, '9/4/25<br>Cynthia called to inquire about coverage for a <b>Cologuard test</b> as well as a <b>regular colonoscopy</b>. She also wanted to know whether she would be responsible for any costs associated with these procedures.<br>I informed her that:<br><ul style="list-style-type:disc;list-style-position:inside;"><li style="list-style-image:none;"><p style="display:inline;"><span style="color:rgb(51, 51, 51);font-style:normal;"><b>Cologuard</b></span><span style="color:rgb(51, 51, 51);font-weight:normal;font-style:normal;"> is  covered as a preventive screening </span></p></li><li style="list-style-image:none;"><p style="display:inline;"><span style="color:rgb(51, 51, 51);font-weight:normal;font-style:normal;">A </span><span style="color:rgb(51, 51, 51);font-style:normal;"><b>regular colonoscopy</b></span><span style="color:rgb(51, 51, 51);font-weight:normal;font-style:normal;"> used as a screening is usually covered as preventive as well.</span></p></li><li style="list-style-image:none;"><p style="display:inline;"><span style="color:rgb(51, 51, 51);font-weight:normal;font-style:normal;">However, </span><span style="color:rgb(51, 51, 51);font-style:normal;"><b>if polyps are found and removed during the colonoscopy</b></span><span style="color:rgb(51, 51, 51);font-weight:normal;font-style:normal;">, it may be billed as a diagnostic procedure, and </span><span style="color:rgb(51, 51, 51);font-style:normal;"><b>she would be responsible</b></span><span style="color:rgb(51, 51, 51);font-weight:normal;font-style:normal;"> for that portion of the cost. AC</span></p></li></ul>', 'Concierge', 'Concierge', '2025-09-04 13:21:53', '2025-09-04 13:21:53'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000170418005', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000149209408', 'Mark Newberg', NULL, 'legacy salmon creek hospital(er to icu), Vancouver clinic, critical care pathology biopsy, (Oregon Health Plan medicaid) start date april 1st. admitted into hospital 21st, biopsy done 23rd (vancouver clinic - maybe where specimin sent) until 27th , oregon anasthesiology group(2800 anathesia bill for biopsy june 23rd,  preliminary blood testing - quest diagnostic', 'Tupac Manzanarez', 'Tupac Manzanarez', '2025-09-04 13:18:42', '2025-09-04 13:18:42'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000170443003', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000109090013', 'Clinton Sexton', NULL, '9/4/25<br>Sent email so we can assist her with booking an appoitment AC', 'Concierge', 'Concierge', '2025-09-04 12:30:51', '2025-09-04 12:30:51'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000170411061', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000170439002', 'Raymond Balgie', 'Member & Spouse $1000 IUA Premium HSA Eff 10/25', NULL, 'Michele R', 'Michele R', '2025-09-04 12:24:34', '2025-09-04 12:24:34'),
