  ('zcrm_1579374000170416128', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000153947002', 'Kyle Taylor', NULL, '9/4/25: Ginal called needing help finding an orthopedist for her husband. We looked at options in HCBB to get her started. All the ones around her were in the green. AM', 'Concierge', 'Concierge', '2025-09-04 11:45:03', '2025-09-04 11:45:03'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000170411033', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000153932019', 'Cora Reynolds', NULL, 'Member submitted payment update.  I will process.', 'Michele R', 'Michele R', '2025-09-04 11:41:25', '2025-09-04 11:41:25'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000170445001', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000167582017', 'Zoe Patana-O''Keefe', NULL, '09/04/2025<br>Zoe emailed info mailbox trying to get login for husband and mental health access. I gave her the transition link to switch to lyric for telehealth and that would give her and her husband individual logins that i will assist her with after the transition.<br>AJ', 'Concierge', 'Concierge', '2025-09-04 11:35:37', '2025-09-04 14:21:36'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000170416120', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000011610497', 'Adam Burstein', NULL, '9/4/25: Allyson called, very irritated. She''s at her doctor - who she''s been seeing for many years and was just informed that Dr. Erica Liesmacki is no longer in network. She said she chose this plan bc her dr is in-network. I called the PHCS provider search and Liesmaki is not showing in PHCS. Called Allyson back and LVM explaining this unfortunate news and that it is the doctor''s choice on what networks they participate in and it may be worth having the discussion with the provider directly. AM', 'Concierge', 'Concierge', '2025-09-04 11:26:39', '2025-09-04 11:27:11'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000170424005', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000159710227', 'Jane Kassel', NULL, '09.04.25 Jane needed access to Virtual Mental Health and needed to transition through Lyric. Confirmed with Lyric that she has access, left her vm instructions and a text on how to proceed. JA', 'MPB Health Member Notification', 'MPB Health Member Notification', '2025-09-04 11:25:20', '2025-09-04 11:25:20'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000170411022', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000167582001', 'Rodney Spangler', NULL, 'Member &amp; Family $1000 IUA Premium HSA Eff 10/25', 'Michele R', 'Michele R', '2025-09-04 11:22:13', '2025-09-04 11:22:41'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000170409296', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000169649002', 'Angeline McLean', NULL, 'No response. Left a detailed message on vm. Sent email to reschedule welcome call. Vanessa Orozco', 'Concierge', 'Concierge', '2025-09-04 11:03:47', '2025-09-04 11:03:47'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000170409281', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000153932019', 'Cora Reynolds', NULL, 'Welcome call refresher complete. Vanessa Orozco', 'Concierge', 'Concierge', '2025-09-04 10:57:16', '2025-09-04 10:57:16'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000170416110', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000169950023', 'Michelle Maziar', NULL, '9/4/25: Michelle Maziar called wanting some clarification regarding her plan. We discussed the IUA, when to submit bills, how Zion pays out, therapeutic treatment, and mental health benefits. AM', 'Concierge', 'Concierge', '2025-09-04 10:53:06', '2025-09-04 10:53:06'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000170420081', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000057125429', 'John Smieszek', NULL, '9/4 /25<br>Foothill Sports Medicine and Rehabilitation called to check eligibility for Marley. I informed Don that the member would have to present as self pay and contact us after for further assistance AC', 'Concierge', 'Concierge', '2025-09-04 10:17:56', '2025-09-04 10:17:56'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000170409254', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000169940023', 'Nathan Erickson', NULL, 'Welcome call complete. Vanessa Orozco', 'Concierge', 'Concierge', '2025-09-04 10:04:10', '2025-09-04 10:05:05'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000170409233', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000168804002', 'James Vardas', NULL, 'Welcome call complete. Vanessa Orozco', 'Concierge', 'Concierge', '2025-09-04 09:54:20', '2025-09-04 09:54:20'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000170416101', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000140542018', 'Pamela Roble', NULL, '9/4/25: Pam received a weird call from MPB stating please stay on the line for an important message and then line went dead. I let her know it wasn''t anything I''m aware of. AM', 'Concierge', 'Concierge', '2025-09-04 09:54:16', '2025-09-04 09:54:16'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000170416082', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000011740100', 'Rossana Johnston', NULL, '9/4/25: Rossana called bc her provider said she has to be self pay bc they cannot find Altrisk in their computer system. I explained that as long as the provider is in PHCS network, all they need to do is submit the claim to the address on the back of her card but to verify eligbility first. Also offered, as a worst case scenario, if they refuse to bill - then call me back and we''ll help facilitate a reimbursement. AM', 'Concierge', 'Concierge', '2025-09-04 09:38:04', '2025-09-04 09:38:04'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000170420068', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000014679198', 'Kari Rosckowff', NULL, '9/4/25<br>Kari called to see if kabs for her hormones are covered, i informed her that only laabs for her wellness check are covered sent her via email the lab request form Ac', 'Concierge', 'Concierge', '2025-09-04 09:21:01', '2025-09-04 09:21:56'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000170420063', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000061255207', 'Rachel Martin', NULL, 'Updated Advisor/Producer from Jill Clark to Wendy Scipione. KG', 'Accounting Office', 'Accounting Office', '2025-09-04 09:04:23', '2025-09-04 09:04:23'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000170416074', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000107468010', 'Troy Wolfe', NULL, '9/4/25: Troy called asking how wife can access HW. Advised for her to simply log in with social. He also asked if his daughter needs to go off plan - she''s 21 - no, she can stay on till 26. AM', 'Concierge', 'Concierge', '2025-09-04 08:59:36', '2025-09-04 08:59:36'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000170409207', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000166781002', 'David Meyer', NULL, 'Welcome call complete. Vanessa Orozco', 'Concierge', 'Concierge', '2025-09-04 08:58:04', '2025-09-04 08:58:04'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000170420037', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000141685002', 'Laura Murtha', NULL, '9/4/25<br>Called Laura to let her know we fixed her DOB on the health wallet app AC', 'Concierge', 'Concierge', '2025-09-04 08:55:27', '2025-09-04 08:55:42'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000170420032', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000125144014', 'Edward Hartman', NULL, '9/4/25<br>Edward called regarding his 8:00 AM appointment. He stated that he did not receive a confirmation prior to the appointment time and only received a confirmation text the day of his appointment approximately an hour and 30 minutes later. He has not heard back from the provider.<br>P.S member sent us screenshots of text he received turns out he accidently scheduled for sep 11th not the 4th and is refusing to accept his mistake AC', 'Concierge', 'Concierge', '2025-09-04 08:49:09', '2025-09-10 07:26:27'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000170420027', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000119081001', 'Gregory Curler', NULL, '9/4/25<br>Laura called needing assistance accessing her telehealth services Ac', 'Concierge', 'Concierge', '2025-09-04 08:34:27', '2025-09-04 08:34:27'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000170420006', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000129016002', 'Paige Anderson', NULL, '9/4/25<br>Family Medical Specialties in Holdridge called to very eligibility and see if we would cover breast implant removal, I advised Rhonda that the member would present as self pay and contact us for more support. She asked if preventative services are covered and i informed her that they are and they must be in the phcs network Ac<br><span><br></span>', 'Concierge', 'Concierge', '2025-09-04 08:22:47', '2025-09-04 08:22:47'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000170420001', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000109171015', 'Marcus Diener', NULL, '9/4/25<br>Marcuas called to see he can use ih MEC card for his flu shot AC', 'Concierge', 'Concierge', '2025-09-04 08:13:11', '2025-09-04 08:13:11'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000170416066', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000108043002', 'Parker Foy', NULL, '9/4/25: Reached out to Parker to let him know PHCS search page is still not working. Provided number to do a search via phone and also offered to do it for him if need be. AM', 'Concierge', 'Concierge', '2025-09-04 08:08:10', '2025-09-04 08:08:10'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000170416058', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000100383002', 'Stephanie Mancuso', NULL, '9/4/25: Sent FU email to Stephanie checking on sharing request. AM', 'Concierge', 'Concierge', '2025-09-04 08:04:47', '2025-09-04 08:04:47'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000170409167', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000081629002', 'Jill Banner', NULL, 'No response. Not able to leave a message on vm. Mailbox full. Sent email to reschedule welcome call. Vanessa Orozco', 'Concierge', 'Concierge', '2025-09-04 08:04:04', '2025-09-04 08:04:04'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000170416045', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000159525002', 'Keira Hartnett', NULL, '9/4/25: Sent Keira an RX quote per request on 8/21.<br>Emailed FU today.<br>AM', 'Concierge', 'Concierge', '2025-09-04 07:58:44', '2025-09-04 07:58:44'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000170416037', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000082890018', 'Laurie Morse', NULL, '9/4/25: Sent Laurie FU email in our thread checking to see if she was able to get bill resubmitted. <br>She said she still hasn''t heard anything, and asked if she should get dr to resubmit bill too - she only sent over EOB. YES! Setting another task to check back in couple weeks. AM', 'Concierge', 'Concierge', '2025-09-04 07:56:09', '2025-09-08 12:04:25'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000170416029', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000131710002', 'Scott Beaton', NULL, '9/4/25: Sent FU email checking on Elizabeth and seeing if she was able to get help she needed through telehealth appt. AM', 'Concierge', 'Concierge', '2025-09-04 07:52:56', '2025-09-04 07:52:56'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000170416020', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000109499017', 'Thomas Mele', NULL, '9/4/25: Mary left the following VM:<br><br><span style="color:rgb(37, 40, 45);">Hi, this is Mary, M-E-L-E, 925-784-1102, date of birth, 6-24-1963, in Murray, Utah. You guys need to help me on this. I am on your website, and it says we are still using serous for telehealth. But the last time I spoke with everyone there, which was less than six weeks ago, I was told we are on Lyric now. And I have an appointment tomorrow, but my account on Lyric has been disabled. So I don''t know what to do, and no one seems to be able to guide me. I will not be available from 10 a.m. to 12 p.m. Mountain Time to take a call from you. So you can call me from 8.30 a.m. until 10 a.m. or afternoon, but my telehealth appointment with Lyric, which is a benefit I was told of my MPB Health account is scheduled for 1.30 p.m. Mountain Time tomorrow Thursday. Thank you. Also, you should probably put on your website that your business hours are Eastern Standard because it does not say that. Thank you.</span><br><span style="color:rgb(37, 40, 45);"><br></span><span style="color:rgb(37, 40, 45);">Checked HW - and there doesn''t seem to be anything wrong with her access to telehealth. Called Mary - she was confused bc she was accessing lyric through member portal instead of health wallet which was directing her to download lyric app and then gave her an update that her acct is disabled. I walked her through signing in using HW and accessing telehealth that way. Hopefully her appt goes ok - but she''s going to call us back if for some reason it doesn''t. AM</span>', 'Concierge', 'Concierge', '2025-09-04 07:36:49', '2025-09-04 09:00:27'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000170409149', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000168753002', 'Gordon Matthews', NULL, 'No response. Left a detailed message on vm. Sent email to reschedule welcome call. Vanessa Orozco', 'Concierge', 'Concierge', '2025-09-04 07:35:21', '2025-09-04 07:35:21'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000170416012', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000169959013', 'Lisa Side', NULL, '9/4/25: Lisa left me a personal VM asking her to call her. Returned call and LVM. AM', 'Concierge', 'Concierge', '2025-09-04 07:26:35', '2025-09-04 07:26:35'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000170409139', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000169484001', 'Jason Wolden', NULL, 'Welcome call complete. Vanessa Orozco', 'Concierge', 'Concierge', '2025-09-04 07:23:18', '2025-09-04 07:23:18'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000170411017', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000117961002', 'Ryan Banuelos', NULL, 'Member submitted payment update.  I will process.', 'Michele R', 'Michele R', '2025-09-04 07:20:30', '2025-09-04 07:20:30'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000170411009', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000159976002', 'Tracy Peterson', NULL, 'Member submitted payment update.  I will process. Payment information that was submitted is the same as the current active ACH on file', 'Michele R', 'Michele R', '2025-09-04 06:56:22', '2025-09-04 07:12:34'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000170411001', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000170404002', 'Tara Albrigo', 'Member & Spouse $2500 IUA Secure HSA', NULL, 'Michele R', 'Michele R', '2025-09-04 06:40:11', '2025-09-04 06:40:11'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000170389052', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000012010011', 'Elizabeth Wood', NULL, '9-3-25 Elizabeth sent me a note letting me know she been in ICU for a few days now! She''s asking about advice as to how to proceed. I sent her some instructions via text to help her.', 'Wendy Scipione - SR VP National Sales Advisor', 'Wendy Scipione - SR VP National Sales Advisor', '2025-09-03 17:05:50', '2025-09-03 17:05:50'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000170389047', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000170144016', 'Christopher Harding', NULL, '9-3-25 Chris called bc he doesn''t see his payment deducted from Kaiser yet. I tried calling twice but I can''t leave a vm. So, I sent him a text letting him know to wait 7-10 biz days first and then call Kaiser at 1-800-632-9700 to confirm or make the payment.', 'Wendy Scipione - SR VP National Sales Advisor', 'Wendy Scipione - SR VP National Sales Advisor', '2025-09-03 16:15:14', '2025-09-03 16:15:14'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000170389032', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000061255207', 'Rachel Martin', NULL, '9-3-25 Looks like no changes to Advisor status yet. So, I''ll wait until it''s changed to reach out to Rachel. JC and the client have requested an Advisor change for me to take over.', 'Wendy Scipione - SR VP National Sales Advisor', 'Wendy Scipione - SR VP National Sales Advisor', '2025-09-03 15:00:04', '2025-09-03 15:00:04'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000170364124', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000166955002', 'Joseph Rakoski', NULL, '09/03/2025<br>Joseph called for assistance with a preventative bill. Let him know how to send it to arm and will reach out in a few days to see if he ahd any trouble.<br>AJ', 'Concierge', 'Concierge', '2025-09-03 14:54:50', '2025-09-03 14:54:50'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000170360204', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000011881658', 'James Lynch', 'Member Aging into Medicare Eff 11/25', '9/3-1st notice sent to member &amp; advisor via em<br>10/2-2nd notice sent to member &amp; advisor via em<br>10/29-Member finally sent in cancellation  already processed.', 'Michele R', 'Michele R', '2025-09-03 14:43:09', '2025-10-29 09:19:30'),
