  ('zcrm_1579374000170364073', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000161616006', 'Jane Brajkovich', NULL, '09/03/2025<br>Jane called needing assistance with a medication from telehealth so i transferred to lyric so they could assist<br>AJ', 'Concierge', 'Concierge', '2025-09-03 14:06:04', '2025-09-03 14:06:04'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000170364068', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000059061132', 'David Pool', NULL, '09/03/2025<br>Spoke to David and wendy about the hospital situation she is in. Let her David know what to do in the IUA scenario and sent him to Zion for them to help him start a share request<br>AJ', 'Concierge', 'Concierge', '2025-09-03 14:04:30', '2025-09-03 14:04:30'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000170394014', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000091048002', 'Jessica Couch', NULL, '08.29.25:  Have not heard from Jessica, so I''m assuming she could not get the required funds as Patti had to cancel her plan. I texted her to ask if she thinks she''ll be able to re-enroll for Oct. 1. JSP', 'Joan Phelps', 'Joan Phelps', '2025-09-03 13:52:33', '2025-09-03 13:52:46'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000170360179', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000115999002', 'Keith Bakos', 'Spouse Aging into Medicare Eff 11/25', '9/3-1st notice sent to member &amp; advisor via em<br>10/1-Member spouse submitted cancellation as she is going on Medicare &amp; spouse Keith is a smoker (limited sharing)I will process', 'Michele R', 'Michele R', '2025-09-03 13:46:03', '2025-10-01 12:03:37'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000170394006', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000117877002', 'Angela M Gutierrez', NULL, '08.29.25:  Bern got in touch w/Sergio and Sergio resolved the payment issue, so Angela and Alfredo''s balance for Sept. is paid. JSP', 'Joan Phelps', 'Joan Phelps', '2025-09-03 13:41:24', '2025-09-03 13:41:24'),
