  ('zcrm_1579374000170367060', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000153824002', 'Samuel Young', NULL, '9/3/25<br>Assisted sun loging into her health wallet app so she can use the mental health service. She also wanted to know if we knew of any discounts for a medical device for her childs knee I advised her to try and opne a sharing request that it might qualify for it to be shared into AC<br><br>', 'Concierge', 'Concierge', '2025-09-03 13:37:02', '2025-09-03 13:57:46'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000170394001', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000068391103', 'Diana Freeman', NULL, '09.03.25:  Texted Diana - asked when she would be available for a call to discuss options for her son Ryker, who is aging out of their SECURE plan. JSP', 'Joan Phelps', 'Joan Phelps', '2025-09-03 13:36:57', '2025-09-03 13:36:57'),
