  ('zcrm_1579374000170367055', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000098614002', 'Joseph Whitman', NULL, '9/3/25<br>Jessica called because i January she took her children to wellness checks, they provider is having a hard time submitting these bills they claim they are being regected but when i check the portal there are no claims on file. I requested she email us pictures of the bill to foward to Lori at ARM AC', 'Concierge', 'Concierge', '2025-09-03 13:31:40', '2025-09-03 13:31:40'),
