  ('zcrm_1579374000170360109', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000108598001', 'Charlene Olsen', 'Member Aging into Medicare Eff 11/25', '9/3-1st notice sent to member &amp; advisor via em<br>9/22-Member called in regarding the Sept 20th payment to be sure that was for the month of October as she is aging into Medicare in November.  I told her yes, that payment is for the month of October and she is covered through the end of October.  She will submit the confirmation of cancellation form in October between the 1st and the 19th for aging into Medicare.  She also asked about her annual exam that she has scheduled for the 3rd week in October and wanted to be sure it will be covered with Zion, that she gets reimbursed through Zion. I told her yes, but to be sure to submit it as soon as possible after the visit so that it gets processed while she is covered.<br>10/2-2nd notice sent to member &amp; advisor via em<br>10/7-Received Cancellation', 'Michele R', 'Michele R', '2025-09-03 12:45:40', '2025-10-07 10:07:26'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000170364063', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000146087021', 'Jane Kim', NULL, '09/03/2025<br>Jane was having trouble setting her pharmacy on health wallet so i logged in and set it for her. Then she called back wanting to reschedule her appointment for tomorrow so i transferred her to lyric.<br>AJ', 'Concierge', 'Concierge', '2025-09-03 12:34:13', '2025-09-03 12:34:13'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000170364058', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000166693002', 'Gemie McLeod', NULL, '09/03/2025<br>Maristella called for Dr. Mcleod. Looking for a specific document to open HSA. I let her know we give them the comliant product in order to fund an HSA. They should be able to open it without proof but i told her we would provide it if necessary, Let her know it is usually at tax time when they need something to show that she is compliant in order to fund her HSA and not get a penalty.<br>AJ', 'Concierge', 'Concierge', '2025-09-03 12:28:14', '2025-09-03 12:28:14'),
