  ('zcrm_1579374000170367025', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000169603002', 'Amy Heine', NULL, '9/3/25<br>Amy wanted to know the diffrnece between mail order and picking up her meds at the pharmacy AC', 'Concierge', 'Concierge', '2025-09-03 11:28:28', '2025-09-03 11:28:28'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000170367006', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000001063061', 'James Tipple', NULL, '9/3/25<br><span><br></span>Karla called to see what the dead line was to open a sharing request. I explained to her that Zion has a 6 month deadline. ITs been over a year since she went to the er and gave the staff her planstin card. She had no idea how to use her plan. I advice her to open a sharing request and then go through the appeal process.<br> Ac', 'Concierge', 'Concierge', '2025-09-03 11:26:55', '2025-09-03 11:26:55'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000170389011', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000059725045', 'Michelle Skellion', NULL, '9-3-25 Michelle called to understand how it will work for her son Ty who will be in Europe for 3 months. I let her know it works the same but only for acute and ER type scenarios, no wellness/preventive and no card to show. She understands. I''ll send her the verbiage from the Sharing Guidelines. Done.', 'Wendy Scipione - SR VP National Sales Advisor', 'Wendy Scipione - SR VP National Sales Advisor', '2025-09-03 11:26:20', '2025-09-03 11:29:13'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000170360059', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000170384001', 'Sherry Finzer', 'Member Only $1000 IUA Premium HSA Eff 10/25', NULL, 'Michele R', 'Michele R', '2025-09-03 11:23:22', '2025-09-03 11:23:22'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000170389006', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000170446023', 'Elena Bensonoff', NULL, '8-29-25 Ilena found me via Heidi Piper. Ilena is 50 and Dudley (?) is 55. She''s self-employed as a holistic practitioner. She does not have insurance bc it''s so expensive and she never goes to the Dr. No pre-x, no meds, no tobacco and no drinking. She gets supplements at wholesale price, ie.  50% discount. She likes the Premium Care option best at $1000/$603 ES and wants a Nov. 1st start date, not Oct.', 'Wendy Scipione - SR VP National Sales Advisor', 'Wendy Scipione - SR VP National Sales Advisor', '2025-09-03 11:22:57', '2025-09-03 11:30:53'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000170360051', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000170382002', 'Victoria Shaw', 'Member Only $2500 IUA Secure HSA Eff 10/25', NULL, 'Michele R', 'Michele R', '2025-09-03 11:14:56', '2025-09-03 11:14:56'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000170363144', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000057125429', 'John Smieszek', NULL, '9/3/25: Marley called. She submitted a bunch of things to ZIon and needs to know if her PT is going to be shared. Transferred to Zion to look into request. Will check in next week to make sure she got an answer. AM', 'Concierge', 'Concierge', '2025-09-03 11:13:58', '2025-09-05 08:47:23'),
