  ('zcrm_1579374000170360046', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000059061132', 'David Pool', NULL, 'Member''s spouse called in stating that she was recently admitted to the hospital and she had not used her membership in a long time and wanted to know how to get things initiated.  I pulled up her account and asked Adam to join to speak with her to review the process.  Adam spoke with Wendy and stated that he had previously spoken with David as to how to initiate a need.  Adam said he was planning to call David this afternoon after lunch to see how the process is going and to check if he needs further assistance.', 'Michele R', 'Michele R', '2025-09-03 10:22:14', '2025-09-03 10:22:14'),
