  ('zcrm_1579374000170363082', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000108294002', 'John Mone', NULL, '9/3/25: Sent FU email to John regarding sharing request for Terzepitide. <br><span style="color:rgb(49, 49, 49);">JOHN: "We were disappointed and kinda confused because they denied our share. </span><br><span style="color:rgb(49, 49, 49);">We had noted that part of the reason we looked into the Tirzepatide was because we were told I was insulin resistant and that’s why I was having a hard time losing weight. So because I used  that term, they are saying that I am diabetic and that they can’t use any share money for it because under the guidelines diabetic supplies are not included. It said in the email that we  can appeal the decision, which I would like to do because it doesn’t seem like the denial for sharing the cost seemed appropriate. What are your thoughts?"</span><br><span style="color:rgb(49, 49, 49);">Suggested John appeal the decision and make sure dr recommends the treatment for weight <a href="http://loss.AM" style="color:rgb(49, 49, 49);" target="_blank">loss.AM</a></span>', 'Concierge', 'Concierge', '2025-09-03 09:26:28', '2025-09-17 09:26:26'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000170363077', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000103921002', 'John Greene', NULL, '9/3/25: Provider called to confirm eligibility for preventive visit. John provided old card and no longer has MEC. Let provider know he is cash pay and to call us if he has questions about this. AM', 'Concierge', 'Concierge', '2025-09-03 09:25:51', '2025-09-03 09:25:51'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000170363072', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000011740100', 'Rossana Johnston', NULL, '9/3/25: Rossana called needing help filling out doctor''s application and inputting correct info. She also said she stopped receiving the newsletters in April. Let her know I''d make sure her email was added back to list. AM', 'Concierge', 'Concierge', '2025-09-03 09:20:18', '2025-09-03 09:20:18'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000170367001', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000159787002', 'Samara Umstead-Staas', NULL, '9/3/25<br>Samara has an open sharing request with Zion for a stomach issue. Samara wanted to know what to do with some bills that zion is refusing to pay, they believe those bills have nothing to do with her stomach issues, I advised Samara to appeal that decision with Zion AC', 'Concierge', 'Concierge', '2025-09-03 09:14:21', '2025-09-03 09:14:21'),
