  ('zcrm_1579374000170363046', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000169959013', 'Lisa Side', NULL, '9/3/25: Checked Lisa''s credentials in HW - everything is working fine. <br>Sent RX, Lab and Imaging quote per requests. See email for details. AM', 'Concierge', 'Concierge', '2025-09-03 09:02:37', '2025-09-03 09:02:37'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000170364033', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000011610497', 'Adam Burstein', NULL, '09/03/2025<br>Called to request physiacl ID cards. Also to ask why he is getting a bill. We found out the provider sent the bill to planstin. Let him know to get them to send it to ARM and if he has trouble let us know and we can assist them in getting the bills where they need to go.<br>AJ', 'Concierge', 'Concierge', '2025-09-03 09:02:02', '2025-09-03 09:02:02'),
