  ('zcrm_1579374000170360022', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000169922040', 'Lucy Hess', NULL, 'Member emailed me asking how to get a copy of her cards.  I told her to contact the Concierge.  She attempted to call but could not get through.  She emailed me back.  I told her that Adam would be reaching out to her shortly to call her at the phone number on file.', 'Michele R', 'Michele R', '2025-09-03 08:44:03', '2025-09-03 08:44:03'),
