  ('zcrm_1579374000170305025', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000168219002', 'Stephen Johnson', NULL, '9/2: Member called in.  Said he is a new member and wanted to review his billing payments to ensure we are on the same page.  I reviewed his two payments and the charges.  We also reviewed that his next billing date is for September 20th for his October 1st share amount including processing fees. He was good with that.', 'Michele R', 'Michele R', '2025-09-02 12:14:43', '2025-09-02 12:14:43'),
