  ('zcrm_1579374000170296196', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000152338040', 'Yang Rich', NULL, '9/2/25: Yang called wanting info on how to use her preventive services and look up a provider. Guided her on how to find a provider, but PHCS site is not working. She said this isn''t the first time I''ve experienced technical issues with MPB. Offered to give her a call tomorrow to try and find providers. AM', 'Concierge', 'Concierge', '2025-09-02 11:53:48', '2025-09-02 11:53:48'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000170325001', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000149209408', 'Mark Newberg', 'cancellation', 'gaps in payments under our program, he''s switched over to the oregon health plan (medicaid). June 1st emergency room (diagnosis), cat scan found brain tumor. he was in critical condition, wife believed he would have died had he not gone to the hospital head was swelled up to being misshapen and he went nonverbal, in fifth stage of chemo treatment, tumor was found in base of his brain where it attaches to his spine, because of location it is inoperable. wife thought it was a stroke, but doctor recognized through catscan the tumor and saved his life. cannot ever be rmoved surgically. very rare and very aggresive tumor. lifelong condition. 8-12 chemo sessions over 12 months, intention that tumor will be small enough that it will allow him to live. anasthesia bill for almost 3k, from when he was admitted. on monday they had a biopsy.<br><span><br></span>unpaid medical bills<br> 1. lab bill from quest (separate testing labwork after hospital for prechemo) - july 1st - $129 <br>2. OREGON ANATHESIOLOGY GROUP (ANATHESIA -  06/23/25 - $2877<br>3. LEGACY HEALTH SYSTEM (LEGACY SALMON CREEK MEDICAL CENTER (ER HE WAS ADMITTED TO) - 06/21 TO 06/27(6 DAYS IN HOSPITAL, 5 DAYS IN ICU) - $2931<br>4. last bill - vancouver clinic - 06/23 - $719, insurance adjustment -$175, balanced owed $539.25<br><span><br></span>medicaid started in july 1st (but she sitll needs to confirm) <br><span><br></span>', 'Tupac Manzanarez', 'Tupac Manzanarez', '2025-09-02 11:53:21', '2025-09-02 11:53:21'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000170296177', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000142290002', 'Katelynn Milligan', NULL, '9/2/25: Katelynn called needing to open sharinging request. Connected to Zion to open portal. AM', 'Concierge', 'Concierge', '2025-09-02 11:50:49', '2025-09-02 11:50:49'),
