  ('zcrm_1579374000170296156', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000117190002', 'Bruce Jones', NULL, '9/2/25: Bruce called. His wife is having hip surgery this Thursday and wants to know what to do next. They''ve been very dilignt on getting the costs of their bills and the surgery down and have kept up with all statements and receipts. I explained the next steps of opening the sharing request and what items can be submitted as part of the request. Connected to Zion to open member portal. AM', 'Concierge', 'Concierge', '2025-09-02 11:29:52', '2025-09-02 11:29:52'),
