  ('zcrm_1579374000170287021', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000157224002', 'Timothy Craig', NULL, '9/2/25: Tim emailed in stating he thinks website is down, can''t access portal. I urged him to give us a call to help troubleshoot as everything is up and running as usual. AM', 'Concierge', 'Concierge', '2025-09-02 08:09:23', '2025-09-02 08:09:23'),
