  ('zcrm_1579374000170237374', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000059281121', 'Dechen Hawk', NULL, '8/29/25<br>Dechen called back to follow up on his colo procedure. The hospital he wants to have it done needs a referral he wants to go his own provider for said ref real, I informed him that the provider might charge him for it and it would not be covered by the ARM card, I suggested he use the telehealth service through  lyric to optain the refreal for free AC', 'Concierge', 'Concierge', '2025-08-29 14:17:02', '2025-08-29 14:17:02'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000170239133', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000131710002', 'Scott Beaton', NULL, '08/29/2025<br>Elizabeth called to verify where her meds were being sent be the telehealth. Had trouble loggin in with member ID so i asked her for her social in order to get into her health wallet account and look for her to see what pharmacy they sent them. <br>AJ', 'Concierge', 'Concierge', '2025-08-29 14:14:01', '2025-08-29 14:14:01'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000170239128', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000154585008', 'Nicole Boye', NULL, '08/29/2025<br>Nicole called to ask about some injections she wanted to get from her dr in her knee. I let her know the IUA process and how to start share request. <br>AJ', 'Concierge', 'Concierge', '2025-08-29 14:09:46', '2025-08-29 14:09:46'),
