  ('zcrm_1579374000170237323', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000102421002', 'Christopher Rutt', NULL, '8/29/25<br>Called Chris to follow up on a sharing request unfortuntaly we was not able to meet his IUA and will not open a sharing request Ac', 'Concierge', 'Concierge', '2025-08-29 13:42:55', '2025-08-29 13:42:55'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000170237315', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000148837002', 'Ariel Dilamani', NULL, '8/29/25<br>Called to follow up on sharing request no response lvm AC', 'Concierge', 'Concierge', '2025-08-29 13:40:16', '2025-08-29 13:40:16'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000170239093', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000137483002', 'Denis Bashtovoi', NULL, '08/29/2025<br>He texted back saying he has not heard anything back about his share request. I let him know i can try and reach out but they might not tell me everything due to HIPPA. Gave him the number to Zion so he could give them a call also in case they dont speak to me. He will need to speak with them anyway because if his share request has stalled like he says then they are probably waiting for something or did not approve the request.<br>AJ', 'Concierge', 'Concierge', '2025-08-29 13:36:50', '2025-08-29 13:36:50'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000170262001', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000170259002', 'Alexander George-Johnson', 'Direct $2500 IUA Member & Children Eff 10/25', NULL, 'Michele R', 'Michele R', '2025-08-29 13:35:08', '2025-08-29 13:35:08'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000170237310', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000131710002', 'Scott Beaton', NULL, '8/29/25<br>Elizabech called back to ensure it was proper procedure to ask for ssn, she was upset Adam asked for it, I reasured her he was trying to assist her loging into the health wallet app AC', 'Concierge', 'Concierge', '2025-08-29 13:30:49', '2025-08-29 13:30:49'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000170237291', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000026209074', 'Michael Flynn', NULL, '8/29/25<br>Ann wanted to know if a nutritionist would be covered by the plan I explained to her that the mec nor the health share would cover it but she could speak to a primary provider through our telehealth service about nutrition and it would free of charge Ac', 'Concierge', 'Concierge', '2025-08-29 13:28:18', '2025-08-29 13:28:18'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000170237286', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000125339002', 'Suzanne Hughes', NULL, '8/29/25<br>Called back Suzanne after several she made several attempts at reaching out to us for rx assistance no response <br>Suzanne called back and guided her through the process of finding out if their superscription is covered. AC', 'Concierge', 'Concierge', '2025-08-29 13:25:52', '2025-08-29 14:38:27'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000170239077', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000119080002', 'Drew Workman', NULL, '08/29/2025<br>Got ahold of his secondary email and was able to send a f/u message there. Let him know to reach out if they still need help with any preventative care bills and where to send them if they do. <br>AJ', 'Concierge', 'Concierge', '2025-08-29 13:21:06', '2025-08-29 13:21:06'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000170237281', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000161290008', 'Rachel Tate', NULL, '8/29/25<br>Rachel called because she received several emails she was under the impression it was us or a scam. After reviewing the email I informed her it was not use emailing her AC', 'Concierge', 'Concierge', '2025-08-29 12:50:41', '2025-08-29 12:50:41'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000170237262', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000132108009', 'Joy Smith', NULL, '8/29/25: Emailed Joy the best price I could find for Linzess, which unfortunately is $535 at CVS. See email for details. AM', 'Concierge', 'Concierge', '2025-08-29 12:10:25', '2025-08-29 12:10:25'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000170237250', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000141685002', 'Laura Murtha', NULL, '8/29/25: Emailed Laura RX Quote per request. AM', 'Concierge', 'Concierge', '2025-08-29 12:05:25', '2025-08-29 12:05:25'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000170237225', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000154053002', 'William Schulz Jr', NULL, '8/29/25: William called wanting help finding a provider - let him know to find a PCP, he can search multiplan website and emailed over link. He''s wanting to get STD testing done. The ACA guidelines list STD counseling but not testing - if he uses card, it may be discounted but not paid in full. AM', 'Concierge', 'Concierge', '2025-08-29 12:00:57', '2025-08-29 12:00:57'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000170235038', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000153617002', 'Jacob Johnson', NULL, 'Member submitted Change Form to correct dependent Matthew''s Year of birth from 2001 to 2021.  It was corrected in CRM by Vanessa, however needed to be update in A123.', 'Patti Baron', 'Patti Baron', '2025-08-29 11:20:00', '2025-08-29 11:20:00'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000170236058', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000164915002', 'Gabriella Stockdale', NULL, 'Welcome call complete. Submitted Non -Mec telehealth transition form and sent info to Julia. Vanessa Orozco', 'Concierge', 'Concierge', '2025-08-29 11:15:47', '2025-08-29 11:30:29'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000170237216', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000123789009', 'Huong Le', NULL, '8/29/25: Darin called and spoke to after hours on Wed - and was very confused by the whole ordeal. Called to apologize and assist him - he didn''t even know he had telehealth services. Sent HW link and advised him on how to log in. AM', 'Concierge', 'Concierge', '2025-08-29 11:08:00', '2025-08-29 11:08:00'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000170237209', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000111068002', 'Patrick Burns', NULL, '8/29/25: Cathy called 3x on Wednesday and spoke to Lyric - after hours service. I called to apologize for confusion and urged her to reach out if she still needs assistance - letting her know we''ll be here until 5pm EST today. AM', 'Concierge', 'Concierge', '2025-08-29 10:58:15', '2025-08-29 10:58:15'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000170236043', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000153617002', 'Jacob Johnson', NULL, 'Welcome call complete. Vanessa Orozco', 'Concierge', 'Concierge', '2025-08-29 10:51:25', '2025-08-29 10:51:25'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000170237188', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000142862002', 'Victoria Shavlik', NULL, '8/29/25: Victoria called. She needs help with her Zion member portal. Stated that she had a sharing request open from January for physical therapy and now when she goes into her portal it''s not there. Connected to Zion to look into the issue. AM', 'Concierge', 'Concierge', '2025-08-29 10:43:15', '2025-08-29 10:43:15'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000170237183', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000095968002', 'Regina Piper', NULL, '8/29/25: Regina called bc she''s having issues getting connected to telehealth doctor. She says they keep calling but then the line goes dead and disconnects. While we were talking, they were calling her again. Asked her to please call me back if she continues to have issues. AM', 'Concierge', 'Concierge', '2025-08-29 10:38:16', '2025-08-29 10:38:16'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000170257001', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000069341714', 'Mark Read', NULL, '8-29-25 I left Mark a vm to make sure there''s money in his account to re-run the bill.', 'Wendy Scipione - SR VP National Sales Advisor', 'Wendy Scipione - SR VP National Sales Advisor', '2025-08-29 10:25:13', '2025-08-29 10:25:13'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000170236033', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000167880011', 'Matthew Scow', NULL, 'Welcome call complete. Vanessa Orozco', 'Concierge', 'Concierge', '2025-08-29 09:36:29', '2025-08-29 09:36:29'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000170237167', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000126126002', 'William McKoon', NULL, '8/29/25: Bill called. His wife, Lara is starting clinicals for school and they need a proof of coverage letter. Confirmed email address and let Bill know I''d get that out to them today. <br>Emailed letters and SOB. AM', 'Concierge', 'Concierge', '2025-08-29 09:07:48', '2025-08-29 09:23:01'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000170237144', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000131710002', 'Scott Beaton', NULL, '8/29/25: Elizabeth called in (sounding awful!) She said she''s tested positive for covid and needs help using telehealth. I walked her through signing on and starting the process. AM', 'Concierge', 'Concierge', '2025-08-29 08:46:24', '2025-08-29 08:46:24'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000170235012', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000130448042', 'Michael Leinweber', NULL, 'Member submitted cancellation eff 9/25 due to getting Employer Benefits.  I will process &amp; refund', 'Patti Baron', 'Patti Baron', '2025-08-29 08:37:22', '2025-08-29 08:37:22'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000170237130', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000124507252', 'Gina Robb', NULL, '8/29/25: Sent FU email checking to make sure everything went smoothly for Gina''s preventive sharing <a href="http://request.AM" style="" target="_blank">request.AM</a>', 'Concierge', 'Concierge', '2025-08-29 08:33:09', '2025-08-29 08:33:09'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000170237121', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000144970001', 'Stanley Brandon', NULL, '8/29/25: Sent FU email to Stanley and Jenna to make sure everything went ok with opening maternity request. AM', 'Concierge', 'Concierge', '2025-08-29 08:29:03', '2025-08-29 08:29:03'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000170237100', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000058356758', 'Joan Tekula', NULL, '8/29/25: Called to FU with Joan to see if she was able to find a gyno from the provider list I sent. She was still frustrated that she didn''t know plan was changing and she couldn''t see her dr and said she wasn''t going to see anyone - will wait till she''s on Medicare. AM', 'Concierge', 'Concierge', '2025-08-29 08:19:09', '2025-08-29 08:19:09'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000170237092', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000127150001', 'Cynthia Barrett', NULL, '8/29/25: Called Cynthia to FU and see if telehealth worked out for her. LVM. AM', 'Concierge', 'Concierge', '2025-08-29 08:15:06', '2025-08-29 08:15:06'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000170237084', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000088723002', 'Jodi Ayers', NULL, '8/29/25: Sent Jodi FU email in our thread asking if she was able to pick up the epipen. AM<br>9/2/25: Jodi emailed back, she didn''t see email till after paying $266 for epipen and asked if Walgreens would consider refunding for accurate costs - I said it''s worth a try, since the issue was in how they rang it up. AM', 'Concierge', 'Concierge', '2025-08-29 08:12:40', '2025-09-02 08:05:44'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000170239008', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000153593020', 'Jordan Gosney', NULL, '08/29/2025<br>Sent email to Jordan to explain that Denali does not operate in their state and that is the only dental i am appointed with currently. Going to send to Tupac to get the dental since he has multiple options that he is contracted with.<br>AJ', 'Concierge', 'Concierge', '2025-08-29 08:11:54', '2025-08-29 08:11:54'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000170239003', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000166941001', 'Anita Gupta', NULL, '08/29/2025<br>Working with julia to figure out exactly how to get labs for preventative through the telehealth with lyric. We are going to make sure they can use ARM benefits so they do not have to pay for any preventative labs ordered through telehealth. Which if they had to pay would defeat the purpose of advising them to go through telehealth for small things like primary care if they have to pay for it as opposed to an office visit with associated labs. <br>AJ', 'Concierge', 'Concierge', '2025-08-29 08:10:20', '2025-08-29 08:10:20'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000170237060', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000141685002', 'Laura Murtha', NULL, '8/29/25: Emailed Laura results from lab quote request and reminded her that any STANDARD preventive labs ordered during a general wellness screening can be billed directly to ARM. See email for details. AM', 'Concierge', 'Concierge', '2025-08-29 08:06:49', '2025-08-29 08:06:49'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000170237036', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000153058003', 'James Longmire', NULL, '8/29/25: Jim said he''d give Dr. Cline from my recommendations a call. Advised him to reach out if he has any issues. AM', 'Concierge', 'Concierge', '2025-08-29 07:38:37', '2025-08-29 07:38:37'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000170237017', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000153327002', 'Rachel Klobucher', NULL, '8/29/25: Rachel emailed in an old bill for a simple skin cancer check to see if there''s any way she could be reimbursed. When we were talking yesterday, I tried to clear up the whole skin cancer/dermatologist/pcp debacle and why she received conflicting info. <br>Forwarded the bill to Lori to see if they would consider reimbursing. <br>AM', 'Concierge', 'Concierge', '2025-08-29 07:35:06', '2025-08-29 07:35:06'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000170237012', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000098254002', 'Angela McGuire', NULL, '8/29/25: Angela emailed in asking if it''s ok that she gets the cash rate for upcoming wellness exam and submits for reimbursement to ARM. I advised that she should always try to use in-network providers for preventive services and asked if the provider is in PHCS. Also said to check with ARM first to make sure they will reimburse for the full cash rate and offered to coordinate a 3-way call. AM', 'Concierge', 'Concierge', '2025-08-29 07:27:54', '2025-08-29 07:27:54'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000170237007', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000168397002', 'Yvonne Hawkins', NULL, '8/29/25: Yvonne called. Her daughter has a UTI and she''s wondering whether they need to go to urgent care or can use telehealth - I advised to use telehealth and gave her initial instructions on how to access. AM', 'Concierge', 'Concierge', '2025-08-29 07:26:03', '2025-08-29 07:26:03'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000170235001', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000130448042', 'Michael Leinweber', NULL, 'Member called in after hours wanting to cancel the membership due to getting employer benefits.  I will send out the Cancellation Link', 'Patti Baron', 'Patti Baron', '2025-08-29 06:45:24', '2025-08-29 06:45:24'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000170135192', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000163967002', 'Alicia Thompson', 'buttdial', 'She was concerned about her password not having been reset', 'Tupac Manzanarez', 'Tupac Manzanarez', '2025-08-28 16:27:30', '2025-08-28 16:27:30'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000170125454', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000120108002', 'Penny Fallon', NULL, '8/28/25<br>Called penny to follow up on her sharing request she states shw will open it during the weekend Ac<br><span><br></span>', 'Concierge', 'Concierge', '2025-08-28 15:02:05', '2025-08-28 15:02:05'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000170125444', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000133424002', 'Deborah Smith', NULL, '8/28/25<br>Called to follow up on a sharing request no response lvm AC', 'Concierge', 'Concierge', '2025-08-28 14:58:15', '2025-08-28 14:58:15');
