  ('zcrm_1579374000170191342', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000011509065', 'Joy Kelley', NULL, '08/28/2025<br>Joy called to verify how preventative care works and what is covered under that. i looked her dr and place she is going up and everything is in network and she should have no issues getting her preventative care done<br>AJ', 'Concierge', 'Concierge', '2025-08-28 14:30:44', '2025-08-28 14:30:44'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000170125388', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000154665002', 'Leslie Ashley', NULL, '8/28/25<br>Called leslie to follow up on a sharing request, she has not meet her IUA but is working on it Ac', 'Concierge', 'Concierge', '2025-08-28 14:27:36', '2025-08-28 14:27:36'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000170125309', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000125052002', 'Lauryn Sargent', NULL, '8/28/25<br>Lauryn called to see if she was eligble to open an hsa account ac', 'Concierge', 'Concierge', '2025-08-28 14:18:49', '2025-08-28 14:18:49'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000170206058', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000170212009', 'Kristen Douhan', NULL, 'Member Only $1000 IUA Secure', 'Patti Baron', 'Patti Baron', '2025-08-28 14:07:37', '2025-08-28 14:07:37'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000170126075', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000091048002', 'Jessica Couch', NULL, '08.28.25:  Texted Jessica to notify her she has been sent 3 notices of c.c. decline and she must call Patti to correct pmt. for her Sept. ''25 membership fee today if possible or by 3 p.m. EST tomorrow. She responded she has to gather some funds to jump back on track, which I acknowledged. Messaged Patti to let her know. JSP<br>Jessica texted she will try to get the funds for the 9/1/25 pmt. because she doesn''t want to cancel her membership and have to re-enroll. I relayed this to Patti.  JSP', 'Joan Phelps', 'Joan Phelps', '2025-08-28 14:01:39', '2025-09-03 13:45:05'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000170125301', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000144055012', 'Kate Wasserman', NULL, '8/28/25<br>Kate called back and informed us that the new telehealth services was not the best she was not able to get any assistance with either the primary care or urgent care. Urgent care could not give her a referral for labs i had to be a primary and when she scheduled with a primary they canceled on her AC<br><span><br></span>', 'Concierge', 'Concierge', '2025-08-28 14:00:36', '2025-08-28 14:00:36'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000170191293', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000028082440', 'Robert Weiffenbach', NULL, '08/28/20205<br>Sent update letter and the statement of benefits as well as let him know where to get a more official looking ID card on health wallet<br>AJ', 'Concierge', 'Concierge', '2025-08-28 13:58:50', '2025-08-28 13:58:50'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000170225004', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000170212009', 'Kristen Douhan', NULL, '8-28-25 Kristen was referred to me by Gaia. Kristen has UHC/RMHP now via C4. She''s paying $450 and no APTC. She''s a single, healthy person who owns her own PT Clinic. Patients are all cash pay and she won''t take ins. She lives in Littleton 80120. She gets the mammo, pap screenings, skin checks, etc. She''s best suited for Secure HSA since she''s 46 and single. She also has some $ in an HSA that RMHP/UHC now have their clients create the HSA account through their own Optum Bank!  She just started funding it this year. She does have sleep apnea so I read the Sharing Guidelines section about sleep apnea. The just uses a mouth gaurd and No C-pap machine. The mouth guard should be good for about 8 years. She takes birth control and loestrin for anxiety. I found loestrin on Pharmacy Checker for 84 tablets for $38.76. It might be on the OptumRX free drug list as well. She takes vitamin D, milk thistle and collagen so she will benefit from the supplement discounts.', 'Wendy Scipione - SR VP National Sales Advisor', 'Wendy Scipione - SR VP National Sales Advisor', '2025-08-28 13:56:29', '2025-08-28 13:57:13'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000170125296', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000163967002', 'Alicia Thompson', NULL, '8/28/25<br>Provided access to HCBB so she can compare prices for dermatologist in her area AC', 'Concierge', 'Concierge', '2025-08-28 13:47:36', '2025-08-28 13:47:36'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000170125291', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000155188036', 'Jason Tompkins', NULL, '8/28/25<br>Jason called to see where he cant get his covid vaccine I infomred him he can go to cvs or walgreens AC', 'Concierge', 'Concierge', '2025-08-28 13:46:19', '2025-08-28 13:46:19'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000170125282', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000123636002', 'John Nichols', NULL, '8/28/25<br>sent proof of coverage AC', 'Concierge', 'Concierge', '2025-08-28 13:39:36', '2025-08-28 13:39:36'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000170191288', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000128525010', 'Paula Lueske', NULL, '08/28/2025<br>sent member breakdown email we send out when we do sales calls to help explain the membership and all of its features.<br>AJ', 'Concierge', 'Concierge', '2025-08-28 13:35:50', '2025-08-28 13:35:50'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000170191283', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000131784019', 'Nicolle Mackey', NULL, '08/28/2025<br>Nicolle called for the flu shot. Let her know she can go to the pharmacy and show her ARM card like i was advised.<br>AJ', 'Concierge', 'Concierge', '2025-08-28 13:34:05', '2025-08-28 13:34:05'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000170125277', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000168251003', 'Edward Moore', NULL, '8/28/25<br>Edward needed assistance using health wallet for rx coupons AC', 'Concierge', 'Concierge', '2025-08-28 13:18:47', '2025-08-28 13:18:47'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000170206047', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000125098022', 'John Catlett', NULL, 'Member called in and said he needed to update his address.  I will send him out the link', 'Patti Baron', 'Patti Baron', '2025-08-28 12:58:38', '2025-08-28 12:58:38'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000170206042', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000170209003', 'William McClelland', NULL, 'Member Only $2500 IUA Secure', 'Patti Baron', 'Patti Baron', '2025-08-28 12:03:51', '2025-08-28 12:03:51'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000170206034', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000170220023', 'Debra Howell', NULL, 'Member only $1500 IUA Premium Care', 'Patti Baron', 'Patti Baron', '2025-08-28 12:00:40', '2025-08-28 12:00:40'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000170158143', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000132108009', 'Joy Smith', NULL, '8/28/25: Called Joy to discuss RX price options for Linzess - it''s super expensive, in the $500 range. I left her a VM and sent an email asking if it''s part of a current sharing request. <br>International is not an option - they''ve suspended shipping bc of tariff increases, Rx Valet is higher than the discount sites. <br>Best options would be a sharing request, or even trying the med first with samples from the provider. <br>Will wait on her to return my call/email before moving forward. <br><span><br></span>8/29/25: Sent another email to Joy trying to see if this is part of a sharing request. <br>AM', 'Concierge', 'Concierge', '2025-08-28 11:47:37', '2025-08-29 08:34:33'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000170158136', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000168462023', 'David Tracht', NULL, '8/28/25: Anne called to get set up with RX Valet. She was trying to get pricing on her next refill for Combipatch. I did a quick search - it''s very expensive. Suggested she fill out a quote request form and let us perform a search for her. AM', 'Concierge', 'Concierge', '2025-08-28 11:22:18', '2025-08-28 11:22:18'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000170158131', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000155243058', 'Brent Corrigan', NULL, '8/28/25: Spoke to Nicole regarding Brent''s eligibility and how to process claim. Provided info - the provider was in network, all good. AM', 'Concierge', 'Concierge', '2025-08-28 11:19:37', '2025-08-28 11:19:37'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000170190096', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000021695112', 'Donovan Kahler', NULL, 'Spoke to members will reschedule welcome call after start date of October 1, 2025. Sent an email to do so. Vanessa Orozco', 'Concierge', 'Concierge', '2025-08-28 10:34:35', '2025-08-28 10:34:57'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000170190076', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000153932019', 'Cora Reynolds', NULL, 'No response. Left a detailed message on vm. Sent email to reschedule the refresher call. Vanessa Orozco', 'Concierge', 'Concierge', '2025-08-28 10:21:14', '2025-08-28 10:21:14'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000170158121', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000117873002', 'Marc Marlowe', NULL, '8/28/25: Sent FU email checking to see if Patricia was able to get her preventive bill squared away. AM', 'Concierge', 'Concierge', '2025-08-28 10:18:35', '2025-08-28 10:18:35'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000170158106', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000130296008', 'Jeffrey Virlee', NULL, '8/28/25: Sent FU email to Jeffrey regarding sharing request. <br>He responded saying so far so good on 9/3. Will check back in a few weeks. AM', 'Concierge', 'Concierge', '2025-08-28 10:10:39', '2025-09-11 07:07:27'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000170191104', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000168094002', 'Maria Marshall', NULL, '08/28/2025<br>Sent f/u email to Bruce checking in on his PCP appointment. Wanted to check and make sure he was finally ablt to make that apointment with Dr. Farford.<br>AJ', 'Concierge', 'Concierge', '2025-08-28 10:07:56', '2025-08-28 10:07:56'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000170206026', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000170142007', 'Patrick Dittoe', NULL, 'Member &amp; Sp $2500 IUA Secure', 'Patti Baron', 'Patti Baron', '2025-08-28 09:52:32', '2025-08-28 09:52:32'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000170125260', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000069290256', 'Lynn MacRitchie', NULL, '8/26/25<br>Called to ask what her rx benefits are directed her to the health wallet app ac', 'Concierge', 'Concierge', '2025-08-28 09:44:38', '2025-08-28 09:44:38'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000170125255', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000169155002', 'Linda Liederbach', NULL, '8/26/25<br>sent rx quote ac', 'Concierge', 'Concierge', '2025-08-28 09:42:07', '2025-08-28 09:42:07'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000170191094', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000083369001', 'Melanie Lamere', NULL, '08/28/2025<br>Ran Rx quote for Estradiol patches.  .01 mg/ 8 patches<br>Walgreens$49.27 the pharmacy they selected "big Y" is double the price at $91<br>AJ', 'Concierge', 'Concierge', '2025-08-28 09:37:26', '2025-08-28 09:37:26'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000170191089', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000152338040', 'Yang Rich', NULL, '08/28/2025<br>Yang called after getting the email about her health wallet upgrade. I walked her through the app and answered all of her questions about the features of it and how everything works.<br>AJ', 'Concierge', 'Concierge', '2025-08-28 09:33:12', '2025-08-28 09:33:12'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000170125232', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000011659413', 'Brad Uhlig', NULL, '8/28/25<br>Brad wants to remove his chil from his plan sent him the change form AC', 'Concierge', 'Concierge', '2025-08-28 09:32:22', '2025-08-28 09:32:22'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000170125227', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000166746002', 'Alexandru Parasca', NULL, '8/28/25<br>Alex called because his spouse goes to they obgyn every 6 months and for regular check up. At the time of her appointment the provider did not accept the ARM because it is labeled preventative services. I confirmed that only the yearly pap smear would be covered as we follow the ACA guidlines AC', 'Concierge', 'Concierge', '2025-08-28 09:31:48', '2025-08-28 09:31:48'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000170158090', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000123789009', 'Huong Le', NULL, '8/28/25: Darin emailed in asking about what labs are covered with preventive visit. Let him know as long as they are preventive labs in conjunction with a general wellness checkup, they are covered - but they can''t be diagnostic. AM', 'Concierge', 'Concierge', '2025-08-28 09:27:31', '2025-08-28 09:27:31'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000170158085', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000153327002', 'Rachel Klobucher', NULL, '8/28/25: Rachel called and said she was going in circles trying to find a place to get a dexa scan. Corewell Health - dr already sent order to <span style="color:rgb(51, 51, 51);">Corewell Health but willing to go elsewhere. I let her know I''d do some research for her and make some calls and get back to her tomorrow.</span><br><span style="color:rgb(51, 51, 51);">Called Corewell and they said it''s no problem - They are also listed in PHCS network as an option. Called and let Rachel know that she''ll be fine, just make sure they send the bill to ARM instead of Priority Health (which is what they currently have on file). And if there are any issues, email me the bill and we''ll help facilitate a reimbursement. Confirmed that she does meet ACA caveat for bone density scans - which is either over 65 or post menopausal. AM</span>', 'Concierge', 'Concierge', '2025-08-28 09:15:15', '2025-08-28 09:56:00'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000170158066', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000082890018', 'Laurie Morse', NULL, '8/28/25: Laurie emailed in an EOB from her providers office bc the labs were not paid for. By the looks of member number, group number and note (not paid bc membership terminated) - it was billed to planstin instead of ARM. Advised her to have provider send to ARM or see if ARM will take the bill directly and reimburse her. AM', 'Concierge', 'Concierge', '2025-08-28 09:00:31', '2025-08-28 09:00:31'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000170158061', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000010543087', 'Tania Dibbs', NULL, 'PCP has said she needs a preventive mammogram and ultrasound bc she has very dense breast tissue. Was covered last time, but $190 was not paid for. <br>Karen let her know that they sent EOB August 1st, and ultrasounds are not covered under ACA, and she should only owe $190.13, suggested she send copy of EOB and only $190 back to radiology facility. AM', 'Concierge', 'Concierge', '2025-08-28 08:59:55', '2025-08-28 08:59:55'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000170126067', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000117877002', 'Angela M Gutierrez', NULL, '08.28.25:  Called Bern in response to his text asking if I have access to the CRM. He said Angela does not speak English and has Sergio as her  interpreter who works at their company, Anicam Enterprises. We are to use Sergio''s email to communicate with him on behalf of Angela &amp; Alfredo. Email address for Sergio:  <a style="display:inline;" target="_blank" href="http://operations2@anicamenterprises.com/"><u>operations2@anicamenterprises.com</u></a> .  I gave this information to Bern to relay to Patti and I told him that Acelyn can call and speak to Angela, Alfredo or Sergio in Spanish, if needed.  JSP', 'Joan Phelps', 'Joan Phelps', '2025-08-28 08:46:35', '2025-08-28 09:04:08'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000170190055', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000167582001', 'Rodney Spangler', NULL, 'No response. This person scheduled a welcome call but there is no enrollment in our system. Left a detailed message on vm. Vanessa Orozco', 'Concierge', 'Concierge', '2025-08-28 08:38:14', '2025-08-28 08:38:14'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000170191084', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000168251003', 'Edward Moore', NULL, '08/28/2025<br>Ran Rx quote for edward<br><ul style="list-style-type:disc;list-style-position:inside;"><li style="list-style-image:none;"><p style="display:inline;"><span style="color:rgb(0, 0, 0);font-weight:normal;font-style:normal;">Lisinopril : RXValet = $0.00   </span></p></li><li style="list-style-image:none;"><p style="display:inline;"><span style="color:rgb(0, 0, 0);font-weight:normal;font-style:normal;">Levothyroxine sodium: RXValet = $0.00 </span></p></li><li style="list-style-image:none;"><p style="display:inline;"><span style="color:rgb(0, 0, 0);font-weight:normal;font-style:normal;">Rosuvastatin: RXValet = $0.00</span></p></li></ul>', 'Concierge', 'Concierge', '2025-08-28 08:35:02', '2025-08-28 08:35:02'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000170206018', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000170199002', 'John Cooper', NULL, 'Member only $1000 IUA Care +', 'Patti Baron', 'Patti Baron', '2025-08-28 08:09:04', '2025-08-28 08:09:04'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000170158032', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000088723002', 'Jodi Ayers', NULL, '8/28/25: Jodi emailed in stating that the rx valet coupon for epipen did not work at Walgreens. I reached out to the help desk number and they informed me that Walgreens needs to add a (01) after her member ID in their system to indicate a "person code" in order to access discounted price. Sent Jodi a reply in concierge email with these instructions and advising her to call me or the rx help desk if still not working at pharmacy to help troubleshoot. AM', 'Concierge', 'Concierge', '2025-08-28 07:52:49', '2025-08-28 07:52:49'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000170190033', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000170140033', 'Michael Robison', NULL, 'Spoke to member will reschedule the welcome call after his start date of October 1, 2025. Sent an email to do so. Vanessa Orozco', 'Concierge', 'Concierge', '2025-08-28 07:34:23', '2025-08-28 07:34:23'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000170158017', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000153058003', 'James Longmire', NULL, '8/28/25: Sent JIm a list of colon surgeon provider options per request and asked for the name of last facility that gave him issues. AM', 'Concierge', 'Concierge', '2025-08-28 07:31:31', '2025-08-28 07:31:31'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000170206001', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000079996013', 'Justin Barney', NULL, 'Member submitted Change Form to remove dependent Katelyn from the membership eff 9/1/25 due to her getting married.  Since no difference in monies I can process.', 'Patti Baron', 'Patti Baron', '2025-08-28 07:20:59', '2025-08-28 07:20:59'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000170158012', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000132108009', 'Joy Smith', NULL, '8/28/25: Joy reached out asking for clarification on her prescriptions benefits. Emailed her info about discounts through rx valet, meds under an eligible sharing request and concierge quotes. AM', 'Concierge', 'Concierge', '2025-08-28 07:16:57', '2025-08-28 07:16:57'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000170189003', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000134767002', 'Kara Weld', NULL, '8-27-25 Shared with Kara the Health Access Direct Co-Op for her group of 10+. She''s excited about this prospect and she asked great questions. It looks like she will have 10 FTE employees. I''m awaiting the correct price sheet. She now thinks they might as well get the ball rolling for an earlier start date than Jan. 1st. Plus this will help avoid the chaos of open enrollment. She might choose to keep her current membership with MPB to keep access to the virtual healthcare app. They''ve used that a few times and are happy with it (CirrusMD).', 'Wendy Scipione - SR VP National Sales Advisor', 'Wendy Scipione - SR VP National Sales Advisor', '2025-08-27 15:27:50', '2025-08-27 15:27:50'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000170125217', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000114217020', 'Troy Nickell', NULL, '8/27/25<br>troy called to see what codes are considered preventative for a colonoscopy. Transferred to ARM so they can give him those codes as I informed him we could not really tell him or the provider how to code the bill, that it was up to the providers discretion but if it was coded prevetative he should be good to go  AC', 'Concierge', 'Concierge', '2025-08-27 15:01:40', '2025-08-27 15:02:32'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000170125212', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000161676452', 'Kristi Ross', NULL, '8/27/25<br>James has to get an mri and wanted to know if we have preferred vendors. I informed him that dont but i emailed him the link to radiology assist so he can get a discounted rate as well as searched up what the average price for an MRI is in his area so he dont not paying high prices Ac', 'Concierge', 'Concierge', '2025-08-27 14:54:15', '2025-08-27 14:54:15'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000170125207', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000153327002', 'Rachel Klobucher', NULL, '8/27/25<br>Racheal needed assisatance finidng an imaging place that was in network. Guided her through the multiplan website AC', 'Concierge', 'Concierge', '2025-08-27 14:53:43', '2025-08-27 14:53:43'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000170125185', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000123636002', 'John Nichols', NULL, '8/27/25<br>John called to get a letter of coverage for his son''s college AC', 'Concierge', 'Concierge', '2025-08-27 14:44:02', '2025-08-27 14:44:11'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000170191077', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000168251003', 'Edward Moore', NULL, '08/27/2025<br>Cheryl called after being disconnected from a dermatologist visit on telehealth. I transferred her to the 469 lyric tranfer line<br>AJ', 'Concierge', 'Concierge', '2025-08-27 14:41:50', '2025-08-27 14:41:50'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000170191056', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000097027002', 'Elaine Colter', NULL, '08/27/2025<br>Tupac asked me to reach out to her after she sent in her lyric transfer form. I talked to vinnie and he is going to create a notification email when people ask to be transferred. I will also be notifying elaine and then when she is added i will send her the info email about how to use health wallet and stuff and explain to her on the phone if necessary <br>AJ', 'Concierge', 'Concierge', '2025-08-27 14:36:12', '2025-08-27 14:36:12'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000170191051', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000106699002', 'Kelly McKinney', NULL, '08/27/2025<br>Kelly called in and wanted to get access to telehealth so she requested the link to be transferred over to lyric. I sent her that and the welcome call link because it has been a while and she forgot how everything worked<br>AJ', 'Concierge', 'Concierge', '2025-08-27 14:27:55', '2025-08-27 14:27:55'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000170191030', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000001608001', 'Carlos Matamoros', NULL, '08/27/2025<br>Carlos called leo and he asked me to get back to him. He just wanted to ask some questions about a share request like how long he has to submit stuff and how long they keep the request open for. Let him know to call back with any other questions<br>AJ', 'Concierge', 'Concierge', '2025-08-27 14:22:22', '2025-08-27 14:22:22'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000170196001', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000055816343', 'Mary Ann Harpenau', NULL, '08.27.25:  Mary Ann called me to ask about a plan for Jaime once she ages out as of Oct 1, 2025. Since they have a DPC provider they''re paying for, I discussed the Direct and Premium Care plan options and pricing. She asked me to email the Premium Care plan summary and pricing. I sent her the link to my website explaining the Premium Care plan and price schedule. I will call to follow up. JSP', 'Joan Phelps', 'Joan Phelps', '2025-08-27 14:14:27', '2025-08-27 14:14:27'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000170191025', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000028082440', 'Robert Weiffenbach', NULL, '08/27/2025<br>Responded to his email requesting a letter of proof of membership along with a copy of his Id cards for his daughters school<br>AJ', 'Concierge', 'Concierge', '2025-08-27 14:08:52', '2025-08-27 14:08:52'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000170186202', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000092255002', 'Lafi Abdeljaber', NULL, 'I reached out to Karen and received a call back from her.  She told me that this couple are separating and the member has been told by the judge that he must put her back on the membership eff 8/1/25.  Member removed her from the membership eff 7/25.  I let Karen know that I could not backdate her and that she could re-enroll with her and the earliest that I could get her on would be 10/1/25.  I suggested that she put the spouse direct with Zion, however she is located in NJ and needs the Secure membership and it is questionable that she is part of the business.', 'Patti Baron', 'Patti Baron', '2025-08-27 13:57:38', '2025-08-27 13:57:38'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000170191020', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000154687092', 'Laura Eckhardt', NULL, '08/27/2025<br>Julia requested i reach back out after Laura called after hours about mental health and spoke with the lyric people. Ireached out to explain to her how everything works and answer any of her questions but she did not answer so i left a VM for now.<br>AJ', 'Concierge', 'Concierge', '2025-08-27 13:56:52', '2025-08-27 13:56:52'),
