  ('zcrm_1579374000170124282', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000030826048', 'Trent Mullikin', NULL, '08/27/2025<br>trent is all good now. I talked to him about the process to get his meds and everything and he says he is confident that he knows how to get the coupon and bring to pharmacy. Let him know he just needs to go to his appointment later and get the prescription to initiate this process and get his meds before leaving town. Looked up local pharmacies and his appointmetn is at 5PM and the pharmacies near him close at 8PM so he should have time to get it filled.<br>AJ', 'Concierge', 'Concierge', '2025-08-27 09:05:52', '2025-08-27 09:05:52'),
