  ('zcrm_1579374000170186056', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000146489002', 'Anna Nadasdy', 'Decline of the 9/25 Share Amount', '8/27-1st notice sent to member &amp; advisor via em &amp; vm<br>8/28- Final notice sent to member &amp; advisor via em.  Member called and left a voice message.  She also submitted the payment update form.  I called her back to review.  She said to go ahead and update her payment method for the September payment and use this going forward.  We will process.', 'Patti Baron', 'Patti Baron', '2025-08-27 07:55:00', '2025-08-28 09:38:12'),
