  ('zcrm_1579374000170144092', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000030826048', 'Trent Mullikin', NULL, '8-26-25 I sent this to the ticketing system as well. <br>I''m already getting complaints about Health Wallet. This is the 2nd complaint in just a few days. Trent Mullikin has been using CirrusMD with great success. He''s been switched to the Health Wallet and needs a medication before he leaves on a trip out of the country super early on Thursday. The earliest that he can get an appointment with a Dr. on the new app is 4:00 pm or 5:00 pm tomorrow night, not leaving him time to actually go get the prescription. He''s been able to get it instantly via CirrusMD. He called our Concierge Team and they said there''s nothing they can do. Any chance you can get him an earlier appointment. There''s been no mention of needing to wait 24 hrs before appointments. I was told it''s a 7-22 minute wait. We need to set proper expectations with members and this is not what has been expressed to us.  Thank you, thank you for any help you can offer!', 'Wendy Scipione - SR VP National Sales Advisor', 'Wendy Scipione - SR VP National Sales Advisor', '2025-08-26 17:06:38', '2025-08-26 17:06:38'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000170144087', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000001413013', 'Aaron Weiner', NULL, '8-26-25 Randall, Aaron''s dad is asking to cancel his membership bc Aaron found something else. I think Randall was still paying for him. So, I won''t press him to maintain his membership.', 'Wendy Scipione - SR VP National Sales Advisor', 'Wendy Scipione - SR VP National Sales Advisor', '2025-08-26 16:26:14', '2025-08-26 16:26:14'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000170144082', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000140549002', 'Patricia Nilsen', NULL, '8-26-25 Patty joined 1Dental - <span style="color:rgb(34, 34, 34);"><a target="_blank" href="http://nilsencreative@icloud.com" style="color:rgb(34, 34, 34);">nilsencreative@icloud.com</a> just purchased a plan from your link! You will earn commission once the member is active beyond the 30-day trial period.</span>', 'Wendy Scipione - SR VP National Sales Advisor', 'Wendy Scipione - SR VP National Sales Advisor', '2025-08-26 16:18:36', '2025-08-26 16:18:36'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000170144077', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000171119022', 'Ashley Coburn', NULL, '8-26-25 Ashley is working for Jennifer Abbott.  Jennifer''s new company is called Center for Effective Treatment. Ashley is married but only needs ins for herself. She doesn''t need dental or vision since she gets that through her husband. His name is Kelly Dingler 10-24-1980. Ashley has psoriasis and like to go to the derm every 6 months or so since she''s a red head. Skin cancer is  a concern but otherwise totally healthy. No meds, no tobacco. She wants to keep her NP with Longs Peak Family Practice, Allison Fostveit. She needs  an Oct. 1st start date.', 'Wendy Scipione - SR VP National Sales Advisor', 'Wendy Scipione - SR VP National Sales Advisor', '2025-08-26 15:43:04', '2025-08-26 15:43:04'),
