  ('zcrm_1579374000170124258', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000092255002', 'Lafi Abdeljaber', NULL, '08/26/2025<br>Sent an email responding to Karen, she was asking for verification that the spouse was added and wanted to know if it could be back dated to avoid a lapse in coverage. I let Karen know she should reach out to patti because at concierge we could not see if the form was processed but Patti could tell her if the form has been submitted, processed, and if they can back date.<br>AJ', 'Concierge', 'Concierge', '2025-08-26 14:30:45', '2025-08-26 14:30:45'),
