  ('zcrm_1579374000170120193', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000060583574', 'Carlos Guerrero', NULL, 'Francis called in asking about a mammogram bill from before 1/1/25.  She had been speaking to Planstin about this.  I advsed her that she would have to get back with Planstin about this as we do not have access to that information.', 'Patti Baron', 'Patti Baron', '2025-08-26 11:44:20', '2025-08-26 11:44:20'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000170165151', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000125340012', 'Wesley Burke', NULL, '8/26/25: Katie called wondering if and how her plan would pay for hormone replacement therapy. I referenced the Zion guidelines related to hormone therapy - they have a limit of $3k for this type of incident, but advised her to speak to them directly for a solid answer bc there''s nothing explicit in guidelines. AM', 'Concierge', 'Concierge', '2025-08-26 11:43:48', '2025-08-26 11:43:48'),
