  ('zcrm_1579374000170165146', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000012871127', 'John Taylor', NULL, '8/26/25: Provider called to check on a claim filed to ARM for John. Transferred over to ARM. AM', 'Concierge', 'Concierge', '2025-08-26 11:21:21', '2025-08-26 11:21:21'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000170165138', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000166955002', 'Joseph Rakoski', NULL, '8/26/25: Joseph called, he went to an annual visit but the provider was not in network and paid out of pocket. I advised him to get a statement from provider with CPT codes and reach out to ARM to see if they can process it that way. AM', 'Concierge', 'Concierge', '2025-08-26 11:02:43', '2025-08-26 11:02:43'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000170165119', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000166857002', 'Nicole Kloenne', NULL, '8/26/25: Nicole called, feeling overwhelmed, about how to navigate her health issue. She explained that she went to the ER in August and having heart palpitations and an extra heart beat. She''s followed up with a specialist and had enough visits now to exceed her IUA. I advised her to go ahead and get a need started with Sedera - helped her get into portal and provided number so they can walk her through the process. AM', 'Concierge', 'Concierge', '2025-08-26 10:57:34', '2025-08-26 10:57:34'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000170165080', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000137618019', 'Jared Kaban', NULL, '8/26/25: Jared called. He has a colo coming up on Thurday and wants to know if he''s doing everything correctly. The provider is not coming up in PHCS search. I advised him to call and verify the network, if they aren''t - get cash rate price and call me back. <br><span><br></span>Jared called back - said that the provider called ARM and they verified they are in network, but if they pull polyps then, he would be billed. I explained that if that happned, it would become a needs case. AM', 'Concierge', 'Concierge', '2025-08-26 09:59:50', '2025-08-26 11:07:45'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000170120175', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000101280089', 'Jack Taylor', NULL, 'Member only $1000 IUA Premium Care', 'Patti Baron', 'Patti Baron', '2025-08-26 09:46:03', '2025-08-26 09:46:03'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000170120162', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000144870002', 'Aubrey Winik', NULL, 'Member submitted cancellation eff 9/25 citing getting Employer benefits.  I will process.', 'Patti Baron', 'Patti Baron', '2025-08-26 09:30:50', '2025-08-26 09:30:50'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000170165061', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000163494009', 'Katherine Totten', NULL, '8/26/25: Kste called back regarding getting a prescription filled. She said she''s also having a lot of trouble getting into her accounts. I walked her through rx quoting, using telehealth, and logging into MPB portal. <br>Cirrus wasn''t working- sent support ticket<br>I don''t know what she kept typing in but finally was able to get her into portal and explain some of the links in there. <br>Let her know that once the Cirrus login issue is resolved, she''ll get an email from Cirrus and I''ll reach out via phone call to make sure she can access it. <br><span><br></span>Cirrus got back to me letting me know she was already registered and sent email to reset password. <br>Called Kate to let her know. LVM. AM', 'Concierge', 'Concierge', '2025-08-26 09:23:04', '2025-08-26 11:48:53'),
