  ('zcrm_1579374000170158007', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000016132018', 'Robert Campbell', NULL, 'Member''s spouse Amy called in requesting to remove her two children from the membership as they are getting their own health insurance.  I told her we will email the change form to submit and will update the membership for October 1', 'Michele R', 'Michele R', '2025-08-26 06:43:57', '2025-08-26 06:43:57'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000170144067', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000163494009', 'Katherine Totten', NULL, '8-25-25 Kate called bc she needed help figuring out how to access prescriptions and log into her MPB Portal. She also wants to use the virtual healthcare app now to get a prescription. She was very confused and said the MPB portal was not hepful when she was able to login. She was thankful for my help and plans to call the MPB Concierge Team now.', 'Wendy Scipione - SR VP National Sales Advisor', 'Wendy Scipione - SR VP National Sales Advisor', '2025-08-25 16:22:16', '2025-08-25 16:22:16'),
