  ('zcrm_1579374000170126049', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000170090019', 'Patrick Erickson', NULL, 'I was contacted by the advisor that this member wanted to enroll in the $2500 IUA.  I will correct.', 'Patti Baron', 'Patti Baron', '2025-08-25 14:24:11', '2025-08-25 14:24:11'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000170144056', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000101280089', 'Jack Taylor', NULL, '8-25-25 Jack is enrolling in Premium Care. He asked about his son with Medicaid. But, we decided to leave it all alone until and unless Medicaid kicks him off or until the options for 2026 are released. He''s all set with $1000/$299 EO for Oct. 1st. He can choose Cobra if something goes wrong in Sept.', 'Wendy Scipione - SR VP National Sales Advisor', 'Wendy Scipione - SR VP National Sales Advisor', '2025-08-25 14:23:20', '2025-08-25 16:08:10'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000170126044', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000125284001', 'Marianne Ricciardi', NULL, 'Member called in with many questions around costs and workings of the membership.  She is contemplating a move to Zion direct.  She told me that her son would be coming off the plan soon as he would be getting his own coverage.  She is looking for ways to save money.  Member also looking to update her pmt method.  I sent her out the link.', 'Patti Baron', 'Patti Baron', '2025-08-25 14:22:00', '2025-08-26 06:54:49'),
