34);">(verification of benefits and claims):</span><br><span style="color:rgb(34, 34, 34);">800-877-7195</span><br><span style="color:rgb(34, 34, 34);">Initial premium will be withdrawn within 3 days of your policies effective date, subsequent premiums are due on the day of the month in which the policy was effective. Plan includes a one-time non-refundable enrollment fee of $25. This charge will be made at the time of purchase and may appear as a separate transaction from your insurance as Direct Vision or Direct Benefits, Inc. </span><br><span style="color:rgb(34, 34, 34);">Your specific coverage information is as follows:</span><br><span style="color:rgb(34, 34, 34);"><br></span><span style="color:rgb(34, 34, 34);">Plan Selected: VSP Choice Plan B</span><br><span style="color:rgb(34, 34, 34);">Who’s covered: Applicant + Family</span><br><span style="color:rgb(34, 34, 34);">Effective Date: 08/26/2025</span><br><span style="color:rgb(34, 34, 34);">Carrier: Ameritas</span><br><span style="color:rgb(34, 34, 34);">Monthly Charge: </span><span style="color:rgb(34, 34, 34);"><b>$33.60</b></span><br><span style="color:rgb(34, 34, 34);"><br></span><span style="color:rgb(34, 34, 34);">Policy Number: </span><span style="color:rgb(34, 34, 34);"><b>300159614</b></span><br><span style="color:rgb(34, 34, 34);">Age nt Info: </span><span style="color:rgb(34, 34, 34);"><b>Wendy Scipione (Phone : (720) 259-1555)</b></span><span style="color:rgb(34, 34, 34);"> </span><br><span style="color:rgb(34, 34, 34);">Questions? Call (844)833-8440</span><br><span style="color:rgb(34, 34, 34);"><br></span><span style="color:rgb(34, 34, 34);">©2025 Direct Benefits Inc, All rights reserved. </span><br><span style="color:rgb(34, 34, 34);">You are receiving this email from filling out an e-enrollment application form on the Direct Benefits website. </span><br><span style="color:rgb(34, 34, 34);">Our mailing address is: </span><br><span style="color:rgb(34, 34, 34);">Direct Benefits Inc, 7900 International Drive, Suite 1040, Bloomington, MN 55425</span><br><span style="color:rgb(34, 34, 34);">CA Agency License: 600496</span><br><span style="color:rgb(34, 34, 34);"> </span>', 'Wendy Scipione - SR VP National Sales Advisor', 'Wendy Scipione - SR VP National Sales Advisor', '2025-08-25 11:55:51', '2025-08-25 11:55:51'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000170144011', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000170144016', 'Christopher Harding', NULL, '8-25-25 Chris joined VSP Choice Plan B for his family of 3. It''s only $19.95 for family of 3 vs $18.95 for 2 people. He''s paid for dental and vision. He got bumped out of C4 to pay for Kaiser. He will call them in 7 days to make the payment via cc to gain points.', 'Wendy Scipione - SR VP National Sales Advisor', 'Wendy Scipione - SR VP National Sales Advisor', '2025-08-25 11:44:20', '2025-08-25 11:51:57'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000170144006', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000170144016', 'Christopher Harding', NULL, '8-25-25 1Dental Enrollment - <span style="color:rgb(34, 34, 34);"><a target="_blank" href="http://crharding2017@gmail.com" style="color:rgb(34, 34, 34);">crharding2017@gmail.com</a> just purchased a plan from your link! You will earn commission once the member is active beyond the 30-day trial period.</span>', 'Wendy Scipione - SR VP National Sales Advisor', 'Wendy Scipione - SR VP National Sales Advisor', '2025-08-25 11:38:11', '2025-08-25 11:38:11'),
