  ('zcrm_1579374000170120068', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000130372001', 'Sandra Ferris Maples', NULL, '8/25/25: Sandra called wanting to know if we manged her plan and what it covers. I explained briefly what she had with us. Turns out, she has a bad ear infection and needs to use telehealth. I was able to begin her registration and urged her to schedule a welcome call with us when she has time. Sent email to do so. AM<br><span><br></span>Sandra called back to let me know that she was not happy with telehealth bc they wouldn''t prescribe her medication for her ear infection. That the provider told her to see an allergist. AM', 'Concierge', 'Concierge', '2025-08-25 11:34:17', '2025-08-25 12:05:12'),
