  ('zcrm_1579374000170125011', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000098470001', 'Jen Coggin', NULL, '8/25/25<br>Jen called she wanted assistance navigating her benefits in the health wallet app AC', 'Concierge', 'Concierge', '2025-08-25 11:07:41', '2025-08-25 11:07:55'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000170120041', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000065203137', 'Sarah Wright', NULL, '8/25/25: Called to FU with Sarah about ER visit and opening request. They were all concerned that I needed something - let them know I was just here to help if they had questions about the processs. They said they''d take care of it later when they are on the road (aparently they have a trip coming up). AM', 'Concierge', 'Concierge', '2025-08-25 10:43:34', '2025-08-25 10:43:34'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000170121060', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000169904033', 'Scott Ramey', NULL, 'Spoke to member he will reschedule the welcome call after his start date of September 1, 2025. Sent email to do so. Vanessa Orozco', 'Concierge', 'Concierge', '2025-08-25 10:27:52', '2025-08-25 10:27:52'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000170125006', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000091159002', 'Daniel Cody', NULL, '8/25/25<br>Daniel called because he received an EOB from planstin for his wellness check. I adviced him to please have the provider the provider with an updated po box. AC', 'Concierge', 'Concierge', '2025-08-25 10:13:38', '2025-08-25 10:13:38'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000170120036', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000131624019', 'Charles Evers Whyte', NULL, '8/25/25: An orthopedic office called to verify Charle''s plan. Let the billing dept know he would be self pay. AM', 'Concierge', 'Concierge', '2025-08-25 09:58:44', '2025-08-25 09:58:44'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000170126006', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000161794002', 'Amanda Notman', NULL, 'Member submitted Payment Update.  I will process.', 'Patti Baron', 'Patti Baron', '2025-08-25 09:47:35', '2025-08-25 09:47:35'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000170126001', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000145560002', 'Stephanie Thompson', NULL, 'Member submitted Change Form to remove dependent from membership since he will be attending college.  This was received after the 20th so will be pended until next month. UPDATE: due to the fact that member notified Sedera of this change and took too much time to notify us I will have to honor this members request to remove dependent eff 9/1/25.  I have refunded difference of $313.', 'Patti Baron', 'Patti Baron', '2025-08-25 09:44:26', '2025-08-26 07:30:45'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000170125001', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000121090002', 'Jeri Smith', NULL, '8/25/25<br>Jeri called because she needed assistance with lyric. transfred her over to lyric AC', 'Concierge', 'Concierge', '2025-08-25 09:41:44', '2025-08-25 09:41:44'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000170121035', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000168215001', 'Dianna Knight', NULL, 'No response. Left a detailed message on vm. Not able to send email to email address on file to reschedule welcome call. Vanessa Orozco', 'Concierge', 'Concierge', '2025-08-25 09:34:58', '2025-08-25 09:34:58'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000170120017', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000088723002', 'Jodi Ayers', NULL, '8/25/25: Jodi called in saying she had a medical emergency over the weekend and is needing to pick up some prescriptions. She was stung by a wasp, went to the ER and now they prescribed an Epipen 2 pak, Prednisone and Pecid. I did a search while we were on the phone. The best prices for all came through health wallet. I emailed over the coupons along with instructions for accessing prices through app. Epipen-$188, Prednisone-$0, Pecid-$0. AM', 'Concierge', 'Concierge', '2025-08-25 09:26:33', '2025-08-25 09:26:33'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000170120004', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000109502001', 'David Hartman', NULL, '8/25/25: Elizabeth called asking about international coverage. Let her know guidelines for sharing. AM', 'Concierge', 'Concierge', '2025-08-25 08:55:50', '2025-08-25 08:55:50'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000170108063', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000169904061', 'Angela Ottmann', NULL, 'Member requested that I refund the $100 since she did not have access to the code at enrollment.  I will process.', 'Patti Baron', 'Patti Baron', '2025-08-25 08:24:24', '2025-08-25 08:24:24'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000170109030', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000113318002', 'Thomas Parker', NULL, '8/25/25: Lori emailed me letting me know that they cannot process the bill from what Nancy provided and called Labcorp directly to get the bill sent to them. Emailed Nancy the update and let her know that our goal is to have this processed the correct way, but if it still is an issue - we''ll look at alternative ways to get the bill paid. AM', 'Concierge', 'Concierge', '2025-08-25 08:21:55', '2025-08-25 08:21:55'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000170108055', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000004808067', 'Elisa Gustafson', NULL, 'Member submitted Change form to update address.  I will process.', 'Patti Baron', 'Patti Baron', '2025-08-25 08:16:56', '2025-08-25 08:16:56'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000170109023', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000140532002', 'Mary Covarrubias', NULL, '8/25/25: Finally heard back from Lori regarding Mary''s lab bill - She sent it over to clearing house for processing. Emailed Mary to let her know. AM', 'Concierge', 'Concierge', '2025-08-25 08:13:12', '2025-08-25 08:13:12'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000170116062', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000153932105', 'Allison O''Connor', NULL, '8/22/25<br>Allison called to express her dissatisfaction regarding the number of mental health sessions covered. She stated she was informed by someone from our company that she was eligible for 20 sessions, but later learned she only had access to 12. Additionally, she is upset that MPB/MSEAP did not notify her as she approached the session limit, nor informed her that the 5 additional sessions she attended would not be covered.<br>Allison is requesting that we either cover the cost of the sessions beyond her eligibility or take action to make the situation right.', 'Concierge', 'Concierge', '2025-08-25 08:09:55', '2025-08-25 08:09:55'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000170115031', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000169904033', 'Scott Ramey', NULL, 'No response. Left a detailed message on vm. Sent email to reschedule welcome call after start date of September 1, 2025. Vanessa Orozco', 'Concierge', 'Concierge', '2025-08-25 08:04:22', '2025-08-25 08:04:22'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000170109015', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000078939263', 'Rachelle Dunn', NULL, '8/25/25: Rachelled emailed back asking for an appt w/ Dr. Derwin Grey - I reached out to both offices Grey works at and neither accepted PHCS. Attempted Paul R. Moncla, MD at Total Care for Women and asked for a call back. Will keep working through list to verify before suggesting any back to Rachelle. AM', 'Concierge', 'Concierge', '2025-08-25 07:58:37', '2025-08-25 07:58:37'),
