  ('zcrm_1579374000170109001', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000102254002', 'Alli Totzke-Hitzeroth', NULL, '8/25/25: Allie left the following VM over the weekend: <span style="color:rgb(37, 40, 45);">Hi. My name is Allie Topski. I''m calling because I had submitted a request through the Message a Doctor, and it came back as canceled and said to contact for further information. I''m really frustrated with this new system because I''m not getting any updates on anything that I''ve submitted as well as things are just getting denied without commentary on why or any explanation of how to submit things differently. So if you could give me a call back, my number is 630-779-3424. It is absolutely okay to leave a voicemail according to any health records as well. Thank you.</span><br><span style="color:rgb(37, 40, 45);"><br></span><span style="color:rgb(37, 40, 45);">Attempted to call back but was unable to connect. AM</span>', 'Concierge', 'Concierge', '2025-08-25 07:15:47', '2025-08-25 07:15:47'),
