  ('zcrm_1579374000170022058', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000166952001', 'Mark Basil', NULL, '08/22/2025<br>Sent f/u message today to see if anyone reached out and spoke with julia about her issue. Trying to get health wallet to help her<br>AJ', 'Concierge', 'Concierge', '2025-08-22 14:33:57', '2025-08-22 14:33:57'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000170038046', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000091076023', 'Amie Brown', NULL, '8/22/25<br>Amie called because she had no clue who we are and why we are taking money out of her account. I explained she are a health share company for catastrophic coverage. She explained that she could not afford this plan and might cancel Ac', 'Concierge', 'Concierge', '2025-08-22 14:22:20', '2025-08-22 14:22:20'),
