  ('zcrm_1579374000170022030', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000166857002', 'Nicole Kloenne', NULL, '08/22/2025<br>If her doctor calls to verify that someone updated Faiths birthday to 2004 instead of 2008 they really needed a reference number. Reference # 4769<br>Use that number if any provider calls to verify the notes on the birthday update<br>I updated the birthday in Zoho and just need to talk to patti about how to update in E123 and Nicole will also be sending in the form to update the birthday<br>AJ', 'Concierge', 'Concierge', '2025-08-22 14:16:49', '2025-08-22 14:25:41'),
