  ('zcrm_1579374000170051001', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000131819010', 'Marni Shymkus', NULL, '8-22-25 I responded to her email a few days ago and I just left Marni a vm now to check in and make sure she got what she needed for the college.', 'Wendy Scipione - SR VP National Sales Advisor', 'Wendy Scipione - SR VP National Sales Advisor', '2025-08-22 11:08:54', '2025-08-22 11:08:54'),
