  ('zcrm_1579374000170038031', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000152633020', 'Dylan Miller', NULL, '8/15/25<br>Dylan called to get more information on his mental health benefits and I explaied how it it all virtual. He sid he wanted to hold of for the time sice he wanted in person seccions AC', 'Concierge', 'Concierge', '2025-08-22 11:04:47', '2025-08-22 11:04:47'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000170038026', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000115999002', 'Keith Bakos', NULL, '8/15/25<br>Mary called wanting to be switched as the primary member. I informed her that we would not be able to do the switch since she will be aging into medicaid in 2 month, I explaied patties not below AC', 'Concierge', 'Concierge', '2025-08-22 11:02:04', '2025-08-22 11:02:04'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000170038021', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000011521706', 'Jeffrey Walker', NULL, '8/22/25<br>Jeffery called to see if a mammogram would be covered since he received a bill for his wife. it seems like his wife gave the provider her old planstin card. jeff will give the providers that new MEC card Ac', 'Concierge', 'Concierge', '2025-08-22 10:47:54', '2025-08-22 10:47:54'),
