  ('zcrm_1579374000170015186', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000073820032', 'Ottis Fausett', NULL, 'Donna Fraleigh called in and wanted to update the payment method.  I advised that I would send link out to the email on file.  They could update if need be.  If this 3rd parrty calles again I will advise that we will need a Permission to discuss Form filled out.', 'Patti Baron', 'Patti Baron', '2025-08-22 09:54:49', '2025-08-22 09:54:49'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000170019133', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000010282165', 'Alicia Turbidy', NULL, '8/22/25: Spoke to Alicia about Sedera not using 2nd MD anymore and <br>She really wants a second opinion on a mamm and ultrasound. <br><br>Received info from Julia about new service Sedera is using for second opinions  - Summus. Called Sedera to get the details of how this works and is different from 2ndMD. They said they prefer members to only use this in relation to an open mendial need. <br><br>Reached out to Alicia, but Wendy had already provided Summus info - told her I''d check in next week to make sure everything worked out for her, but to call me if she has issues. <br>AM', 'Concierge', 'Concierge', '2025-08-22 09:47:57', '2025-08-26 07:47:36'),
