  ('zcrm_1579374000170019112', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000127150001', 'Cynthia Barrett', NULL, '8/22/25: Cynthia called - she''s needing to go to dr for issue and wondering if it''s covered. She doesn''t really understand her plan too well. I advised her to use her telehealth first and provided info for HW app. AM', 'Concierge', 'Concierge', '2025-08-22 09:39:16', '2025-08-22 09:39:16'),
