  ('zcrm_1579374000170015081', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000134448007', 'Robert Ridpath', 'Decline of 9/25 Share Amount', '8/22-1st notice sent to member and advisor via em &amp; vm<br>8/25-2nd notice sent to member &amp; advisor via em<br>8/27-3rd notice sent to member &amp; advisor  via em<br>8/29-Member cancelled due to non-pmt<br>9/2-sent Final Notice of Cancellation to member &amp; advisor via em. Member replied to this email requesting that his membership be reinstated, due to the funds were available ahead of the 3pm deadline, and that he did not need to update his account, and anticipated another charge attempt by MPBHealth.  I replied that Patti was out of the office until Monday, September 8th at which time we would address is request and respond accordingly.<br>9/3-Karina spoke with Rachelle at Zion and was able to reinstate the membership.  Karina charged the share amount. I am sending him an email of Payment Processing Verification.', 'Patti Baron', 'Patti Baron', '2025-08-22 08:43:16', '2025-09-03 14:20:02'),
