  ('zcrm_1579374000169948670', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000101280089', 'Jack Taylor', NULL, '8-21-25 Jack is retiring from school system. He''s tired of teaching. He may get another job down the road but not for now. His income will solely be from PARA at $4500 per month which is $54K. At that income level he gets an APTC of $575 and son would qualify for CHP+. Son is currently on Medicaid and has had some accidents from sports as a 16 year old. He will be filing taxes in 2025 to include his son. Jacks DOB 2-7-68 and son JohnHenry 12-18-2008. Jack is super healthy, no pre-x, only takes half an ambien sometimes for sleep and nothing else. They travel for baseball to Atlanta, Dallas, Cincinatti, and AZ, etc. When we looked at ACA he is most interested in catastrophic at $280.21 <a style="color:rgb(26, 112, 179);background-color:rgb(231, 246, 254);display:inline;" target="_blank" href="https://planfinder.connectforhealthco.com/plan-results"><u>Anthem Bronze Pathway Essentials 8000 for HSA</u></a>. I''ll send him the 3 options we discussed. Then we moved onto Premium Care since his benefits will be much better and his income doesn''t matter. He won''t have to mess with his account for his son either. He wants to share this with friends in Telluride and his son''s mom. She''s older and has some aches and pains. But, her costs are pretty high around $450+ for a bad plan. He will share it with many people and is excited for the $100 referral fee.  He mentioned a card he used to have called the Free Card that gave him incredible prices for stem cell therapy, labs, doctor visits, etc. via UMR. I''m not sure but it sounds incredible. He also might benefit from the supplement discounts for protein shakes and amino acids for him and son. We will revisit on Monday. He might have to back date Cobra to Sept. 1st if anything happens in Sept. He will have to choose Oct. 1st start date for Premium Care  $1000/$299. Or, choose C4 and start Sept. 1st.', 'Wendy Scipione - SR VP National Sales Advisor', 'Wendy Scipione - SR VP National Sales Advisor', '2025-08-21 15:48:10', '2025-08-21 15:48:10'),
