  ('zcrm_1579374000169948665', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000155863212', 'Hillary Thomas', NULL, '8-20-25 Tracy called to understand what bills to submit and what not to bother with. Most are preventive or cosmetic and not shareable and the ones rejected by HAB already. She has 3 chiro visits for $245, $250 and $245 done in Jackson Hole, WY. It sounds like maintenance not a new injury. But she''ll submit it just in case they accept them if/when she exceeds $1000. She''s all set for now.', 'Wendy Scipione - SR VP National Sales Advisor', 'Wendy Scipione - SR VP National Sales Advisor', '2025-08-21 13:47:53', '2025-08-21 13:47:53'),
