  ('zcrm_1579374000169887611', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000153857910', 'Heather Ravera', NULL, '8/21/25: Mike called, he''s trying to get into portal for Heather but it''s taking him to his old account. I let him know that he''d have to speak to Zion to get Heather set up with her own portal access if this is the first time they are submitting a request under this new member ID. Connected to ZIon. AM', 'Concierge', 'Concierge', '2025-08-21 12:01:06', '2025-08-21 12:01:06'),
