  ('zcrm_1579374000169887603', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000113318002', 'Thomas Parker', NULL, '8/21/25: Called ARM to check on if there''s anything we can do for Nancy to get these bills moved through - at this point, it''s been 2 months. I already emailed the info a couple days ago. Anna said they were having lunch and asked if she could call back.......AM', 'Concierge', 'Concierge', '2025-08-21 11:53:07', '2025-08-21 11:53:07'),
