  ('zcrm_1579374000169887598', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000078939263', 'Rachelle Dunn', NULL, '8/21/25: Rachelle submitted an appt request for obgyn, however provider listed is not in network. Called to go over other options, unable to reach. Left detailed message. Sent email prom PHCS site with available OBGYNs in her area and asking how she would like to proceed. AM', 'Concierge', 'Concierge', '2025-08-21 11:33:51', '2025-08-21 11:33:51'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000169887593', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000094942002', 'Tim Ottmann', NULL, '8/21/25: Analisa called bc she wanted to know why Angela needed to sign up again since Tim is aging into medicare. I let her know it''s bc Tim is currently the primary, so Angela will need to re-enroll as the primary on the account. Transferred to Patti for assistance. AM', 'Concierge', 'Concierge', '2025-08-21 11:31:31', '2025-08-21 11:31:31'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000169887574', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000157231043', 'jennifer dudley-Pieropan', NULL, '8/21/25: Jennifer called ready to be walked through submitting husband''s endo for additional giving and starting a sharing request with her recent visits. She wasn''t able to begin sharing request bc there was an issue within the portal. Brought Zion in (Michelle) who said it''s bc she was in the older portal, but needed a new email to register for new one. Michelle needed to get with someone and call Jennifer back to get that corrected so she can use her current email.<br><span><br></span>I advised that when Michelle calls her back, get her to walk through submitting to additional giving and when you do, reach out to me at the concierge email. AM', 'Concierge', 'Concierge', '2025-08-21 11:28:59', '2025-08-21 11:28:59'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000169879277', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000081885001', 'Douglas Doran', NULL, '8/21/25<br>Natalie called because she received a bill for her mammogram. I informed her that we did not recive this claim and to please have them resubmit this claim AC', 'Concierge', 'Concierge', '2025-08-21 10:50:57', '2025-08-21 10:50:57'),
