  ('zcrm_1579374000169934154', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000163684002', 'Massa Lavant', NULL, 'Member called me very confused wanting to know what she was paying for.  She told me that she is paying for alot out of pocket and wants to know what she is paying for.  She has not done a Welcome Call.  I tried to explain how the membership works but she just wants to pay a small amount when she sees a provider.  We talked about opening a HSA account, that was her main motivator in enrolling.   I asked Vanessa to reach out to her and do a Welcome call with her if she could.', 'Patti Baron', 'Patti Baron', '2025-08-21 10:36:54', '2025-08-21 10:36:54'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000169996371', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000169961003', 'Kylie Fernandez', NULL, 'No response. Left a detailed message on vm. Sent email to reschedule welcome call after start date of September 1, 2025. Vanessa Orozco', 'Concierge', 'Concierge', '2025-08-21 10:33:35', '2025-08-21 10:33:35'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000169907409', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000048514500', 'Johnnie Harriman', NULL, '08/21/2025<br>sent f/u email to see if they got the bill taken care of for colo<br>AJ', 'Concierge', 'Concierge', '2025-08-21 10:19:56', '2025-08-21 10:19:56'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000169879260', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000079059075', 'Jon Hancock', '8/20/25', 'John called back wanting assistance finding an in-network dermatologist for his skin check. I informed him that ARM no longer covers a skin check at the dermatologist. He was confused with this information since me <span style="color:rgb(255, 255, 255);background-color:rgb(31, 31, 31);">colleague</span>mention it would be covered. I apologized and asked if he would give me some time to look into it and to ensure we are all giving the same information. AC', 'Concierge', 'Concierge', '2025-08-21 10:12:45', '2025-08-21 10:12:45'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000169879255', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000002724127', 'Paul DeFelice', NULL, '8/21/25<br>Paul responded to our f/u email and has confirmed him and his wife had their colo procedure and ARM has paid those bills will close this task AC', 'Concierge', 'Concierge', '2025-08-21 10:07:29', '2025-08-21 10:07:29'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000169887545', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000165842030', 'Niccole Swim', NULL, '8/21/25: Nicole called stating she never received anything about her plan. Sent fulfillment letter via mail merge, requested a letter be mailed to her, helped her log into account and walked her through setting up an appointment for a welcome call. AM', 'Concierge', 'Concierge', '2025-08-21 09:27:59', '2025-08-21 09:27:59'),
