  ('zcrm_1579374000169887483', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000157224002', 'Timothy Craig', NULL, '8/21/25: Sent a FU email in our thread regarding son''s surgery need and reimbursement. AM<br>Tim responded with an update - he''s not sure if he should submit bills for his latest ER visit and son''s surgery or not. I let him know that if they are going to exceed his IUA of 5K, then yes - however, if they haven''t I would hold off just knowing he has 6 months to open a needs case from date of service. AM', 'Concierge', 'Concierge', '2025-08-21 07:37:37', '2025-08-25 08:09:13'),
