  ('zcrm_1579374000169887459', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000167776002', 'Tonya Russell', NULL, '8/21/25: Checked Tonya''s login this morning and it appears to FINALLY be working. Sent her an email letting her know it is fixed. AM', 'Concierge', 'Concierge', '2025-08-21 07:23:54', '2025-08-21 07:23:54'),
