  ('zcrm_1579374000169936108', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000100491002', 'Michelle Faciana', NULL, '8/20/25<br>Michelle called too see what she needs to do with her new ARM card, i explained to her that for preventative appointments the provider can send the claims to the po box on the card AC', 'Concierge', 'Concierge', '2025-08-20 17:15:15', '2025-08-20 17:15:15'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000169936103', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000159732002', 'Chad Moore', NULL, '8/20/25<br>Chad called to confirm his plan is hsa compatible AC', 'Concierge', 'Concierge', '2025-08-20 17:12:10', '2025-08-20 17:12:10'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000169936098', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000129638010', 'Douglas Merrifield', NULL, '8/20/25<br>Douglas has un upcoming appointment for an echo cardiogram, I advised him to present as self pay and save all his receipts for when he reaches his iua AC', 'Concierge', 'Concierge', '2025-08-20 17:10:45', '2025-08-20 17:10:45'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000169936093', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000164387002', 'Karl Bowers', NULL, '8/20/25<br>Sophia called to see what she neededto do for her mammogram and welness check. I adviced her to find an in network provider first and then go from there AC', 'Concierge', 'Concierge', '2025-08-20 17:06:36', '2025-08-20 17:06:36'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000169936088', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000154723001', 'Madeleine McGuire', NULL, '8/20/25<br>Madelaine called because she has 6 bills that need to be paid. The providers office claims they sent the claim to a po box in Miami and it has been accepted. I informed the member that we do not have a po box in Miami and that no claims have been filled on her behalf. she has several non- preventative appointment and i explained those would not be covered. She asked if i could reach out to the provider so figure out what happened.<br><span><br></span>I called the billing department for the provider and submitted to them her ARM card information and requested they submit any preventative(mentiond only things in the aca) bills to us AC', 'Concierge', 'Concierge', '2025-08-20 17:04:01', '2025-08-20 17:04:01'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000169936083', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000155863212', 'Hillary Thomas', NULL, '8/20/25<br>Tracy called on behalf of Hilary to see who she would submit her chiropractic bills, I explained that she has to meet her IUA before the health share can cover any bills. AC', 'Concierge', 'Concierge', '2025-08-20 16:18:58', '2025-08-20 16:18:58'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000169936078', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000119666009', 'Melinda Deckert', NULL, '8/20/25<br>Melinda called to see if there was an update on her claims that she submitted yesterday, i infomred her it takes at least 2 weeks for the calim to be procces so at this time i would not have any updates AC', 'Concierge', 'Concierge', '2025-08-20 16:16:28', '2025-08-20 16:16:28'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000169907314', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000130562001', 'Philip Ender', NULL, '08/20/2025<br>Let Esther know that i was able to validate that Dean west in her area still takes PHCS and i set up an appointment that she just needs to reach out and finalize the details of for an OBGYN appt. Now just waiting on the primary provider i called to reach out for her annual physical as well. Will also reach out and see if the OBGYN could do that for her.<br>AJ', 'Concierge', 'Concierge', '2025-08-20 15:18:38', '2025-08-20 15:18:38'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000169907309', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000153824002', 'Samuel Young', NULL, '08/20/2025<br>Sunny reminded me she still needed a quote for Enbrel. Ran it and sent her the numbers. It is really expensive like $1,800 per shot<br>AJ', 'Concierge', 'Concierge', '2025-08-20 15:16:54', '2025-08-20 15:16:54'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000169907304', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000109018002', 'Cathie Kovacs', NULL, '08/20/2025<br>Talked to Cathie through text. She had a couple of questions about lab work being covered. Let her know if it is coded preventative she should be good. If diagnostic she could have some out of pocket<br>AJ', 'Concierge', 'Concierge', '2025-08-20 15:15:34', '2025-08-20 15:15:34'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000169907285', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000166781002', 'David Meyer', NULL, '08/20/2025<br>Called to add daughter to membership. Sent him the update form and since it is almost 5 and Patti is already gone i will check tomorrow morning (08/21/2025) to make sure she got the form.<br>AJ', 'Concierge', 'Concierge', '2025-08-20 15:02:51', '2025-08-20 15:02:51'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000169907264', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000162648002', 'Zach Meschi', NULL, '08/20/2025<br>Isabel called in to get assistance with the health wallet primary care option. She wanted to get a medication refilled. Could not help her get around the pharmacy not showing up when they search for it so i gave her the number for lyric to see if they could help her. Let her know if she still has troubles to let us know so we can address it and get it fixed.<br>AJ', 'Concierge', 'Concierge', '2025-08-20 15:00:47', '2025-08-20 15:00:47'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000169907259', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000128845002', 'JoAnn Riedl', NULL, '08/20/2025<br>Called to ask about a mammogram she needs to get. Let her know that since her only other option is 2 hours away ARM would be willing to work with in or out of network provider as long as they do not charge way over the average price for a mammogram. She said they quoted a couple hundred dollars so i advised her to just make sure everything is coded preventative and if the provider will not send the bill to ARM directly then if she could get the bill we could asist her with submitting it for processing<br>AJ', 'Concierge', 'Concierge', '2025-08-20 14:58:04', '2025-08-20 14:58:04'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000169907254', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000100491002', 'Michelle Faciana', NULL, '08/20/2025<br>assisted her with her telehealth logging in. Also answered a bunch of her questions about all of the recent changes and upgrades. She did not know about ARm/planstin switch and wanted to just know more and learn about the health wallet app and her new features. Walked her through all of it and told her call us if she has issues<br>AJ', 'Concierge', 'Concierge', '2025-08-20 14:54:35', '2025-08-20 14:54:35'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000169907249', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000108294002', 'John Mone', NULL, '08/20/2025<br>Called to verify information about RX quote<br>AJ', 'Concierge', 'Concierge', '2025-08-20 14:53:11', '2025-08-20 14:53:11'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000169907244', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000140532002', 'Mary Covarrubias', NULL, '08/20/2025<br>Called to verify her provider was in network which she was<br>AJ', 'Concierge', 'Concierge', '2025-08-20 14:51:42', '2025-08-20 14:51:42'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000169920285', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000169910049', 'Matthew Luby', NULL, 'Member &amp; Fam $1000 IUA Direct', 'Patti Baron', 'Patti Baron', '2025-08-20 14:33:10', '2025-08-20 14:33:10'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000169920277', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000154723001', 'Madeleine McGuire', NULL, 'Member called to check on the status of her "claims".  Told me she had 6 visits that she had just received bills for from providers.  I asked what kind of visits they were and she told me that they were "maternity". I told her that those services would not fall under Preventative and that she should be in touch with Zion to open a Maternity need.  She hne told me that she had a miscarried.  I directed her to Zion to ask how this should be handeled.', 'Patti Baron', 'Patti Baron', '2025-08-20 14:23:52', '2025-08-20 14:23:52'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000169907239', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000167892005', 'Kelly Petty', NULL, '08/20/2025<br>Called to get help and some guidance since she is new and just started. Showed her the health wallet and how to log in so she can see her digital ID cards. Physical ones were mailed out last week. Also sent her links to reschedule welcome call and links to the tier 1 and 2 med discounts. <br>AJ', 'Concierge', 'Concierge', '2025-08-20 14:16:40', '2025-08-20 14:16:40'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000169920272', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000169910033', 'Macy Davis', NULL, 'Member Only $1000 IUA Secure', 'Patti Baron', 'Patti Baron', '2025-08-20 13:40:22', '2025-08-20 13:40:22'),
