  ('zcrm_1579374000169907143', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000158795002', 'Deatra Jones-Dixon', NULL, '08/20/2025<br>Deatra called because she could not log in  to the portal. I pulled up her credentials and helped her get into the portal. Also requested from accounting to send her all of her previous bills since she asked for them. <br>AJ', 'Concierge', 'Concierge', '2025-08-20 13:04:49', '2025-08-20 13:04:49'),
