  ('zcrm_1579374000169966039', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000119666009', 'Melinda Deckert', NULL, 'Member called in wanting the phone number for ARM as she wanted to follow up on some receipts.  I gave her the toll free number and she also asked for her Member ID number.', 'Michele R', 'Michele R', '2025-08-20 12:17:28', '2025-08-20 12:17:28'),
