  ('zcrm_1579374000169948580', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000169959013', 'Lisa Side', NULL, '8-20-25 Lisa does consulting on the side and just uses her SS#. She''s already a member of Dr. Mary Ellen Francescani''s Middleway Wellness DPC. We used her link to enroll. She''s choosing $419/$1000  for Secure HSA with a Sept. 1st start date. Setting it up with ACH.', 'Wendy Scipione - SR VP National Sales Advisor', 'Wendy Scipione - SR VP National Sales Advisor', '2025-08-20 12:13:01', '2025-08-20 12:14:39'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000169887432', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000080094010', 'Amy Jacobs-Schroeder', NULL, '8/20/25: Sean emailed in stating that the proof of benefit letter was denied. See concierge email for details. Upon consulting with Julia, I sent over the SOB for ARM hoping that suffices but clarifying that the MEC is not fully ACA compliant. AM', 'Concierge', 'Concierge', '2025-08-20 11:51:52', '2025-08-20 11:51:52'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000169887427', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000069838033', 'James Truett III', NULL, '8/20/25: Grace called- she has an rx that she typically has written by Cirrus and needed to know how to schedule a visit through HW. I walked her through the new telehealth services and scheduling. AM', 'Concierge', 'Concierge', '2025-08-20 11:50:17', '2025-08-20 11:50:17'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000169966031', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000166349002', 'Daniyal Ansari', NULL, 'Member submitted Dependent Over 18 Form.  I will process.<br>8/20:  left voicemail for Member to clarify information that she provided on the Cognito Form for her Dependent (Zainab Khatoon). Zainab (Spouse) returned my voicemail and we confirmed that the correct social security number for Dependent Zainab Khatoon is the one that we already have on file, not the one she submitted in the Cognito Form dated 8/20/25.', 'Michele R', 'Michele R', '2025-08-20 11:49:06', '2025-08-20 14:35:55'),
