  ('zcrm_1579374000169887414', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000161284002', 'Norman Kraakmo', NULL, '8/20/25: Sherril called asking if we could send her a fulfilllment package. I resent fulfillment email, put in a physical card request, and asked Jacobo to send another package. Verified address. Also let her know how to access ID card in the meantime through health wallet. She had a lot of questions about HSA accounts. Sent HSA bank email and provided some general info. AM', 'Concierge', 'Concierge', '2025-08-20 11:18:50', '2025-08-20 11:18:50'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000169887409', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000108294002', 'John Mone', NULL, '8/20/25: RX QUOTE: John submitted an rx quote request for <span style="color:rgb(51, 51, 51);">Terzepitide. In the notes section, he stated how much he''s paying for the medication - $400/month which is already THE BEST price. I called and spoke to John and his wife and advised them to open a sharing request for the med since Zion will share up to $3000 for weight loss. AM</span>', 'Concierge', 'Concierge', '2025-08-20 11:16:46', '2025-08-20 11:16:46'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000169884618', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000155097001', 'Rosanne Garza', NULL, 'Member had to reschedule welcome call. I rescheduled her welcome call refresher for her for Friday, September 5, 2025 at 1:00pm EST. Very confused member and not computer friendly. This will be the 5th time someone will be going over plan with her. Look back at notes. Vanessa Orozco', 'Concierge', 'Concierge', '2025-08-20 11:05:56', '2025-08-20 11:30:56'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000169887387', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000027885384', 'Jennifer Cowden', NULL, '8/20/25: Called Jennifer and left detailed vm letting her know that her daughter is indeed active and has never been dropped. I verified through ARM portal as well. AM', 'Concierge', 'Concierge', '2025-08-20 10:44:34', '2025-08-20 10:44:34'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000169936066', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000133865034', 'Astrid Weisseise', NULL, '8/19/25<br>Astrid called to get some medical advise from us but I advised her to connect with a provider through telehealth Ac', 'Concierge', 'Concierge', '2025-08-20 10:34:59', '2025-08-20 10:35:15'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000169936061', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000110424034', 'Todd Schrum', NULL, '8/19/25<br>Todd wanted to know what he needed to do to open a sharing request, connected him with zion health AC', 'Concierge', 'Concierge', '2025-08-20 10:22:29', '2025-08-20 10:22:29'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000169936056', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000081753002', 'Anja Price', NULL, '8/20/25<br>Anja called to see what she needs to do if she where to get a surgery, I explained to her how the health share works AC', 'Concierge', 'Concierge', '2025-08-20 10:20:26', '2025-08-20 10:20:26'),
