  ('zcrm_1579374000169887353', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000132699001', 'Heidi Faith', NULL, '8/20/25: Called Heidi to discuss appointment scheduling request and lvm. I reached out to several providers within PHCS network and the first few were scheduling out to March of next year. The soonest available I could find was November through Scripps clinic in San Diego with Dr. Kim Hui. <br><span><br></span>Appt info: <br>November 6, 2025<br>10:40am<br><p style=""><span style="color:rgb(74, 74, 74);">Kim Hui, MD</span></p><ul style="list-style-type:disc;list-style-position:inside;"><li style="list-style-image:none;"><p style="display:inline;"><span style="color:rgb(74, 74, 74);display:inline-block;font-weight:normal;font-style:normal;">Obstetrics and Gynecology</span></p></li></ul><a style="display:inline;" target="_blank" href="https://www.scripps.org/physicians/6849-kim-hui"><u>https://www.scripps.org/physicians/6849-kim-hui</u></a><span></span><br><p style="display:flex;"><span style="color:rgb(74, 74, 74);">Scripps Clinic Hillcrest</span></p><p style="display:flex;"><span style="color:rgb(74, 74, 74);">2918 Fifth Ave</span></p><p style="display:flex;"><span style="color:rgb(74, 74, 74);">#100</span></p><p style="display:flex;"><span style="color:rgb(74, 74, 74);">San Diego, CA 92103</span></p><p style="background-color:transparent;display:block;"><span style="color:rgb(13, 108, 157);background-color:transparent;"> Get directions</span></p><p style="display:flex;"><a style="color:rgb(13, 108, 157);background-color:transparent;display:inline;" target="_blank" href="tel:+16196880770"><u>619-688-0770</u></a><span></span></p>', 'Concierge', 'Concierge', '2025-08-20 09:46:42', '2025-08-20 09:46:42'),
