  ('zcrm_1579374000169887348', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000109742001', 'Abigail Chan', NULL, '8/20/25: Abigail called very confused bc she had a telehealth appt scheduled with Lyric, but since it''s white labeled they kept saying your appt with MPB Health provider has been rescheduled and she didn''t know how to get in touch with them to cancel or reschedule. They ended up calling while we were on phone. AM', 'Concierge', 'Concierge', '2025-08-20 09:44:12', '2025-08-21 08:13:12'),
