  ('zcrm_1579374000169936040', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000153932105', 'Allison O''Connor', NULL, '8/19/25<br>Called back allison she left us a vm AC', 'Concierge', 'Concierge', '2025-08-19 17:40:21', '2025-08-19 17:40:21'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000169936035', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000144055012', 'Kate Wasserman', NULL, '8/19/25<br>Called back after she left a vm AC', 'Concierge', 'Concierge', '2025-08-19 17:34:05', '2025-08-19 17:34:05'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000169936030', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000168289025', 'John Sparks', NULL, '8/19/25<br>John called to set up his telehealth benefit AC', 'Concierge', 'Concierge', '2025-08-19 17:30:42', '2025-08-19 17:30:42'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000169936025', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000089065002', 'Susan Fontana', NULL, '8/19/25<br>Susana called to see what her benefits are with this plan Ac', 'Concierge', 'Concierge', '2025-08-19 17:26:18', '2025-08-19 17:26:18'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000169936020', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000149209408', 'Mark Newberg', NULL, '8/19/25<br>Mark called to cancel their account with us AC', 'Concierge', 'Concierge', '2025-08-19 17:19:52', '2025-08-19 17:19:52'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000169936015', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000088967001', 'Kristen Victor', NULL, '8/19/25<br>Kristen called requesting an authorization code for her therapist in order to begin a new treatment plan through MSEAP. I informed her that, based on my understanding, MSEAP is active until 8/31/2025 <b>only</b> for those who currently have an active treatment session – which she does <b>not</b>.<br>I explained that she would need to transition to LRYC for future services. Kristen insisted that she had access to information indicating otherwise, referencing what she said Angee had told her earlier in the day.<br>I asked for time to clarify the situation with my manager, but Kristen stated that her appointment is early in the morning. Due to her insistence that she can still use MSEAP, I provided her with the MSEAP contact number so she can reach out directly and request the authorization code.', 'Concierge', 'Concierge', '2025-08-19 17:18:33', '2025-08-19 17:18:33'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000169948034', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000149171052', 'Bailey Johnson', NULL, '8-19-25 Bailey called bc she wants the HAB for dental, mental health, etc. Sadly I can''t offer it to her anymore. She was hoping for couples therapy. I told her about the new mental health counseling and she''s open to trying that upon her return from travels in Nov. or so. I believe it should be accessible for sure by then. She will give it a whirl.', 'Wendy Scipione - SR VP National Sales Advisor', 'Wendy Scipione - SR VP National Sales Advisor', '2025-08-19 16:51:30', '2025-08-19 16:51:30'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000169948029', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000149171052', 'Bailey Johnson', NULL, '8-19-25 I called Bailey and left vm bc Concierge said she''s looking to add some benefits to her membership.', 'Wendy Scipione - SR VP National Sales Advisor', 'Wendy Scipione - SR VP National Sales Advisor', '2025-08-19 16:25:23', '2025-08-19 16:25:23'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000169948024', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000061006173', 'Brian Delaney', NULL, '8-19-25 Left vm for Brian and also sent him an email to help him understand what''s included for wellness in his membership.', 'Wendy Scipione - SR VP National Sales Advisor', 'Wendy Scipione - SR VP National Sales Advisor', '2025-08-19 16:22:21', '2025-08-19 16:22:21'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000169948019', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000011497108', 'Kathleen Walsh', NULL, '8-19-25 Kathleen is aging into Medicare. I''m trying to find out if anyone knows a Medicare person in NC. Awaiting response.', 'Wendy Scipione - SR VP National Sales Advisor', 'Wendy Scipione - SR VP National Sales Advisor', '2025-08-19 16:09:54', '2025-08-19 16:09:54'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000169948014', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000054641074', 'Kerek Swanson', NULL, '8-19-25 Kerek''s job ended and he needs a Sept. 1st start date. He wants Care+ again and is fine without wellness bc he does that on his own through alternative care. $273/$1000 and I waived the $100 since he''s been a member before.', 'Wendy Scipione - SR VP National Sales Advisor', 'Wendy Scipione - SR VP National Sales Advisor', '2025-08-19 15:41:09', '2025-08-19 15:41:09'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000169907078', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000144055012', 'Kate Wasserman', NULL, '08/19/2025<br>Helped her by giving guidance through telehealth to get treatment for a UTI.<br>AJ', 'Concierge', 'Concierge', '2025-08-19 15:05:53', '2025-08-19 15:05:53'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000169907070', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000057645404', 'James (JP) Boylan', NULL, '08/19/2025<br>Called to say they were good after share request<br>AJ', 'Concierge', 'Concierge', '2025-08-19 15:04:32', '2025-08-19 15:04:32'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000169907065', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000119666009', 'Melinda Deckert', NULL, '08/19/2025<br>Helped her with letting her know where to send bills for preventative care. also let her know to submit some older bills for possible reimburse.<br>AJ', 'Concierge', 'Concierge', '2025-08-19 15:03:52', '2025-08-19 15:03:52'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000169907060', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000073656124', 'Lesa Russell', NULL, '08/19/2025<br>Questions about cologaurd. Exaplined possible false positive causing it to be diagnostic if it comes up that way<br>AJ', 'Concierge', 'Concierge', '2025-08-19 15:02:19', '2025-08-19 15:02:19'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000169907053', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000164754002', 'Catherine Rottinghaus', NULL, '08/19/2025<br>Send email with price sheets<br>Looked up quotes for Vraylar<br>sending link to lyric upgrade<br>AJ', 'Concierge', 'Concierge', '2025-08-19 14:52:47', '2025-08-19 14:52:47'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000169907048', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000149171052', 'Bailey Johnson', NULL, '08/19/2025<br>Ran Rx quote for QVAR<br><ul style="list-style-type:disc;list-style-position:inside;"><li style="list-style-image:none;"><p style=" display:inline;"><span style="color:rgb(17, 17, 17);background-color:rgb(255, 241, 118);font-weight:normal;font-style:normal;">Qvar</span><span style="color:rgb(17, 17, 17);font-weight:normal;font-style:normal;"> Redihaler 100mcg (Beclomethasone) - 1 x 200 dose inhalers, brand- $112.68+$9.95 (shipping)</span><span style="color:rgb(17, 17, 17);background-color:rgb(255, 241, 118);font-weight:normal;font-style:normal;">
