  ('zcrm_1579374000169887001', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000164546001', 'Heinz Kuster', NULL, '8/19/25: Heinz emailed in asking when welcome call is scheduled - Let him know it''s for 12 noon EST today. AM', 'Concierge', 'Concierge', '2025-08-19 07:12:06', '2025-08-19 07:12:06'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000169884011', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000103737002', 'Matthew Hatcher', NULL, 'Member submitted Cancellation Form Eff 9/1. I will process. Cancellation verification email was sent to the email address on file.  Cognito Form showed a different email address.', 'Michele R', 'Michele R', '2025-08-19 07:04:54', '2025-08-19 07:13:53'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000169885001', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000167982018', 'Christina O''Connor', NULL, 'Member submitted Change Form to remove her dependent from the membership eff 9/1/25 due to the fact that her college would not accept MCS as proof of insurance.  I have let Julia know as she was pursuing following up w/the college.', 'Patti Baron', 'Patti Baron', '2025-08-19 07:01:11', '2025-08-19 07:01:11'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000169884001', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000124216002', 'Bradon Erickson', NULL, 'Member submitted Cancellation Form Eff 9/1. I will process.', 'Michele R', 'Michele R', '2025-08-19 06:54:41', '2025-08-19 06:54:41'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000169799103', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000169948549', 'Emily Rhoades', NULL, '8-18-25 Cindy Gordon referred Emily to me. She is just settling into CO and just turned 26 I think. She will get a sizable APTC according to Cindy.  I have a meeting set up with her on Wed. She created her C4 account and selected me as her agent.', 'Wendy Scipione - SR VP National Sales Advisor', 'Wendy Scipione - SR VP National Sales Advisor', '2025-08-18 21:54:44', '2025-08-18 21:54:44'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000169799093', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000168202017', 'Sean Coyne', NULL, '8-18-25 Janet called wanting dental and vision. She would love VSP and it looks like Dr. Gregory Keene with Keene Smiles is not in network anywhere. She will find out for sure. But, I sent her the Spirit Dental options. Sean or her husband is in the middle of an implant right now and has many other dental issues. The implant will cost about $4K. I don''t see a great way to handle that since Dr. Keene is not in either of 1Dental networks. The Spirit Dental plans that include out of network don''t include benefits for implants.', 'Wendy Scipione - SR VP National Sales Advisor', 'Wendy Scipione - SR VP National Sales Advisor', '2025-08-18 21:17:06', '2025-08-18 21:17:06'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000169800217', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000154494001', 'Anita Wasielewski', NULL, '8/16/25<br>Anita went to the Er and wanted to know the process of opening a sharing request AC', 'Concierge', 'Concierge', '2025-08-18 18:00:36', '2025-08-18 18:00:36'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000169800212', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000155312083', 'Alexander Mishchuk', NULL, '8/18/25<br>Alex needed assistance logging into the health wallet app AC', 'Concierge', 'Concierge', '2025-08-18 17:59:14', '2025-08-18 17:59:14'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000169800204', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000153431002', 'Darin Thomas', NULL, '8/18/25<br>Darin called because she has an upcoming colonoscopy because she is having digestive issues and is near meeting her IUA and wanted to know how to open a sharing request Ac', 'Concierge', 'Concierge', '2025-08-18 17:57:32', '2025-08-18 17:57:43'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000169800199', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000010870127', 'Heather Braeutigam', NULL, '8/18/25<br>Needed assisatance with the health wallet app AC', 'Concierge', 'Concierge', '2025-08-18 17:50:47', '2025-08-18 17:50:47'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000169800194', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000046294019', 'Melany Matheson', NULL, '8/18/25<br>Sent rx quote via Email AC', 'Concierge', 'Concierge', '2025-08-18 17:50:07', '2025-08-18 17:50:07'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000169800182', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000081871010', 'Tiffany Brodt', NULL, '8/18/25<br>Tiffanys husband is having shoulder issues and wants to know the process of opening a sharing request AC', 'Concierge', 'Concierge', '2025-08-18 17:27:43', '2025-08-18 17:27:57'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000169800177', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000155097001', 'Rosanne Garza', '8/18/25', 'Rosanne once again called with questions on how her plan works and i tried to explain how everything works and scheduled her a welcome call, she was not happy on all the extra work she has to do and with her iua AC', 'Concierge', 'Concierge', '2025-08-18 17:26:32', '2025-08-18 17:26:32'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000169799083', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000168256006', 'Nytashia Allbritton', NULL, '8-18-25  1Dental enrollment complete - <br><a style="display:inline;" target="_blank" href="http://allbritton.nytashia@gmail.com/"><u>allbritton.nytashia@gmail.com</u></a><span style="color:rgb(34, 34, 34);"> just purchased a plan from your link! You will earn commission once the member is active beyond the 30-day trial period.</span><br>', 'Wendy Scipione - SR VP National Sales Advisor', 'Wendy Scipione - SR VP National Sales Advisor', '2025-08-18 16:43:52', '2025-08-18 16:43:52'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000169799078', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000134767002', 'Kara Weld', NULL, '8-18-25 I spoke with Kristina Wiles and HA Co-Op and they can operate in all 50 states. None of the states we need are states with penalties, OR, PA, MD or WA. The employer can choose the different category for eligibility. They have 12 employees who are salary based employees, which includes Kara and her husband.  If they pay for every salary based employee at $124 per month, then they qualify for the $10K immediate sharing. Plus, they have to pay for preventive for all emp in each benefit eligible class. They can choose to make the hourly employees an eligible benefit class. If so, they need to pay for the $124 for everyone in that group as well. This might simplify her decision about paying more than 10% for the hourly employees moving forward. She can offer them the preventive package. This is an active healthy group who might love this employee benefit. There is a $500 1x set-up fee. There is a 24 month look back for all things except longer for cancer which is 6 years. Screenings are fine to still be taking place. They must have been in remission for 6 years. Tobacco surcharge is $75 per member, per month. They have about 6000 members and 200 groups. Once they enroll the price will remain for at least 1 year from their start date. Earliest start date is Oct. 1st. If they want Nov. 1st, the deadline is mid-Sept. to get everything in order.  Age range is 24-56.', 'Wendy Scipione - SR VP National Sales Advisor', 'Wendy Scipione - SR VP National Sales Advisor', '2025-08-18 16:24:19', '2025-08-18 16:24:19'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000169783074', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000066223040', 'Michael Schreiber', NULL, '08/18/2025<br>Michael called due to a bill he got from ARM saying that he has responsibility to pay part still. We spoke to ARM together and he realized he went for a second visit but it still should have been paid for. They billed him for an extra code on one of his visits and she needs to call him back and see why there is a portion he still owes. Lori will look into it and try and get that knocked off for him. <br>AJ', 'Concierge', 'Concierge', '2025-08-18 14:30:07', '2025-08-18 14:30:07'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000169783022', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000120995010', 'Tom Trimmer', NULL, '08/18/2025<br>Tom called to ask if physical therapy was covered. I let him know if it is part of a treatment plan then yes they will share towards it after the IUA is met. He also wanted to know if the telehealth had mental health options. I let him know about acute care options through the behavioral health link on health wallet. <br>AJ', 'Concierge', 'Concierge', '2025-08-18 13:42:55', '2025-08-18 13:42:55'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000169783017', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000011610208', 'Marc Krawatsky', NULL, '08/18/2025<br>Hillary called and was looking for a dietitian. I sent her a list of some in her area.<br>AJ', 'Concierge', 'Concierge', '2025-08-18 13:40:21', '2025-08-18 13:40:21'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000169799073', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000169810007', 'Andrea Lee Nguyen', NULL, 'Member &amp; Fam $1000 IUA Secure', 'Patti Baron', 'Patti Baron', '2025-08-18 13:35:51', '2025-08-18 13:35:51'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000169799065', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000163846068', 'Mark Reinhard', NULL, '8-18-25 Mark''s wife thinks $1M is plenty. However they should have at least 10X his income which would bring it to $1.5M. At that level  it''s $306.24 if he pays monthly or $3480 if he pays annually.  At $100K, it''s $37.31 if he pays monthly. They have a policy with Cincinnati Casual for $1M already and supposed LB. He''s going to find out what it really included with the LB on that policy and we will reconvene again on Friday. They have about $900K in assets and only about $1500 a month in expenses. We will review options from $100K - $500K to make sure they have enough LB and DB.', 'Wendy Scipione - SR VP National Sales Advisor', 'Wendy Scipione - SR VP National Sales Advisor', '2025-08-18 13:33:30', '2025-08-18 13:33:30'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000169783012', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000156834039', 'Andrew Thomsen', NULL, '08/18/2025<br>Spoke with michelle about her main dr retiring. Now she wanted me to find her some other options for primary care providers and dermatologist. I founhd her a list of each and sent those to her and will be looking into maybe migrating her over to health wallet sooner if we can. She tried to use cirrus just to manage a couple medications that she has and they could not help her so i wanted to see if lyric could do it for her. <br>AJ', 'Concierge', 'Concierge', '2025-08-18 13:29:25', '2025-08-18 13:29:25'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000169800172', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000086528002', 'Cynthia Colandrea', NULL, '8/18/25<br>Cynthia called because she paid for her wellness check out of pocket and wanted to know who to submit it to. Provided her with ARM,s email AC <br><span><br></span>', 'Concierge', 'Concierge', '2025-08-18 13:27:11', '2025-08-18 13:27:11'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000169800161', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000011881141', 'Nathan Butryn', NULL, '8/18/25<br>Sent txt to follow up on sharing request AC', 'Concierge', 'Concierge', '2025-08-18 12:42:00', '2025-08-18 12:42:00'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000169798011', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000095960001', 'Doug Richter', NULL, 'Member''s spouse Jennifer called in and wanted to be sure that she had sufficient time to submit the cancellation link that was sent to her before the billing cycle for the month of September.  She also asked about any previous claims, if they would be shareable and said that she did speak with ARM they said that they would be, because they were preventative for her daughters.  She wanted to confirm that with us.  We told her that if that is what ARM said then that would be good. She also wanted to know if she had any further questions, if she could contact us.  We told her to reach out to ARM if it is about their bills, and if her questions are about our billing to contact us.  They were happy with the services we provided.  They are moving out of the country.  We are sending her a Google review to send in along with her cancellation notice.', 'Michele R', 'Michele R', '2025-08-18 12:38:30', '2025-08-18 12:38:30'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000169799055', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000134767002', 'Kara Weld', NULL, '8-18-25 Kara is looking at MCS to her employees of 18 total. They live in OR, PA, MD and WA but with about 6 living in WA. She knows MCS is banned in WA.  We can offer Secure HSA for all but 6 employees. However, they are right on the border of WA and OR. This will be an ongoing problem. They will pay 100% <span style="color:rgb(51, 51, 51);"> of EF for owners, 100% for</span> EO for all salaried employees and 10% EO for hourly employees. They might choose to offer more for hourly employees depending on how that looks down the road. They have 5-6 non WA state salary employees. Most move out to that area bc it''s a kayaking meca. The business is called Immersion Research. Most employees are very healthy. She knows of one employee who had cancer a number of years ago but now it''s in remission. She doesn''t know of anybody that smokes. I will explore Health Access Co-Op since it will work in WA state as well and has immediate sharing up to $25K (I think) with 10+ employees.', 'Wendy Scipione - SR VP National Sales Advisor', 'Wendy Scipione - SR VP National Sales Advisor', '2025-08-18 12:34:15', '2025-08-18 12:34:15'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000169800150', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000128543002', 'Eugene Small', NULL, '8/18/25<br>sent email to follow up on sharing request AC', 'Concierge', 'Concierge', '2025-08-18 12:22:00', '2025-08-18 12:22:00'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000169800145', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000109789024', 'Sundiata Soon-Jahta', NULL, '8/18/25<br>After multiple attempts at reaching wellstar hospital, i offered sundita to find a diffrent provider to do the colonscpy procedure. they hos[ital would not call us back or pick up the phones. AC', 'Concierge', 'Concierge', '2025-08-18 12:16:38', '2025-08-18 12:16:38'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000169800134', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000111068002', 'Patrick Burns', NULL, '8/18/25<br>sent txt to follow up on er vist AC', 'Concierge', 'Concierge', '2025-08-18 12:08:30', '2025-08-18 12:08:30'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000169800129', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000141230001', 'Paula Hershman', NULL, '8/18/25<br>Paula called to see if her colonoscopy would be covered under the preventative section AC', 'Concierge', 'Concierge', '2025-08-18 12:06:43', '2025-08-18 12:06:43'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000169799050', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000169135018', 'Megan Cencelewski', NULL, 'Member submitted new payment method.  I will process.', 'Patti Baron', 'Patti Baron', '2025-08-18 12:00:01', '2025-08-18 12:00:01'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000169784124', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000011610208', 'Marc Krawatsky', NULL, '8/18/25: Hilary called bc she wanted a list of dietitian in PHCS network close to her. I let her know that it''s unlikely to use preventive services for a dietitian - she said she wanted to get "PPO discount" Either way, I said it''s usually a better price simply asking for cash rate. Regardless, I sent her a list from PHCS webiste in her zip code. AM', 'Concierge', 'Concierge', '2025-08-18 11:55:56', '2025-08-18 11:55:56'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000169799039', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000062289695', 'Ghislaine Nadeau', NULL, 'Member submitted Change Form to change named since she has gotten married.  I will process. Fromer name Ghislaine Bens', 'Patti Baron', 'Patti Baron', '2025-08-18 11:53:53', '2025-08-18 11:54:56'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000169784105', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000167982018', 'Christina O''Connor', NULL, '8/18/25: Christina emailed in bc her proof of benefit letter was rejected by the school. I let her know I would adjust it to include more info and get another one out to her. AM', 'Concierge', 'Concierge', '2025-08-18 11:53:47', '2025-08-18 11:53:47'),
