  ('zcrm_1579374000169784071', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000104457002', 'Normandie Rainwater', NULL, '8/18/25: Normandie called wondering how to present for upcoming wellness appt. I said just to present benefit card, and that provider must be in PHCS network for it to be paid for by preventive portion of plan. She said she already confirmed they are. AM', 'Concierge', 'Concierge', '2025-08-18 10:18:32', '2025-08-18 10:18:32'),
