  ('zcrm_1579374000169784052', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000011779212', 'Timothy Gustafson', NULL, '8/18/25: Julie emailed in asking about mental health sessions through HW and that she couldn''t find or access. Logged in as her and the telemedicine button goes straight to a login page for Lyric. Let her know there''s an issue and we''d get back to her once it is fixed. AM', 'Concierge', 'Concierge', '2025-08-18 10:17:00', '2025-08-18 10:17:00'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000169784047', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000061006173', 'Brian Delaney', NULL, '8/18/25: Brian called. He''s had several tests done and wanting to know if they could be paid for as preventive (heart and thyroid scans). I let him know it sounded like all these were diagnostic in nature and could go towards a medical need(s) after meeting IUA. AM', 'Concierge', 'Concierge', '2025-08-18 10:16:23', '2025-08-18 10:16:23'),
