  ('zcrm_1579374000169799001', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000119666009', 'Melinda Deckert', NULL, 'Member called in and wanted to know why her bloodwork was not shared.  She told me that provider had run this due to recent weight loss looking for the cause.  I told her that most likely  it had been coded as diagnostic as they were looking for something.  She asked how her membership worked since they were spending alot of money out of pocket.  I explained how the membership worked and I could tell that the member was disillusioned that maybe this wasn''t what they thought.', 'Patti Baron', 'Patti Baron', '2025-08-18 10:03:54', '2025-08-18 10:03:54'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000169798001', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000153594036', 'Daniel skarsten', NULL, 'Member submitted Cancellation Form Eff 9/1.  I will process.', 'Michele R', 'Michele R', '2025-08-18 10:03:33', '2025-08-18 10:03:33'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000169786015', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000168201002', 'Emily Armstrong', NULL, 'Member emailed me letting me know she needed to reschedule the welcome call. Sent an email to do so. Vanessa Orozco', 'Concierge', 'Concierge', '2025-08-18 09:49:06', '2025-08-18 09:49:06'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000169784036', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000129819012', 'Bryce Roberts', NULL, '8/18/25: Mackenzie emailed in a bunch of bills but I don''t see circumcision on any of them - forwarded to Karen. Karen suggested I send the name info to Lori since Dave is on vacation which I did. Lori stated they have been reprocessed and Mackenzie''s name has been updated. Let her know via email. AM', 'Concierge', 'Concierge', '2025-08-18 09:45:09', '2025-08-19 09:11:01'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000169784015', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000169484001', 'Jason Wolden', NULL, '8/18/25: Karen emailed in requesting that Jason be in the first group to transition to MPB Virtual Care. Filled out form to manually transition Jason and let Karen know. AM', 'Concierge', 'Concierge', '2025-08-18 09:29:23', '2025-08-18 09:29:23'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000169779017', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000099203002', 'Todd Muffley', NULL, '8/17/25: Todd emailed in asking if any of the bills from his kidney stone procedure have been paid. I let him know I cannot see into his Zion member portal, but happy to jump on a call if need be. AM', 'Concierge', 'Concierge', '2025-08-18 09:19:30', '2025-08-18 09:19:30'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000169783007', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000061255207', 'Rachel Martin', NULL, '05/18/2025<br>Rachel called and said she was upset she did not got informed of the ARM planstin switch. Let her know all the details of the switch and she also wanted to change her advisor so i sent her the change form. Also re sent her physical ARM cards.<br>AJ', 'Concierge', 'Concierge', '2025-08-18 09:18:02', '2025-08-18 09:18:02'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000169779012', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000113318002', 'Thomas Parker', NULL, '8/18/25: Called ARM to check on Nancy''s bill since Lori hasn''t responded to any emails from me in WEEKS. Anna said they still do not have a claim from Amity Medical group. Emailed Nancy to let her know. AM', 'Concierge', 'Concierge', '2025-08-18 09:14:50', '2025-08-18 09:14:50'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000169779007', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000130802017', 'Bruce Maleski', NULL, '8/18/25: Sarah called saing that she ended up paying $750 for anesthesia and facility fee for Bruce''s colo and they said she would also be receiving a bill from provider. I advised her to go ahead and email me the bill so I can get it over to ARM. AM', 'Concierge', 'Concierge', '2025-08-18 09:05:59', '2025-08-18 09:05:59'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000169753022', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000141173002', 'Amy Houston', NULL, '8/17/25: Brad called in - his college student - Logan is needing some mental health coaching services. I let him know he can access those through the HW app and sent email with instructions. He also stated that they keep getting mail from ARM to old PO Box. Let him know I''d reach out to them to update the address on file - Karen updated it. Sent email letting them know. AM', 'Concierge', 'Concierge', '2025-08-18 08:15:26', '2025-08-18 09:03:51'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000169755009', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000168290001', 'Stuart Myers', NULL, 'Member submitted Cancellation Request prior to start citing financial reasons.  I will process &amp; refund Enrollmnet Fee.', 'Patti Baron', 'Patti Baron', '2025-08-18 08:12:51', '2025-08-18 08:12:51'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000169753003', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000123883002', 'Kiya Wiedis', NULL, '8/17/25: Kiya emailed in and came through chat with issues related to health wallet. She cannot access the telemedicine portion of app, nor check out her prescriptions. It''s stating she needs to complete profile to continue. Let her know we''d reach out to health wallet and let her know when the issue is resolved. <br>She also asked if we cover any diagnostic costs, briefly explained about IUA and MCS. <br>She ended up calling and we went over her MEC and Sharing aspects of her plan in detail. She needs help finding a primary care dr and interested in one that also does an annual gyno appt as well. <br>Advised her to put in appt request. AM', 'Concierge', 'Concierge', '2025-08-18 08:06:58', '2025-08-18 08:58:32'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000169760039', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000164999002', 'Aaron Johnson', NULL, '08/18/2025<br>Aaron called since they <a style="display:inline;" target="_blank" href="http://moved.he/"><u>moved. He</u></a> was setting up with a new dr. Let him know how to present himself in order for billing. Told him he could let them know to bill ARM for all routine preventative care and for anything else he would be cash pay until IUA where cost sharing would kick in.<br>AJ', 'Concierge', 'Concierge', '2025-08-18 08:04:19', '2025-08-18 08:04:19'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000169757075', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000130955002', 'Laurie Boehk', NULL, 'Spoke to member will reschedule welcome call after start date of September 1, 2025 for new plan. Sent email to do so. Vanessa Orozco', 'Concierge', 'Concierge', '2025-08-18 08:02:37', '2025-08-18 08:02:37'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000169760034', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000156164001', 'Anthony Cottrell', NULL, '08/18/2025<br>Alicia called to get a reimburse for preventative services. I gave her the email provided to me by ARM for claims, <a style="display:inline;" target="_blank" href="http://kelly@altrisk.com/"><u>kelly@altrisk.com</u></a>. Let her know to reach back out to us in a few days so we can make sure the claim is being processed. <br>AJ', 'Concierge', 'Concierge', '2025-08-18 07:58:00', '2025-08-18 07:58:00'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000169760026', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000168094002', 'Maria Marshall', NULL, '08/18/2025<br>Responded to Bruce letting him know the teledoc should be able to call his meds in to wherever he needs them. I recommended to use urgent care for possibly faster results.<br>AJ', 'Concierge', 'Concierge', '2025-08-18 07:45:42', '2025-08-18 07:45:55'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000169760021', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000131309012', 'Tyler Dalton', NULL, '08/18/2025<br>''Sent a resonse email to his. He wanted to see if paying with a card would have an extra fee. I let him know yes there is a processing surcharge so we rcommend the bank draft to get around that.<br>AJ', 'Concierge', 'Concierge', '2025-08-18 07:44:51', '2025-08-18 07:44:51'),
