  ('zcrm_1579374000169760006', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000117867002', 'Peter Harris', NULL, '08/18/2025<br>Returned lonnies VM, left VM. she had questions about if an ultrasound would be covered. Told her in voicemail most likely not since that would be a diagnostic procedure. She should hold onto bills in case treatment is also needed or if all the related bills reach the IUa you could open a share request.<br>AJ', 'Concierge', 'Concierge', '2025-08-18 07:41:42', '2025-08-18 07:41:42'),
