  ('zcrm_1579374000169705181', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000028471248', 'Charles Christian Figge VI', NULL, '08/15/2025<br>Called to f/u and he was walking into a meeting. he said he was able to have the visit with thelehealth and it was helpful<br>Wants to talk in the near future to make sure he knows what he is doing<br>AJ', 'Concierge', 'Concierge', '2025-08-15 14:40:13', '2025-08-15 14:40:13'),
