  ('zcrm_1579374000169705143', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000083404002', 'Robert M. Gullinese', NULL, '08/15/2025 <br>He called in to see if the facility where his daughters OBGYN is located is in the network as well since she is pregnant. <br>They are. Told him they need to open a maternity share request and transferred him to ZIon to do that<br>AJ', 'Concierge', 'Concierge', '2025-08-15 14:37:35', '2025-08-15 14:37:35'),
