  ('zcrm_1579374000169724058', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000123074010', 'Caleb Vogtner', 'dental', 'goes to harpeth dental care, i gave hime a quote on spirit, his practice is in network, he wants to do 2 cleanings, and I quoted him  for 17.80 a month, 213 for 12 months, if his cleanings come out to more than that, he will get the plan. might call me monday.', 'Tupac Manzanarez', 'Tupac Manzanarez', '2025-08-15 13:54:54', '2025-08-15 13:54:54'),
