  ('zcrm_1579374000169708026', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000133844002', 'Alex Woelfel-Smith', NULL, 'Member called in and gave us new dependent Knoxs Social.  This was added to A123 and will go over in the file.  Member has been in contact with Zion who has not been "seeing" Knox in their system.  I advised member to let Zion know that this information has been being transmitted to Planstin since 8/4/25.', 'Patti Baron', 'Patti Baron', '2025-08-15 09:12:11', '2025-08-15 09:12:11'),
