  ('zcrm_1579374000169708014', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000167071008', 'Jaclyn Bianchi', NULL, 'After speaking with this member we determined that she is not a small business owner.  She was unable to "find" her EIN.  She told me that she was a W2 employee with her employer, so therefore she is not eligible for the Secure membership.  I will cancel the change.', 'Patti Baron', 'Patti Baron', '2025-08-15 08:47:50', '2025-08-15 08:47:50'),
