  ('zcrm_1579374000169705018', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000168094002', 'Maria Marshall', NULL, '08/15/2025<br>Going back and fourth right now through email trying to help bruce get into his telehealth. I let him know about using that for meciation management and he attempted to access telehealth via the member portal and he used the wrong link. I let him know it would be better if he tried the health wallet. I sent him links to acess it and instructions to login. Will be monitoring his email to make sure he gets into telehealth and is able to utilize it. Also working on making an appointment for him to a PCP: Bryan Farford. <br>AJ', 'Concierge', 'Concierge', '2025-08-15 08:36:59', '2025-08-15 08:36:59'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000169702031', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000167107002', 'Arielle Leva', NULL, '8/15/25: Emailed Darren RX quote per request. See email for details. AM', 'Concierge', 'Concierge', '2025-08-15 08:36:38', '2025-08-15 08:36:38'),
