  ('zcrm_1579374000169708006', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000165358007', 'Sean Fenelon', NULL, 'Member submitted cancellation eff 9/1/25 citing Financial reasons.  Per Wendy''s note below possibility her will be enrolling in spouses employer benefits.  Not comfortable with the Self pay mode.', 'Patti Baron', 'Patti Baron', '2025-08-15 08:04:33', '2025-08-15 08:04:33'),
