  ('zcrm_1579374000169703001', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000137215161', 'Christine Nelsen', NULL, 'Member Aging into Medicare eff 10/25<br>8/15-1st notice sent to member &amp; advisor via em<br>9/2-Member called in to let me know that she is turning 65 next month (October) and that she had made her last payment to us.  She was just checking in to confirm this information.  I told her that we had sent her out the first notification of Aging into Medicare on 8/15.  She never received it, so I resent that email to the email on file and she confirmed that she received it, as she wanted to have it for her records.  She also mentioned that she was working with Jessica Manion (not Michael Montes as noted in the email and in the file) She wanted to know if Jessica was still her person, as she has been working with her. I told her we would check on our end, but that if she contacts Jessica, she would also ask her about it.<br>9/11-2nd notice sent to member &amp; advisor member cancelled', 'Michele R', 'Michele R', '2025-08-15 07:07:44', '2025-09-11 12:03:31'),
