  ('zcrm_1579374000169637025', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000167107002', 'Arielle Leva', NULL, '8/14/25: Darren called with a few questions. He was informed during signing up that mental health benefits would be through EAP and 6 per year and wondering if he could get his current therapist to join. I informed him about the recent upgrade to therapy - he wasn''t thrilled that he wasn''t informed of this. We discussed his rx quote and what he''s currently paying for these medication - hoping to find cheaper options online - I let him know I''m working on it and will email him , supplement and fullscript - yamoa, prev vaccines for daughter - they see a DPC who doesn''t offer vaccines, advised provider is best but if they go to pharmacy have them send claim to address on card.<br>AM', 'Concierge', 'Concierge', '2025-08-14 11:40:51', '2025-08-14 12:05:53'),
