  ('zcrm_1579374000169624008', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000080094010', 'Amy Jacobs-Schroeder', NULL, '8/14/25: Sean and I went back and forth several times about his proof of benefit letter via email. He kept requesting edits that were not accurate for our plans such as wanting us to include that it meets ALL ACA requirements and <span style="color:rgb(0, 0, 0);">Santa Clara University’s insurance waiver criteria</span>. I edited the letter to best suit his wishes while still accurately representing the plan they have. AM', 'Concierge', 'Concierge', '2025-08-14 08:12:09', '2025-08-14 08:12:09'),
