  ('zcrm_1579374000169599021', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000159324002', 'Daniel Kilkeary', NULL, '8/12/25 and 8/13/25<br>Daniel''s wife called on this dates to request an invoice for his last payment. I advised her that we have already sent over that information AC', 'Concierge', 'Concierge', '2025-08-13 18:08:55', '2025-08-13 18:08:55'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000169599016', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000048401026', 'Angel Ayala Jimenez', NULL, '8/13/25<br>Angel wanted to know what the process for a maternity sharing request would be like, I advised her that she has to meet an IUA of 2500 with zion now. AC', 'Concierge', 'Concierge', '2025-08-13 18:06:37', '2025-08-13 18:06:37'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000169599011', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000065038037', 'Jeff Bolf', NULL, '8/13/25<br>Jeff called because he was under he impression he had so type of hsa account with us, I explained to him that we are not a financial institution and would not know who he signed up with. I advised him to go through his records to find out who he signed up with. He was very persistent we were charging him for that account. <br><span><br></span>I later received a call from a Zion rep with Jeff on the back end trying to find answers on who has his funds. I asked the zion rep to transfer to be so i could explain what i foun in previous notes. I explied to Jeff that it looks like in the past hes was signed up to an HMA account, and that we had no affiliation to that account to please reach out to zack for more info AC', 'Concierge', 'Concierge', '2025-08-13 18:03:55', '2025-08-13 18:03:55'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000169595064', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000069838033', 'James Truett III', NULL, '08/13/2025<br>Grace called in to see what to do now that cirrus was cancelled. Let her know to go to health wallet and use that from now on for her telehealth.<br>AJ', 'Concierge', 'Concierge', '2025-08-13 14:50:54', '2025-08-13 14:50:54'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000169595045', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000131710002', 'Scott Beaton', NULL, '08/13/2025<br>Scott called in for some guidance on what to do with bills to start his share request. Transferred him to zion so they could walk him through his portal and how to open a request and upload bills and documents<br>AJ', 'Concierge', 'Concierge', '2025-08-13 14:49:44', '2025-08-13 14:49:44'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000169595040', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000145346174', 'Scott Garcia', NULL, '08/13/2025<br>Susan called with her son in order for him to access telehealth. They were still trying to use cirrus MD. Showed them health wallet and walked them through logging in and opening telemedicine. Once they were logged in and seemed to be all set and ready to use it i got off the call so she could speak to her son on the phone by himself so they could talk<br>AJ', 'Concierge', 'Concierge', '2025-08-13 14:45:48', '2025-08-13 14:45:48'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000169595035', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000131624019', 'Charles Evers Whyte', NULL, '08/13/2025<br>Charles called in for some guidance on what to do for a hip surgery<br>AJ', 'Concierge', 'Concierge', '2025-08-13 14:28:18', '2025-08-13 14:28:18'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000169595030', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000139367002', 'Jason Trochessett', NULL, '08/13/2025<br>Illena called because she wanted to see what the process would be if she was a smoker. She mentioned she quit when she was 30 but every now and then still does smoke. A little more often than someone who has a cigar periodically to celebrate. Went and talked to patti about and she is going to look into this a little deeper ti see how we should advise her moving forward with this. We are going to email her what we find and i will text her also to let her know we sent the email. Send it to her husbands email since her email box is full a lot of the times.  <a style="color:rgb(51, 140, 240);display:inline;" target="_blank" href="mailto:Jtdundee99@gmail.com"><u>Jtdundee99@gmail.com</u></a><span></span><br>AJ', 'Concierge', 'Concierge', '2025-08-13 14:17:06', '2025-08-13 14:17:06'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000169595025', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000161646001', 'Lynette Deitering', NULL, '08/13/2025<br>Provider called in to verify her benefits and see how things worked with our program<br>AJ', 'Concierge', 'Concierge', '2025-08-13 14:14:27', '2025-08-13 14:14:27'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000169595020', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000137621018', 'Maria Daniela Ysursa', NULL, '08/13/2025<br>Provider called in to ask questions about the benefits to understand what they are and how they work since they have never heard of us or ARM before. Let them know how prevnetative and regular share requests operate and what to do with the bill for each situation<br>AJ', 'Concierge', 'Concierge', '2025-08-13 14:13:22', '2025-08-13 14:13:22'),
