  ('zcrm_1579374000169595008', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000130357002', 'Steven Copus', NULL, '08/13/2025<br>Called in because she tried to use cirrus MD. I guided her to the health wallet let her know this is an upgrade and that she can get her telehealth from there now. <br>AJ', 'Concierge', 'Concierge', '2025-08-13 14:09:43', '2025-08-13 14:09:43'),
