  ('zcrm_1579374000169543010', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000100832001', 'Laura Scheer', NULL, '8/13/25: Laura emailed in asking questions about new mental health benefits, really wanting to know if their current therapist is part of that network. Responded giving her an overview of new benefits. AM', 'Concierge', 'Concierge', '2025-08-13 08:03:47', '2025-08-13 08:03:47'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000169552010', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000166844023', 'Margo Clinkenbeard', NULL, 'Member submitted Cancellation Form stating financial reasons.  I will process.', 'Michele R', 'Michele R', '2025-08-13 07:57:01', '2025-08-13 07:57:01'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000169548001', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000169532002', 'David Morris', NULL, 'I received Cancellation from this member saying that he enrolled "in error".  I will cancel membership and refund any monies', 'Patti Baron', 'Patti Baron', '2025-08-13 07:15:51', '2025-08-13 08:32:53'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000169547001', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000155296018', 'Ian Feazel', NULL, '08/12/2025<br>Ian called to find out what he is supposed to do with well child visit bills. Let him know the process of submitting them for reimburse and he requested assistance for this so i let him know if he is having trouble he can send them to us at concierge and we can help him submit those.<br>AJ', 'Concierge', 'Concierge', '2025-08-13 07:13:46', '2025-08-13 07:13:46'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000169543005', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000167313007', 'Paul Rettmann', NULL, '8/13/25: Paul called needing to reschedule his welcome call. Sent link to do so and let Vanessa know via teams. AM', 'Concierge', 'Concierge', '2025-08-13 07:03:52', '2025-08-13 07:03:52'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000169517028', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000108564032', 'Simone Fohrman', NULL, '8-12-25 <br><span style="color:rgb(34, 34, 34);">Dear SIMONE FOHRMAN,</span><br><span style="color:rgb(34, 34, 34);"> </span><br><span style="color:rgb(34, 34, 34);">Your policy is no longer in effect as of 01/31/2025 due to member request. There''s nothing else you need to do.</span><br><span style="color:rgb(34, 34, 34);"> </span><br><span style="color:rgb(34, 34, 34);">If you have any questions, or need a Certificate of Creditable Coverage, please call us at 1-877-900-1237.</span><br><span style="color:rgb(34, 34, 34);"> </span><br><span style="color:rgb(34, 34, 34);"><b>No Cost Language Services.</b></span><span style="color:rgb(34, 34, 34);"> You can get an interpreter. You can get documents read to you and some sent to you in your language. For help, call us at 1-877-900-1237.</span><br><span style="color:rgb(34, 34, 34);"> </span><br><span style="color:rgb(34, 34, 34);">We appreciate your business and thank you for allowing us to serve all your health insurance needs.</span><br><span style="color:rgb(34, 34, 34);"><b>myCigna® is YOUR Cigna</b></span>', 'Wendy Scipione - SR VP National Sales Advisor', 'Wendy Scipione - SR VP National Sales Advisor', '2025-08-12 20:09:39', '2025-08-12 20:09:39'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000169517018', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000028471248', 'Charles Christian Figge VI', NULL, '8-12-25 Figge has found a solution to move forward with the help of Julia! YAY!', 'Wendy Scipione - SR VP National Sales Advisor', 'Wendy Scipione - SR VP National Sales Advisor', '2025-08-12 15:54:40', '2025-08-12 15:54:40'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000169517013', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000066091133', 'Roseann Rasker', NULL, '8-12-25 Roseann called bc she had some blood work done and they told her that her plan has been terminated. She told me that she indicated to them that she is cash pay. Clearly they must have tried billing an old card since as cash pay they would not bill anybody else. She agreed. She will go back to them and ask for the best cash price. She knows she''s been paying for her membership. I checked Admin123 and Zoho and everything shows as Active. She also knows the labs won''t be paid for since it won''t reach the IUA and they are for her knowledge not for a Need.  She''s all set for now.', 'Wendy Scipione - SR VP National Sales Advisor', 'Wendy Scipione - SR VP National Sales Advisor', '2025-08-12 15:30:42', '2025-08-12 15:30:42'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000169492162', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000104626002', 'Matt Wohlgemuth', NULL, '08/12/2025<br>Called in to double check when he started to know what his limit on pre ex would be because he is looking to get a surgery but wants to wait till he has the highest amount available to go towards his surgery. <br>AJ', 'Concierge', 'Concierge', '2025-08-12 14:08:24', '2025-08-12 14:08:24'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000169492157', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000168219002', 'Stephen Johnson', NULL, '08/12/2025<br>Stephen called to see what the procedure is for RX needs. LEt him know the med he was looking for could be acquired for free through rx valet and he change it however he wants it based on what is most convenient for him. <br>AJ', 'Concierge', 'Concierge', '2025-08-12 14:06:48', '2025-08-12 14:06:48'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000169492152', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000056140001', 'Betsy Green', NULL, '08/12/2025<br>Called in looking for guidance on what to do for an upcoming eye appointment. Let her know that is goung to be something going towards an IUA if necessary. It is not preventative so it is out of pocket until IUA is met<br>AJ', 'Concierge', 'Concierge', '2025-08-12 14:04:53', '2025-08-12 14:04:53'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000169517005', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000028471248', 'Charles Christian Figge VI', NULL, 'Spoke with member at length regarding the process to obtain ADHD medication in person.<br><b>Details:</b><br><ul style="list-style-type:disc;list-style-position:inside;"><li style="list-style-image:none;"><p style="display:inline;"><span style="color:rgb(51, 51, 51);font-weight:normal;font-style:normal;">Advised member to first use </span><span style="color:rgb(51, 51, 51);font-style:normal;"><b>telehealth via Health Wallet</b></span><span style="color:rgb(51, 51, 51);font-weight:normal;font-style:normal;"> for immediate evaluation and access to </span><span style="color:rgb(51, 51, 51);font-style:normal;"><b>non-controlled substance options</b></span><span style="color:rgb(51, 51, 51);font-weight:normal;font-style:normal;"> that may provide symptom relief.</span></p></li><li style="list-style-image:none;"><p style="display:inline;"><span style="color:rgb(51, 51, 51);font-weight:normal;font-style:normal;">Same telehealth process recommended for obtaining migraine medication.</span></p></li><li style="list-style-image:none;"><p style="display:inline;"><span style="color:rgb(51, 51, 51);font-weight:normal;font-style:normal;">Directed member to refer to email for full instructions and cost details.</span></p></li><li style="list-style-image:none;"><p style="display:inline;"><span style="color:rgb(51, 51, 51);font-weight:normal;font-style:normal;">If telehealth options are ineffective, MPB can assist with finding in-person care.</span></p></li><li style="list-style-image:none;"><p style="display:inline;"><span style="color:rgb(51, 51, 51);font-weight:normal;font-style:normal;">Informed member that MPB cannot guarantee a provider will prescribe Adderall.</span></p></li></ul><b>Next Steps:</b><br><ul style="list-style-type:disc;list-style-position:inside;"><li style="list-style-image:none;"><p style="display:inline;"><span style="color:rgb(51, 51, 51);font-weight:normal;font-style:normal;">Member to try telehealth first and report back results.</span></p></li><li style="list-style-image:none;"><p style="display:inline;"><span style="color:rgb(51, 51, 51);font-weight:normal;font-style:normal;">Follow up as needed based on <a href="http://outcome.JA" style="color:rgb(51, 51, 51);" target="_blank">outcome.JA</a></span></p></li></ul>', 'MPB Health Member Notification', 'MPB Health Member Notification', '2025-08-12 13:59:51', '2025-08-12 14:00:04'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000169492147', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000159732002', 'Chad Moore', NULL, '8/12/2025<br>Chad called to make sure what is covered under preventative and how to go about explaining it to his doctor. I let him know to call it a PPO plan from ARM on the PHCS network and made sure to tell him to get the preventative codes to be used on his bills so ARM knows it is a preventative screening visit.<br>AJ', 'Concierge', 'Concierge', '2025-08-12 13:55:14', '2025-08-12 13:55:14'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000169492142', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000144243002', 'Frances Tamaariki', NULL, '08/12/2025<br>Emailed her the coupons from goodRX for the rx quote that she sent in<br>AJ', 'Concierge', 'Concierge', '2025-08-12 13:51:19', '2025-08-12 13:51:19'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000169501028', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000014189229', 'Gemma Lynn Davis', NULL, 'Member called in very confused.  She explained that she had medical bills that she needed to reimbursed for.  Also spoke to her husband who told me that she had some mental health issues.  I advised that this would not be shareable.  Member also shared that they hadn''t spoken to anyone since they enrolled.  They also shared that they would be leaving the country and that they needed to cancel.  I will send out Cancellation Link.', 'Patti Baron', 'Patti Baron', '2025-08-12 13:26:36', '2025-08-12 13:26:36'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000169497173', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000167982018', 'Christina O''Connor', NULL, '8/12/25: Emailed Christina proof of benefit letter per request. AM', 'Concierge', 'Concierge', '2025-08-12 11:48:57', '2025-08-12 11:48:57'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000169497143', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000130802017', 'Bruce Maleski', NULL, '8/12/25: Spoke to Wendy about Bruce''s upcoming colo tomorrow. His wife Sarah is overwhelmed by the situation bc provider is wanting her to pay over $700 upfront, plus the last time she spoke to ARM, they said the provider is out of network and it wouldn''t be covered. <br>Brought Sarah into a 3-way call with Karen at ARM. There are actually no providers showing up in PHCS within a 50 mile radius which means it will be paid for regardless. We both explained this to Sarah and advised her to 1) call provider and let them know it is covered and to please send claim to address on card - she can conference call either myself or Karen to verify. Otherwise if they won''t budge and make her pay upfont, to send us the bill as soon as possible so we can process it quickly. <br><a style="display:inline;" target="_blank" href="http://surgerytc.com/"><u>surgerytc.com</u></a> - copper ridge surgery center<br>AM', 'Concierge', 'Concierge', '2025-08-12 11:16:22', '2025-08-12 11:16:22'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000169497138', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000100861002', 'Erin Dreistadt', NULL, '8/12/25: Erin emailed in saying Zinnia needs to get second round of vaccines and best way to move forward. Advised that the best way is through a provider''s office or having pharmacist send claim to ARM. AM', 'Concierge', 'Concierge', '2025-08-12 11:11:18', '2025-08-12 11:11:18'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000169494088', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000168619001', 'Matthew McKinney', NULL, 'Welcome call complete. Vanessa Orozco', 'Concierge', 'Concierge', '2025-08-12 11:03:09', '2025-08-12 11:29:53'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000169494064', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000065366108', 'Elizabeth Meyer', NULL, 'No response. Left a detailed message on vm. Sent email to reschedule refresher welcome call. Vanessa Orozco', 'Concierge', 'Concierge', '2025-08-12 10:34:11', '2025-08-12 10:34:11'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000169504009', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000080094010', 'Amy Jacobs-Schroeder', NULL, '08.12.25:  Sean left me a voicemail saying he called the concierge over a week ago requesting a proof of insurance letter for his daughter for college and was told he would receive it within 24 hrs.  He hasn''t received it as yet and the deadline to submit it is fast approaching. He asked if I could look into this for him. I saw Angee''s note and contacted her for an update. She said she spoke w/him and told him she would get it to him today but he didn''t tell her his daughter''s name. I called him and he said the letter is for Ellison.  JSP', 'Joan Phelps', 'Joan Phelps', '2025-08-12 10:18:20', '2025-08-12 10:18:20'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000169501021', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000169512012', 'Richard Walton', NULL, 'Member &amp; Sp MEC + Essentials', 'Patti Baron', 'Patti Baron', '2025-08-12 10:17:42', '2025-08-12 10:17:42'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000169492137', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000077566026', 'MaiLan Boris', NULL, '08/12/2025<br>Mailan called to get some guidance on prevnetative care. Wanted to make sure a womens well visit for a pap smear would be covered. let her know yes it would be. She said she has been having trouble getting help with anything so i gave her my direct line and told her whenever she has questions about preventative we can call ARM together so she can make sure she goes about the right process to make it the least amount of annoyance,<br>AJ', 'Concierge', 'Concierge', '2025-08-12 10:01:12', '2025-08-12 10:01:12'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000169497128', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000133850001', 'Scott Egbers', NULL, '8/12/25: Mallorie called to ask about life care benefits. I let her know that the therapy options were changing and she can now access through app. AM', 'Concierge', 'Concierge', '2025-08-12 09:54:01', '2025-08-12 09:54:01'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000169497123', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000164147020', 'Brock Bomberger', NULL, '8/12/25: Brock left me a personal VM. Returned call and LVM. AM', 'Concierge', 'Concierge', '2025-08-12 09:48:52', '2025-08-12 09:48:52');
