  ('zcrm_1579374000169497025', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000129964018', 'MAUREEN SMITH', NULL, '8/12/25: Maureen called saying that she is still getting a bill from prev mamm and ins is paying $0. I connected her to ARM to check claim status, and let her know if they don''t have it, to just email it to me and I''ll help facilitate a reimbursement for her. AM', 'Concierge', 'Concierge', '2025-08-12 08:23:21', '2025-08-12 08:23:21'),
