  ('zcrm_1579374000169497003', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000082151010', 'Peter Benjamin', NULL, '8/12/25: Sent Peter best options I was able to find for cash rate pcp''s and obtaining travel vaccines in Burlington VT and offered to assist with scheduling. See email for details. AM', 'Concierge', 'Concierge', '2025-08-12 08:17:33', '2025-08-12 08:17:33'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000169494001', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000168397002', 'Yvonne Hawkins', NULL, 'Welcome call complete. Vanessa Orozco', 'Concierge', 'Concierge', '2025-08-12 07:57:17', '2025-08-12 07:57:17'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000169442247', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000159872002', 'Robyn Hugar', NULL, '8/12/25: Robyn called asking what the price breakdown was between her and her son. What she was really wanting to know is price for an individual member - we discussed the price options for member only 22yo, and other prices in her age bracket for 1000 IUA. AM', 'Concierge', 'Concierge', '2025-08-12 07:31:19', '2025-08-12 07:31:19'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000169489045', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000169447050', 'Scott Burton', 'New Membership eff 9/25', 'Member Only $1000 IUA Premium Care', 'Patti Baron', 'Patti Baron', '2025-08-12 07:22:03', '2025-08-12 07:22:03'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000169489040', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000169447050', 'Scott Burton', NULL, 'Member submitted Change Form to remove spouse from membership eff 9/1/25 due to the fact that she now has coverage thru employer.  I will process.', 'Patti Baron', 'Patti Baron', '2025-08-12 07:20:43', '2025-08-12 07:20:43'),
