  ('zcrm_1579374000169489001', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000154862002', 'Danell Underwood', NULL, 'Member submitted Change Form to update his address.  I will process.', 'Patti Baron', 'Patti Baron', '2025-08-12 06:50:13', '2025-08-12 06:50:13'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000169479137', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000168397002', 'Yvonne Hawkins', NULL, '8/11/25<br>Yvonne called because she had no clue she had a mec with us, I provided all avalible info vie email regarding her coverage AC', 'Concierge', 'Concierge', '2025-08-11 18:13:07', '2025-08-11 18:13:07'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000169479132', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000156171016', 'Tamara Lowe', NULL, '8/11/25<br>Tamaras asscistant called to ensure her mammogram is covered AC', 'Concierge', 'Concierge', '2025-08-11 18:10:40', '2025-08-11 18:10:40'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000169479127', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000146978002', 'Seamus Mullen', NULL, '8/11/25<br>Seamus wanted to know if his wife neede to make her own account with zion to open a sharing request AC', 'Concierge', 'Concierge', '2025-08-11 18:09:07', '2025-08-11 18:09:07'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000169479122', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000168462023', 'David Tracht', NULL, '8/11/25<br>Anne called to see what card to present at the pharmacy for her RX. I explained that its best to check the app to see if it is covered it looks like they only offer it discounted, I also offered her to do some research on who has the best price but dismissed me Ac<br><span><br></span>', 'Concierge', 'Concierge', '2025-08-11 18:08:00', '2025-08-11 18:08:00'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000169479040', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000095555002', 'Kyle Larsen', NULL, '8/11/25<br>Kyles wife called to see why Kyles colo is not being covered by ARM after some context she explained kyle had polyps removed 5 years ago, I explained to her that once polyps are found future colonoscopy will never be considered preventative/screening AC', 'Concierge', 'Concierge', '2025-08-11 17:58:29', '2025-08-11 17:58:29'),
