  ('zcrm_1579374000169479010', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000028471248', 'Charles Christian Figge VI', NULL, '8/11/25<br>Informed patient about the process for scheduling a consultation with a PCP for prescription renewal. Provided a link to the list of providers. Advised that the consultation will be out-of-pocket and that there is no guarantee of an Adderall prescription, as this is at the provider’s discretion. Noted that Adderall is a controlled substance with strict regulations and may require referral to a specialist depending on the provider’s assessment.<br>Let me know if you''d like to personalize it further with the patient''s name or appointment <a href="http://details.AC" style="" target="_blank">details.AC</a>', 'Concierge', 'Concierge', '2025-08-11 17:04:34', '2025-08-11 17:04:34'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000169479003', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000027993452', 'Holly Wiese', NULL, '8/11/25<br>sent email to radiology assist link per her request to find more affordable ct scans Ac', 'Concierge', 'Concierge', '2025-08-11 16:39:42', '2025-08-11 16:39:42'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000169447045', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000169447050', 'Scott Burton', NULL, '8-11-25  Per her request, I sent her the Member Change Form and instructions.<br><span style="color:rgb(34, 34, 34);">Hi Wendy,</span><br><span style="color:rgb(34, 34, 34);"><br></span><span style="color:rgb(34, 34, 34);">Thank you for all your help last month and getting my husband and I enrolled in the MPB Premium Care plan. We had our intake meeting last week and things are rolling along.</span><br><span style="color:rgb(34, 34, 34);"><br></span><span style="color:rgb(34, 34, 34);">I wanted to let you know that my Premera health plan through my employer (for free) has been set up so I want to unenroll as Scott''s dependent on the Premium plan as of September 1st. I''m sorry that was a quick one month plan.</span><br><span style="color:rgb(34, 34, 34);"><br></span><span style="color:rgb(34, 34, 34);">Is there a form that I need to complete to make this request official? </span><br><span style="color:rgb(34, 34, 34);"><br></span><span style="color:rgb(34, 34, 34);">Thanks, Wendy!</span><br><span style="color:rgb(34, 34, 34);"><br></span><span style="color:rgb(34, 34, 34);">Sincerely,</span><br><span style="color:rgb(34, 34, 34);">Brooke Munro </span>', 'Wendy Scipione - SR VP National Sales Advisor', 'Wendy Scipione - SR VP National Sales Advisor', '2025-08-11 16:30:33', '2025-08-11 16:30:33'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000169443239', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000128730012', 'Timbrey Rosales', NULL, '08/11/2025<br>Called with general membership questions and asked about how preventative works<br>AJ', 'Concierge', 'Concierge', '2025-08-11 15:05:50', '2025-08-11 15:05:50'),
