  ('zcrm_1579374000169440067', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000126941009', 'Madeline Badgett', NULL, 'Member called in and wanted to cancel.  She has not spoke to her advisor.  I will send out link to member &amp; advisor', 'Patti Baron', 'Patti Baron', '2025-08-11 13:58:18', '2025-08-11 13:58:18'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000169443119', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000155312001', 'Melissa Farrar', NULL, '08/11/2025<br>Ran rx quote<br><ul style="list-style-type:disc;list-style-position:inside;"><li style="list-style-image:none;"><p style="display:inline;"><span style="color:rgb(17, 17, 17);font-weight:normal;font-style:normal;">NP Thyroid: Kroger Pharmacy = $81.69</span></p></li></ul>', 'Concierge', 'Concierge', '2025-08-11 13:43:18', '2025-08-11 13:43:18'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000169443112', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000080021001', 'Amy Fowler', NULL, '08/11/2025<br>Amy called due to a bill she got from her provider and she did not know why there was a charge after ARM paid for a portion of the bill. We called ARM together so they could explain what they paid for and what they did not and why, She found out there were some diagnostic codes on the yearly visit bill. She also wanted to know if she could go to another dr that does not take insurance. Me and ARM both explained that as long as the bill is coded preventative and it is routine preventative care then ARM will pay as long as the bill is not substantially higher than the average cost for the visit.<br>AJ', 'Concierge', 'Concierge', '2025-08-11 13:35:34', '2025-08-11 13:35:34'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000169463046', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000169470002', 'Esly Caldwell', NULL, 'Member &amp; Fam $2500 IUA Secure HSA Eff 9/25', 'Michele R', 'Michele R', '2025-08-11 13:24:18', '2025-08-11 13:40:02'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000169440057', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000125276002', 'Tristan Sophia', NULL, 'Member submitted cancellation eff 9/1 due to the fact that she thinks the membership is too confusing with too many changes.  I will process.', 'Patti Baron', 'Patti Baron', '2025-08-11 13:17:05', '2025-08-11 13:17:05'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000169440049', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000144243002', 'Frances Tamaariki', NULL, 'Member submitted Change Form to update address.  I will process.', 'Patti Baron', 'Patti Baron', '2025-08-11 13:07:24', '2025-08-11 13:07:24'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000169440044', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000169461002', 'Connie Man Lai Wong', NULL, 'Member only $5000 IUA Care +', 'Patti Baron', 'Patti Baron', '2025-08-11 13:05:11', '2025-08-11 13:05:11'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000169443107', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000168250023', 'Kevin Isenberg', NULL, '08/11/2025<br>Ran RX quote<br><ul style="list-style-type:disc;list-style-position:inside;"><li style="list-style-image:none;"><p style="display:inline;"><span style="color:rgb(17, 17, 17);font-weight:normal;font-style:normal;">Sulfasalazine: Walgreens= $ 9.10 for 60 tablets</span></p></li></ul>', 'Concierge', 'Concierge', '2025-08-11 12:47:57', '2025-08-11 12:47:57'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000169443100', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000150815002', 'Josiah Owens', NULL, '08/11/2025<br>Olivia called because she wanted to ask if she owed us any money due to a visit she had. I let her know it does not work like that and if she owed money she would get a bill from the provider<br>AJ', 'Concierge', 'Concierge', '2025-08-11 12:44:39', '2025-08-11 12:44:39'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000169443095', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000144243002', 'Frances Tamaariki', NULL, '08/11/2025<br>ran RX quote<br><ul style="list-style-type:disc;list-style-position:inside;"><li style="list-style-image:none;"><p style="display:inline;"><span style="color:rgb(0, 0, 0);font-weight:normal;font-style:normal;">Prednisone: Walgreens =$5.96</span></p></li><li style="list-style-image:none;"><p style="display:inline;"><span style="color:rgb(0, 0, 0);font-weight:normal;font-style:normal;">Diphenhydramine: Walgreens =$5.05</span></p></li><li style="list-style-image:none;"><p style="display:inline;"><span style="color:rgb(0, 0, 0);font-weight:normal;font-style:normal;">Epipen: Walgreens =$297.53 or CVS=$163.33</span></p></li></ul>', 'Concierge', 'Concierge', '2025-08-11 12:39:48', '2025-08-11 12:39:48'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000169443088', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000010543087', 'Tania Dibbs', NULL, '08/11/2025<br>Called for some guidance on a colo. We called ARM together so tania could get guidance on what to do to make sure it is not out of pocket. She is going to try and get the preventative screening and not bring anythign else up<br>AJ', 'Concierge', 'Concierge', '2025-08-11 12:23:36', '2025-08-11 12:23:36'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000169443083', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000082256002', 'Christopher McNiven', NULL, '08/11/2025<br>called to check on wifes benefits, jennifer, but she was not enrolled so i recommended he call karen to see if there was any confusion.<br>AJ', 'Concierge', 'Concierge', '2025-08-11 12:21:29', '2025-08-11 12:21:29'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000169442226', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000065203137', 'Sarah Wright', NULL, '8/11/25: Sarah went to ER yesterday, she had an infection - needed a refresher on process. Explained how to open sharing request. Requested 2 new cards through ARM portal per request, verified address. We also addressed the MEC changeover from Planstin to ARM since member was still using planstin card. Explained health wallet and some updates. <br>We searched for a pcp for son in Cortez CO - and I provided some options verbally based on the clinic they were interested in. AM', 'Concierge', 'Concierge', '2025-08-11 12:02:46', '2025-08-11 12:02:46'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000169463022', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000169459001', 'David Willis', NULL, 'Member &amp; Sp $2500 IUA Premium Care Eff 9/25', 'Michele R', 'Michele R', '2025-08-11 11:38:00', '2025-08-11 13:40:51'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000169439371', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000164147020', 'Brock Bomberger', NULL, 'Welcome call complete. Vanessa Orozco', 'Concierge', 'Concierge', '2025-08-11 11:32:27', '2025-08-11 11:32:27'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000169442196', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000136403002', 'Duane Ellsworth', NULL, '8/11/25: Angela called. Her don is traveliing overseas on a church trip and she was trying to fill out paperwork describing what type of benefits they have. Explained how it works and shared International sharing guidelines via email. <br>She also needs to find provider for youngest son. Having a difficult time finding a pcp that also does immunizations in office and asked if zocdoc is the best resource. I guided her on how to use multiplan which she found super useful. Also offered to do research for her if she needed. AM', 'Concierge', 'Concierge', '2025-08-11 11:30:20', '2025-08-11 11:30:20'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000169442189', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000149069020', 'Joseph Flores', NULL, '8/11/25: Joseph called to make sure he''s doing everything correctly for upcoming hernia surgery. We discussed the Zion member portal, choosing surgery option, collecting an estimate at next appt, what can go towards IUA, showing proof of payment in portal - etc. He''s going to try and get all this submitted as soon as possible. Not setting FU task since Adam already has one for this. AM', 'Concierge', 'Concierge', '2025-08-11 11:05:49', '2025-08-11 11:05:49'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000169443075', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000144243002', 'Frances Tamaariki', NULL, '08/11/2025<br>Frances called because it has been a while and she frogot how everything works. Sent hre links for an RX quote, to update her address and to schedule a welcome call to help remind her of what the membership provides<br>AJ', 'Concierge', 'Concierge', '2025-08-11 10:28:02', '2025-08-11 10:28:02'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000169443070', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000159767002', 'Pamela Skop', NULL, '08/11/2025<br>Pamela called to request some providers in her area for primary care. Sent her the list in email. Also answered her questions about when she should start her sharing request based on her not meeting her IUA yet. Let her know she can open it now or when she gets closer to IUA<br>AJ', 'Concierge', 'Concierge', '2025-08-11 10:26:39', '2025-08-11 10:26:39'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000169442170', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000129819012', 'Bryce Roberts', NULL, '8/11/25: Mackenzie emailed in asking about how to check on hospital bills she submitted. Let her know that we cannot check on her behalf, but I''d be happy to facilitate a 3way call to see what''s going on. She said she would call tomorrow. She also asked about getting a prescription filled - It looks like Ace is already helping her with that and will be coming in later today. I attempted to log into HW as her with no luck. AM', 'Concierge', 'Concierge', '2025-08-11 10:18:49', '2025-08-11 10:18:49'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000169442149', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000111619002', 'Lynne Diekmann', NULL, '8/11/25: Lynne called asking how to get in touch with Savvos - transferred to Sedera. AM', 'Concierge', 'Concierge', '2025-08-11 10:10:19', '2025-08-11 10:10:19'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000169442144', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000168219002', 'Stephen Johnson', NULL, '8/11/25: Stephen called. His dr called in a prescription for lisinopril 40 mg, 90 days. I let him know that it is a $0 medication according to formulary and how to access at local pharmacy and then mail order. We also discussed labs and what would be paid for - he said all his labs were preventive and he used benefit card at appt. AM', 'Concierge', 'Concierge', '2025-08-11 10:09:38', '2025-08-11 10:09:38'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000169440033', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000135320002', 'Wilfred Thibodeau', NULL, 'Member submitted Change Form to update address.  I will process.', 'Patti Baron', 'Patti Baron', '2025-08-11 09:55:00', '2025-08-11 09:55:00'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000169439121', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000163569002', 'Peter Nethington', NULL, 'Welcome call complete. Vanessa Orozco', 'Concierge', 'Concierge', '2025-08-11 09:50:35', '2025-08-11 09:50:35'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000169442132', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000082151010', 'Peter Benjamin', NULL, '8/11/25: Started calling around to help Peter find best cash rate for primary care. Also sent him and email requesting the names of the vaccines he is needing before he travels. AM<br><span><br></span>University of Vermont Medical Center (<span style="color:rgb(0, 100, 60);"><b>John H. Miller, MD, Michael W. Latreille, MD - both have good reviews 5 star)</b></span> - PCP cash rate: ____ soonest available appt: ________', 'Concierge', 'Concierge', '2025-08-11 09:49:26', '2025-08-11 09:58:54'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000169442119', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000168222001', 'Ian Rahilly', NULL, '8/11/25: Checked Ian''s health wallet access and if telehealth is showing up. All looks in order. Sent email letting him know it appears to be working on my end. AM', 'Concierge', 'Concierge', '2025-08-11 09:42:10', '2025-08-11 09:42:10'),
