  ('zcrm_1579374000169442088', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000168250023', 'Kevin Isenberg', NULL, '8/11/25: Sent Kevin a FU email letting him know he can log into health wallet along with some instructions about accessing medication. AM', 'Concierge', 'Concierge', '2025-08-11 09:02:42', '2025-08-11 09:47:01'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000169442080', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000154585041', 'Kyle Harper', NULL, '8/11/25: Still haven''t heard from Lori about male hormone labs - Sent another FU. AM', 'Concierge', 'Concierge', '2025-08-11 09:01:17', '2025-08-11 09:01:17'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000169443029', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000001608001', 'Carlos Matamoros', NULL, '08/11/2025<br>Carlos called in and i was able to find out he started the sharing request but is not sure which treatment he should do and i tried to give him some guidance. was not sure if everything was to go to same need. i let him know all of the treatment that is related to the prostate would be the same request until they are finished with treatment. transferred to zion so he could get clarification on what they are requesting from him<br>AJ', 'Concierge', 'Concierge', '2025-08-11 08:37:59', '2025-08-11 08:37:59'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000169442045', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000132825011', 'Marissa Goldhoff', NULL, '8/11/25: Marissa called, she wanted to know what labs were covered under her plan. I informed her of what preventive labs are paid for through MEC and let her know we can find discounts on diagnostic labs, emailed over quote form. She also asked if there''s anyway to search facility in multiplan. It''s provider, facility type, NPI or procedure- but she can reference the address of providers listed with practice she''s interested in. AM', 'Concierge', 'Concierge', '2025-08-11 08:37:22', '2025-08-11 08:37:22'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000169442037', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000025283259', 'Julie Oldham', NULL, '8/11/25: Returned Julie''s call. She was wondering why she can''t get into app - let her know the email was sent by mistake so unfortunately, she doesn''t have access to that app. AM', 'Concierge', 'Concierge', '2025-08-11 08:16:02', '2025-08-11 08:16:02'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000169439107', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000168235002', 'Andrew Swisher', NULL, 'Welcome call complete. Vanessa Orozco', 'Concierge', 'Concierge', '2025-08-11 08:03:23', '2025-08-11 08:03:23'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000169447003', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000028471248', 'Charles Christian Figge VI', NULL, '08.08.25 - Spoke with Figgie regarding his migraine and Adderal medication needs. Explained that a PCP through Lyric can assist with the migraine medication, however Adderall will require an in person visit since it''s a controlled substance. Explained the IUA, and FIggie was under the impression that everything would be covered. Connected him with Lyric directly to set up his account (it was missing email and phone number). Told him that the team will reach out and help him with Aderall on Monday.', 'MPB Health Member Notification', 'MPB Health Member Notification', '2025-08-11 07:56:05', '2025-08-11 07:56:05'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000169439097', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000166746002', 'Alexandru Parasca', NULL, 'Welcome call complete. Vanessa Orozco', 'Concierge', 'Concierge', '2025-08-11 07:52:53', '2025-08-11 07:52:53'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000169442011', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000135320002', 'Wilfred Thibodeau', NULL, '8/11/25:Charlene called to update address. Emailed over form and gave instructions. AM', 'Concierge', 'Concierge', '2025-08-11 07:42:03', '2025-08-11 07:42:03'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000169442006', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000151804001', 'Claudio Zeballos', NULL, '8/11/25: Returned Claudio''s call from weekend. Claudio also put in an rx quote request for paxlovid and lagevrio - both covid medications that are over 1K each. I let him know in message that both were pricey and calling to discuss options. His best route (if he really wants them) is to submit a need for them and see if sedera would share into the cost. Sending email with this info. AM', 'Concierge', 'Concierge', '2025-08-11 07:37:22', '2025-08-11 07:37:22'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000169439085', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000167985005', 'Marlaena Hartness', NULL, 'Welcome call complete. Vanessa Orozco', 'Concierge', 'Concierge', '2025-08-11 07:28:37', '2025-08-11 07:28:37'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000169440028', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000169427002', 'Shanna Gilliland', NULL, 'Member &amp; Sp $2500 IUA Secure', 'Patti Baron', 'Patti Baron', '2025-08-11 07:25:30', '2025-08-11 07:25:30'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000169442001', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000111239002', 'Lois Hurst', NULL, '8/11/25: Lois called over weekend - left VM asking about covered services. Called back - LVM. <br>Lois called back, IUD, provider in network, and is vasectomy covered. Yes on IUD - her provider was not in network, provided list of options through multiplan site and no vasectomy is not eligible for sharing. <br><span><br></span>Lois called back again stating that some of the providers listed are located at the facility that is saying they aren''t in network - I advised her to just have them verify with ARM before making appt, but if they are listed, she should be good. AM', 'Concierge', 'Concierge', '2025-08-11 07:11:36', '2025-08-11 08:19:03'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000169440017', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000144701035', 'Kathleen Williams', NULL, 'Member submitted cancellation eff 9/1/25 due to getting Employer Coverage.  I will process.', 'Patti Baron', 'Patti Baron', '2025-08-11 07:04:01', '2025-08-11 07:04:01'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000169440012', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000169416002', 'Ashley Caldwell', NULL, 'Member &amp; Ch $1000 IUA Secure', 'Patti Baron', 'Patti Baron', '2025-08-11 06:52:41', '2025-08-11 06:52:41'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000169440004', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000169410002', 'Steven Tanner', NULL, 'Member &amp; Fam $2500 IUA Secure', 'Patti Baron', 'Patti Baron', '2025-08-11 06:49:15', '2025-08-11 06:49:15'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000169386017', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000145346174', 'Scott Garcia', NULL, '8-8-25 Susan thinks the waiver got accepted, so she''s all set!', 'Wendy Scipione - SR VP National Sales Advisor', 'Wendy Scipione - SR VP National Sales Advisor', '2025-08-08 17:39:34', '2025-08-08 17:39:34'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000169386012', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000158712002', 'Kathleen Schofield', NULL, '8-8-25 Confirmation of cancellation for HAB for Sept. 1st, 2025.<br><span style="color:rgb(34, 34, 34);">Hi Wendy,</span><br><span style="color:rgb(34, 34, 34);">Thank you for your message.</span><br><span style="color:rgb(34, 34, 34);">Kathy Schofield''s membership is confirmed to end effective September 1, 2025. Her membership benefits will remain active through August 31, 2025.</span><br><span style="color:rgb(34, 34, 34);">Please let us know if you have any questions or need anything further.</span><br><span style="color:rgb(34, 34, 34);">Best regards,</span><br><span style="color:rgb(34, 34, 34);"> </span><br><p style=""><span style="color:rgb(34, 34, 34);">ANGELICA ZUNIGA</span></p><p style=""><span style="color:rgb(34, 34, 34);">Health Access</span></p>', 'Wendy Scipione - SR VP National Sales Advisor', 'Wendy Scipione - SR VP National Sales Advisor', '2025-08-08 17:11:11', '2025-08-08 17:11:11'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000169383228', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000115911012', 'Roy Thomson', NULL, '08/08/2025<br>Sent them a letter for proof of membership for college. <br>AJ', 'Concierge', 'Concierge', '2025-08-08 15:13:06', '2025-08-08 15:13:06'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000169383223', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000095555002', 'Kyle Larsen', NULL, '08/08/20258<br>SPoke with natalie and arm and her medical center in a 4 way call to clear up why they are still charging her for a portion of the bill for a colo. Going to follow up with her next week to see what to do after she tries to get her dr to re adjust the bill. The medical center was not willing to cooperate and natalie got in an argument with them at the end of the phone call.<br>AJ', 'Concierge', 'Concierge', '2025-08-08 15:11:40', '2025-08-08 15:11:40'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000169383218', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000153058003', 'James Longmire', NULL, '08/08/2025<br>Spoke to james about an upcoming colo appointment where he is being told the office visit is not covered. let him know to speak with ARm cause they can anser this question sbetter then i can since they actually sign the checks<br>AJ', 'Concierge', 'Concierge', '2025-08-08 15:08:04', '2025-08-08 15:08:04'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000169383213', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000116616002', 'Cora Lonning', NULL, '08/08/2025<br>Spoke with cora and walked her through how preventative care works. she wanted to know difference between planstin and arm and i let her know it is mainly just the name so she should do the same as she did with planstin with her information from ARM<br>AJ', 'Concierge', 'Concierge', '2025-08-08 15:05:49', '2025-08-08 15:05:49'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000169383192', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000119080002', 'Drew Workman', NULL, '08/08/2025<br>Shelly called in to get help with logging into health wallet. Walked her through it and got her logged in. Let them know the bill they have needs to be sent to ARM directly and also instructed how to do so.<br>AJ', 'Concierge', 'Concierge', '2025-08-08 15:02:26', '2025-08-08 15:02:26'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000169383187', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000132396012', 'Cody Clanton', NULL, '08/08/2025<br>followed up with him by giving him the number to zion so he could call and get his portal opened and start a share request<br>AJ', 'Concierge', 'Concierge', '2025-08-08 14:58:17', '2025-08-08 14:58:17'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000169380067', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000095960001', 'Doug Richter', NULL, 'Member called in and spoke to me about canceling, since she now might be moving out of the country.  I went over the timeline to submit the cancellation so she would not be billed.  I will send out the link to member &amp; advisor.', 'Patti Baron', 'Patti Baron', '2025-08-08 14:09:12', '2025-08-08 14:09:12'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000169380054', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000168214002', 'Sheri Ottosen', NULL, 'Member submitted Payment Update.  I will process.', 'Patti Baron', 'Patti Baron', '2025-08-08 12:26:22', '2025-08-08 12:26:22'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000169380044', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000140549002', 'Patricia Nilsen', 'New Membership eff 9/1/25', 'Member Only $1000 IUA Premium Care', 'Patti Baron', 'Patti Baron', '2025-08-08 12:16:49', '2025-08-08 12:16:49'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000169380039', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000140549002', 'Patricia Nilsen', NULL, 'Since this member was unsuccessful in getting her sons college to accept the MEC coverage, she now wants to go back to the Premium Care membership &amp; remove her sons.  I will process.', 'Patti Baron', 'Patti Baron', '2025-08-08 12:15:51', '2025-08-08 12:15:51'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000169381142', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000082151010', 'Peter Benjamin', NULL, '8/8/25: Peter called to go over what type of visits would be covered: <span style="color:rgb(51, 51, 51);">physical and vaccines for upcoming travel. I explained that both of those would be cash pay, and we discussed IUA, some of his services, and sharing based on travel. I offered to help him find some good cash options for his physical and immunizations and requested he fill out appt sched request - let him know I''d get back to him next week with some options. AM</span>', 'Concierge', 'Concierge', '2025-08-08 11:42:49', '2025-08-08 12:23:59'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000169381130', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000168293002', 'Carlene Wehrli', NULL, '8/8/25: Carlene called. Her dr ordered some follow up labs. From our conversation, it seems like they are diagnostic. I offered for us to do a lab quote for them and emailed over form. AM', 'Concierge', 'Concierge', '2025-08-08 11:14:34', '2025-08-08 12:18:56'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000169378187', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000168214002', 'Sheri Ottosen', NULL, 'Welcome call complete. Member not able to get into MPB Virtual Care. Sent info over to Julia. Vanessa Orozco', 'Concierge', 'Concierge', '2025-08-08 11:04:11', '2025-08-08 11:27:27'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000169381125', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000119469002', 'Steven Snead-Smith', NULL, '8/8/25: Jennifer called needing help finding in-network facility to get mamm done. Gave her an option through multiplan and offered to make appt for her if she needed, emailed over schedule appt form. AM', 'Concierge', 'Concierge', '2025-08-08 10:59:03', '2025-08-08 10:59:03'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000169378172', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000168293002', 'Carlene Wehrli', NULL, 'Welcome call complete. Vanessa Orozco', 'Concierge', 'Concierge', '2025-08-08 10:53:15', '2025-08-08 10:53:15'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000169381120', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000002630141', 'Cameron Elmendorf', NULL, '8/8/25: Cameron called wondering why she can''t get into health wallet. Explained that the email was a mistake, she doesn''t actually have access to that app with her current plan. AM', 'Concierge', 'Concierge', '2025-08-08 10:47:11', '2025-08-08 10:47:11'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000169381101', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000064218045', 'Eric Lipp', NULL, '8/8/25: Eric called. He said that he had quadruple bypass 2021, and has a defibrillator implanted in chest. Cardiologist ordered him to be on zepbound. He''s unable to get the medication at pharmacy. He already has a sharing request open for this through Zion. I advised him to speak to Zion about the med and cost, if eligible, they can issue the funds for it - but next step would be to submit documentation in member portal under the current sharing request. AM', 'Concierge', 'Concierge', '2025-08-08 10:45:54', '2025-08-08 10:45:54'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000169381077', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000163033002', 'Rhyan Hauter-Sims', NULL, '8/8/25: Ryan called needing to make an initial maternity appt. I let her know there is no network, she can make an appt where ever she likes, and the first step would be to open a medical need with Sedera. She said she''d call them later, had to jump off call. AM', 'Concierge', 'Concierge', '2025-08-08 10:30:01', '2025-08-08 10:30:01'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000169378143', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000168289025', 'John Sparks', NULL, 'Welcome call complete. Vanessa Orozco', 'Concierge', 'Concierge', '2025-08-08 10:30:00', '2025-08-08 10:30:00'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000169381072', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000060583574', 'Carlos Guerrero', NULL, '8/8/25: Frances called very confused about the emails she''s been getting from concierge regarding a bill that was from a year ago? She doesn''t know what we are talking about. Transferred to Adam. AM', 'Concierge', 'Concierge', '2025-08-08 10:19:31', '2025-08-08 10:19:31'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000169378133', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000168289025', 'John Sparks', NULL, 'No response. Left a detailed message on vm. Sent email to reschedule welcome call. Vanessa Orozco', 'Concierge', 'Concierge', '2025-08-08 10:07:38', '2025-08-08 10:07:38'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000169381067', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000144777002', 'Thomas Newton', NULL, '8/8/25: Kristi called. Her dr ordered some labs and she wants to know what''s covered. I explained that if they are preventive and part of wellness check up they would be paid for, but if getting bc of symptoms, then no. I did an impromptu lab quote over the phone and sent her link to JasonHealth for anything she''d like to pay cash for. AM', 'Concierge', 'Concierge', '2025-08-08 09:41:20', '2025-08-08 09:41:20'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000169378116', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000163473002', 'Tammy Chiarelli-Kelling', NULL, 'Welcome call complete. Vanessa Orozco', 'Concierge', 'Concierge', '2025-08-08 09:38:16', '2025-08-08 09:38:16'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000169383102', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000109184005', 'Merryl Rothaus', NULL, '08/08/2025<br>Sent f/u text to see if she was ablt to get the labwork done that she called in to ask about<br>AJ', 'Concierge', 'Concierge', '2025-08-08 09:27:24', '2025-08-08 09:27:24'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000169378101', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000167361002', 'Justin James', NULL, 'Welcome call complete. Not able to get into MPB Virtual  Care. Sent info over to Julia. Vanessa Orozco', 'Concierge', 'Concierge', '2025-08-08 09:24:59', '2025-08-08 09:24:59'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000169380015', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000169459001', 'David Willis', NULL, 'Did a full presentation on 08/06. Today he reached out asking for the application. David (56) lives in South Carolina. Him and his wife (60) currently has medishare. Use to take blood pressure medication but now is no longer needed. Had a back surgery over 5 years ago. <br><span><br></span><span><br></span>', 'Leonardo Moraes', 'Leonardo Moraes', '2025-08-08 09:15:14', '2025-08-08 09:15:14'),
