  ('zcrm_1579374000169381043', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000153058003', 'James Longmire', NULL, '8/8/25: James called. He has an upcoming colo and provider is telling him office visit isn''t covered, only procedure and not dr fee. The dr - Eimile Dalton is not showing in network. He said it doesn''t really make sense bc his wife just went through this a couple months ago and it was all paid for. I mentioned it may be that the provider jumpeed out of network recently. He said he''s going to call and ask a few more questions - urged him to call me back. AM', 'Concierge', 'Concierge', '2025-08-08 08:46:39', '2025-08-08 08:46:39'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000169378084', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000163569002', 'Peter Nethington', NULL, 'No response. Left a detailed message on vm. Sent email to reschedule welcome call. Vanessa Orozco', 'Concierge', 'Concierge', '2025-08-08 08:38:37', '2025-08-08 08:38:37'),
