  ('zcrm_1579374000169381038', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000141685002', 'Laura Murtha', NULL, '8/8/25: Laura Murtha said her DOB is still not correct in health wallet. It should be 11/9/78 and they have 11/8/78. Sent email to Sarah per Julia''s request to confirm correct DOB or update. AM', 'Concierge', 'Concierge', '2025-08-08 08:15:14', '2025-08-08 08:15:14'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000169381031', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000028471248', 'Charles Christian Figge VI', NULL, '8/8/25: Returned Christian''s call, mailbox full, sending email and text. AM<br>Figge called back - said he needs to use telehealth and has been waiting week(s) to do so. He can''t login to health wallet to access Lyric. Asked Julia if there''s anyway we can give him direct access - no. <br>She''s going to talk to IT. I promised we''d get back to Figge today with an answer. AM', 'Concierge', 'Concierge', '2025-08-08 08:00:51', '2025-08-08 11:30:01'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000169378036', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000168406025', 'Don Hough', NULL, 'Welcome call complete. Not able to get into MPB Virtual Care. Sent info over to Julia. Vanessa Orozco', 'Concierge', 'Concierge', '2025-08-08 07:57:32', '2025-08-08 07:57:32'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000169381018', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000157103002', 'Nicole Feenstra', NULL, '8/8/25: Returned Nicole''s call - LVM. AM', 'Concierge', 'Concierge', '2025-08-08 07:34:30', '2025-08-08 07:34:30'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000169381013', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000123789009', 'Huong Le', NULL, '8/8/25: Returned Darin''s call. He is having some gut lab tests done and wants to know if they are covered. I let him know they would be subject to IUA so he''d be paying cash at first and then once the issue expenses exceeded $2500, sharing would kick in. Sent him lab quote form. AM', 'Concierge', 'Concierge', '2025-08-08 07:32:38', '2025-08-08 07:32:38'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000169380008', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000107133002', 'Preston Jones', NULL, 'Member submitted Dependent over 18 From to submit spouse''s information since she has opened a need and Zion needed more contact information for her.  Submitted to Zion via file frm A123.', 'Patti Baron', 'Patti Baron', '2025-08-08 07:31:42', '2025-08-08 07:31:42'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000169381006', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000156744038', 'David Descoteaux', NULL, '8/8/25: Returned David''s call - he just asked if Lyric is replacing Cirrus - yes. We briefly discussed the differences and options within this telehealth. AM', 'Concierge', 'Concierge', '2025-08-08 07:16:35', '2025-08-08 07:16:35'),
