  ('zcrm_1579374000169352044', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000004455005', 'Carleen Andersen', NULL, '8-7-25 Carleen changed her income but indicated she''s not applying for ins which then ended her current plan. She just increased her income by $8K. She wants the same plan and no disruption. I had her call C4 to correct her account. She did and it all looks fixed now. Her APTC dropped to $79 from about $151. But, she''s getting mental health counseling and doesn''t want to lose that. So, she''s good to go.<br><br><p style="background-color:rgb(232, 241, 212);display:flex;"><span style="background-color:rgb(232, 241, 212);"><b>Enrolled members:</b></span><span style="background-color:rgb(232, 241, 212);">Carleen Andersen</span></p><span style="color:rgb(43, 49, 60);"><br></span><p style="display:flex;"><b>Cigna Connect Flex Gold 2700</b></p><span style="color:rgb(43, 49, 60);">Family Deductible</span><br><span style="color:rgb(43, 49, 60);">Family Out-of-Pocket Max</span><br><span style="color:rgb(43, 49, 60);">Primary Care Coinsurance</span><br><span style="color:rgb(43, 49, 60);">N/A</span><br><span style="color:rgb(43, 49, 60);">N/A</span><br><span style="color:rgb(43, 49, 60);">N/A</span><br><span style="color:rgb(43, 49, 60);">Individual Deductible</span><br><span style="color:rgb(43, 49, 60);">Individual Out-of-Pocket Max</span><br><span style="color:rgb(43, 49, 60);">Specialist Coinsurance</span><br><span style="color:rgb(43, 49, 60);">$2,700</span><br><span style="color:rgb(43, 49, 60);">$8,700</span><br><span style="color:rgb(43, 49, 60);">N/A</span><br><span style="color:rgb(43, 49, 60);">Urgent Care Coinsurance</span><br><span style="color:rgb(43, 49, 60);">N/A</span><br><p style="display:flex;"><b>Payment required from:</b></p><p style="display:flex;">01/01/25 - 12/31/25</p><p style="display:flex;"><b>$373.58 /month</b><span style="color:rgb(43, 49, 60);">after$79.08 financial help</span></p><p style="display:flex;margin-inline-start:0.5rem;"><b>Exchange policy number:</b><span style="color:rgb(43, 49, 60);"> 9048474089</span></p><p style="display:flex;margin-inline-start:0.5rem;"><b>Coverage dates:</b><span style="color:rgb(43, 49, 60);"> 01/01/25 - 12/31/25</span></p><p style="display:flex;margin-inline-start:0.5rem;"><b>Last updated:</b><span style="color:rgb(43, 49, 60);"> 08/07/25</span></p>', 'Wendy Scipione - SR VP National Sales Advisor', 'Wendy Scipione - SR VP National Sales Advisor', '2025-08-07 17:03:34', '2025-08-07 17:04:22'),
