  ('zcrm_1579374000169352034', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000140549002', 'Patricia Nilsen', NULL, '8-7-25 After many attempts to get her membership approved with Pepperdine for her sons, they still rejected it. She needs to remove them and the MEC from her membership. I''ll help her do so.', 'Wendy Scipione - SR VP National Sales Advisor', 'Wendy Scipione - SR VP National Sales Advisor', '2025-08-07 15:27:30', '2025-08-07 15:27:30'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000169352029', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000001409011', 'Karen Frame', NULL, '8-7-25 <br><span style="color:rgb(34, 34, 34);">Dear KAREN FRAME,</span><br><span style="color:rgb(34, 34, 34);"> </span><br><span style="color:rgb(34, 34, 34);"><b>Your insurance premium is past due. Please make a payment to keep your plan active.</b></span><br><span style="color:rgb(34, 34, 34);"> </span><br><span style="color:rgb(34, 34, 34);">Your Medical payment of $154.52 was not received and is now past due. Please pay the full past due amount now. If we don’t receive your payment, your policy will be terminated and you’ll lose your coverage. You should know that depending on when we receive your payment this past due balance may still be listed in your next month’s bill.</span><br><span style="color:rgb(34, 34, 34);"> </span><br><span style="color:rgb(34, 34, 34);">Due to your past due status, you will not receive benefits for your prescription costs. Once the full balance of your account has been paid and posted, your pharmacy benefits will be restored.</span><br><span style="color:rgb(34, 34, 34);"> </span><br><span style="color:rgb(34, 34, 34);">Please disregard this notice if you have already paid your full balance.</span><br><span style="color:rgb(34, 34, 34);"> </span><br><span style="color:rgb(34, 34, 34);"><b>Your next steps:</b></span><br><span style="color:rgb(34, 34, 34);">•  Log into </span><a style="display:inline;" target="_blank" href="http://www.cigna.com/"><u>http://www.cigna.com</u></a><span style="color:rgb(34, 34, 34);"> to pay online, using one of our approved payment methods, or</span><br><span style="color:rgb(34, 34, 34);">•  Pay with your bank account information by calling 1-877-900-1237</span><br><span style="color:rgb(34, 34, 34);"> </span><br><span style="color:rgb(34, 34, 34);"><b>Sign up for Electronic Funds Transfer (EFT) and never miss a payment again.</b></span><span style="color:rgb(34, 34, 34);"> Each month, we will automatically charge your bank account the amount of your premium. You won’t need to mail us anything and your payments will always be on time. To sign up for EFT, please call us at 1-877-900-1237. It will take one to two months to start EFT. Continue to send us your payments by mail until we have it set up.</span><br><span style="color:rgb(34, 34, 34);"> </span><br><span style="color:rgb(34, 34, 34);">If you have any questions, please call us at: 1-877-900-1237 during normal business hours.</span><br><span style="color:rgb(34, 34, 34);"> </span><br><span style="color:rgb(34, 34, 34);"><b>No Cost Language Services.</b></span><span style="color:rgb(34, 34, 34);"> You can get an interpreter. You can get documents read to you and some sent to you in your language. For help, call us at 1-877-900-1237.</span><br><span style="color:rgb(34, 34, 34);"> </span><br><span style="color:rgb(34, 34, 34);">Thank you for choosing Cigna Healthcare Individual and Family Plans.</span>', 'Wendy Scipione - SR VP National Sales Advisor', 'Wendy Scipione - SR VP National Sales Advisor', '2025-08-07 14:33:23', '2025-08-07 14:33:23'),
