  ('zcrm_1579374000169352006', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000169959013', 'Lisa Side', NULL, '8-7-25 Lisa is 61 and just moved from FL to PA. She was referred by Dr. Mary Ellen Francescani who is a friend of hers and possible new patient. Lisa had back surgery in Dec. 2024 for a herniated disc. She said she''s doing amazing now! She has osteoarthritis and osteoporosis and takes some meds for them. She takes fosomax/alendronate 70 mg, citalopram hydrobromide 40 mg and vyvanse 30 mg. Vyvanse was the most expensive one at around $53 per month from my research. Others were $20 or less. She''s paying only $265 now on her FL plan with a $7K ded. Her income is still low and will get a similar tax credit in PA. But, she''s very discouraged by the medical system at this point. So, she''s going to figure out if this makes sense for her. She wants video, written info and brochure.  She plans on getting a colonoscopy and pap screening this year as well. I quoted her Secure HSA $419/$1000 or $369/$2500 and she''ll pair it with Dr. Mary Ellen''s DPC. So, it might be too expensive give her income for now.', 'Wendy Scipione - SR VP National Sales Advisor', 'Wendy Scipione - SR VP National Sales Advisor', '2025-08-07 12:17:48', '2025-08-07 12:19:00'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000169312226', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000130357002', 'Steven Copus', NULL, '8/7/25<br>Sent email to follow up on sharing request AC', 'Concierge', 'Concierge', '2025-08-07 12:15:40', '2025-08-07 12:15:40'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000169312221', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000059281121', 'Dechen Hawk', NULL, '8/7/25<br>sent email to follow up on research for glaucoma, and colonoscopy  AC', 'Concierge', 'Concierge', '2025-08-07 12:12:41', '2025-08-07 12:12:41'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000169351001', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000090939002', 'Tamara Haas', NULL, 'Member called in wanting to know if she can pay for all remaining payments through the end of the year, this month (for September, October, November and December) as she is closing the business.  I told her I would check with the Operations Manager and would get back to her shortly.', 'Michele R', 'Michele R', '2025-08-07 11:50:18', '2025-08-07 11:50:18'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000169308114', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000100383002', 'Stephanie Mancuso', NULL, '8/7/25: Stephanie called. She needs help moving forward with an incident. She broke her ankle and visited urgent care in VT. Now back in AZ about to start seeing an orthopedic dr. I walked her through opening a sharing request, her IUA amount, what goes towards that. We also discussed her MEC, what that includes and how to present for preventive visits. AM', 'Concierge', 'Concierge', '2025-08-07 11:18:32', '2025-08-07 11:18:32'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000169308109', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000164831002', 'Greg Jerum', NULL, '8/7/25: Jennifer Jerum called wanting to confirm that for her upcoming well woman visit, she just presents her PHCS card at the visit - yes. We verified her provider Marvelle Maloney is in network which they were. She''s good to go. AM', 'Concierge', 'Concierge', '2025-08-07 10:51:41', '2025-08-07 10:51:41'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000169308090', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000120770001', 'Adele Haynes', NULL, '8/7/25: Adele called saying that she needs to go to urgent care and wondering how to go about it. Let her know she would present as self-pay. We discussed IUA and using telehealth first. AM', 'Concierge', 'Concierge', '2025-08-07 10:24:50', '2025-08-07 10:24:50'),
