  ('zcrm_1579374000169312016', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000168462023', 'David Tracht', NULL, '8/7/25<br><span><br></span>Anne called to see what was best to take her daughter to her provider or urgent care because she has a sore throat, I advised her to they an urgent care might provide quicker service and to please keep in mind this would be an out of pocket expense and to consider using the telehealth AC', 'Concierge', 'Concierge', '2025-08-07 08:52:38', '2025-08-07 08:52:38'),
