  ('zcrm_1579374000169308001', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000111976010', 'George Elkins', NULL, '8/7/25: George called. He''s about to have the labs drawn that his dr ordered an annual appt and the receptionist at lab is telling him the bill will be $230 so he wanted to check before moving forward. I asked if she submitted a claim or checked with altrisk - no, she just punched something in computer. Let member know that if the labs are coded preventive and part of annual, then ARM will pay for them and suggested him ask the receptionist if any are listed as diagnostic - if so, skip or save for later and we can help him get the price down. AM', 'Concierge', 'Concierge', '2025-08-07 07:12:44', '2025-08-07 07:12:44'),
