  ('zcrm_1579374000169227258', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000072471089', 'Anita Fisher', NULL, '8/6/25: I was finally able to confirm with Banner Health that they do have facilities that offer mamm and are in PHCS - Loveland and Greeley locations being the closest to Anita. Went ahead and added Anita''s info in scheduling to make it easier for her to schedule an appt. <br>Sent Anita email with options, instructions for scheduling and offered to take care of it for her if she''d like. AM', 'Concierge', 'Concierge', '2025-08-06 11:48:11', '2025-08-06 11:48:11'),
