  ('zcrm_1579374000169227190', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000168222001', 'Ian Rahilly', NULL, '8/6/25: Ian called, he just got off his welcome call and wanted to get set up with Zion however, when he called Zion - they have no record of him. Let him know I''d alert IT - that it''s a simple file transfer glitch, but we''ll work on getting everything sorted. AM', 'Concierge', 'Concierge', '2025-08-06 09:55:47', '2025-08-06 09:55:47'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000169229112', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000168222001', 'Ian Rahilly', NULL, 'Welcome call complete. Member not able to get into Health Wallet.Updated his child''s first name to Richard not Fraser. Also member filled out change form in portal. Vanessa Orozco', 'Concierge', 'Concierge', '2025-08-06 09:35:07', '2025-08-06 10:53:17'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000169227183', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000000165427', 'April Porterfield', NULL, '8/6/25: April called bc she''s been giving providers Planstin info and recently got a bill kicked back. I walked her through accessing her new benefit card through HW app and advised her to simply have bills resubmitted. AM', 'Concierge', 'Concierge', '2025-08-06 09:21:32', '2025-08-06 09:21:32'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000169269001', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000011881141', 'Nathan Butryn', NULL, '8-6-25 Nate''s price is going from $273 to $352. He does not have wellness included. He will need a triple hernia surgery soon and a double endoscopy/colonoscopy for acid reflux and preventive colonoscopy bc he''s turning 50. I explained with the acid reflux and endoscopy script that it will likely turn it into diagnostic coding and no longer preventive. So, he will have to meet his IUA of $1000 for each scenario, ie. 2 needs for hernia and acid reflux. He does the rest of his screenings with his naturopath. So, it doesn''t make sense to increase his membership to Secure HSA from CARE+. He will stay put and review this in a year from now after he''s done with his surgeries. He also sees that it''s not worth it to change his IUA to a higher amount. All set for now and likes to refer people to me!', 'Wendy Scipione - SR VP National Sales Advisor', 'Wendy Scipione - SR VP National Sales Advisor', '2025-08-06 09:21:15', '2025-08-06 09:21:15'),
