  ('zcrm_1579374000169239009', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000143308002', 'Hannah Neumeyer', NULL, '8-5-25 Per Stephanie Rankin regarding Hannah Neumeyer''s HAB membership still showing active on the invoice. Nobody told me she left Perrysburg, so her HAB membership has remained active. I''ll cancel it now.<br><span><br></span><span style="color:rgb(34, 34, 34);">"Oh gosh,</span><br><br><span style="color:rgb(34, 34, 34);">Yea I spoke to Wendy, my manager and she said Hannah hasn’t worked here since 2024, she started her own practice and is not affiliated with PCS.</span><br><br><span style="color:rgb(34, 34, 34);">Thanks,</span><br><span style="color:rgb(34, 34, 34);">Stephanie Rankin</span><br><span style="color:rgb(34, 34, 34);">Receptionist</span><br><span style="color:rgb(34, 34, 34);">Perrysburg Counseling Services</span><br><span style="color:rgb(34, 34, 34);">1070 Commerce Dr.</span><br><span style="color:rgb(34, 34, 34);">Building 1, Suite 101</span><br><span style="color:rgb(34, 34, 34);">Perrysburg, OH 43551</span><br><span style="color:rgb(34, 34, 34);"><br></span><span style="color:rgb(34, 34, 34);">419-482-8382 x507</span><br><span style="color:rgb(34, 34, 34);">855-319-1493 (fax)"</span>', 'Wendy Scipione - SR VP National Sales Advisor', 'Wendy Scipione - SR VP National Sales Advisor', '2025-08-05 14:25:46', '2025-08-05 14:25:46'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000169239001', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000169148037', 'Nicole Duke', NULL, '8-5-25 Nicole is 50 and her boyfriend Andrew, 52 joined the call as well. Nicole is a realtor, ie. self-employed. However, she''s more interested in Premium Care since she likes to get the labs on her own.  Andrew is a PA and knows what labs he wants every year as well. He''s earlier in the learning process than Nicole and doesn''t necessarily need Sept. 1st. Nicole definitely needs Sept. 1st since she just learned that she lost Medicaid and is uninsured now. Andrew has an enlarged prostate and elevated PSA as of about 1 year ago. He understands the pre-x clause after we discussed it extensively for his scenario. Nicole doesn''t have pre-x. Nicole will leave her daughter on her x-husband''s plan. She is interested in the mental health benefits. I shared with her the new mental health benefits and what''s included with Premium memberships up to $750 after you meet your IUA. She may want modalities such as EMDR. We are reconnect tomorrow for her to enroll and Andrew will send me an email when he reviews it all.  I quoted her Premium Care $1000/$299, $1500/$267, $125/$25.<br>', 'Wendy Scipione - SR VP National Sales Advisor', 'Wendy Scipione - SR VP National Sales Advisor', '2025-08-05 14:19:05', '2025-08-05 14:19:53'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000169226130', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000017243610', 'Paula Chavez', 'New Membership eff 6/25', 'Member Only $2500 IUA Premium Care', 'Patti Baron', 'Patti Baron', '2025-08-05 13:48:50', '2025-08-05 13:48:50'),
