  ('zcrm_1579374000169226004', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000044265014', 'Rebecca Rechtman', NULL, 'Member submitted Payment Update.  I will process.', 'Patti Baron', 'Patti Baron', '2025-08-05 12:13:03', '2025-08-05 12:13:03'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000169227072', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000072471089', 'Anita Fisher', NULL, '8/5/25: Anita responded to my FU email telling me she hasn''t been able to find a facility in PHCS network for mamm and asked for help. I performed a search and sent her the closest option - Banner Health Clinic (called clinic to confirm and waiting for a call back). <br>Also emailed Anita the list of facility results from PHCS search and informed her I''d reach back out when I hear back from Banner. AM', 'Concierge', 'Concierge', '2025-08-05 11:54:14', '2025-08-05 11:54:14'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000169227053', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000111054002', 'Andrea Reese', NULL, '8/5/25: Josh called. He needs a letter outlining his benefits through MPB. He''s trying to get onto a patient assistance program for Ozempic. I let him know I''d compile something and get it over to him by tomorrow. AM', 'Concierge', 'Concierge', '2025-08-05 11:21:09', '2025-08-05 11:21:09'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000169229009', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000168235002', 'Andrew Swisher', NULL, 'Member was not available. Directed wife Kaylee if she wanted to do welcome call her husband Andrew needs to fill out form permission to discuss. Sent email to reschedule welcome call. Vanessa Orozco', 'Concierge', 'Concierge', '2025-08-05 11:07:33', '2025-08-05 11:07:33'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000169227009', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000146978002', 'Seamus Mullen', NULL, '8/5/25: Emailed Seamus letting him know that unfortunately, our international shopper cannot source paxlovid. Recommended he open a sharing request before paying for the medication to make sure it meets Zion''s guidlines. AM', 'Concierge', 'Concierge', '2025-08-05 11:06:39', '2025-08-05 11:06:39'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000169216168', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000168238002', 'Linda Kenny', NULL, 'Welcome call complete. Not able to get into Health Wallet. Sent info over to Julia. Vanessa Orozco', 'Concierge', 'Concierge', '2025-08-05 10:34:32', '2025-08-05 10:59:40'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000169216158', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000167982018', 'Christina O''Connor', NULL, 'Welcome call complete. Member not able to get into Health wallet. Sent info over to Julia. Vanessa Orozco', 'Concierge', 'Concierge', '2025-08-05 10:30:37', '2025-08-05 10:30:37'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000169146515', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000010282165', 'Alicia Turbidy', NULL, '8/5/25: Alicia emailed in saying she can''t access app - let her know that we are in the process of updating the app and in the meantime, she can access all her benefit info from the MPB portal through a web browser. AM', 'Concierge', 'Concierge', '2025-08-05 10:03:31', '2025-08-05 10:03:31'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000169146510', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000161616006', 'Jane Brajkovich', NULL, '8/5/25: Jane called wanting to know how to go about refilling prescriptions and contributing to HSA account. They are maintenance drugs. Suggessted she utlize her primary care telehealth options, and if they are unable to manage the meds for her, then she''d have to see someone in person. <br>As for HSA, Jane said she already has one - can she contribute to that acct or does she have to set up elsewhere - let her know she can contribute to that one. AM', 'Concierge', 'Concierge', '2025-08-05 09:57:51', '2025-08-05 09:57:51'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000169216139', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000168256006', 'Nytashia Allbritton', NULL, 'Welcome call complete. Member can''t  get into Health Wallet. Sent info over to Julia. Vanessa Orozco', 'Concierge', 'Concierge', '2025-08-05 09:55:03', '2025-08-05 09:55:03'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000169215177', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000099203002', 'Todd Muffley', 'New Membership eff 8/25', 'Member &amp; Fam $1000 IUA Secure', 'Patti Baron', 'Patti Baron', '2025-08-05 09:54:07', '2025-08-05 09:54:07'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000169146498', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000065104032', 'Clove Berger', NULL, '8/5/25: Clove called needing a proof of benefit letter for Ava. Let her know I''d get that emailed over to her today (done) and if for some reason the school needs additional info, just let me know and we can round up more detailed letters from Zion and Altrisk. She said last year it was fine. AM', 'Concierge', 'Concierge', '2025-08-05 09:43:58', '2025-08-05 09:50:05'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000169146479', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000168301001', 'Gretchen Clark', NULL, '8/5/25: Emailed Gretchen RX quote per request. See email for details. AM', 'Concierge', 'Concierge', '2025-08-05 09:36:08', '2025-08-05 09:36:08'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000169215151', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000155884019', 'Michael Logue', NULL, 'Member submitted cancellation eff 9/1/25  since he left the Hindu University.  I will process', 'Patti Baron', 'Patti Baron', '2025-08-05 09:31:16', '2025-08-05 09:31:16'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000169216127', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000167776002', 'Tonya Russell', NULL, 'Welcome call complete. Not able to get into Health Wallet. Sent info over to Julia. Vanessa Orozco', 'Concierge', 'Concierge', '2025-08-05 09:27:35', '2025-08-05 09:27:35'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000169215146', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000066423001', 'Nicholas Palmer', NULL, 'Member called in and told me that he had just recently got married and that he was going to be added to his spouses coverage.  I will send out the Cancellation link', 'Patti Baron', 'Patti Baron', '2025-08-05 09:25:44', '2025-08-05 09:25:44'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000169146452', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000151135017', 'Alana Helapitage', NULL, '8/5/25: Alana called to submit a maternity request but having issues logging into zion portal. Let her know that Zion actually needs to send her a link to set up portal if it''s her first time using it. Connected to Zion to start request. AM', 'Concierge', 'Concierge', '2025-08-05 09:17:47', '2025-08-05 09:17:47'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000169215141', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000157236025', 'Dallas Cluck', NULL, 'We were notified by employee that he will be getting other coverage eff 9/1/25.  I will cancel', 'Patti Baron', 'Patti Baron', '2025-08-05 09:10:23', '2025-08-05 09:10:23'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000169146441', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000164917002', 'Daniel Kelley', NULL, '8/5/25: Called Daniel to see if he was able to get appt through wife - he said he was still waiting on dr to get back to them but they did reach out. Let him know to please give us a call if it doesn''t work out and we''d be happy to do some reserach to help find another provider. AM', 'Concierge', 'Concierge', '2025-08-05 09:04:09', '2025-08-05 09:04:09'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000169146427', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000083717903', 'Anne Singleton', NULL, '8/5/25: Called Anne to FU about Mounjaro options. LVM. AM', 'Concierge', 'Concierge', '2025-08-05 08:58:16', '2025-08-05 08:58:16'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000169215131', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000078032445', 'David Hammer', 'New Membership eff 9/25', 'Member &amp; Sp $1000 IUA Premium Care', 'Patti Baron', 'Patti Baron', '2025-08-05 08:54:36', '2025-08-05 08:54:36'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000169215126', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000078032445', 'David Hammer', NULL, 'Member submitted Switch Request form to go to the Premium Care membership eff 9/1/25.  I will process.', 'Patti Baron', 'Patti Baron', '2025-08-05 08:54:03', '2025-08-05 08:54:03'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000169146401', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000011610497', 'Adam Burstein', NULL, '8/5/25: Adam LVM asking about steps for seeing a specialist. Called back, left detailed message as well as giving him specific guidance via email. AM', 'Concierge', 'Concierge', '2025-08-05 08:52:36', '2025-08-05 08:52:36'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000169146394', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000119178002', 'Jackson Sobbing', NULL, '8/5/25: Jackson called - his daughter has a physical in about 10 minutes and wondering if they should present as cash or use benefit card for billing. Advised him to use card, however if provider not in PHCS network, they may get a balance bill. AM', 'Concierge', 'Concierge', '2025-08-05 08:43:35', '2025-08-05 08:43:35'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000169215116', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000168819001', 'Diane Moore', 'New membership changed prior to start', 'Member &amp; Sp $1500 IUA Premium HSA', 'Patti Baron', 'Patti Baron', '2025-08-05 08:43:31', '2025-08-05 08:43:31'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000169216105', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000168374002', 'Jack Heinz', NULL, 'No response. Left a detailed message on vm. Sent email to reschedule welcome call. Vanessa Orozco', 'Concierge', 'Concierge', '2025-08-05 08:40:01', '2025-08-05 08:40:01'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000169215106', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000153844002', 'Eric Hill', 'New Membership eff 9/25', 'Member &amp; Sp $1000 IUA Secure', 'Patti Baron', 'Patti Baron', '2025-08-05 08:34:44', '2025-08-05 08:34:44'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000169215101', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000153844002', 'Eric Hill', NULL, 'I received change form from this member wanting to remove all dependent from membership eff 9/1/25.  I will process.', 'Patti Baron', 'Patti Baron', '2025-08-05 08:32:41', '2025-08-05 08:32:41'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000169216078', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000010282165', 'Alicia Turbidy', NULL, 'Welcome call refresher complete. Vanessa Orozco', 'Concierge', 'Concierge', '2025-08-05 08:10:05', '2025-08-05 08:10:05'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000169216053', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000164262010', 'Sandrine Lisk', NULL, 'Welcome call complete. Vanessa Orozco', 'Concierge', 'Concierge', '2025-08-05 08:05:53', '2025-08-05 08:05:53'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000169146372', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000120891002', 'Douglas Hill', NULL, '8/5/25: Emailed Doug surgeon and facility info from a HCBB search for his hernia surgery. Called to let him know. He said he got it and will review. Offered to schedule appt as well. AM', 'Concierge', 'Concierge', '2025-08-05 08:05:27', '2025-08-05 11:09:44'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000169146365', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000164546001', 'Heinz Kuster', NULL, '8/5/25: Heinz called needing to schedule welcome call. Sent link to do so. AM', 'Concierge', 'Concierge', '2025-08-05 07:35:56', '2025-08-05 07:35:56'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000169216021', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000168301001', 'Gretchen Clark', NULL, 'Welcome call complete. Not able to get into MPB Virtual Care. Sent info over to Julia. Vanessa Orozco', 'Concierge', 'Concierge', '2025-08-05 07:33:36', '2025-08-05 07:34:09'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000169146360', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000071380029', 'Trevor Berry', NULL, '8/5/25: Melissa called asking how to access their telehealth - said that Cirrus wasn''t working. I walked her through logging into health wallet and setting up appt, and let her know some of the changes. She also requested to schedule a refresher call. Sent link to do so. AM', 'Concierge', 'Concierge', '2025-08-05 07:32:44', '2025-08-05 07:32:44'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000169146355', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000130740002', 'Wayne Easterwood', NULL, '8/5/25: Lisa called, she had a cologuard done and it was accidently billed to old insurance. We confirmed the right claims address info for bill to be resubmitted. AM', 'Concierge', 'Concierge', '2025-08-05 07:10:52', '2025-08-05 07:10:52'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000169146350', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000120892002', 'Carly Swift', NULL, '8/5/25: Carly emailed in asking what the international travel policies are - shared Zion''s guidelines with her regarding this and explained that if it''s an acute need, then shareable like any other large medical expense. AM', 'Concierge', 'Concierge', '2025-08-05 07:10:12', '2025-08-05 07:10:12'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000169215033', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000157249001', 'Sterling Dudley-Bowen', NULL, 'Member called in and asked what the cancellation process was.  I sent out the cancellation link and received the Cognito form back.  I will process.', 'Patti Baron', 'Patti Baron', '2025-08-05 06:46:25', '2025-08-05 06:46:25'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000169215028', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000169199007', 'Jennifer Tai', NULL, 'Member Only $2500 IUA Secure', 'Patti Baron', 'Patti Baron', '2025-08-05 06:44:37', '2025-08-05 06:44:37'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000169146331', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000169447050', 'Scott Burton', NULL, '8/4/25: Brooke called in needing some advice on an upcoming blood draw and she lives in an area without many options. She did say that one of the facilities close to her has a labcorp inside of it so we may be able to find some discounts using traditional sites. Otherwise, I let her know we could call around and check a few other resources for her - suggested she fill out lab quote form and emailed over. AM<br><span><br></span>8/5/25: Did a little preliminary research on the discount lab sites for Juneau AK - looks like we can use Walk in Labs and Health Labs as options for her once the request is submitted. AM', 'Concierge', 'Concierge', '2025-08-04 17:55:04', '2025-08-05 10:45:47'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000169146326', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000146978002', 'Seamus Mullen', NULL, '8/4/25: Seamus called, he''s recently been prescribed Paxlovid but said it wasn''t covered when he presented card to pharmacy. I let him know that drug is not on formulary but that I could check for lower price options and also suggested submitting as sharing request. He said he''s already had 3 sharing requests this year, so shouldn''t have to pay another IUA - yes that would be correct. Let him know I''d email and call tomorrow after doing some reserach on getting price down. AM', 'Concierge', 'Concierge', '2025-08-04 17:46:29', '2025-08-04 17:46:29'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000169146291', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000123624010', 'Heli Ananda', NULL, '8/4/25: Emailed Heli lab quote per request. AM', 'Concierge', 'Concierge', '2025-08-04 16:03:45', '2025-08-04 16:03:45'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000169127154', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000157231043', 'jennifer dudley-Pieropan', NULL, '08/04/2025<br>CAlled and left a VM to return her call<br>AJ', 'Concierge', 'Concierge', '2025-08-04 15:27:53', '2025-08-04 15:27:53'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000169127149', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000021903103', 'Jodi Anglin', NULL, '08/04/2025<br>Needed her password for the member portal<br>AJ', 'Concierge', 'Concierge', '2025-08-04 15:27:19', '2025-08-04 15:27:19'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000169127144', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000001207361', 'Janet Ingvaldsen', NULL, '08/04/2025<br>Moved from optum rx to rx valet <br>.<br>AJ', 'Concierge', 'Concierge', '2025-08-04 15:26:48', '2025-08-04 15:26:48'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000169127139', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000132041011', 'Bobbi Shiflett', NULL, '08/04/2025<br>Called ARM with her about a bill from  UCLA. ARM said they have not gotten the bill yet. I advised Bobbi to get the provider to send the bill to arm so they can take care of it<br>AJ', 'Concierge', 'Concierge', '2025-08-04 15:25:27', '2025-08-04 15:25:27'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000169127131', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000028082440', 'Robert Weiffenbach', NULL, '08/04/2025<br>Called because he could not log into hwalth wallet. I let vinnie know and they should have fixed<br>AJ', 'Concierge', 'Concierge', '2025-08-04 15:18:02', '2025-08-04 15:18:02'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000169127126', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000159872002', 'Robyn Hugar', NULL, '08/04/2025<br>Called with questions about how everything works. Walked her through it all and exaplined how the membership works from IUA to preventative and in between<br>AJ', 'Concierge', 'Concierge', '2025-08-04 15:16:53', '2025-08-04 15:16:53'),
