  ('zcrm_1579374000169166026', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000011610171', 'Melinda Grabau', NULL, '8-4-25 Mindy called bc she submitted her first Need and is working with Kelly Miller Shirley. She told Mindy she has a $3K IUA. But, after talking it through, it sounds like they are breaking it out into 3 Needs, hip, foot and knee issues. They are all connected but Zion is separating them out. She''s most focused on the hip and not the knee or foot. She''s avoiding surgery. Also doing some peptide shots. She was happy to understand it''s 3 needs and not $3K IUA since she was certain that''s not what she chose.', 'Wendy Scipione - SR VP National Sales Advisor', 'Wendy Scipione - SR VP National Sales Advisor', '2025-08-04 15:10:47', '2025-08-04 15:10:47'),
