  ('zcrm_1579374000171561152', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000114408009', 'Kim Scott', NULL, '10/07/2025<br>Spoke to Joel about if charles armstrong is in network and he is not. he is not in network so i am trying to get in touch with arm with him on a 3 way to find out what he should do. <br>AJ', 'Concierge', 'Concierge', '2025-10-07 14:06:16', '2025-10-07 14:06:16'),
