  ('zcrm_1579374000171560039', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000028522170', 'Jonathan Carroll', '10/7/25', 'Informed the customer that if the provider is <b>not in-network</b>, we <b>cannot guarantee full reimbursement</b>. Recommended that claims be <b>submitted directly by the provider</b>, especially if they are in-network.<br>Also advised that <b>out-of-network providers may refuse to submit claims</b>, which could delay or affect reimbursement.<br>Offered assistance if they need help navigating options or next steps.', 'Concierge', 'Concierge', '2025-10-07 13:54:15', '2025-10-07 13:54:15'),
