  ('zcrm_1579374000171561057', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000163249002', 'John Pischke', NULL, '10/07/2025<br>Spoke with Sandra about an ongoing need that she is dealing with and wanted to know exactly how to handle bills. I let her know sedera traditionally pays her and she will then pay the provider after. She wanted to know if sedera would want to speak to provider about bill and i was not totally sure so i transferred her over and helped her get answers from sedera<br>AJ', 'Concierge', 'Concierge', '2025-10-07 13:37:25', '2025-10-07 13:37:25'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000171584001', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000060442195', 'Kristin Smith', NULL, '10-7 25 Kristin wants to cancel her HAB bc she only paid for it to keep her benefits once she leaves her job and loses benefits. She knew she couldn''t join later. Sadly they are ending it altogether. She gets all of her benefits from her employer including dental and vision. She already did her mammo. She may try for a skin check if she can get in before the end of the month. She just did a running race and will submit that. I''ll request to cancel for Nov. 1st.', 'Wendy Scipione - SR VP National Sales Advisor', 'Wendy Scipione - SR VP National Sales Advisor', '2025-10-07 13:36:00', '2025-10-07 13:36:00'),
