  ('zcrm_1579374000171561006', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000168816001', 'Carla London', NULL, '10/07/2025<br>Carla called in initially to find somewhere for her daughter to get her ADD meds. I let her know that due to Adderall being a controlled substance she would need to go to a provider in person for that and they could open a share request but it could be limited due to it being ADD and it being pre existing. Then she wanted a list of providers for basic preventative care and i got her a list of OBGYN and family practice for her and her daughter. I explained how all the preventative care works and what to do for billing.<br>AJ', 'Concierge', 'Concierge', '2025-10-07 11:37:53', '2025-10-07 11:37:53'),
