  ('zcrm_1579374000171561001', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000049780037', 'Adriana Rojas Vargas', NULL, '10/07/2025<br>Adriana called to double check on getting a larger quantity then usual for a trip to costa rica. I let her know we do not do prior authorization so she will have to see what the highest quantity the dr will write for her and i will look into the highest quantity available to get through our sources and reach back out to her. Then she will probably be able to get the dr to write a 3-6 month prescription for her. Closed my task after realizing Ace was already working with her and she just called us both while waiting on Ace to call her back and had me looking into the same thing for her.<br>AJ', 'Concierge', 'Concierge', '2025-10-07 09:24:11', '2025-10-09 12:28:12'),
