  ('zcrm_1579374000171483140', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000120772002', 'Sarah Byrnes', NULL, '10/06/2025<br>Sara called to ask how to go about submitting bills.I let her know she can start by updating her providers from planstin info to ARM. Let her know if providers will not send in the bill then just get the bill w/ CPT codes so we could help her submit<br>AJ', 'Concierge', 'Concierge', '2025-10-06 14:02:22', '2025-10-06 14:02:22'),
