  ('zcrm_1579374000171482144', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000168615016', 'Jeri Roper', NULL, '10/6/25<br>Tammy Parnell with Grand Strand Primary Care called because in order of geoff to move toward with his wellness check, we need to send them a document of what is covered, Arm sent the the letter but they can not accept it becuase they claim it is a generic template and his name is not on it. <br><span><br></span>I cantacted ARM to see if they can generate a new copy and add his name so we can send that over Ac', 'Concierge', 'Concierge', '2025-10-06 13:24:43', '2025-10-06 13:24:43'),
