  ('zcrm_1579374000171483065', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000171503002', 'Resa Hayes', 'Member Only $1000 IUA Premium HSA', 'TAX ID/EIN: request sent to member &amp; advisor via em. Member submitted Tax ID: 721590398', 'Michele R', 'Michele R', '2025-10-06 13:11:04', '2025-10-06 13:46:01'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000171483046', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000154862002', 'Danell Underwood', NULL, '10/06/2025<br>Danelle had trouble with the mental health feature when they asked what her employer was for the EAP. I called the 469 number and they told me should could say MPB group but they would look into why they are asking when they shouldnt. I gave dannell the 469 number and the info they gave me for her to set up an appointment.<br>AJ', 'Concierge', 'Concierge', '2025-10-06 13:03:19', '2025-10-06 13:03:19'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000171501003', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000171503002', 'Resa Hayes', NULL, '10-6-25 Resa is about to turn 54 in a week or so. In good health. She broke her nose about a year ago and it''s all healed. I re-explained the membership to her. She wants the best membership and all wellness benefits. Premium HSA is best at her age and scenario. She may also fund the HSA.  She owns and operates her own psychotherapy business and has about 5 clients with HAB right now. I let her know that will be ending soon sadly. She was curious about getting onto the app to continue helping her clients. Her current rates are $250 but current clients grandfathered around $175-$200. Joining the app might not be good for her since she may only get $100 per session. But, I will find out how to join and what the pay would be. UPDATE - Julia gave me a phone # to pass along for her to reach out and determine the terms of agreement. <br>Resa chose the Premium HSA membership for a Nov. 1st start date $363/$1000. She''s very happy to give this a try now that she has a better grasp. She also thought there were still penalties for non-compliance. She was also nervous to take the plungs with the uncertainty of the election last year. Now she''s ready to go. She also wants to send her daughter to me to give her the options. Her daughter lives in NY and is 26 now.', 'Wendy Scipione - SR VP National Sales Advisor', 'Wendy Scipione - SR VP National Sales Advisor', '2025-10-06 13:00:31', '2025-10-06 20:38:41'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000171482134', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000001165323', 'Kevin Schill', NULL, '10/6/25<br>Kevin called needing help accessing their telehealth Ac', 'Concierge', 'Concierge', '2025-10-06 12:44:45', '2025-10-06 12:44:45'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000171482129', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000085146002', 'Rebecca Snyder', NULL, '10/6/25<br>called and sent email to follow up with the snyders regarding their questions no response AC', 'Concierge', 'Concierge', '2025-10-06 12:36:12', '2025-10-06 12:36:12'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000171482124', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000164546001', 'Heinz Kuster', NULL, '10/6/25<br>Heinz called to see how a wellness check would be covered i explained he has to pay out of pocket and present as self pay and then submit the bill for reimbursement, I informed him that Zion will only reimburse up to $175  Ac', 'Concierge', 'Concierge', '2025-10-06 12:30:43', '2025-10-06 12:30:43'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000171483041', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000111990002', 'John Hill', NULL, '10/06/2025<br>Mary called because she had some bills for preventative care visits that she does not think have been paid. On the ARM portal it also does not show up so we called ARM together and see if they have them and at 2PM claims is at lunch. Going to try again in 30 minutes or she might call on her own.<br>AJ', 'Concierge', 'Concierge', '2025-10-06 12:11:43', '2025-10-06 12:11:43'),
