  ('zcrm_1579374000171482080', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000128422001', 'Doug Shaw', '10/6/25', 'Jill called to check on the status on her claim of 8/13/25 for a mammogram. She claims the provider has not been paid however out system shows it has been paid. I called ARM to confirm when the check was cashed and they stated 10/3/25 AC', 'Concierge', 'Concierge', '2025-10-06 09:30:23', '2025-10-06 09:30:23'),
