  ('zcrm_1579374000171483018', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000170673010', 'Richard Liebert', NULL, '10/06/2025<br>Ran RX quote for Bethany on Montelukast which was $0 at RX Valet. Richard then emailed back how to go about getting the meds. I gave him instructions through email and let him know to reach out if he has any difficulties<br>AJ', 'Concierge', 'Concierge', '2025-10-06 08:14:15', '2025-10-06 14:03:36'),
