  ('zcrm_1579374000171483013', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000089065002', 'Susan Fontana', NULL, '10/06/2025<br>Susan called and left a VM saying she was hvaing trouble with the telehealth. I called back and she said she has figured it out and does not need help anyhmore.<br>AJ', 'Concierge', 'Concierge', '2025-10-06 07:48:55', '2025-10-06 07:48:55'),
