  ('zcrm_1579374000171483008', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000151799037', 'Michael Guerriero', NULL, '10/06/2025<br>Michael called to see how he can go about getting a prescription through telehealth. I let him know the primary care feature is there for things like medication management and got him to make an appointment through telehealth. Let him know to reach out with any issues<br>AJ', 'Concierge', 'Concierge', '2025-10-06 07:46:00', '2025-10-06 07:46:00'),
