  ('zcrm_1579374000171395505', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000012630005', 'Michelle Badger', NULL, '10/3/25<br>Michella called wanting to schedule a tele health appointment transferred over to lyric AC', 'Concierge', 'Concierge', '2025-10-03 14:24:09', '2025-10-03 14:24:09'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000171438333', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000002630141', 'Cameron Elmendorf', NULL, '10-3-25 I left her a long vm letting her know her monthly amount will remain the same until June 2026. She should use her Health Access wellness benefits now. If she wants to upgrade to Premium HSA, we can do so at any time next year. She''s self-employed with her own LLC as well.', 'Wendy Scipione - SR VP National Sales Advisor', 'Wendy Scipione - SR VP National Sales Advisor', '2025-10-03 14:09:10', '2025-10-03 14:09:10'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000171395500', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000110082002', 'Elizabeth Sayre', '10/3/25', 'Elizabeth called in stating she is currently at the provider''s office and was informed that the provider is not in-network. She inquired whether she could pay out of pocket and seek reimbursement. I advised her that she is more than welcome to do so; however, we cannot guarantee full reimbursement, as many factors are involved and we cannot predetermine the outcome until a claim is submitted. I offered to assist in booking an appointment with an in-network provider, but she declined. AC', 'Concierge', 'Concierge', '2025-10-03 13:55:23', '2025-10-03 13:55:23'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000171418221', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000130955002', 'Laurie Boehk', NULL, 'Member submitted Cancellation  eff 11/1/25 due to the fact that her colonoscopy was not going to be covered.  Member only has MEC + Essentials and has had a polyp removed previously so would be considered diagnostic.  This membership was clearly not explained properly.', 'Patti Baron', 'Patti Baron', '2025-10-03 13:21:29', '2025-10-03 13:21:29'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000171395495', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000111417002', 'Maria Shea', NULL, '10/3/25<br>Maria called in to see if certin vaccines are covered AC', 'Concierge', 'Concierge', '2025-10-03 13:16:39', '2025-10-03 13:16:39'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000171395490', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000109671026', 'George Jarratt', NULL, '10/3/25<br>George called to see how he should present at his dermatology appointment i advised him to present as self pay AC', 'Concierge', 'Concierge', '2025-10-03 12:46:37', '2025-10-03 12:46:37'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000171395482', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000100500002', 'Robin Rudy', NULL, '10/3/25<br>Robin needed assistance with the health wallet app AC', 'Concierge', 'Concierge', '2025-10-03 12:32:29', '2025-10-03 12:32:29'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000171395477', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000156834039', 'Andrew Thomsen', NULL, '10/3/2<br>Michelle called because she scheduled an appointment with a telehealth provider and she had already spoken to the scheduling department regarding this issue. She then later called us again to<a style="" target="_blank"> reschedule.AC</a>', 'Concierge', 'Concierge', '2025-10-03 12:30:16', '2025-10-03 12:30:16'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000171395472', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000130955002', 'Laurie Boehk', NULL, '10/3/25<br>Laurie called to check to see if her preferred providers where in network for a Colo. She mentioned she had a polyp removed in the past and I informed her that it will longer be covered Ac', 'Concierge', 'Concierge', '2025-10-03 12:15:14', '2025-10-03 12:15:14'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000171438328', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000044725004', 'Richard Zimmerman', NULL, '10-3-25 Ann called to review her membership. They still have the best option for their needs and age group. They are fine with paying cash for all wellness except mammo and colonoscopy that is included. I refreshed her memory on every other year for mammo  up to $600 and colonoscopy every 10 years up to $2500. She''s an acupuncturist and sees how brutal the insurance world is. She''s wanting to work on creating a membership solution instead of doing insurance reimbursements. She was excited about the pet telehealth. I need to find out if MPB can look up pet meds and get best rates. Also she had a friend with stage 4 cancer go to Envita for treatment and they helped her tremendously. They took small cancerous part of and tested those cells with what her own body will respond to properly!  It was successful. Very cool!', 'Wendy Scipione - SR VP National Sales Advisor', 'Wendy Scipione - SR VP National Sales Advisor', '2025-10-03 12:03:21', '2025-10-03 12:03:21'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000171391478', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000170212009', 'Kristen Douhan', NULL, 'Welcome call complete. Vanessa Orozco', 'Concierge', 'Concierge', '2025-10-03 11:26:20', '2025-10-03 11:26:20'),
