  ('zcrm_1579374000171391404', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000170623002', 'Christine Gearhart', NULL, 'Welcome call complete. Not able to get into Health Wallet. Sent info over to Julia. Vanessa Orozco', 'Concierge', 'Concierge', '2025-10-03 10:13:34', '2025-10-03 10:36:02'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000171391367', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000170998024', 'Satish Turlapati', NULL, 'Welcome call complete. Vanessa Orozco', 'Concierge', 'Concierge', '2025-10-03 09:57:41', '2025-10-03 09:57:41'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000171381167', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000031295146', 'Keith Marshall', '10/03/2025', 'Called about getting the bill for his cologuard by exact sciences paid. Need help downloading health wallet and credentials. Got him logged into health wallet and emailed him his member id number, called exact sciences to get the bill routed to arm, we need their email since they didn''t pick up, he will call back once he sends his bill to me.', 'Tupac Manzanarez', 'Tupac Manzanarez', '2025-10-03 09:40:23', '2025-10-03 09:53:38'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000171395402', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000170998024', 'Satish Turlapati', '10/3/25', 'Satish called because he had his welcome call scheduled at 11:30 est but it looks like vanessa is runnig behind will have her reach out AC', 'Concierge', 'Concierge', '2025-10-03 09:38:49', '2025-10-03 09:38:49'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000171395397', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000049780037', 'Adriana Rojas Vargas', NULL, '10/3/25<br>Adriana called in regarding a recent <b>telehealth appointment</b> to renew her <b>Fluoxetine prescription</b>.<br>She requested a <b>higher quantity</b> since she is leaving for <b>Costa Rica</b> and is unsure when she will return.<br>The provider told her a <b>prior authorization</b> from insurance is needed.<br>Informed her that <b>we do not do prior authorizations</b>.<br>She also requested an <b>exemption letter</b> to avoid getting a <b>flu shot required by her job</b>.<br>Informed her that we <b>cannot provide that</b> and she would need a letter from a <b>licensed medical professional</b>. AC', 'Concierge', 'Concierge', '2025-10-03 09:31:37', '2025-10-03 09:31:37'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000171395392', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000108523001', 'Charles Holliday', NULL, '10/3/25<br>Reached out to <b>Orlando Health</b> regarding billing for <b>Evangeline Holliday</b>.<br>Orlando Health confirmed they had been <b>sending bills to Planstin in error</b>.<br>Provided <b>updated insurance information</b> to Orlando Health.<br>Orlando Health has <b>resubmitted claims under the correct plan</b>.<br>Advised member to reach out if any further bills are received. AC', 'Concierge', 'Concierge', '2025-10-03 09:18:06', '2025-10-03 09:18:06'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000171391357', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000170996010', 'Matthew Kuhman', NULL, 'Welcome call complete with Jordyn. Vanessa Orozco', 'Concierge', 'Concierge', '2025-10-03 09:07:05', '2025-10-03 09:07:05'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000171395383', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000012578137', 'Rachel Fisher Ingraham', NULL, '10/3/25<br>After multiple back-and-forth calls with ARM and Invisionsally jobe  representatives it was confirmed that ARM originally <b>approved the breast ultrasound</b> service back in <b>January</b>.<br>The member <b>did not receive the service until August</b>.<br>I <b>confirmed this information with Lori</b> at ARM. She verified the approval and gave the <b>green light for the provider to submit the claim directly</b> to ARM for reimbursement.<br>Lori stated she would <b>document this exception</b> in the member’s profile.<br>I provided the <b>correct PO Box</b> to the provider for claim submission.<br>Lori also emphasized that this is a <b>one-time exception</b>, and <b>ARM will no longer cover this service going forward</b>. AC', 'Concierge', 'Concierge', '2025-10-03 09:03:23', '2025-10-03 09:03:23'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000171391347', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000170902001', 'Val Hunter', NULL, 'Welcome call complete. Vanessa Orozco', 'Concierge', 'Concierge', '2025-10-03 09:01:15', '2025-10-03 09:01:15'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000171457001', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000171455002', 'Rachel Terrell', 'Member Only $5000 IUA Secure HSA', 'Tax ID/EIN: Need TIN<br><br>10/3-1st request sent to member &amp; advisor via em<br>10/8-2nd request for TAX ID sent to member &amp; advisor via em<br>10/13- Tried to call Member.  The voicemail message said" The wireless customer you are trying to reach is not available.  Please try again later." Sent an email to Leslie Alford to reach out to Member.  She told me to contact Mike Montes.  Sent an email to Mike Montes with no response.<br>10/15- Tried to call Member again.  Immediately received the same voicemail message as on 10/13.  Sent another follow up email to both Mike Montes &amp; Leslie Alford to assist with contacting this member.  If no response from Member or Advisors by 10/17, we will have to cancel this Membership before the first billing.', 'Michele R', 'Michele R', '2025-10-03 08:39:17', '2025-10-15 08:16:05'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000171391321', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000171011064', 'Amanda Williams', NULL, 'Spoke to member she needed to reschedule the welcome call. Sent an email to do so. Vanessa Orozco', 'Concierge', 'Concierge', '2025-10-03 08:05:56', '2025-10-03 08:05:56'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000171395376', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000098614002', 'Joseph Whitman', NULL, '10/3/25<br>sent email to inform Jessica that her child''s bills have been processed and paid AC', 'Concierge', 'Concierge', '2025-10-03 08:00:14', '2025-10-03 08:00:14'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000171391305', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000171004005', 'Matthew Byrnes', NULL, 'Welcome call complete. Vanessa Orozco', 'Concierge', 'Concierge', '2025-10-03 07:52:40', '2025-10-03 07:52:40'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000171381122', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000171606056', 'Mary Ann Hanlon', 'First Call', 'f 59, m 54, spousal plan, no preex, wants mammograms, colonoscopies, wellness visits, etc. Looking to retire early, next 6 months, drops employer plan when she does so timeline 6 months from now. recc premium care, followup call next friday 9 am. ref by member (no name provided)', 'Tupac Manzanarez', 'Tupac Manzanarez', '2025-10-03 07:36:54', '2025-10-03 07:36:54'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000171391269', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000170721005', 'Harish Kuram', NULL, 'Welcome call complete. Vanessa Orozco', 'Concierge', 'Concierge', '2025-10-03 07:23:35', '2025-10-03 07:23:35'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000171418213', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000109676002', 'Tracie Singletary', NULL, 'Member submitted change form to update address.  I will process.', 'Patti Baron', 'Patti Baron', '2025-10-03 07:11:55', '2025-10-03 07:11:55'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000171395371', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000152324020', 'John Weller', NULL, '10/3/25<br>John called wanting to know what would be the best car insurance or which pip to choose to pair with our types of plans. I will have leo follow up with him AC', 'Concierge', 'Concierge', '2025-10-03 07:09:02', '2025-10-03 07:09:02'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000171438316', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000174963059', 'Laura Waldman', NULL, '10-2-25 Laura called to see if her new income would change anything. She''s now starting to teach private tennis lessons and guessing she''ll bring in $10K-$12K annually. I let her know she needs to bring in about $23K to no longer qualify for Medicaid and then be able to get a tax credit. She will work towards earning that amount and is also looking for other work. She''s all set for now.', 'Wendy Scipione - SR VP National Sales Advisor', 'Wendy Scipione - SR VP National Sales Advisor', '2025-10-02 15:55:37', '2025-10-02 15:55:37'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000171438311', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000163576188', 'Daniel McCarthy', NULL, '10-2-25 Daniel called me back and I shared the information with him. He will contact the CO DOI and submit a request or appeal to maintain the ded and payments for all of 2025 up until now. Mary has a surgery she still needs to do before the end of year and she had already met her ded for the year until Daniel was removed. He will keep me posted on the success of the appeal.', 'Wendy Scipione - SR VP National Sales Advisor', 'Wendy Scipione - SR VP National Sales Advisor', '2025-10-02 14:45:51', '2025-10-02 14:45:51'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000171394527', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000168986002', 'Shaunt Hartounian', NULL, '10/02/2025<br>Called in because dr. had not shown up to visit yet on telehealth urgent care. Gave him the 469 number for rescheduling and telehealth assistance.<br>AJ', 'Concierge', 'Concierge', '2025-10-02 14:43:43', '2025-10-02 14:43:43'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000171394522', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000170743002', 'James Robinson', NULL, '10/02/2025<br>Spoke with Karen about where to find mental health benefits. Showed her where it was on health wallet and explained that it is only virtual.<br>AJ', 'Concierge', 'Concierge', '2025-10-02 14:33:55', '2025-10-02 14:33:55'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000171435113', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000075974301', 'Gerardo Garcia', NULL, 'Member submitted Change Form to update address.  I will process.', 'Patti Baron', 'Patti Baron', '2025-10-02 14:16:58', '2025-10-02 14:16:58'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000171395358', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000170446023', 'Elena Bensonoff', NULL, '10/2/25<br>Followed up regarding recent login issues with the HealthWallet app. Informed the user that the issue has been resolved and encouraged them to try logging in again. Offered support if any further issues arise. AC', 'Concierge', 'Concierge', '2025-10-02 14:05:57', '2025-10-02 14:05:57'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000171395351', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000101280089', 'Jack Taylor', NULL, '10/2/25<br>Followed up regarding recent login issues with the mpb app. Informed the user that the issue has been resolved and encouraged them to try logging in again. Offered support if any further issues<a style="display:inline;" target="_blank"><u> arise.AC</u></a><span></span>', 'Concierge', 'Concierge', '2025-10-02 14:03:19', '2025-11-05 14:51:42'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000171395346', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000170553002', 'Leslie Peters', NULL, '10/2/25<br>Followed up regarding recent login issues with the HealthWallet app. Informed the user that the issue has been resolved and encouraged them to try logging in again. Offered support if any further issues arise. AC', 'Concierge', 'Concierge', '2025-10-02 13:59:25', '2025-10-02 13:59:25'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000171394517', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000082061010', 'Lauren Beattie', NULL, '10/02/2025<br>Lauren called to ask about procedures to get vaccines. i explained the rx valet card showed her where it is and then gave her the 855 number in case she needs an override at the pharmacy. <br>AJ', 'Concierge', 'Concierge', '2025-10-02 13:48:57', '2025-10-02 13:48:57'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000171434091', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000170721041', 'Suzanne Finder', NULL, 'New member.  Called in to review pricing.  Patti reviewed the monthly share amount, bank info and date of payment.  She also advised Member that there will be a price increase with the December billing for January 1 2026.  Not certain of amount as yet.', 'Michele R', 'Michele R', '2025-10-02 13:48:41', '2025-10-02 13:49:11'),
