  ('zcrm_1579374000169042018', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000095960001', 'Doug Richter', NULL, 'Member called in said that she was sent to me by her advisor.  Her 1st questions were around Preventative bills that she had the were outstanding.  She had called Planstin and was told that she had been cancelled and didn''t know how to get those bills processed.  I answered questions about how the membership works, how to present and what Alt Risk will cover.  Member then told me that she now had the option to enroll in some traditional insurance plans through her employer.  She had the choice of 2 Cigna plans and wanted my opinion whether she should enroll in them.  I told her that I could not give her an opinion without seeing the Plan Designs for those plans.  I let her know that as long as any conditions fell within the Zion Guidelines they would be shared.  I showed her where she could access the guidelines on the Zion Website.', 'Patti Baron', 'Patti Baron', '2025-08-01 07:39:47', '2025-08-01 07:40:29'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000169046001', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000062380307', 'Jada Faye', NULL, '8/1/25: Jada emailed in asking if her daughter can use HW primary care for a school sports physical. I asked lyric directly - they said no, as those require an in-person visit. Let member know and directed her to PHCS provider search plus offered to help with finding someone. AM', 'Concierge', 'Concierge', '2025-08-01 07:22:03', '2025-08-01 07:22:03'),
